<!doctype html><html lang="zh-Hant"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>X 觀點共識 2026-10-05</title><style>
:root{--bg:#faf9f5;--fg:#1a1a19;--muted:#6b6a63;--line:#e3e1d8;--card:#fff;
--bull:#1a6b3c;--bull-bg:#eaf5ee;--bear:#a32d2d;--bear-bg:#fbecec;--accent:#3b5bdb}
@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root:not([data-theme=light]){--bg:#161614;--fg:#eceae2;
--muted:#9c9a90;--line:#2e2e2a;--card:#1e1e1b;--bull:#5fbf85;--bull-bg:#16281d;
--bear:#e07b7b;--bear-bg:#2a1818;--accent:#8fa4f5}}
:root[data-theme=dark]{--bg:#161614;--fg:#eceae2;--muted:#9c9a90;--line:#2e2e2a;
--card:#1e1e1b;--bull:#5fbf85;--bull-bg:#16281d;--bear:#e07b7b;--bear-bg:#2a1818;--accent:#8fa4f5}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--fg);font:15px/1.6 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,
"Segoe UI","Noto Sans TC","PingFang TC",sans-serif;margin:0;padding:28px 20px 60px}
.wrap{max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto}
h1{font-size:30px;margin:0 0 4px;letter-spacing:-.02em}
h2{font-size:19px;margin:36px 0 6px;padding-bottom:6px;border-bottom:2px solid var(--fg)}
.sub{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin:0 0 4px}
.note{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin:0 0 12px;font-style:italic}
.warn{background:var(--bear-bg);border-left:3px solid var(--bear);padding:10px 14px;
border-radius:4px;font-size:13px;margin:14px 0}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(300px,1fr));gap:12px}
.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:14px}
.card.bull{border-left:4px solid var(--bull)}.card.bear{border-left:4px solid var(--bear)}
.card.split{border-left:4px solid var(--accent)}
.tk{font-size:17px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.01em}
.ret{float:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-weight:600}
.up{color:var(--bull)}.down{color:var(--bear)}
.who{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px}
.tag{display:inline-block;font-size:11px;padding:1px 7px;border-radius:99px;margin-right:4px}
.t-bull{background:var(--bull-bg);color:var(--bull)}.t-bear{background:var(--bear-bg);color:var(--bear)}
.t-mute{background:var(--line);color:var(--muted)}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13.5px}
th{text-align:left;font-weight:600;color:var(--muted);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
padding:7px 8px;font-size:12px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.04em}
td{padding:7px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);vertical-align:top}
tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none}
.num{text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.bar{height:6px;border-radius:3px;background:var(--line);overflow:hidden;min-width:70px}
.bar>i{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--accent)}
.scroll{overflow-x:auto}

details.dt{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;margin:6px 0}
details.dt>summary{list-style:none;cursor:pointer;padding:10px 14px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;
align-items:center;gap:6px 14px;font-size:13.5px}
details.dt>summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
details.dt>summary::before{content:"▸";color:var(--muted);width:10px}
details.dt[open]>summary::before{content:"▾"}
details.dt[open]>summary{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
details.dt>summary:hover{background:var(--bull-bg)}
.s-tk{font-weight:700;min-width:110px}.s-n,.s-range,.s-src{color:var(--muted);font-size:12.5px}
.s-w{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-weight:600}.s-bar{width:90px;display:inline-block}
.s-ret{margin-left:auto}.s-ret .ret{float:none}
.flip{font-size:11px;padding:1px 7px;border-radius:99px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff}
.dt-body{padding:6px 14px 12px}
.paths{background:var(--bg);border-radius:6px;padding:8px 12px;margin:6px 0 10px;font-size:13px}
.paths-h{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;margin-bottom:2px}.paths ul{margin:0;padding-left:18px}
.tl-row{display:flex;gap:10px;padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.tl-row:last-child{border-bottom:none}
.tl-t{flex:0 0 84px;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;padding-top:2px}
.tl-body{flex:1;font-size:13.5px}
.tl-detail{color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.5}
.tl-detail a{color:var(--accent)}
footer{margin-top:44px;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);
color:var(--muted);font-size:12px}
</style>
<div class="wrap">
<h1>X 觀點共識儀表板</h1>
<p class="sub">產出時間 2026-10-05 02:57 美東時間 · 窗口 26 小時 · 16 個帳號 · 83 篇貼文 · 分類器 <code>session/v1</code></p>

<p class="note">最新入庫貼文（UTC）：2026-10-05T05:48:28+00:00。歷史回補尚未完成，分類器尚未通過人工評測。</p>
<p class="note">固定候選全文回填 · 揭露/選擇權：636／636 篇已判讀，0 篇待判讀；8 篇含 8 個待確認股票參照。候選完成不代表全部歷史已取得或分類，待確認身分不進個股投票。</p><p class="note">固定候選全文回填 · 觀點：5,239／5,239 篇已判讀，0 篇待判讀；1,086 篇含 2,329 個待確認股票參照。候選完成不代表全部歷史已取得或分類，待確認身分不進個股投票。</p>
<div class="warn">這是公開資訊彙整，不是投資建議。所有立場標籤都是模型推斷，會錯。報酬數字為最近 7 日收盤價變化，僅供對照，不代表任何人的實際損益。</div>
<h2>明確共同看多</h2>
<p class="note">至少 2 個意見帳號明確看多，且無人看空</p>
<p class="note">今天沒有</p>
<h2>明確共同看空</h2>
<p class="note">至少 2 個意見帳號明確看空，且無人看多</p>
<p class="note">今天沒有</p>
<h2>多空分歧</h2>
<p class="note">同一檔同時有帳號看多與看空</p>
<p class="note">今天沒有</p>
<h2>語氣訊號</h2>
<p class="note">多個意見帳號用同一種語氣談同一檔，但都沒有明確表態。嘲諷產品不等於看空股票，所以不計入共識；但整天沒人提到它也是資訊損失。</p>
<div class="scroll"><table><tr><th>標的</th><th>語氣</th><th class="num">帳號數</th><th>誰</th></tr><tr><td><b>US:AMD</b></td><td>偏負面</td><td class="num">2</td><td>Ren、Zephyr</td></tr></table></div>
<h2>個股總覽</h2>
<p class="note">全歷史，不限於本次窗口。點任一檔展開：上方是每個人的立場軌跡（有反轉會標出來），下方是由新到舊的完整時間線。交易者的揭露事件以<b>交易日</b>排序，揭露日另外標註。</p>
<details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:NVDA</span><span class="s-n">288 筆</span><span class="s-range">2016-01-01 → 2026-10-04</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="flip">8 人反轉</span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+2.2%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Cathie Wood</b>：2023-01 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li><li><b>Cleo Fields</b>：2026-07 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Donald Trump</b>：2025-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>John McGuire</b>：2026-02 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Jukan</b>：2026-07 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> → 2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> → 2026-08 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> → 2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2026-03 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> → 2026-08 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> → 2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li><li><b>Mark Stevens</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li><li><b>Michael Burry</b>：2025-11 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> → 2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-07 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Peter Thiel</b>：2025-11 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li><li><b>Ren</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> → 2026-09 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> → 2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-01 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> → 2026-03 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> → 2026-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li><li><b>Sheldon Whitehouse</b>：2016-01 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> → 2026-06 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li><li><b>Zephyr</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> → 2026-08 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> → 2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> → 2026-08 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> → 2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li><li><b>大老师</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> → 2026-08 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> → 2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者同時認為 NVIDIA 可取得更多運算能力，明確說兩個層級都受益。「Both layers win.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2106546457167671735" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">延长折旧提高回报，明确看多辉达及Nebius。「For $NVDA it means every chip sold carries more lifetime revenue for the customer, which is what justifies the next order.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2105861371980071381" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">競爭及產品評論，未判斷股價。「$NVDA is eating $CBRS&#x27;s lunch, and then some.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2105848503952117973" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明確以供需和GPU保值反駁投資空頭。「We are crushing the bears over here ⚡️」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2105347306421916129" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">活动自拍计划提到辉达关注，无投资方向。「catching the attention of BofA and Nvidia is not something I take for granted.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2105335186992832593" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者看好GPU競爭力與需求成長。「For Nvidia, the win is less about volume and more about the moat.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2105128873121714549" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面內容來自CEO原話。「NVIDIA is quite inexpensive right now.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2104777073818800175" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">技術投入觀察。「Nvidia seems pretty serious about glass substrates.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2103321704923795628" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Mark Stevens</b> <span class="tag t-bear">賣出</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · $300M · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-09-23 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2102647150001705318" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">以AI投資回報轉為持續支出支持四股看多。「Use cases with proper ROI, become recurring spend lines.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2102206142956839081" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">辉达设计速度赞赏，仅技术判断。「Nvidia is moving faster too」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2101606508115222759" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">參訪辦公室及工程氛圍讚賞，非股票論點。「let me say I&#x27;m impressed」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2100749965068791940" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品出貨的正面反應。「10M accelerator shipment target」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2100578585333686392" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">赞赏Jensen对AI前景的自信，不等于辉达股票看多。「Some people would be better off following Jensen.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2100060877131219092" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">勸投資人不要因宏觀恐慌賣股，明確支持續持輝達。「They didn’t get to that number paperhanding shares」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2099999510898577543" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">人物互動的正面情緒。「I GOT A SELFIE WITH JENSEN」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2099937363891790227" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">支持CEO建設言論，非股票方向。「You tell them boss」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2099932540849000958" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">皮衣救場比喻正面，但無明確股價展望。「to save the day」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2099900744853757959" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确反駁崩盤並支持增長。「unfollow the clowns on X that predict AI stocks from $NVDA to $TSM to $MU will crash」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2099229447304122410" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，作者對列出的整組個股發出「血腥的一週」警告。「It&#x27;s going to be a bloody week. Are you prepared?」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2099179266852196638" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者稱此為「布里GPU快速折舊論」的又一次敗仗，也是NVDA與新雲端商的勝利。「another L for the Burry&#x27;s rapid GPU depreciation thesis. And W for $NVDA and the Neocloud party.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2099048356345696391" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Evan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">只是轉貼Nvidia官方宣傳機器人計程車業務的貼文，語氣正面但沒有作者自己對股價的判斷。「&quot;Robotaxis are hitting the road. And NVIDIA is helping power them.&quot;」 <a href="https://x.com/StockMKTNewz/status/2098368762542010806" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">NVDA的財測只是用來佐證整體AI資本支出強勁的數據點，作者未直接對NVDA股價表態。「$NVDA gave forecasts for $1.3T hyperscaler capex」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2098306366167535766" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">NVDA在此僅被描述為投資LITE、COHR的一方,作者沒有對NVDA本身股價方向表態。「$NVDA invested billions in $LITE and $COHR」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2098121475190559054" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">列出持股清單並明說自己是全場最多方，喊「送它更高」「Tens of trillions, baby. Send it higher.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2098081185620467855" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">認為 Rubin 平台每美元運算與記憶體頻寬效益遠勝華為，即使黑市價高四倍仍會主導訓練需求「It will dominate training even if the black market price is 4x higher」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2097920303875911741" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">對其高價鎖定測試產能的做法表示佩服，語氣正面看待其供應鏈掌控力「LMAO Jensen is a demon」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2097850972446056584" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bull">回補</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · covering part of his short position, reducing bearish bet size · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-09-09 <a href="https://x.com/unusual_whales/status/2097757177482199422" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者以「LFG!!!」熱烈歡呼Nvidia在Rubin機櫃導入銅鑽石複合散熱材料的技術進展,顯示對其持續技術領先感到興奮。「Nvidia is finally using copper diamond composites LFG!!!」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2097483752842912125" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者比較Nvidia Rubin與華為950DT的每FLOP成本,算出Rubin單位算力成本反而便宜3.5倍,以「Not bad」肯定Nvidia產品的競爭力與定價合理性。「on a peak FLOPS basis, Rubin is 3.5x cheaper. Not bad」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2097101377940148652" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，此檔列於作者的agentic AI算力需求看多清單中「You are not bullish enough...Position yourself accordingly」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2097039199102730470" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者引用NVDA供給受限但營收成長預估70%（潛在可破100%）的數據，直接論證AI股仍將續漲。「$NVDA 70% supply constrained revenue growth projections (would be 100%+)」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2095882424932766163" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者暗示GPT-6 Astra可能是AI基建股新的正面催化劑,但用詞為「也许」,態度保留且未展開具體論證。「GPT-6 Astra的潜在影响 也许是一个新Catalyst了」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2095600255354261929" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者對輝達併購Hugging Face這筆交易評價為「不錯的併購」，顯示認同這項策略決定對公司是正面的。「Good acquisition」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2095553451673657587" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者將Nvidia以129億美元收購Hugging Face類比為微軟收購GitHub(事後證明是成功的策略收購)，暗示看好此次收購的長期價值。「this almost reminds me of $MSFT buying Github?」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2095490725412733092" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者稱輝達與博通近期釋出的財測展望是「monstrous（誇張強勁）」，顯示對兩家公司前景高度看多。「Monstrous guides from Nvidia and now Broadcom」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2095263732935065972" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者引述Nvidia FY28可能上看8020億美元營收(不受限情境)，並直言「這成長幅度太誇張了」，臆測Nvidia可能成為首家市值10兆美元的公司。「I wonder if Nvidia will be the first $10T company... this growth is absurd」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2095153855818547571" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者稱讚Google與Nvidia聯手投資聯發科的操作「是GOAT等級的投資」，展現正面評價。「Google/Nvidia are goats with investments」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2094704372831920324" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">僅提及Nvidia是Lambda背後的投資方，屬事實描述未表態方向。「$NVDA backed Lambda」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2094585395224981709" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，作者完全認同引用貼文對NVDA等公司財報優於預期的看多論述。「100% agreed. Fundamentals and capex demand are running circles around the macro panic.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2094559531376218224" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">引用Nvidia 2027年70%成長預測作為看多AI建設週期的佐證。「$NVDA 70% growth 2027」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2094492628758999451" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者以驚嘆語氣宣布原本傳出將取消的Rubin CPX重新復活,規格更接近Rubin本體且改用容量更大的HBM4,顯示看好輝達這條產品線的發展。「Rubin CPX is back, and it uses HBM4!」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2094426622753718528" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明確表示認同Nvidia此策略「我認為這很高明」，並稱此舉「鞏固了Nvidia在推論領域的戰略地位」。「I do think it&#x27;s brilliant... this move cements Nvidia&#x27;s strategic position in inference」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2094416430032896428" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者描述Nvidia以37.5億美元投資聯發科，正將自己「網路化」進入更廣泛的ASIC生態系，語氣偏正面但未明確表態股價方向。「It appears Nvidia is &quot;networking&quot; itself into the broader ASIC ecosystem」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2094405648293482965" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">「completely agreed, great read」認同引用串「史上最強財報」的看多論述。「$NVDA completely agreed, great read.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2093006391984246850" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">「up +8%... it wants to pull a double-digit day」，預期漲勢延續。「it wants to pull a double-digit day」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2092991307551576406" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者稱分析師Srasgon為『我們的英雄』,並轉發其將輝達目標價上調至400美元的消息,語氣明顯認同這個樂觀看法。「Our hero @Srasgon has raised his price target on Nvidia to $400.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2092948033319346572" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者細看財報後直言「Bullish AF」，認為市場尚未反應NVDA的成長性。「Bullish AF ⚡ ⚡ ⚡」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2092829182786982251" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">稱讚收購Hugging Face是「playing chess while everyone else plays checkers」，正面評價此策略動作。「They&#x27;re playing chess while everyone else plays checkers. This is getting serious.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2092790362536378737" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者僅以「👀👀👀」回應黃仁勳談資本回收期不到一年的說法，屬驚訝／關注的反應，未表態自己對股價的判斷。「👀👀👀」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2092746380637020337" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者只用『Custom HBM!』表達關注,對 NVLink Fusion 與 NVHBM 技術新聞沒有明確表態股價方向。「Custom HBM!」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2092740104368648502" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者只簡短表示「I like this」回應Nvidia NVLink Fusion/NVHBM技術發表，未展開對股價的具體看法。「I like this」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2092737721043411047" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者質疑黃仁勳前後說法「Jensen Math/Finesse」，帶著懷疑口吻檢視其數字說法的一致性，但未明確表態股價方向。「OK. But why was Jensen pumping 80B-100B few weeks ago?? More Jensen Math/Finesse?」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2092733441339203691" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者直接表示 NVIDIA 已預訂大量記憶體,顯示其供應鏈掌控力強,屬正面訊號。「NVIDIA has reserved a massive amount of memory.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2092732199481266284" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者認為 70% 的成長幅度顯示 NVIDIA 已經鎖定大量記憶體產能,暗示其供應鏈地位穩固,屬正面訊號。「70% growth makes it sound as if NVIDIA has already secured that much memory capacity.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2092727980682575941" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">開頭以「BOOM」驚嘆財報優於預期、營收連四季加速成長，雖提及毛利率下修但整體語氣偏多。「BOOM. $NVDA just guided fiscal 2028 revenue growth of roughly 70%」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2092727731402240222" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者稱CFO罕見給出一年後的成長展望且股價因此翻紅上漲，認為這代表公司對AI需求極度有信心，屬明確看多。「The largest company in the world said that it would double again next year if it weren&#x27;t constrained.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2092726860669125089" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">對照離場又回頭的人說「we never left」，暗示自己持續看多並持有這組半導體標的。「Welcome back; we never left 😎」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2092724027936698540" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面財報與業務成長評價，不推定股價方向。「Insane upward revision beat from +43.9% expected to 70%.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2092723047107355133" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · opened a bullish position described as a &#x27;hedge&#x27; · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-08-26 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2092722550077866132" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">辉达财报数据及需求赞赏，强调机会在其他供应链，没有明确辉达股票方向。「Nvidia is clearly leading the charge and no obvious signs of demand slowing.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2092718416683819292" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">「double beat」加上「We are going up baby」明確看多。「$NVDA double beat ✅✅ We are going up baby」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2092709791298707826" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者強調聽$NVDA財報電話會對所有人都是必要的，是對其重要性的高度肯定，但未明說股價方向。「Listening to $NVDA ER isn&#x27;t just mandatory for every investor.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2092696659092250629" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者認為前沿AI實驗室因掌握內部模型，能比Nvidia/AMD更快自研軟硬體堆疊，暗示對其護城河構成競爭威脅。「Frontier labs can co-design and develop their hardware-software stack at a much faster pace compared to Nvidia/AMD due to them having access to cutting edge internal models」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2092377713256587514" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">貼文重點是想買NVIDIA DGX Spark硬體的玩笑話，並未對NVDA股價方向表態。「How do I tell my wife I have to buy an NVIDIA DGX Spark」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2092291407201399227" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者只用「YES SIR」附和他人「NVIDIA GPUs become HBM wrappers」的說法，本身未加入具體論述，方向偏負面但過於簡短難判定。「YES SIR」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2092280436282343745" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者改口表示 Jalapeño 無法擴展到 Rubin 的規模,暗示 Nvidia Rubin 在擴展能力上仍占優勢。「OAI’s Jalapeño can’t scale to the same level as Rubin.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2092271778819375391" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者直接說Nvidia已「lost its perf/$ and perf/W crown」，認為記憶體廠正在吃掉所有資本支出，是對Nvidia基本面轉弱的明確論斷。「Now, Nvidia has lost its perf/$ and perf/W crown, and memory bois are eating all the CAPEX」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2092268947265728777" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者接續前一則貼文，強調NVIDIA真正的優勢在於其資產負債表與供應鏈長約，暗示即使有競爭消息其護城河仍穩固，屬相對看多的補充「Nvidia&#x27;s advantage... is its balance sheet and its LTAs/contracts in the supply chain」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2092267341530931420" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者說黃仁勳與蘇姿丰「今天大概很不好過」，暗示博通（Hock Tan）相關的競爭消息對NVDA是壞消息「Jensen and Lisa Su are probably having a super bad day today」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2092263334188114080" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者引述SemiAnalysis測試結果，指OpenAI自研的Jalapeño晶片在推理效率上贏過NVDA，暗示競爭威脅。「OpenAI&#x27;s Jalapeño chip beat $NVDA and $AMD on inference efficiency, per SemiAnalysis testing.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2092259903561666737" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者表示 OpenAI 的 Jalapeño 晶片『優於 Rubin』,暗示 Nvidia 新一代 Rubin 平台在這場比較中處於劣勢。「It’s superior to Rubin.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2092257540771917956" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者以驚呼「WTF!!!」回應OpenAI自研Jalapeño晶片在多項推理效能指標上超越NVDA的分析報告，反映對其競爭地位受威脅的負面情緒「it outperformed $NVDA, $AMD and Google accelerators on several inference efficiency metrics」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2092255035354984777" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品進展称讚。「Announces Groq3 LPX now in full production.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2091909391238979970" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者以「LFG」興奮回應NVIDIA Groq 3 LPX晶片正式量產的消息，屬正面看待出貨進展「GROQ 3 LPX in Full Production. LFG!!!」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2091905284063318372" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者僅以「if anyone can save us it is $NVDA」表達期待，屬希望性語氣而非明確方向判斷。「if anyone can save us it is $NVDA」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2091887594170671564" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者在Jackson Hole與NVDA財報前明確表示「半导体和存储暂时不碰，NVDA财报完全不赌」，並認為反彈持續性轉弱，屬防守／看空立場。「半导体和存储暂时不碰，NVDA财报完全不赌」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2091875599568797852" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者「想像」NVDA在法說會上駁斥整季讓市場恐慌的800V與CPO傳言，暗示認為這些恐慌是過度反應，隱含看多情緒。「Imagine $NVDA gets on the call and denies every 800V and CPO rumor finx panicked about all quarter」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2091566118418653548" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者質疑Nvidia「Rubin將帶來10倍代幣輸出」的說法是選擇性引用的基準測試，屬對行銷數字的質疑，不等於對股價方向的判斷「Nvidia always likes to cherry-pick their benchmarks」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2091527293005189613" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">純轉述 The Information 報導 Nvidia 擬將 Rubin NVL72 機櫃漲價至 800 萬美元,作者未附加自己的判斷。「Nvidia plans to raise GPU prices by 17%, which would bring the price of a Rubin NVL72 rack to $8 million.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2091422117841752209" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者僅描述GB300漲價約15%、每台約60萬美元，用「Hefty hike」形容漲幅之大，未明確表態這對NVDA股價是利多或利空「Hefty hike」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2091245805185462454" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者指出OpenAI與微軟已收到首批VR200（Vera Rubin），認為量產即將到來，對NVIDIA出貨進度持正面看法「MP starts soon」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2091128164097610137" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者以「Mmmkay....」語帶嘲諷回應摩根大通在NVDA財報前示警拋售的說法，看不出對NVDA股價本身的明確方向判斷。「Of course, just in time for the $NVDA ER on Wednesday.. Mmmkay....」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2090823014732460172" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者稱讚NVDA提前多年鎖定Zayo長途光纖供應鏈以解決AI基礎設施擴張瓶頸，屬正面評價其策略布局。「$NVDA doing what they do best. Locking in supply chains years before they need them.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2090458399385297029" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者提到NVIDIA Vera Rubin機櫃已開始在OpenAI運作，認為量產即將或已經開始，屬正面看待出貨進度「Rubin mass production starts soon (maybe even started already?)」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2090442965101805932" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">認為TTMI估值折價不久將消失，並提出需求與收入論點，明確看多。「Over 40% share on NVIDIA’s VR200 platform」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2089411155903304104" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明確反駁「循環融資」的空頭論點，認為500億美元融資保證有助避免GPU銷售受衝擊，並將加速GPU市場規模擴大。「It should accelerate the expansion of the GPU market’s TAM, and I do not view it as circular financing.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2088797214873133358" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">對他人嘲笑空頭的正面反應，不新增看多。「Omg this is too funny」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2088636715481059572" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">競品性能比較。「Vera CPU」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2088489847526944992" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面產品資訊；買記憶體未指向NVDA或任何明示個股。「NVIDIA’s Rubin Ultra is unlikely to use HBM4」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2087901960146170161" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bear">放空</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-08-11 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2087276225727271035" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">對營收預測可行性提出負面質疑。「$1.5T in 2028 will require GPU ASPs to 3x」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2087129569170215396" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面產品設計與供應決策評價。「that fits Nvidia&#x27;s interest.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2086073288242123134" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">反驳芯片规格削减是需求坏讯息，讨论技术供需而非股票方向。「This isn&#x27;t a demand problem, it&#x27;s a supply problem.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2085220111959654856" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品供應限制新聞。「NVIDIA Considering Downgrading Rubin Ultra&#x27;s HBM Configuration」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2084536701532451009" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bear">放空</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-07-30 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2082942341019525339" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">強調SpaceX算力建設規模消息，沒有股價方向。「$NVDA $SPCX」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2082704028354707943" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">競爭優勢稱讚不自動轉成投資方向。「NVIDIA’s moat.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2082056450394956200" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">融資新聞，整體反彈期待未確定歸於NVDA股價。「$NVDA in talks with OpenAI to guarantee $250 billion」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2081596676544848131" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">品牌社群引用。「@nvidia」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2081186838480330775" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bear">放空</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · added to short again · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-07-25 · 2 則報導 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2081129209322262578" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文1</a> <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2080969026172264899" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文2</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">指向產業建設及產品主張，不直接指NVDA股票。「Open models are BULLISH for the AI buildout」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2080665042630926743" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">人物及公司產品情緒稱讚。「THE SEMICONDUCTOR MESSIAH HAS SPOKEN」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2080651763674190224" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品性能正面比較。「Nvidia&#x27;s HBM4 is at 10.7 Gbps」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2080382231718351212" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">AI基建需求及泛供應鏈定位，未明示輝達股價或買賣。「I&#x27;m positioned to catch the benefits across the whole supply chain.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2080372555257405661" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">批評Blackwell線纜技術困難，AMD為引文製造評論，非股票方向。「Blackwells were a nightmare」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2080345494434488340" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">競爭及產品護城河負面語氣。「Jensen&#x27;s biggest nightmare」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2080343648995283340" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者本次明说AMD看多；NVDA看空僅旧自引，不能作为新方向。「Very bearish on $NVDA.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2080207595722469687" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者在转述后自行明确看空辉达，方向归作者。「Very bearish on $NVDA.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2080205767861510343" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">對空方論點的認可不等於本人下跌預測。「Nvidia bear case quite well」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2080185552914309428" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品交付讚賞不另給股票票。「Jensen doesn’t play around.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2080173287196197225" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產業觀點與主管稱讚。「Glad to see Jensen validating that Kimi is net positive for AI infra.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2079951490362298435" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">反驳便宜模型减少算力的产业判断，没有具体股票价格或行动方向。「Cheaper tokens mean more tokens」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2079932080260075635" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">讚嘆實測效能並计划研究供應鏈，無股票方向。「Imaging going 10x performance」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2079839215785758823" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">技術交付正面消息。「NVIDIA said its co-packaged optics switch is in volume manufacturing」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2079694429951267289" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">引文競品比較。「pulling ahead of Nvidia」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2079571388147646799" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">專家技術風險轉述。「difficult to realize Nvidia’s Feynman generation in 2029.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2079568535093973274" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">競爭及替代資訊非股價方向。「without a single Nvidia chip!」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2079353599105315152" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">需求推論。「Nvidia’s Rubin CMX will quite literally soak up NAND supply」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2079129709921878438" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Cleo Fields</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · up to $45k · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-07-18 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2078401700369416245" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">引用他人負面論點，作者只確認技術細節。「The bear case for $NVDA」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2078013092466938203" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Jensen与供应商CEO相聚照片介绍，无股票方向，未核实日股主体保留。「Jensen Huang and the bottleneck bros.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2077674966292771039" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面產品發布。「FIRST AI-RAN platform.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2077445684366856283" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者以輝達否認延誤及大量生產支持AI基建，未明确輝達個股方向。「Giant amounts of production incoming.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2077406924354498751" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">對公司產品時程信任，沒有股價主張。「I&#x27;m trusting $NVDA on timelines」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2077406548012466390" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">转述CEO否認延误及竞爭回答；自引舊評論無新方向。「Jensen Huang said no delays:」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2076846994614792663" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">對競爭執行力的正面語氣。「Jensen Huang is absolutely ruthless.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2076831218973426025" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">供應鏈技術風險。「the problem is with the PCB, not the chip」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2076307633364156861" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">維護公司供應鏈語氣。「blowing it out of proportions」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2076266613675069628" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品延遲反應，無股票承諾。「正如我所预期的那样…」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2075939810062328268" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品延遲嘲諷。「NVIDIA’s Rubin has been delayed yet again」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2075937524225310879" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品新聞。「NVIDIA’s Rubin has been delayed yet again」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2075933338540581375" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">管理與產品負面評價。「panic-bought Groq」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2075863081998229512" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">强调辉达技术时程转述，未给作者股票方向。「proceeding exactly as scheduled.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2075662855366492382" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明說Apple越来越看空並給供需壓力前瞻，NVIDIA为技术背景。「best visibility into global AI demand」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2075477320270520665" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">圖片稱讚不替代股價方向，不能猜圖片內容。「美图分享一个」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2075249694146785306" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">交易結果回顧。「已经ITM了」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2074913200165048663" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者认为辉达新增中国市场将触发重新计价，为明确正向投资论点。「Jukan这一段成立将会 重新计价大陆市场」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2074892295732867417" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">调侃辉达H200采购量，不是股票看空。「Only 200k H200s」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2074874382946894175" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">批评主题卖出并预测未点名机构重新做多，不对META/NVDA明确下股票结论。「got refuted by $NVDA」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2074405723816304743" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面路線澄清，無作者投資承諾。「NVIDIA SAYS AI CHIP ROADMAP REMAINS INTACT」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2074175388909994102" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品進度負面評論。「even the 2+2 MCM design got canceled」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2074065258701033711" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品時程批評非股票方向。「plz don&#x27;t expect Nvidia to meet their deadlines」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2074057436671975547" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确长期持有Sivers、相信估值巨大扩张，其他公司为合作/同业资讯。「$NVDA NVLink」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2074046947434860971" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">被引用產品延遲負面資訊，不變成作者股價看空。「NVIDIA’s NVL72x2」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2073971091161395378" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">技術競爭力負面評論，無直接股票方向。「signals the erosion of NVIDIA’s performance moat.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2073890864628421111" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">公司澄清正面。「$NVDA, analyst desks, and major optical companies refuted」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2073070567796727956" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">公司澄清正面。「$NVDA, analyst desks, and major optical companies refuted」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2072936659369517341" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">估值、EPS與PEG形成明確買入投資論點。「The most important company in technology isn&#x27;t expensive.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2072692136017879200" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面產品能力預測，未說股票方向。「I think they will match Opus」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2072678513690444004" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">反驳輝達模型性能说法，非看空股票。「I love the Nemotron guys, but this isn&#x27;t true」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2072547487588762028" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">競爭新聞負面語氣。「alternative that resolves dependence on NVIDIA」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2072446000858579176" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">待確認價格條件。「目前只看NVDA能不能收复200刀的位置并站稳」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2071951943191396466" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">工厂机器人的業務驗證及社会評論，無上市股票方向。「deal with $NVDA on factory robotics」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2071532870859149617" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">公司議價能力正面比喻。「Jensen (more like 2400 pound) &amp; Hock」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2070674114600436039" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">技術進度澄清。「everything is still proceeding according to that schedule.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2070475755759567125" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">引用成本與產業風險評論。「Nvidia几乎完全不会降价」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2070382980728754639" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">批評泡沫說法，不等於明確NVDA股票投資方向。「$NVDA upstream supply chain as a “bubble”」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2069399639154213281" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">推荐技术需求文章，非Nvidia股票方向。「Nvidia’s CMX rack could drive massive NAND demand」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2068595103233671513" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">混合键合技术成本与BESI业务机会讨论，BESI身份未核实。「Rubin Ultra&#x27;s HBM literally got downgraded」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2067915761331618074" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">技术成本评论无已核实股票方向，BESI缺身份。「Rubin Ultra&#x27;s HBM literally got downgraded」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2067912731122872684" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">管理與商業行為負面語氣。「effectively threatening neo-clouds」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2067865844689056191" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">分析師提到客戶技术態度。「Nvidia is so positive on the glass core substrate.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2067440482524029088" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">供應不足背景。「Nvidia cut SOCAMM2 capacity」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2067418881002725737" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品進度澄清。「No delays on CPO or 800v dc.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2067033934194696469" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Coherent工厂及当前最大持仓描述，没有新的方向承诺。「$NVDA locked up supply」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2067032543791284414" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">引用負面政策背景，不归作者空票。「export restrictions imposed on NVIDIA’s sales」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2065827599474139404" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">自己的當前投資支持及信念。「It’s investing in $NVDA」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2065114293