权并明确估计MRVL两三年可能翻倍；其他股票为过去交易例子。「$NVDA」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2040269140855083041" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">DeepSeek中国芯片迁移新闻，无作者股票方向。「NVIDIA」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2040242690999328981" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">技术能力肯定。「internal scale-up CPO efforts are second to none」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2039346115989135784" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">产品技术认可。「taking Celestial&#x27;s tech seriously」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2038953208438276187" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">分析英伟达产业投资与锁定光学供应，不含作者股票方向。「$NVDA」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2038771661961343292" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">反驳H100二手价格猜测并表示购买硬件，不是英伟达股票方向。「$NVDA」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2038516629806694541" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">质疑Nvidia供应链规模及客户资金可行性，业务预测非明确股票看空。「I doubt Nvidia can even ramp」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2038149702815011169" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">当前重申Nvidia看跌期权对冲。「as a hedge with $NVDA and $LCID」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2038109389111062832" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">计算英伟达产品出货量，业务预测非股票投票。「$NVDA」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2037871839507259883" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者条件性股票看跌配置。「$NVDA Puts」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2037779565066764425" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">产品经济性赞许。「Jensen was right」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2037577101138866329" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">惊讶Amazon采购与团队新闻，引用他人判断非自身方向。「$NVDA」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2037295400433160361" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">产品竞争影响，没有股票看空指令。「cannibalize the market for inference and $NVDA market share.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2036746039588434165" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">GTC技术复盘与他人译文，Nvidia优势与Cerebras成本评论不是股票方向。「What Nvidia ultimately delivered was more elegant」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2035581499597275615" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">销售许可业务消息。「Nvidia&#x27;s H200 AI chip sales」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2034082819111326099" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">机器人演示嘲讽不是股票看空，QLCM疑似笔误不硬映Qualcomm。「basically Frosty the Snowman」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2033665621356122611" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">被引用公司业务预测。「multi-billion dollar business」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2033630359229972844" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">对比未來8.3至16.7兆市值情境，形成估值上行。「Current market cap: $4.47T.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2033625215713120366" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">假设改名提高估值的玩笑，未构成实际投资方向。「$NVDA」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2033033107557986332" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">会议期待与内容推广。「$NVDA GTC」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2031407141547028617" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">批评新闻引发跌幅并更新项目状态，自引旧买点不构成新票。「$NVDA」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2030024185490329799" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确将新闻引发的三只芯片股下跌视为买点；其他公司是资金背景。「This looks like a buying opportunity for specific names」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2030020673570275618" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">英伟达新品猜测和采访预告，无明确股票方向。「$NVDA」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2027105330111623298" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">技术新品猜测与供应链预告，没有投资方向。「$NVDA」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2027102653147144349" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Nvidia财报与行业需求指标分析，無明确股票投票。「$NVDA blows away」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2027052811318693995" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">他人收益称赞。「$8.3M gains on $NVDA」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2026794830416982339" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>John McGuire</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-02-11 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2021603276941078693" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确反对CRWV多头并推荐Nvidia，表达一空一多。「But it does make Nvidia one.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2016361080117961170" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bear">放空</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-01-05 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2008255886851240041" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者将AI需求比作军备竞赛；他人财报数据不构成作者NVDA买卖判断。「$NVDA」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1991256506159739264" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Peter Thiel</b> <span class="tag t-bear">賣出</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · ~$100M position · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2025-11-17 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/1990425167793725878" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bear">放空</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2025-11-03 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/1985464359750140237" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">旧价格跌幅。「nvda -1.5%」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/1974176380113072395" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-08-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Donald Trump</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · between $5 million and $25 million · 交易日 2025-08-18（原文：August 18） · 揭露 2026-07-01 · 2 則報導 <a href="https://x.com/DJTRadar/status/2073063521282076799" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文1</a> <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2072209361238372446" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文2</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2023-01-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Cathie Wood</b> <span class="tag t-bear">賣出</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · almost her entire position · 交易日 2023-01-01（原文：January 2023） · 揭露 2026-05-13 · 5 則報導 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2069372779393102123" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文1</a> <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2067951104952778954" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文2</a> <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2065728185644257281" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文3</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2016-01-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Sheldon Whitehouse</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日 2016-01-01（原文：in 2016） · 揭露 2026-06-02 · 2 則報導 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2105959049254539524" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文1</a> <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2061870974736187644" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文2</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:AAOI</span><span class="s-n">264 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-12-11 → 2026-10-03</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="flip">2 人反轉</span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+19.4%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Jukan</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2026-02 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-02 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> → 2026-04 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> → 2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li><li><b>Ren</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2025-12 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> → 2026-08 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> → 2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li><li><b>大老师</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">轉述 Lumentum 執行長的供需缺口及供應分配，未明確判斷點名股票的未來價格。「projected deficit has now expanded to 70%」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2106450096808153311" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者期待利率不變與殖利率下降，認為高 beta 股票還會走高並點名四檔；未核實未知代碼公司名。「high betas are screaming higher.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2106076184840667539" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者期待十月股市上漲並點名三檔作為該方向的標的，情緒強烈且論據較少。「This market wants to buy stocks so desperatley」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2106056040873935257" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者直接認為限制措施有利於其點名的國內光學供應商。「These restrictions benefit domestic suppliers.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2105725080370356309" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者只以「Optics go brrr」表達光學領域的興奮，個股論點均在引文中，未逐股給方向。「Optics go brrr」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2105712095014851027" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者直接認為 AAOI 是此政策下的大型受益者。「$AAOI another large beneficiary.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2105709782854435274" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者認為限制中國收發器可能對其點名的美國光學供應商帶來重大利多。「Potentially big for US optical suppliers.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2105698908416479284" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">代碼出自被引用的先前互連論點，本篇自己的標題只點名 LITE，其他不新增方向票。「[引用 @ren_stocks]: $LITE $COHR $GLW $MRVL $AAOI $SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2105667101038158155" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">增發批評而無確定股價方向。「$AAOI once these bullshit ATMs get absorbed.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2103869705509388694" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">AAOI业务看多但股价受增发抑制，2027跑赢附停止发行条件；其他为融资/机会成本案例。「I do expect AOI to strongly outperform (especially in 2027) if they stop issuing these stupid ATMs.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2103151990146801812" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">偏重網路股投資理由，為四股多方論點。「Why am I so focused on networking over raw compute?」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2101057160537084356" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">直接預期2027光學公司成長。「As photonics like $SMTC to $AAOI, I expect to cook heavily in 2027」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2100938001077674262" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，作者將AAOI列為雷射短缺受惠供應商之一。「Who benefits from supplying all that lasers during a shortage other than $LITE / $SIVE / $AAOI / $COHR?」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2098306366167535766" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者引用AAOI產能從每月10萬台擴張到93萬台，且預測需求持續超過產能到2027年中，顯示基本面強勁「$AAOI is scaling from 100k to 930k units per month by end of 2027 and still forecasts demand exceeding capacity through mid 2027」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2098114790048583928" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">列在 Bullish for 清單，理由是可插拔光模組仍有成長空間「$AAOI - pluggable runway」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2097820413900276043" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同LITE，作者強調自己從2025年就開始看好AAOI，早於市場共識，並認同花旗的稀缺溢價論述。「I&#x27;ve been talking about lasers like $LITE / $AAOI since 2025... and architectural shifts toward CW, ahead of the current industry consensus.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2097660318369697875" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者將AAOI列為「我的光學題材持股」之一,並在高盛上修市場規模後列出其當日漲幅,明確表態持有看多。「AAOI: +8.52%」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2097367356523892915" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者用「Insane strength」形容當日+8.9%的漲勢並稱之為利多驅動「Insane strength across optics today after some solid news &gt; $AAOI +8.9%」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2097332258386403456" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者指出AAOI雷射產能被轉往收發器且必須回絕客戶訂單，顯示需求強勁、供給吃緊。「$AAOI not really known to be a merchant supplier... having to turn away customers for lasers.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2097200456090952096" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，此檔列於作者看多的光學/互聯股清單中「You are not bullish enough on interconnect, photonics and optics ⚡️」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2097072930114969608" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者僅將「$AAOI in February」列為過去成功交易案例,不是對現況的看法。「$AAOI in February」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2097007843799171358" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者引用AAOI的CPO雷射毛利率55-65%作為雷射業務高獲利的佐證。「if we apply similar 55-65% CPO laser margin quotes by $AAOI.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2096890295128625153" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者將AAOI列為自己至今仍上漲逾100%的光通訊主題持股。「7. $AAOI - Photonics」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2096814311306129776" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，作者將此檔列入不打算賣出、看到2030年的互聯股名單「I know I&#x27;m not selling my interconnect shares. I&#x27;m seeing this through 2030.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2096439098634313987" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者把自己研究AAOI時發現的CW雷射供需失衡思路，當成鼓勵他人尋找『看好做多標的』的範例，隱含他對AAOI仍持看多立場。「或者把我研究 $AAOI 时关于 CW 激光器供需失衡的思路, 应用到 A 股.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2096122640465645937" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">需求正面讀穿，無股價方向。「great read through on 1.6T ramp.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2092408620277457255" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">僅陳述股價下跌17%並明確表示「Nothing else to add」，未給出方向判斷。「$AAOI -17% Nothing else to add.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2091887930105082135" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明確維持AAOI多頭及大倉位；對其他公司融資批評不等於看空股票。「I&#x27;m still bullish on $AAOI and I have large positions」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2091843192639672553" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者雖批評AAOI管理層連續增發稀釋股東而減碼，但仍保留核心倉位並認為長期股價會走高。「it should go higher in due time」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2090986982088266149" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者一方面認同連續增發ATM「很糟」且對管理層有疑慮，一方面又說「仍有清楚的多頭論點」，立場矛盾難以判斷方向「The jury is not out and there is still a clear bull case. But pretty discouraging to see when there&#x27;s already doubts around management.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2090935426240667725" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">以稀釋及融資結構否定股票投資，明確负向。「It&#x27;s getting much harder to support $AAOI」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2090903631793127644" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者形容AAOI是「安全且卡位良好的AI概念股」，屬正面肯定。「Everyone is trading the same safe, well-positioned AI names. $NBIS $SNDK $AAOI $LITE. Great as an investor.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2090657349706928636" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者直指光学股跌幅不合理、需求可见及安心等待，明确低估多方论点；其余仅产业佐证。「My opinion is that the optical sector underperformance recently from $AAOI to $SIVE has been absurd.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2090490101260591481" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者引用AAOI關於美國製光模組享有溢價的說法作為佐證，用以支持其美國製造溢價的論點。「AAOI has said that U.S.-made optical modules carry a premium.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2090045731864539387" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">光学产业供需与超级周期讨论，三家公司作为数据出处，没有明确逐股方向。「$LITE, $MTSI, $AAOI all pointing to extreme demand imbalances」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2089973586425766134" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明示股價更高的方向並引用需求理由，為看多。「$AAOI HIGHER」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2089921425326866896" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者認為美國政府投資本土光通訊產業「非常合理」，暗示這類政策若成真對AAOI是利多敘事「very logical for natsec and U.S. AI leadership」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2089788807881363931" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">以需求、定價及估值重評支持AAOI，明確反對看空。「I can&#x27;t see how anyone can be bearish on this company...」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2089766053274661143" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者小倉買入POET且提出現金估值催化上行，AAOI明說清晰多頭；Sivers為技術比較。「a clear as day long for me like $AAOI」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2087846074027295020" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">供需資訊。「AOI confirmed demand imbalances  + bottlenecks for lasers.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2087447527595692180" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面訂單數據。「Orders running 20 to 40% above what they can build.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2087336733218156608" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面財報及業務需求分析，未表態股票投資方向。「maybe not AAOI since they&#x27;re missing out」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2087271842696593764" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">本人前瞻多週期成長投資論點。「Rather than one-and-done off of one year.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2087249406638862506" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">具名光學公司投資持有建議。「Be sure to own the part of optics on the correct side of two transitions」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2087005727185383686" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者重新明确看多美光与三星，其他光学公司仅市场叙事及旧估值案例。「demand imbalance from $AAOI」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2086148557187461412" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者當前光子投資組合及短缺論點支持所列核心股。「great to have our thesis rewarded today.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2085811801988685950" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">光學恢復結果回顧。「$LITE $AAOI $SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2085762483944391024" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">AAOI问候没有明确投资方向。「GOOD MORNING $AAOI」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2085725183143219480" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">已完成交易與價格績效回顧，自引舊買賣不變成新方向。「$AAOI is at 140 now」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2085713926776365403" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">MXL重仓与呼吁不被震出，明确持有多方承诺；引文其他标的无作者方向。「Some more TLDR takeaways from $AAOI ER」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2085712485500248182" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">財報讚賞。「Always impressed by the revenue ramp」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2085711500875116887" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">赞赏卖方渠道检查与复盘光学股回升，没有新作者方向。「$AAOI, $LITE, $SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2085649654059016387" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确更看多有产能的既有CPO激光公司，AAOI供需新闻不看空，其他仅客户/竞争资料。「this is not bearish AAOI because they have too much demand」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2085603590903902621" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產能優於計畫，不直接股票方向。「Roughly 30% ahead of their own plan」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2085539348204879938" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明說重倉多頭及Bullish，AAOI看多；Coherent僅引文業務消息。「Bullish $AAOI」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2085534371516211706" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">AAOI电话会数据与产业需求赞赏，没有股票价格或行动方向。「AAOI has the customers now. Limitation is making enough lasers and transceivers.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2085499853099208716" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">已賣出交易回顧。「told you when I sold」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2085497449263620140" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">新增持有承諾及論點确认。「Holding a concentrated position and not selling here.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2085486739448094901" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面營收引述。「$500 million revenue.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2085476279277564119" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面公司产能宣告為引用。「WE CONTINUE TO BELIEVE THAT WE WILL HAVE THE LARGEST」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2085467508296061153" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">表達執行風險但未明確股價方向。「Massive execution risk on Q3/Q4.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2085465039893659771" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">負面反應但多頭策略在自引旧文，不產生新票。「这个图已经不是人类了」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2085459820782719246" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">直接當前偏空判斷。「AAOI 偏空反转」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2085454305604346110" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">如果看多的條件策略，非作者直接承諾。「如果看多可以放在114止损的做多」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2085444438856437902" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">需求週期正面分析。「Welcome to the multi year cycle.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2084920594139959305" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">漲幅回顧。「$AAOI +50%」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2084725475327508978" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者重申AAOI多頭並預測新高，明確看多；AXTI只在自引價格回顧。「New highs soon.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2084685159388074236" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">AAOI猎熊的当前方向号召，明确看多挤空行情。「Time to go bear hunting」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2084662223419384047" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">直接將AAOI定位為政策受益投資。「telling you exactly what to invest in again.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2084659577585545566" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">禁令条件下AAOI受益的业务情境，未作无条件股票预测。「exactly who benefits most if this lands.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2084645228846198822" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者只是上漲反應，舊全倉宣告不生成新票。「$AAOI +16%」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2084644276399448470" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">受惠產業提及無特定方向。「$LITE $AAOI $SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2084633351470600387" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面情緒反應及引用政策，不直接成為個股看多。「BABY DON&#x27;T FEAR THE REAPER」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2084631786668097713" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">禁令的產業受益與供應鏈分析，未說股票投資方向。「A very material catalyst came about for Western supply chains」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2084597612175618342" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明說全部組合投入AAOI，明確買入看多。「100% full porting $AAOI」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2084514164907676139" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">等待指引驗證，不是方向。「what&#x27;s more important is Q3 guide.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2084353106637209852" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">AAOI财报观察指标及历史波段复盘，没有当前确定方向。「looking for to see if the thesis is on track」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2084349399287910866" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面供應瓶頸評價，不自動转成股票看多票。「glad this thesis is starting to see validation.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2083438823548293140" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">所列光子股票及ETF選擇後明示重新投入投資方向。「This is the time to get back in the saddle.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2082958254527664464" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确保有Sivers/AAOI多方信念，其他公司为主题需求数据而非各自方向。「I have full conviction in my names, especially optical interconnects like $SIVE or $AAOI.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2082230983487803755" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品架構及需求分析，正面公司語氣但無股票方向。「they&#x27;re working on CPO too」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2080445777395298454" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者直接投資方向。「Hyper bullish CPO $LITE $AAOI $SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2079694429951267289" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者將多年算力短缺明確當作所列股票多頭投資論點。「the AI trade isn&#x27;t over.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2079341645091188854" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Innolight卖方目标转述及产业需求读穿，无作者明确股票方向；SOI不能误映射美国能源公司。「$AAOI to $LITE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2078228019584668121" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">現價與反彈幅度抱怨。「$AAOI close to the 200s.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2078173339504288144" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">當前维持投資信念，對自引具体AAOI成長論點重新支持。「I have conviction that all these themes are backed by structural revenue growth」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2078150537074373117" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">以未實現成長和低市值反駁投資論點失效。「annualized $5.6B off a $8B MC.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2078130772121399553" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">當前反駁顶部並明確支持折價投資。「I also enjoy buying stuff at a discount.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2077769328653463813" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">他人持倉非作者方向。「He’s also long optics with retail favorite $AAOI.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2077476821797671094" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">自己當前持续支持多頭及主流低估論點。「names I&#x27;ve been bullish for so long like $LITE $AAOI」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2077152287273922706" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Tower与AAOI扩产消息的成长赞赏，没有明确股价/行动方向。「glad to see both of these companies」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2077039373711970804" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">直接表態及當前重倉。「Bullish $AAOI」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2077028286446620834" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明確對三公司需求投資前景看多。「bullish read through on US transceiver makers like $AAOI, $COHR, $LITE.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2076808331453415674" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">對兩股興奮反應，無可判方向。「ARE YOU NOT ENTERTAINED」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2075225312753750385" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">以折價估值及未變成長論點重申AAOI不對稱投資機會，明確看多；其他公司為比較背景。「now the same asymmetric thesis is 40% cheaper.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2074944367022977448" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确今日加码AAOI，转述空论及他人评级不归作者。「I also increased $AAOI in my &quot;Photonics Is Next&quot; portfolio today.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2074273679697961422" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确长期持有Sivers、相信估值巨大扩张，其他公司为合作/同业资讯。「$LITE, $SIVE, $AAOI」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2074046947434860971" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确持有光学组合与需求长线信念，支持其点名股票多方持有。「why I have conviction in it.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2072738199927926897" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明確以市值低估及未來營收支持投資論點。「of a stupid $9.3B MC today.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2072726120706007465" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者以AAOI扩产护城河论点明确Bullish，方向看多。「Bullish AFK $AAOI」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2072674406921376065" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">直接当前多頭及營收成長投資論點。「I&#x27;m actually more bullish than ever as prices go down.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2070179074048409662" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">本人持倉與需求未破壞的前瞻論點。「many of these names will have a major inflection point」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2069967746377662587" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者认为下一年会后悔没买CW瓶颈公司，明确聚焦低估的AAOI/Sivers/Tower。「next year I think we&#x27;ll look back and say &quot;Why didn&#x27;t I learn my lesson」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2069258326505140653" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">已發生漲幅反應。「单日反弹10%」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2069118626788155795" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">对买价问题请读者决定，提供AAOI收入及利润预测但无明确自己股价方向。「That’s for you to decide.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2069062745308254434" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">AAOI匿名看涨期权数据与技术支撑，无作者明确方向。「技术面支撑成立」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2069059062470472085" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确将AAOI和Sivers视为最看好投资并指出未来营收扩张，COHR为整合例子。「像 $AAOI 和 $SIVE 这样的激光公司是我个人的最爱」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2067542382523122001" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">CW激光供需业务分析及持仓披露，未明示股票方向；其他为采购背景。「own Sive and aaoi」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2067206734427697196" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者重申AAOI高信念多头并认为空头错误，明确看多。「my high conviction $AAOI long」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2067071462360666165" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">歷史漲幅回顧。「AAOI is $15.37B」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2066785056031670657" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者持有AAOI/Sivers并明确CW激光受益论点，其他公司仅供应状态。「Obvious CW laser beneficiaries:」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2066707573139763211" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">格言與舊自引不重新承諾。「Without controversy, there is no asymmetry.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2066587395122979173" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">歷史驗證回顧，未獨立新增AAOI方向。「watch all my thesis ideas play out」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2066521694836330618" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">持仓对出口放宽业务消息正面反应，未明示新股价方向。「My optical positions are very happy to hear this:」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2066340661633372452" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">自身加倉和明確進場觀點。「I do believe the stock at $170 is still a solid entry point and I began loading again heavily」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2066231137291415709" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">已發生復甦的正面反應，不当新的股票看多。「slightly recovering as they should.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2064705380933074945" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">本人持續投資機會與股價上行論點。「I continue to see asymmetry in $AAOI」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2064479078162567437" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">維護公司存續語氣。「disappearing anytime soon」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2064361170270933269" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">融資結構負面比較，無該股看空主張。「$AAOI capex ATMs」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2064237083510952402" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">投资方法反思；当前明确建议AAOI低估做多，余股是研究示例与泛品质判断，非单股方向。「probably undervalued might be a good idea to go long for next years.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2063465386960736396" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">本人歷史獲利來源。「profits off $SIVE to $AAOI」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2063235166336856251" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">風控持股泛論。「hold indiviudal stocks like $AAOI or $MRVL」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2063118835105014006" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确选择继续做多。「stay long on current company projections (eg. $AAOI」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2062927167936504133" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确股票偏好排序。「favorite CPO / photonics stock after AAOI」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2062903639300309302" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者持续加仓AAOI并预期翻倍三倍，明确看多；其他为客户与毛利背景。「imminent to double or triple if they execute」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2062697638500462639" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者认为AAOI 2.3倍市值目标可行并解释估值，明确看多；Intel为业务比喻。「That is a 2.3x from here」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2062205707488039131" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">他人交易表现反应。「day 1 ever for a full port challenge??? $AAOI」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2061503170585780452" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确AAOI未来投资比较及持续等候放量。「If you want the next $SNDK, you&#x27;re looking at it.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2061498698098708676" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者主张在2027估值口径形成前持有AAOI。「owning the name before its 2027 number」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2061448403314147594" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明示未來股票回報。「it could be a 4-5x return in 12-24M.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2061252644195504239" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">研究被報導。「$AAOI」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2060837455881031876" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">歷史收益称讚。「$SNDK to $AAOI」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2060578117320904884" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">自身明確看多再確認。「I’m actually even more bullish on $AAOI」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2060068635159478351" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确当前做多下一阶段CPO中的Sivers；其他已涨标的为旧交易回顾。「$AAOI」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2059646212803051722" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">感谢粉丝并回顾过去想法，未新增投资方向。「$AAOI」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2059479203746296219" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">研究認可。「关于 $SOI 或 $AAOI 的许多观点」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2059073941734662551" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者认为CPO重估尚未开始；Soitec代码身份无法核实。「$AAOI」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2058594141727060106" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">喜好不等於股票方向。「单纯喜欢像 $AAOI 这样的股票」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2058163202190680520" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者详细重申四项持有论点与未来更高股价；Sivers及AAOI看多，另两股身份待验证。「It&#x27;s likely going to keep rising as it hits that $400m+/month revenue target」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2055822766600016238" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者预测AAOI融资导致的股价下跌会被吸收，表达当前股价看多。「Expect the immediate drop in price to get absorbed」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2055145835193622781" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class