"https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2033848250101616646" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">转述黄仁勋光学供给不足，非作者投资方向。「$AAOI」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2033634984096108588" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者实际加仓。「I bought more $AAOI yesterday.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2032902835772502227" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确继续做多AAOI并低估论点，看多；同业为估值比较。「I am still long.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2032547247875903786" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">回顾基金规模收益及AAOI涨幅，没有新方向。「$AAOI」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2032524595199357106" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确加码AAOI及3至5倍目标，看多；其他为比较。「why I doubled down and loaded more」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2032292117226406280" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确对IRENPOET过量ATM看空；AAOI融资抱怨但仍预计增益，无单一空方。「not happy about it」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2032198562877227199" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">股东情绪反应，不是买卖。「$AAOI shareholders」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2031888825656680779" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者股票价格预期。「These $AAOI price targets are conservative」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2031807234079162393" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">舊自引收益。「$AAOI」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2031760383359529030" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确认可AAOI过低市值并预期重估，看多；Oracle客户AXTI比较背景。「Likely a long way to go for repricing photonic names」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2031206834879737894" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">对比量子与光学业务、过去价格变化，未明确当前投资方向。「$AAOI」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2031118556172005694" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确反对股票空头观点。「The short sellers are wrong about $AAOI.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2031088841025794390" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">当日价格回顾。「$AAOI」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2031014187401650192" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">产品订单资讯。「landed its first volume order」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2030997744987308242" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">业务订单肯定。「first volume order for 1.6T transceivers」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2030992022161461505" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">AAOI订单及经营执行验证，没有明确股票方向。「$AAOI」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2030973822514712627" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确看多该股。「We&#x27;re not bullish enough on $AAOI.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2029972403720441944" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者暗示AAOI是下一个LITE，当前多方投资推荐。「Sometimes, it might just be sitting right in front of you?」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2029950298492715170" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面股票评价但无明确交易或未来价格。「The most asymmetrical AI stock」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2029939322510791074" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者直接看多事件影响。「This delay is extremely bullish to certain photonics players like $AAOI.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2029698209199837354" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确判断估值上行空间。「There’s a raw, unadulterated upside」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2029659552141246661" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确AAOI当前加大集中与估值重估目标，看多；同业为比较。「$AAOI still has a legitimate path to re-rating to be worth tens of billions of dollars」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2029659125563674864" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">承接上行是否值得执行风险的直接肯定。「To me: Yes, Unequivocally.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2029492958550949893" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">條件式前瞻大幅上行。「re-rates to $35B+ or higher next year from $7B」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2029337803369349293" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者以当前最大持仓重申AAOI投资论点，看多。「$AAOI is my biggest position. Let me show you exactly why」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2029286378006003892" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">历史涨幅赞叹。「$AAOI to $LITE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2029189271572365661" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">AAOI旧收益及是否太晚的问题，無自身新方向。「$AAOI is up 92% in two days」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2028887853745488130" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">过去组合收益与Nvidia光学投资新闻，无新股票方向。「$AAOI jumped 57%」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2028886681949225404" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者预期收入增长驱动当前估值上修。「AAOI along with the entire supply chain will start to get repriced in now」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2028754498710290457" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确新投资对AXTI、AAOI及COHR的股票多方催化；旧自引目标无新承诺。「other optical networking companies like $AAOI」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2028465538444427584" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确投资为五项光学股尾风，当前股票看多；NVDA投资者背景。「This is a massive tailwind for photonics stocks」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2028464631195574674" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">收入增长称赞。「surprise ~900% revenue growth blowout projections」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2028380960954413389" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确认为IQE重估及AAOIAXTI相关业务价值未计价，看多；其他为订单背景或估值拥挤比较。「definitely not priced in yet」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2027830093247300016" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确认可远高于现值的估值上行。「A $50B market cap does not sound crazy」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2027459009138114560" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">當前市值對巨大收入規模的估值上行論點。「At a $5.5B MC.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2027435474793730240" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者披露AAOI当前最大仓位并论证新增长重估，表达当前看多。「I made it the #1 position in my photonics portfolio」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2027406143761645898" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者认可更高股价空间。「$54 is still very conservative in my view. $AAOI」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2027346783450312845" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">已发生涨幅回顾。「just doubled in the last two months」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2027275242628948103" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">AAOI财报笔记及业务论点实现，未新股票买卖方向。「Everything we thesis&#x27;d is playing out.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2027151623974494242" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者当前持仓明确。「It is the largest position in my photonics fund.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2027136707037151649" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">AAOI财报成绩赞誉，自引旧技术比较无新投资方向。「strongest year ever」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2027134722711912594" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确高上行非对称投资选择。「highest asymmetry bet」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2018462434554466647" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">AAOI产品及业务比较，没有明确股票投资方向。「$AAOI」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2018370861351284759" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">以AAOI及Marvell为核心论证股价重估，其余为微软芯片供应链背景。「far more transformative for its stock.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2003476197028852074" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">前瞻股票重估上行。「expect $AAOI to rerate.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2003259964526330053" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确股票正向重估预期。「$AAOI will revalue extremely fast.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2003024646367740327" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确持有AAOI和LITE并认为AAOI结构低估；其他公司为旧持仓或客户背景。「AAOI seems structurally undervalued」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/1999240464420250042" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">STO:SIVE</span><span class="s-n">253 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-03-16 → 2026-09-23</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Ren</b>：2026-07 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-03 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Zephyr</b>：2026-03 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">供需与产品进度评价，没有股票方向。「Sivers&#x27; partner」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2102763548715753927" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">建议客户预订激光产能，不是买卖 Sivers 股票。「If you lock up $SIVE laser supply」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2101402656845808007" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">供需確認尚無獨立股票方向。「confirmed by both Innolight / $SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2100938001077674262" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Sivers行业认可与业务成长赞赏，无明确股票方向；同业为比较。「proud to see this little company growing up」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2100008575229976995" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">當前持股及未来成長投資論點明确。「I&#x27;m personally a happy $SIVE shareholder for high-beta exposure」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2093988125144207710" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">溝通及估值顧慮但無確定方向。「The more time $SIVE spends in Swedish markets, the more they will be valued as such.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2093678493335011831" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">股東批評Sivers溝通與資本配置，沒有看空或賣出；其他公司為業務比較與自引背景。「CFO needs retraining or bring on a new one.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2093652781928448279" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者前瞻明確看好Sivers投資機會。「I think Sivers is going to cook after connecting the dots.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2093230562261823905" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者直接偏好其市值與成長機會。「$SIVE is the #1 for me in terms of MC relative to qualifications paths across the industry.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2093087267594314182" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Sivers业绩逐项解析与业务供给赞赏，没有明确股票投资方向。「very happy after reading the transcript」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2093054882282651723" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">財報反應與期待。「very excited so far.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2093014569279189295" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">上架與法說正面情緒。「excited for Sivers earnings + planned Nasdaq listing coming up.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2092517102339162263" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">法說與業務期待。「Regardless, excited for what&#x27;s up and coming.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2092186856792506435" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">供應鏈受益偏好但主要是技術路線推測，未明說股價或倉位。「I still think $SIVE is the cleanest read through」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2090735668532224224" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者直指光学股跌幅不合理、需求可见及安心等待，明确低估多方论点；其余仅产业佐证。「My opinion is that the optical sector underperformance recently from $AAOI to $SIVE has been absurd.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2090490101260591481" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者当前明示向上預期及長持；短線出售不覆蓋該觀點。「Will $SIVE go higher from here? Of course, that is why I&#x27;m still long it」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2089399105919619083" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者小倉買入POET且提出現金估值催化上行，AAOI明說清晰多頭；Sivers為技術比較。「technical moat for CW lasers」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2087846074027295020" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Sivers开发计划及去风险合作业务观察，无明确股票方向。「$SIVE announces a $3.4M development program with SemiNex!」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2087807614172488131" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">低市值稀缺供應商看多論點，等待需求拐點。「It&#x27;s very special you get one of the public 4 Western CPO leaders at a ~$1.5B MC with $SIVE.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2087447527595692180" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">财报电话会摘要肯定需求价格与业务时间，没有明确逐股投资方向；SIVEF代码未核实。「Positive pricing power for $SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2087329770879197549" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">具名光學公司投資持有建議。「Be sure to own the part of optics on the correct side of two transitions」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2087005727185383686" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面情境模型更新，未新增買入或明確股價方向。「I think it’s a good time to revisit $SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2086247069900300393" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">光學恢復結果回顧。「$LITE $AAOI $SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2085762483944391024" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">舊自引供應鏈分析。「$SIVE + other laser player readthrough」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2085711500875116887" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">赞赏卖方渠道检查与复盘光学股回升，没有新作者方向。「$AAOI, $LITE, $SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2085649654059016387" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明示買入POET以催化與資產論點支持，Sivers為正面業務讀穿。「nice read through upstream on $POET (derisking) /  $SIVE.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2085628664528662818" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确更看多有产能的既有CPO激光公司，AAOI供需新闻不看空，其他仅客户/竞争资料。「Just more bullish on the existing few qualified CPO laser names that have capacity.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2085603590903902621" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">激光瓶颈经营消息及正面读穿，没有明确股票方向。「$SIVE and $LITE should be happy」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2085511646257332581" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">AAOI电话会数据与产业需求赞赏，没有股票价格或行动方向。「read through for $LITE, $SIVE / $JBL」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2085499853099208716" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">新增交易號召與前景上修。「Be on the right side of this tradeor watch it pass by.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2085379897208234083" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确Sivers底部与看多，第三方减空资讯是支持证据。「Bullish $SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2085353128413548982" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者稱Sivers在光學中心，產品業務讚賞而非股票方向；其他為引文。「$SIVE finds itself yet again at the center of the photonics play」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2085219919524667427" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明確作者對Sivers看多。「$AEVA becoming an NPO/CPO player is highly bullish for $SIVE.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2085219567727431738" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Aeva产品新市场及Sivers供应链正面读穿，不是明确股票判断。「positive read through for upstream suppliers like $SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2085217487864643658" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">受惠產業提及無特定方向。「$LITE $AAOI $SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2084633351470600387" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">禁令的產業受益與供應鏈分析，未說股票投資方向。「A very material catalyst came about for Western supply chains」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2084597612175618342" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面供應瓶頸評價，不自動转成股票看多票。「glad this thesis is starting to see validation.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2083438823548293140" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">雷射量產時間正面。「stating &quot;production&quot; with Sivers lasers projected EOY 2026.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2083114743729107236" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">股價上漲號召。「Let’s send this to the moon.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2083033117925749076" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">所列光子股票及ETF選擇後明示重新投入投資方向。「This is the time to get back in the saddle.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2082958254527664464" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">業務利好讀穿非股票票。「a strong read through on $SIVE / $LITE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2082513405219631384" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确保有Sivers/AAOI多方信念，其他公司为主题需求数据而非各自方向。「I have full conviction in my names, especially optical interconnects like $SIVE or $AAOI.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2082230983487803755" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品架構及需求分析，正面公司語氣但無股票方向。「room for every qualified laser supplier」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2080445777395298454" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者直接投資方向。「Hyper bullish CPO $LITE $AAOI $SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2079694429951267289" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">本人長倉及前景押注。「I’m long $SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2079588876708909186" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">未確認客户前的條件受益，不推定方向。「That would be extremely positive for $SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2079495178793201678" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Innolight卖方目标转述及产业需求读穿，无作者明确股票方向；SOI不能误映射美国能源公司。「$SIVE (cw)」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2078228019584668121" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">當前維持長期部位，重新承接自引Sivers成長論點。「I personally have a longer horizon」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2078150537074373117" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者當前曝險與TAM成長論點。「Same applies to my CPO sector exposure like $SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2078130772121399553" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">將未來獲利與當前估值比較支持上行。「Sivers only needs a low end allocation from Win to make substantial gross income relative to current valuations.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2077768896061563339" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Sivers获得机构研究认可的业务赞赏，强调股价仍待收入兑现，无明确股票方向。「Great validation for Sivers.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2076872026615144666" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">矽光滲透產品讀穿，沒有獨立股票方向。「Positive for SiPH penetration eg. $SIVE / $JBL」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2076808331453415674" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">現行市值與全球重要性不對稱的投資論點。「A small $1.5B laser company next to your two leading $60B+ companies」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2076748688559587338" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">供應技術論點确认，但未明言投資方向。「supports my core $SIVE thesis.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2075645547978084371" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">玩笑式回顧圖形預測及CEO買股，未作投資方向。「predicted the $SIVE rally today」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2075539824589860866" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">價格反彈情緒。「We are so back!」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2075478927984705733" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">解释Sivers内部人士交易与新闻误导，无作者新股票方向。「is not insider panic」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2075466779288064483" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">公司規模成長預期，無股價承諾。「clear potential for Sivers to become the next photonics giant (myself included).」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2075289915697553697" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确长期持有四家并认为便宜估值可恢复，构成保有多方承诺。「leader of the next optical shift with $SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2074951295027568736" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确看多LITE/Sivers上游受益；雷达公司监管条件分析不等于无条件方向。「this is also bullish for upstream laser suppliers too like $LITE and $SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2074581698604593367" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确长期持有Sivers、相信估值巨大扩张，其他公司为合作/同业资讯。「I&#x27;m personally holding long term」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2074046947434860971" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">重申目前持倉信心與稀缺需求價值。「likely to become scarce resources.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2072726120706007465" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">称Sivers上市时间明确为正面业务进展，未表态股票方向。「Very material improvement from evaluation」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2072219315760488615" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">融資價格支撐與業務正評。「which typically sets a floor.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2072152226169331776" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Sivers融资正面评价附机构与折价条件，未形成无条件投资承诺。「it depends when more info comes out」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2072007692684837039" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">个人帐号媒体压力与旧研究回顾，没有新投资方向。「$RPI or $SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2071763387948859506" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">供應角色推測。「high confidence $SIVE as laser supplier」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2071488272245944399" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">潜在供應商猜測，未確立投资方向。「plausible merchant suppliers」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2070691462354993543" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">面对下跌明确保持投资承诺及未来成长论点。「I still have my million+ share position.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2070444675337503166" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">直接当前多頭及長期產能投資論點。「I&#x27;m actually more bullish than ever as prices go down.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2070179074048409662" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">本人長倉。「Disclosure, long Sive」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2069775271562289299" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">推测Sivers/Aeva/Apple产品合作及收入潜力，尚无明确股票方向。「$SIVE + Aeva」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2069388279355756826" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者认为下一年会后悔没买CW瓶颈公司，明确聚焦低估的AAOI/Sivers/Tower。「next year I think we&#x27;ll look back and say &quot;Why didn&#x27;t I learn my lesson」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2069258326505140653" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">維護公司語氣而非投資票。「how Swedish media treated $SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2068880324202008964" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确Sivers为最喜欢的激光瓶颈长仓，其他公司为合作佐证。「by far my favorite laser chokepoint long.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2068651355422814294" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品資格與較低風險肯定，不獨立股票方向。「higher risk than a major CPO player like $SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2068603148311404902" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确将AAOI和Sivers视为最看好投资并指出未来营收扩张，COHR为整合例子。「像 $AAOI 和 $SIVE 这样的激光公司是我个人的最爱」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2067542382523122001" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">CW激光供需业务分析及持仓披露，未明示股票方向；其他为采购背景。「own Sive and aaoi」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2067206734427697196" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品需求利好正面語氣。「hello $SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2067033934194696469" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明示當前長持及類似早期成長機會。「current $3B MC optical longs like $SIVE.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2066785056031670657" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者持有AAOI/Sivers并明确CW激光受益论点，其他公司仅供应状态。「Obvious CW laser beneficiaries:」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2066707573139763211" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">舊自引市場文化比較。「from $SIVE to $SOI」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2066676986324648239" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">以稀缺客户渠道及相对估值支持Sivers投资唯一性，明确多方论点；其他股为比较及客户。「Don’t think you’ll find another company.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2066498742942159288" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">持仓对出口放宽业务消息正面反应，未明示新股价方向。「My optical positions are very happy to hear this:」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2066340661633372452" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">過往成果。「This idea is now up ~1900%」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2065779524248510758" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">对Sivers独占性与优势提出质疑，没有股价或买卖方向。「I still haven’t seen any third-party or authoritative data showing that SIVE is superior」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2064986985295655235" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">仅表达不喜欢Sivers，不等同股票看空。「I don&#x27;t like $SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2064985091915575515" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">仅表达喜欢Sivers，不等同股票看多。「I like $SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2064983882802565169" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">已發生復甦的正面反應，不当新的股票看多。「slightly recovering as they should.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2064705380933074945" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">機構持倉及公司地位正面解讀。「US institutions validated Sivers’s position in photonics」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2064608597343125931" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">維護公司存續語氣。「disappearing anytime soon」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2064361170270933269" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">業務正面預期。「expecting more volume ramps to be coming soon」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2064246556690469123" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">供應商业务瓶頸背景，不直接該股方向。「$SIVE as the bottleneck」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2064237083510952402" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">他人購股及價格反應，不等同自己的看多。「Surprised $SIVE is only up 3.36%」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2063886704306802891" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明说Sivers供应链看多读穿；輝達为源数据，记忆股仅自引背景。「What a bullish read through on the SiPH supply chain from $SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2063603368178938193" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">歷史報酬比較。「$SIVE (1700%)」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2063347886818230388" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">本人歷史獲利來源。「profits off $SIVE to $AAOI」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2063235166336856251" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确当前最喜欢的股票并反驳做空。「$SIVE is my favorite CPO / photonics stock after AAOI.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2062903639300309302" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">肯定产业地位及既往上涨。「$SIVE being a core part of the CPO supercycle」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2062520852537917649" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确市值成長投資預測。「the next $75B $LITE over the next couple years.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2062433114933334487" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">直接股票上行預測及Sivers瓶頸例子。「all your upstream semi supply chain companies are going much higher.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2062378784855368077" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">赞赏分析师及其Nokia/Sivers/MXL目标价，不归作者方向。「$SIVE and $MXL」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2062249961463418970" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">政策读穿正面但无直接股票涨幅预期。「bullish read through for $SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2062176094162428410" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明確當前低估投資判断。「current valuations are very undervalued」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2062079425475473595" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者以政策资金作为两项投资论点受益理由，Sivers看多；XFab待验证，客户为背景。「I personally expect my two thesis ideas to be large beneficiaries:」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2062045895500419101" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确大幅市值上行预期。「My thesis is $SIVE can do the same from $3B」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2061815015892791408" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者具体上涨预测。「should easily 2x or 3x Sivers market cap over the medium term」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2061718299139100931" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">反駁不實資訊，未提出買賣。「spread disinformation about $SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2061624122560692587" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确认为Sivers相对未来收入低估；其他公司为合作背景。「I think $SIVE is very undervalued relative to forward revenue potential.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2061538735595069534" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">批评空头并期待放量，未提出作者新持仓或股票目标。「to profit off short term sentiment is likely going to see them turn into a long」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2061456212303221196" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者指出Sivers最大增长市场未被市场发现，明确被低估投资论点。「This is the biggest TAM expansion + revenue driver with $SIVE, markets haven’t noticed.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2061384495576789401" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">維護持有論點但沒有新增方向。「it’s a good reminder to know what you own」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2061365325741101442" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">研究成就回顧。「$SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2060896847695384736" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">当前要求举报虚假信息，自引旧上市观点无新投资方向。「I think $SIVE should just become a full American company」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2060872630111228150" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">公司戰略正評。「become a major US optical player」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2060855976513941567" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">肯定业务发展。「77% pipeline growth」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2060615296357196178" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确称Sivers财报很看多并重申增长论点；其他公司为伙伴背景。「Had some more time go through $SIVE earnings transcript, it’s very bullish:」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2060597940461486513" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">當下長倉承諾。「My high conviction CPO/photonics long is $SIVE for a reason.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2060273330804969764" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Sivers营收管线增长预期，业务赞誉未明说股票方向。「It’s probably going to look exponential from here on out.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2060268650796622131" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">營運管線與量產正評。「Overall, very positive.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2060258820547588300" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">維護公司及舊研究。「SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2060045781881725424" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">維護公司。「SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2060013416170107320" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确维持持仓并计划增持。「I haven’t sold and don’t plan to sell a single share.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2060002002994971046" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">業務成長預期非股票方向。「very meaningful for revenue.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2059939664082186246" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">MRVL财报支持CPO及Sivers业务假设，未明确股票买卖方向。「SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2059830121117446415" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确当前做多下一阶段CPO中的Sivers；其他已涨标的为旧交易回顾。「my CPO longs」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2059646212803051722" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者重申持有做多政策受益者，Sivers明确看多；其他欧股待验证。「Glad to all my longs there」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2059561586956837085" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">反駁空頭抹黑。「Hope they get blown apart on their short positions now.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2059527061207937490" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">指出Sivers政策及供应链地位，無明确股票方向。「Europe’s leading photonics/laser company called $SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2059475755277713611" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">当前个股投资偏好。「$SIVE is the most compelling CPO exposure stock to me.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2059242587354169403" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">業務及供應鏈資訊。「$SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2059057639238365336" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确预测Sivers应达更高估值，看多；客户及投资机构为背景。「I&#x27;d expect $SIVE to command similar if not higher valuations」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2058868791438884870" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">过去选股认可。「$SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2058839070122688829" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">指向同一Sivers资金买盘与政策利好。「Extremely bullish.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2058806097436455283" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">分析机器人供应链业务敞口，未明确股票买卖方向。「$SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2058644487224848654" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面事件資訊。「institutional inflow into Sivers」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2058145137214329150" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">公司研發讚許。「most valuable IP」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2058131516346315226" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">Sivers追赶LITE巨额估值目标，明确看多；同业与客户为背景。「For $SIVE to become the next $80B+ $LITE.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2058060753933131949" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确当前投资利好判断。「This is in fact extremely bullish for Sivers.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2057804691321577607" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品及公司重要性。「kingmaker for CPO」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2057720796613873805" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">公司称赞及过去涨价。「crown jewel photonics company in $SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2057374458659389842" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">业务进展称赞。「The story keeps getting better.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2057117978014126372" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">看好Sivers并购能力，业务赞誉与自引旧论点，無明确股票方向。「I’m extremely sure Sivers knows what to acquire」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2057084047466414107" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者重申上市流動性帶來重估。「after new US liquidity reprices of MC/shares on listing.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2057059745429901334" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">預期任何回調都被買進。「$SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2057008127917347125" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">收入催化相對当前市值的看多判斷。「This type of statement is just incredibly material for Sivers revenue relative to their current marketcap.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2056993753882345818" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Apple项目时间表猜测与Sivers营收能见度，不等于股票方向。「markets might appreciate multi-year revenue visibility」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2056877645275820418" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者认为Sivers空头将受损并列催化，明确看多；客户为背景。「I personally don&#x27;t think it&#x27;s going to end well for the Swedish locals shorting」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2056640420008878330" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明確看多政府資助催化。「This is incredibly bullish」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2056611841011548647" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确做多CPO并认为Sivers买点有吸引力；仍预期LITE和COHR上行。「nothing more compelling going long on CPO」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2056558267896311996" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者详细重申四项持有论点与未来更高股价；Sivers及AAOI看多，另两股身份待验证。「it&#x27;s a comfortable hold for the next few years」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2055822766600016238" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">公司治理讚許。「optimal to have more US executives」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2055367916426756386" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">新增看多催化。「So implications for $SIVE, is enormous piggybacking off of Amazon’s ecosystem growth.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2055182601158074769" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明示看多。「this is highly bullish for Sivers」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2054896661672210817" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确极度看多Sivers，并称AEVA放量对双方看多；其他为业务背景。「TLDR: Extremely Bullish.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2054868760629272850" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">仍有很大上行空間。「$SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2054687492750889323" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者预期指数纳入带来被动买盘，表达股价利好。「triggers more passive inflows」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2054502564591464554" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">企业上市事件。「I’d expect things to speed up on NASDAQ listing」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2054477165996241336" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">與同業巨大重估比較當前市值及瓶頸。「$SIVE is $1.6B today in 2026.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2054470106244350122" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者预测结构性重估持续，看多Sivers；其余欧股待验证。「I expect all 3 ($RPI, $SIVE, and $SOI) to keep delivering record growth as AI, SiPH, and CPO drive structural re-rating.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2054141853566726371" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者称Sivers最具吸引力长多并预期空头无限损失，明确看多。「one of the most compelling CPO related longs」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2053851494924034481" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">赞誉Sivers融资上市助扩张，未明确股票方向。「Getting 2.5% dilution passed with $SIVE is actually extremely positive」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2053809563535905063" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明確做多看法。「the most compelling CPO long」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2053741502808133638" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Sivers股权持有数据与机构名单，其他银行为托管背景非推荐；無作者股票方向。「The US/West now controls majority of the shares of $SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2053232613561909746" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">股權結構觀察。「Transfer seems almost complete?」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2052679583892426925" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">媒體及持股結構評論。「$SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2052653551311094074" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确未来市值。「IMO, $SIVE ends up as a $10B+ company next year」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2052296867653066978" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-07</div><div clas