 year.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2051566667009073315" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确称Sivers被市场遗漏与多方指标，看多；合作公司为背景。「highly bullish indicator for Sivers」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2051432439432740931" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Sivers可能客户消息，无作者投资方向；未验证OTC代码另记。「likely undisclosed laser supplier」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2051357868126044577" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明示看多。「This is why I’m so bullish on $SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2051198288997789765" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确持续看多Sivers，其他已验证股票为架构背景或自引旧论点。「I&#x27;m so incredibly bullish on CPO names like $SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2051033642416361642" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">最佳光學投資曝險。「$SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2051014522610372712" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Sivers产业地位与供应映射预测，未股票方向；MVL疑似笔误不可强映MRVL。「Tier 1 laser supplier」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2050833230736269767" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确看多列举CPO受益者；SiversTSEM看多，另三公司待验证。「why I’m so bullish on CPO.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2050762148545216899" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者未來市值上行預測。「My prediction is if and when Sivers hits $4-8B on NASDAQ」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2050272539851821157" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">机构需求推测。「US institutions now want exposure.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2049941088165892196" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">解释Sivers涨幅的防务业务消息，没有明确股票方向；OTC及York代码未核实。「$SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2049916817519587600" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">市場未定價未來收入催化。「I don&#x27;t think markets have priced all of this in」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2049767690425016780" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确称直接Marvell客户关系对Sivers很看多；其余为供应背景。「Going direct to $MRVL is very bullish for $SIVE.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2049761085872570864" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">过去投资结果。「names like $SIVE, $AAOI」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2049576551944204385" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品及業務期待。「most excited for photonics」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2049386026460942645" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确当前做多承诺。「And it’s my high conviction long moving forward.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2049032343974007088" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">业务激光需求受益。「$SIVE that powers Jabil」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2048929438679896317" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者直接对Sivers投资看多。「which is even more bullish」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2048817355141337188" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确重申Sivers低估与多方论点，客户为背景。「I still think it&#x27;s undervalued」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2048801270337831047" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class