class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确POET及Sivers未充分定价，低估看多；Marvell为客户背景。「Markets haven&#x27;t fully priced in either yet imo.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2046918449168085183" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者當前明示看多。「But I’m very bullish on $SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2046894773706035638" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">上游供應背景。「$SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2046879187076817237" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">重大供應催化與市場低估論點。「This find looks structurally massive for $SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2046696582696083634" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">維護公司，無買賣承諾。「no understanding of semiconductors/photonics」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2046507698037170575" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">營運管線正面解讀，舊自引看多不新增。「materiality looks large for Sivers.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2046494023297429645" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确Sivers多方与未计价论点，看多；其他为客户伙伴背景。「highly bullish for $SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2046363533471035793" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">架構供應鏈資訊。「$SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2046187732800782587" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">未來客戶及市場定價催化。「structural multi-year catalyst past 2028.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2045932788218794257" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者對未來投資回報表達方向。「Wait 6 months and you’ll probably see the same thing with $SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2045723587966107858" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确Sivers关键供应商被市场遗漏与低市值论点，看多；AmazonMarvell为背景。「Markets missed Sivers as the critical laser supplier」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2045682728432185713" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明示未來投資收益方向。「Probably expect them all to compound another triple digits from here」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2044682729128874210" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者直接当前长仓。「This is exactly why I long the $SIVE laser ecosystem with Win Semi (3105).」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2044597208860016877" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明示未來股價上漲。「We’ll likely going to see a parabolic ride up from the news.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2044553960431014359" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">業務合作確認。「to use $SIVE Lasers」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2044287196300226960" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">当前长仓承诺。「my longs, especially with CPO/Silicon Photonics related stuff like $SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2044077799338881108" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确认为Sivers估值不合理且将获机构重估，表达看多。「Valuation disconnect makes no sense」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2043602257292534014" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">歷史信息發現與估值比較。「$SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2042819960301588910" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">回顾IQE过去涨幅并猜下一十倍股，未明确新持仓；IQE身份未核实。「$SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2042549185095045231" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者推荐Sivers提前布局且风险已计价，看多；其余为客户比较。「a lot of fears are priced into its ~$350M MC」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2042507141618004372" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">當日漲幅反應。「$SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2041791434525962584" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">期待估值重估。「will likely drive valuation premiums」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2041774512904294595" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">产品放量研究肯定。「$SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2041706026068799877" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确预计所偏爱的三只激光股票在更好宏观环境继续上涨。「I expect many of them to be up more than they are now.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2041650903305089389" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">英伟达投资Marvell及Sivers供应关系推测，未明确股票方向。「$SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2038954532944875733" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者当前股票投资选择。「my #1 pick for frontrunning the next architectural supercycles」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2038943956697059637" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者重申Sivers未来百亿美元市值看多；AXTI供应链辩护与其他旧研究为背景。「$SIVE can be a $10B+ company one day」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2038934006734135572" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">提议Broadcom并购Sivers属于企业战略设想，QLCM代码不匹配。「$SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2038221422808760744" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者自己的投资市值上行路径。「become a $10B+ company.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2038092601224831103" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">公司定位肯定。「$SIVE the laser supplier」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2037698708612210693" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确购买公司股权并认为Sivers被错误定价。「I just bought ~.5%-1% of $SIVE as a company.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2037503648520179834" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确股票高估与长期投资否定。「Sivers is just trading at a very high valuation」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2037449512327782625" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确主张做多Sivers和Win供应链；Win海外身份未核实，同行为架构背景。「It’s highly asymmetrical to long both the supply chain」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2037442444367974907" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">旧自引投机风险，无当前新卖出。「very speculative as a mid/long term bet」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2037427023342383575" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">风险谨慎，未明确股价方向。「very speculative as a mid/long term bet」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2037425664987701755" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">批评Sivers激光技术劣势，技术评价不等于股票看空；同业为性能比较。「Gap is too large between them and the big bois」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2037404598835830902" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">當前投資買入機會。「retail has a rare opportunity to frontrun institutions with $SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2037078978696028364" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确未来投资回报。「I expect this to be my next personal 10x」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2036801199073382422" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确当前高信念多头。「high conviction longs aside from $SIVE and $LITE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2036493814656106744" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">认为AXTI传统估值过高但战略价值更高，方向混合；其余为旧行情回顾。「$SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2036458844793217133" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确股票上行判断。「Probably the highest upside tech-stock in their country」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2036375883037155802" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确认为Sivers今日应值20亿美元，表达看多；旧资金名单仅引用背景。「this company should be $2B+ today.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2036289688227684729" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者当前明确多头。「High conviction long.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2036085968319680677" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">过去投资论回顾。「Both $SIVE and $AEVA were my two longs」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2035897562025410927" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">当前持仓及未来估值上行。「I personally have a long position」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2034993411821117462" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明確建議繼續做多。「$SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2034634272733343835" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者当前股票投资选择及低估上行。「one of the best opportunities in photonics today.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2034584155036828052" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确认为Sivers当前市值低估其Jabil合作敞口，表达看多。「Might be underpricing it.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2034543082071597422" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者认为低市值Sivers可成为下一个LITE并重申论点，明确投资看多；其余为伙伴背景。「I think they genuinely have a shot at becoming the next $LITE.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2034531113574736053" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">新增投資論點驗證。「This is thesis validation that Sivers is the next $LITE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2034524869086552292" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明確未定價投資機會。「an extremely undiscovered opportunity」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2034087274800091401" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Sivers伙伴消息业务论点验证，自引旧多方论点无本次新股票方向。「This is thesis validation」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2033820269358571800" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确当前投资对象。「$SIVE, as my personal CW DFB laser exposure」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2033695716938551350" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确继续持有Sivers并给出百亿美元多头情景；同行为业务比较。「And I’m holding shares」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2033535833085718996" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者直接长仓。「I’m long $SIVE at $140M.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2033466880661606646" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:KRKNF</span><span class="s-n">227 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-10-05 → 2026-10-02</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></span><span class="flip">1 人反轉</span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-4.0%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2025-10 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2025-10 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> → 2026-10 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者指出 Anduril 催化劑延後、流動性不足及更好的替代機會，負面看待當前持有吸引力。「the catalyst is delayed, and there&#x27;s more exciting, fast moving sectors」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2106083350159253575" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者把$KRKNF列為過去「國際市場錯價」交易範例之一,未表態現在方向。「$KRKNF, $SOI.PA, $M7U before 1-200% moves」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2097007843799171358" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者財報數字整體正向，但特別點出「didn&#x27;t like」的部分：Anduril尚未量產、沒有美國廠、CAMP時程未公布，動搖了原本的Anduril代理股論點，正負交雜難判方向。「here&#x27;s what I didn&#x27;t like: ... It appears that Anduril isn&#x27;t ready for full scale production, so Kraken is talking to more customers.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2093066959986610610" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者認為無人機股今年秋天可能因兩黨立法支持與國防預算大漲，並具體點名此股作為受惠標的「I think drone stocks could go on a tear this fall.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2091681510739054761" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">建议重新研究Kraken基本面，研究关注未变为明确买进或股价预期。「Hard not to revisit $KRKNF fundamentals at these levels」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2080513091834376568" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">重申Kraken為十年全部持有首選並給估值理由，明確看多。「the no brainer all in hold for me over 10 years」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2079970466610196546" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面基本面及估值介紹，未明說買入或未來價格方向。「trading at a significant discount」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2072704346744029674" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">大幅折價及重配投資論點。「We&#x27;re calling the bottom on defense stocks」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2072024859563987322" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">認為賣壓錯誤並强调最佳防務投資曝險。「The sell off is complete bullshit.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2068020287397052689" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明確股票上行基準及估值低估。「Roughly 65% from here.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2067713003479585105" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者仍集中持有并论证市场错误定价。「remains a concentrated position」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2062619242072355023" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">社群與耐心讚賞，舊自引不再投票。「0 problem being patient + concentrating intelligently.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2061898548749422966" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确长仓Kraken，主张国防海底技术低估与再评级机会。「Long $KRKNF.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2061796474027929977" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">未计价收入成長投資论点。「And none of it is priced in.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2060409471789404176" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">欢呼交易平台开放Kraken并询问是否做多HOOD，未作明确承诺。「$KRKNF」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2060395925487697997" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确表明做多Kraken两个市场代码。「LONG $KRKNF $PNG」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2060083991651520788" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确Kraken低估且牛市目标近翻倍，看多；同业仅估值比较。「I still think it&#x27;s one of the highest quality growth stocks you can own.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2059395903346373043" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确重申Kraken低估并预测多倍未来收益，看多；其他为历史收益比较。「I am still in love with the stock and think it is highly undervalued here.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2054680371577700745" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Kraken杠杆ETF上市消息与不确定性，ETF排除，底层股票無作者方向。「Defiance is launching a 2X ETF of $KRKNF」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2052488028665639274" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">現有持倉收益情緒。「$KRKNF」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2051776592096223610" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">当前长期持股信心及定投偏好。「Mine is a &lt; $2B MC defense stock $KRKNF.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2049512076675354770" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">当前明确偏好长仓。「my fave long $KRKNF」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2048244936798306631" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">过去投资比较。「most asymmetrical defense stock since $KRKNF」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2046228271214600605" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者當前持有及未來超額回報。「I think it will outperform the vast majority of the market」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2044792665666138167" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者当前第一大持股。「My #1 position $KRKNF / $PNG.V」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2044471587404189715" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Kraken涨幅与行业叙事回顾，无新方向。「$KRKNF surging from the depths」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2043769125437354147" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Kraken美国海军供应链消息，未明确股票方向。「$KRKNF」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2043023263736172723" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确认为Kraken股票将带来巨大投资收益。「$KRKNF stock will change lives」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2043001133845889176" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者当前长期股票立场。「This is not a TRADE. This is a long.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2042675022284886442" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">别人历史交易表现。「$KRKNF」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2042015776916566424" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">称赞Kraken技术演示并询问合作，没有股票投资方向。「$KRKNF」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2041536525742264632" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">客戶與投資收益前景。「$KRKNF」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2040107296781672919" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者当前投资上行论。「Iran is accelerating the 10x thesis.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2039370860382097764" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确称Kraken价格便宜且正在买入。「So I&#x27;m buying $KRKNF」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2037603370639433792" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确做多Soitec但海外上市身份未核实；AAOI和Kraken是当前持仓对照。「behind $AAOI and $KRKNF」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2037254062421533091" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明確做多並支持當前估值。「Long da krak.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2036827087580057941" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">报道验证Kraken技术需求，没有明确股票方向。「$KRKNF」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2034245432499695701" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者当前明确投资推荐。「How can $KRKNF not be in your portfolio?」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2033369678962401312" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">持倉與新增催化強化投資論點。「puts the long Anduril thesis on roids.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2032644972491710610" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">营运订单预测。「A multi-billion $ order is coming.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2032116314509361651" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者以保守分析师目标支持更高上行。「If THESE guys have 30% upside above current prices.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2032105781093679492" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确上行判断。「there is tremendous upside for retail.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2031789022830608859" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">旧Kraken集中仓位与涨幅及未给出答案的问题，無新方向；两市场分别确认。「$KRKNF / $PNG.V」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2031745912574468409" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">研究成果肯定。「The world just learned what we already knew」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2031742208815108242" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">以Kraken相对同业低估及技术需求论证投资价值，表达看多两个市场代码。「still trades at a fraction of the multiples」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2031565394096668780" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Kraken防雷业务市场机会，未股票方向。「critical role in defending against Iran&#x27;s mines」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2031497724894560361" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">业务验证及社群反应。「What will the doubters say now?」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2031472248293380238" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Kraken行业曝光赞誉，自引旧未具名10倍论点，无本次新方向。「became the hottest stock in the world」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2031462908455170245" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">兴奋语气。「$KRKNF LFG」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2031456673123152059" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者正向估值重评预期。「This is the kind of re-rating that changes a stock&#x27;s valuation forever.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2031440111796376035" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">当前明示未来股价上涨。「The rise to the top will be bibilical.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2031395349852815773" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">业务需求及活动宣传。「our entire economy depends on safe waterways」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2031374690795794731