tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">节目称赞。「it was awesome!」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1993439474068734371" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者回顾KRKNF业绩日反弹与他人买入机会，未表达作者的新交易或价格目标。「Savvy investors saw a killer buying opportunity and led the recovery」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1993079222609625176" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者肯定KRKNF业绩与产能并称论点增强，没有明确新增买卖或股票价格预测。「Thesis intact and stonger.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1993065405641113753" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者用盈利比较指出KRKNF低估式错误定价，偏多；ONDS仅作财务对比。「market is grossly inefficient on $KRKNF」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1992993470353699194" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确持有和上行目标。「Not selling until $40.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1992977165311471839" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">针对财报经营数字的正面语气。「all these numbers are so bullish」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1992969960101175310" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明確股價上行預測。「will be a double digit stock in no time.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1992756495436632432" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">財報期待情緒。「$KRKNF」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1992669740301684750" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确该股看多。「HOW ARE YOU NOT BULLISH」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1992636586736206134" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">赞赏Kraken管理、产品及增长数据，未给出作者股票投资方向。「$KRKNF」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1992108532188299680" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">业务成熟度称赞。「an established company hitting inflection point」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1991897013462647194" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">产品研究称赞。「covers it well.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1991607466216550663" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">业务与战略重要性正面评价。「It is existential.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1991167330148331820" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">个人成功愿望和表情式持仓宣传，没有明确股票方向。「When I finally make it」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1991146375233351917" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">声呐产品性能比较，未给出股票投资方向；其他海外公司身份未核实。「$KRKNF」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1991141661485781246" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">相对安全性与营收确定性正面评价。「Every stock feels like gambling to me except $krknf」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1990872551028109595" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">描述KRKNF多头情绪与市场对比，不能把群体情绪当作作者股票方向。「$KRKNF bulls are calm as can be」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1990839169527263629" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品性能稱讚。「$KRKNF」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1990733722728214648" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">潜在业务应用评价。「modular sonar could be relevant」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1990452369696432479" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">管理层履历与历史市值涨幅回顾，不是新的作者买卖判断。「$KRKNF」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1990386182925230253" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">直接买入持有建议。「Buy them. Hold them through the noise.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1990157425408876552" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">社群感谢，不是投资方向。「genuinely grateful」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1990147482869813273" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">推荐他人的Kraken研究阅读，没有采纳其投资方向；其他为引用中的研究文章名称。「$KRKNF」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1990132087047754136" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">业务市场空间正面评价。「massive commercial TAM」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1990102194767471089" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">財報事項監看。「$KRKNF」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1989414072392323572" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确选择在回调时加仓Kraken，表达看多。「for me it&#x27;s $KRKNF every time」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1989081356333453790" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">过去交易庆祝。「Being able to buy $KRKNF below $4 last week」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1987895128820957577" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Kraken跟随市场下跌及无人防务产业周期观点，没有作者股票买卖判断。「$krknf」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1986857111406715314" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">公司新业务应用赞扬。「Underwater vision is priceless」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1986528154815778820" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者赞许KRKNF作为军工主承包商的业务能力，不是股票投资方向。「all the capabilities of a defense prime」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1986459581636354089" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Anduril工厂新闻和Kraken供应内容，Toyota仅为生产方式比喻，没有股票投资方向。「Each Ghost Shark runs on $KRKNF batteries.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1985121713814753476" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">对Anduril工厂新闻及Kraken投资者反应的调侃，没有作者投资承诺。「$KRKNF」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1985100686397440136" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Kraken单机收入潜力及公司赞赏，没有明确股价、估值或买卖方向。「This company will change lives.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1984284378525213031" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者兴奋报道工厂及Kraken单船供货金额，未明确交易或股票价格方向。「Each Ghost Shark carries ~$10M CAD of Kraken content」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1984272737934926076" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">讨论Kraken机构持股比例造成的估值折价；明确重估价格目标来自他人，作者未采纳目标或给出买卖方向。「The institutional ownership gap appears to be driving the valuation discount.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1983665240567840805" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明確未来投资成功期待。「true success story for the West and the retail investing community.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1983261765371867193" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确股票投资上行空间。「asymmetric upside」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1983022546401575155" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者肯定Kraken供应商切换壁垒，业务护城河观点未形成股票方向。「such a strong moat.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1982968977157500939" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">讨论Kraken社群内容影响，没有股票方向。「$KRKNF」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1982878733553070423" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">董事防务履历与关联公司背景赞赏，没有股票投资方向。「$KRKNF」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1982137882157727827" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">政策潜在受益新闻关联，无明确交易。「$KRKNF」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1982081165516263516" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">行业及公司业务乐观评论。「Underwater drones will be as ubiquitous」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1981751509705515112" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">当前只有含糊的市场未注意表态，旧自引的业务和价格不构成新增股票方向。「They still don’t know…」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1981748081092702608" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">公司收入关税风险减轻。「$KRKNF」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1981714302764499236" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">业务和社区肯定。「real business with real contracts」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1981538259466367284" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">描述其他账户发现Kraken业务机会，未给作者股票买卖方向。「underwater defense is having its moment」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1981100533533593917" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">已發生價格及流入。「$KRKNF」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1981099312362000493" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">他人买入与社区欢迎。「Welcome to the underwater revolution」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1981090684086980924" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者预期KRKNF获得类似迷因股的回报，明确看多；BYND只是回顾双向短线娱乐交易。「It&#x27;ll produce meme stock level returns」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1981052953659396254" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">业务机会与社区称赞。「this hidden gem」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1980711170186322077" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者称Kraken最被低估并预期很快涨到双位数，明确看多。「Double digits in no time.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1980656427233607944" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">他人買入故事。「$KRKNF」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1980607491638477197" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者以70%现有持仓表达Kraken投资信念，并重申将成为行业大受益者，偏多。「One of the main reasons I have 70% of my portfolio in $KRKNF」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1980379789224714469" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Kraken代码加澳洲Anduril订单新闻，没有作者方向。「$KRKNF」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1980351312291356969" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确表明自己是Kraken投资者，表达现有多头投资。「Kraken Robotics Investor」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1980337217571795160" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">推介他人Kraken文章及其ASTS历史战绩，没有本作者股票方向。「THIS IS A MUST READ $KRKNF」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1980275896796787146" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确有Kraken投资敞口，并赞赏Anduril关联投资，表达现有多头。「Blessed to have exposure to @anduriltech this early」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1979296478687563957" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">无人防务对AI及台湾安全的重要性论述，没有股票买卖或价值判断。「$KRKNF」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1978480679056027934" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">业务使用增长。「A record number of participants used Kraken&#x27;s sonar」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1978142565678424197" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者直接称Kraken为最被低估的防务科技投资，表达看多；引用行业名单不转作作者对其他股票的判断。「the most undervalued defense tech play」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1978140268483281059" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">以Kraken持仓回应地缘担忧的玩笑，没有明确新的买卖或股价预测。「My Portfolio: $KRKNF」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1977844570340905189" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">庆祝KRKNF创新高并暗示新闻机会，未给明确新增交易或未来目标。「$KRKNF FRESH ATH」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1977827798283948255" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">乐观情绪和条件性设想。「Imagine the price discovery」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1977826680010858598" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">社群活動。「$KRKNF」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1977821563454927262" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">赞许军用人机协作与Anduril技术，KRKNF标签不构成股票投资方向。「amplifying human decision-making with AI」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1977809819311690161" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">过去成交和价格庆祝。「already at record volumes and close to ATH」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1977776976435040563" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者直接当前重仓。「Why am I so deep in $KRKNF?」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1977432324401938893" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">供应链业务稳定性肯定。「supply chains are Xi proof」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1976697224743842280" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确大额押注Kraken并称AVAV、KTOS严重高估，形成看多与看空的相对价值判断。「Hence my big bet on $KRKNF」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1976395025052561556" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同業相比当前低估与高成長。「1/10th the P/E multiple of defense peers」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1976055237170343963" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">产品战略能力肯定。「supplies the eyes and power」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1976020868087066807" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者直接称深海KRKNF和TMC为当前真正alpha，表达看多；ASTS和RKLB仅为喜爱语气。「the real alpha right now」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1975975486770774319" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确维持KRKNF四十美元目标价，表达上涨预期。「My PT remains firm at $40 USD」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1975962199014379660" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者当前持仓集中配置。「70% porting $KRKNF」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1975927901066535107" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">澳洲Ghost Shark采购与Kraken供应商业务观点，没有股票投资方向。「$KRKNF」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1975893949454700650" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">庆祝Kraken已发生的年度涨幅及产能背景，没有新投资方向。「136% YTD」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1975692719679840644" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">已發生價格紀錄。「$KRKNF」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1975666686398505183" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產能合作正評。「$KRKNF」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1975615857427697676" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">业务优势评论。「Kraken supplies both US underwater defense pathways.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1975609324383969592" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确以五至十年期限投资Kraken，表达多头。「I&#x27;m playing $KRKNF over 5-10 years.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1975600135129440421" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">报告Kraken当日涨幅与上市转板愿景，未明确作者买卖方向。「+7% to start the day」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1975572121314337238" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">持倉与尚早的上行投資判斷。「We’re so early it’s criminal.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1975384296635441646" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Kraken技术在无人海战产业中的地位赞赏，没有股票方向。「$KRKNF」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1975344569660178717" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确未来股票价格目标。「The road to $40 starts TODAY!」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1975286239063646445" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明確持有建議。「How can you not own some」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1975242675151642828" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">社群口号。「Get Kraked」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1975241862593323151" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">海底电缆新闻与行业监测需求观点，KRKNF未给股票方向；微软为引用来源。「underwater surveillance revolution isn&#x27;t coming. It&#x27;s here.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1975240133894152273" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">承接Kraken市场和无人潜航器需求的作者投资时机判断。「We&#x27;re so fucking early.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1975223270820512059" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">行业业务机会赞扬，没有明确投资方向。「We&#x27;re so fucking early.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1975108774051414110" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Kraken作为海底防护供应链投资主题的定位，没有买卖、持仓或股价方向。「the picks and shovels play.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1975011627083927955" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">目前價格相對需求與供應收益低估。「still under $5」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1974940277979959720" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者承接当前KRKNF低价明确投资推荐。「who to buy 2 years ago」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1974933673586950233" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者介绍Kraken技术栈及切换成本，业务赞许并非股票买卖方向。「switching costs become massive.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1974932605209661458" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">业务收入前景正面评价。「$730M potential annual revenue」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1974895910518714530" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">潜艇需求与防务开支周期论述，没有Kraken股票买卖方向。「$KRKNF」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1974894929819341152" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">KRX:005930</span><span class="s-n">223 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-12-01 → 2026-10-04</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="flip">1 人反轉</span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+2.2%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Jukan</b>：2026-03 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> → 2026-04 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> → 2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2026-02 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Ren</b>：2026-07 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-01 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Zephyr</b>：2026-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>大老师</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者直接認為客製 HBM 讓 Micron、SK Hynix 與 Samsung 的產品更黏著、合約更長。「bullish for memory.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2106546457167671735" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">讚美 Samsung 的 HBM base die 與定價能力，屬技術評價，沒有直接對股票方向表態。「Things you can do when you have the best base die」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2105911728299282643" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">技術竊取爭議新聞，未表股票方向。「former Samsung Electronics employees」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2104726407880556852" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">他人盈利比較。「names currently profitable like $SNDK or Samsung.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2103869705509388694" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">AAOI业务看多但股价受增发抑制，2027跑赢附停止发行条件；其他为融资/机会成本案例。「Samsung」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2103151990146801812" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者多头标的是记忆体主题及 ETF，没有三星独立明确方向。「The main duo $SKHY and Samsung」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2101906175046635887" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面新聞反應。「NICE」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2101578440315216119" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">低估值持續短缺支持中期多方結論。「Both FY2027 ~2.8-3x fwd P/E off analyst projections.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2099659874892386678" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">估值及需求正面反問，從嚴不當投資票。「Samsung has memory LTAs extending to 2031?」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2099392042657038698" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者將Samsung與MU、SNDK、SKHY並列為記憶體採購支出的高毛利受惠者。「when all that memory procurement spend hits the balance sheets of $MU, $SNDK, Samsung, $SKHY with 70-80%+ margins」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2098306366167535766" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">純轉述中國CXMT快速擴產、逼近韓廠產能的新聞，屬競爭威脅脈絡，作者未加入自己對三星股價的判斷。「CXMT is expected to rapidly narrow the production capacity gap with major Korean players such as Samsung Electronics and SK hynix.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2098239574443250137" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">認為其基底晶片較佳且高頻寬記憶體產能擴張速度明顯較快「Samsung has a better base die and is also expanding HBM capacity much more rapidly」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2098018599466111294" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，被列為受惠於記憶體漲價的廠商「So $SKHY, Samsung, $MU, should be happy to hear this」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2097937708178186303" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者用「👀👀 On device AI chips?」的好奇語氣揣測OpenAI與三星電子在next-gen晶片合作可能指向裝置端AI晶片，但只是提問並未明確表態看漲看跌「👀👀 On device AI chips?」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2097567000151413216" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">只是轉述三星德州Taylor廠已開始營運的韓媒報導，沒有加上作者自己對股價方向的判斷「Samsung&#x27;s Taylor foundry fab has already begun operations.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2097459601780441322" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">報導三星顯示器明年對蘋果的OLED供應量將翻倍成長，顯示其面板業務擴張，但這是產業轉述而非作者自身表態「Samsung Display has reportedly set a business plan to significantly expand next year&#x27;s supply volume, centered on foldable phones and iPads, Apple&#x27;s new OLED demand sources.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2097225172864692461" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">報導指三星德州Taylor廠尚未正式量產即已滿載，2nm良率由年初約60%大幅提升到可量產的80%左右，並拿下特斯拉AI5、博通新一代通訊晶片等大單，晶圓代工業務動能明顯轉強。「The 2nm yield , which stood at around 60% earlier this year, is reported to have recently reached the 80% range」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2097166388842684917" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，作者對韓國散戶過度槓桿現象表達不安，但未明確對三星股價方向表態「Doesn&#x27;t feel healthy, tbh.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2097057093689684460" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">韓媒報導三星與Arm共同開發終端裝置晶片，最終客戶可能是OpenAI，屬拿下指標性大客戶合作的正向訊號。「Samsung has begun co-developing an on-device chip with Arm, with OpenAI believed to be the end customer」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2096967899537907945" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者引用SED報導三星庫存降到不到10天、明年恐嚴重缺貨，並將此列為缺貨帶動漲價的正面案例。「Samsung / $SKHY &quot;stockpiles have fallen to less than 10 days of supply, and a severe shortage could emerge next year&quot;」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2096858276290015563" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">報導指三星晶圓代工已將過半4nm產能投入HBM4基底晶粒生產，為搶先擴大對輝達、博通、超微等客戶的供應而超前部署。「the share of Samsung Electronics&#x27; foundry 4 nanometer (nm) process allocated to mass production of base dies for sixth generation high bandwidth memory (HBM4) has recently surpassed 50%」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2096837362475253761" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">貼文附連結但內容看不到實際產品,『What the hell did Samsung make』語氣偏向驚訝或吐槽,無法判斷對股價方向的看法。「What the hell did Samsung make?」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2094669476155511252" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，被列為技術領先CXMT的HBM龍頭之一。「CXMT is 3 to 5 years behind the leading memory chipmakers in HBM. Bullish memory.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2094484059850158554" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者反駁「memory is a bubble」的空頭論點，引用三星已透過長期合約(LTA)預訂約70%記憶體產能至2031年作為需求能見度的證據，立場明顯看多三星記憶體業務。「Samsung has reportedly reserved ~70% of its memory production capacity through 2031 via LTAs」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2094365307876040857" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者提到自己先前對三星每月晶圓產能（WPM）的預測（150萬片）顯得過於保守，三星實際目標上看170-180萬片，屬於對產能數字的驚訝評論，未直接表態這對股價是利多還是利空。「Looks like my forecast for 1.5M WPM for Samsung was conservative」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2094355004027232666" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">三星記憶體將約70%產能透過2031年前的LTA長約鎖定,顯示訂單能見度高,甚至考慮把平澤S5晶圓代工產線轉為記憶體產能以因應需求。「SAMSUNG MEMORY ALLOCATES ~70% OF PRODUCTION CAPACITY THROUGH 2031 TO LTA COMMITMENTS」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2094354650757829096" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">分析指三星目前擁有最佳的HBM4技術,已在此世代反超SK海力士與美光。「Samsung currently has the best HBM4 technology.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2094204360800833602" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">獨家報導指三星在輝達客製版HBM『NVHBM』上搶得供應先機,開發符合輝達更高速度需求的8-high HBM4E產品,是明確的正面業務進展。「Samsung Electronics is poised to secure a key supplier position for Nvidia&#x27;s customized high-bandwidth memory (HBM), dubbed &quot;NVHBM.&quot;」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2093219540415168605" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">文中對比指出三星電子NAND主力產線已完成轉進236層製程,技術進度領先SK海力士。「Samsung Electronics had already completed the transition of its main production generation to 236-layer NAND.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2093122005897977940" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">仍持有長倉及重申看多。「aside from Samsung/SK Hynix longs」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2092851118233764178" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">新聞轉述三星將提高供應給 Nvidia 的 8-high HBM4 比重,屬產業新聞轉述,沒有作者自己的方向判斷。「Samsung Electronics and SK hynix are expected to increase the share of 8-high products in their shipments」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2092484503080206760" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，Samsung被列為明確看多的記憶體股之一。「the future of memory is inevitably up... Bullish memory」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2092282443558469697" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">純新聞轉述三星在中國西安擴大 V9 NAND 產能投資計畫,未附加作者自己的觀點。「Samsung Electronics has been investing in converting its Xi’an X2 line in China to V9 NAND since the first half of this year.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2091999562340643274" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者僅指出三星投影片確認 HBM4E 規格達到 16 Gbps,屬技術規格觀察,沒有表態股價方向。「HBM4E has been confirmed at 16 Gbps.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2091575575265906868" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同一則貼文以南韓記憶體出口單價暴衝為由，對三星電子等記憶體股全面看多。「South Korea NAND and DRAM export unit price for August goes parabolic. Bullish AF memory」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2090669354752839785" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者引用韓國經濟日報報導，指三星股東回饋規模上修至150兆韓元（約1077億美元），高於稍早100兆韓元的報導。「Samsung Electronics is expected to announce a shareholder return program later this month worth KRW 150 trillion ($107.7 billion), exceeding the KRW 100 trillion reported by another media outlet earlier this morning.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2090333536960287153" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">三星加速美國Taylor二廠建設，提前要求供應商取得設備認證，且特斯拉被視為主要客戶，顯示先進代工業務擴張動能強勁。「Samsung Electronics Accelerates Taylor Fab 2 Buildout, Asks Equipment Suppliers to Secure Certifications in Advance」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2090292742098428287" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">三星規劃超過100兆韓元的創紀錄股東回饋方案（含特別現金股利），且提及「明年還會更多」。「Samsung Electronics Formalizes an Era of Record Shareholder Returns Exceeding KRW 100 Trillion: “Even More Next Year”」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2090259552260510098" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">平澤P5廠房規劃由雙層擴至三層設計，若核准產能可望提升至少50%，屬產能大幅擴張的正面訊號，惟仍待核准。「If the revised plan is approved, however, P5 will adopt a triple-fab configuration accommodating up to six cleanrooms... production capacity is also expected to rise by at least 50%.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2090018803384218030" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">三星先進製程晶圓代工報價已實際調漲10-15%，且Google正洽談以SF4製程投片，顯示代工業務議價力與客戶動能增強。「Prices for SF4 customers in China and the U.S. have risen 10–15% month over month... Google is also in talks with Samsung to produce chips using SF4.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2090001358569230675" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">引述設計批評。「Samsung&#x27;s zHBM」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2089581051186438331" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">供應商業務受益評述。「$MU, $SKHY, and Samsung are happy」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2088457278928412812" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">主文仅称瓶颈未改变，自引旧看多不成为新承诺；SHKY代码无法解出。「$SHKY, Samsung, $SNDK, $MU memory bottleneck never changed」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2088226398708338889" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">券商重估報告非作者觀點。「Samsung Electronics and SK Hynix」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2087689684298461445" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">以未來收入及估值支持有實質上行，勸勿賣底，明確看多記憶股；ETF排除。「that is material upside from here.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2086844710522323276" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面配置條件改善觀察，仍談需要持續資金及未知空間。「已经进入明确的左侧区间」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2086700087737254037" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">對HBM合約策略批評及產品分析，無股票方向。「Samsung&#x27;s HBM4 is on par/better than Hynix」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2086569303869108327" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者重新明确看多美光与三星，其他光学公司仅市场叙事及旧估值案例。「Yes, I&#x27;m still bullish on memory like $MU / Samsung.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2086148557187461412" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">引用分析師正面相對表現預期，不歸作者多票。「SEC (005930) / SEC-P (005935)」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2085569668950249843" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">記憶體議價讚賞。「Specially $MU $SKHY Samsung」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2085353865323372801" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">對三星製程敘事嘲諷。「LMAO」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2084935011980218843" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者反駁供過於求說法，對供需正面但沒有股票方向。「Hard to see those memory &quot;oversupply&quot; claims」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2084468063228060092" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面估值反問，但未明示作者買入或股價預期。「what was Samsung’s market cap again...?」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2083915223644397881" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">野村三星盈利预测转述，不归作者方向。「Nomura raised its operating profit forecasts」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2083914264998478043" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">BofA分析师三星合约条款观点转述。「Samsung’s LTAs are structured on supplier-friendly terms」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2083480189976375410" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明示記憶體多頭受益。「which is bullish on $MU to Samsung」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2083088870942642391" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">韩国证券三星目标价转述，不归作者。「KIS raises its price target for Samsung Electronics」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2082971647460680050" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">三星股东回报政策卖方报告转述，无作者投资承诺。「reports one after another on Samsung’s shareholder return policy」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2082818768779215289" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">負面營運結果，不等於作者看空股票。「posted its first-ever operating loss」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2082809422750065104" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">明确署名Meritz证券的三星回购预测，不归作者股票方向。「Meritz Securities Korea: We expect Samsung」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2082792644149690505" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面機會語境，但未明說自己買入或股價方向。「希望dip也一起来」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2082760411829719407" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">三星电话会Q&amp;A原话转述，无作者方向。「Samsung Electronics 2Q26 Earnings Call Q&amp;A」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2082646196229931185" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">三星电话会供需原话转述，无作者方向。「From Samsung Electronics Q2 Earnings Call」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2082642352989196780" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">對沒有長約披露失望，沒有看空股價。「That’s disappointing.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2082615900231090228" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确保有Sivers/AAOI多方信念，其他公司为主题需求数据而非各自方向。「Samsung/SK Hynix」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2082230983487803755" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">公司部門策略嘲諷。「Samsung DS Division isn&#x27;t even supplying RAM to the MX Division」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2081623091705434224" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者以DDR5價格與利潤持續增長支持記憶股，明示看多；韓股和ADR均在原文列出。「Bullish memory.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2079349851448328447" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">舊自引合作新聞。「Samsung–Nvidia Expand NAND Alliance」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2079129709921878438" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">供應增加的估值風險分析，無直接個股方向。「Samsung Electronics and SK hynix have announced massive fab expansion plans」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2078462124486283755" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">他人建議及需求正面語氣。「This Is Not the Time to Sell Samsung Electronics and $SKHY」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2077955479742173422" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">他人市場評論。「Hynix, Samsung and SanDisk」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2076947502021190088" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">三星取得客户消息的庆祝，无明确股票方向。「LFG!!」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2076929290550288435" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品稱讚。「The first serious AI PC」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2075160899124629792" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">解释三星財報偏差及預期未變，沒有交代該預期的股票方向。「依然不影响三星的预期」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2074485344494645415" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">三星历史盈利与下跌对比的市场讽刺，无未来方向。「market: sells off Samsung -7%」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2074416685843612031" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">自身明確市值上行預測。「both will cross $3T in market cap」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2074090115140591767" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面技術及營運稱讚。「Impressive」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2074003518089056590" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">技術比較正面。「its technical risk is far lower.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2073682227586818371" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面業務進展。「More deals for Samsung」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2072947196031610997" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">对三星封装技术进步疑虑，非股票方向。「We can only hope Samsung’s packaging improves」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2072799162559840616" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">業務合作稱讚不等於股票看多。「BIG Samsung W」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2072684310512169423" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面業務稱讚。「Samsung Foundry has really made a full comeback.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2072613106237550893" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面產品代工資訊。「TPU V10ax will be manufactured by Samsung Foundry.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2071829189905506305" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">採購風險新聞。「inventory headroom continues to shrink」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2071153407994597535" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">引用成本風險，非作者個股價格預期。「影响MU三星海力士的LTA」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2070382980728754639" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">長約定價風險。「影响MU三星海力士的LTA」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2070381829107163422" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> 