及</span><div class="tl-detail">引用高盛上调存储业预期与评级，未新增作者方向。「Samsung」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2061050046611857668" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">引用盈利预测正面。「Goldman Sachs raises its Samsung operating profit forecasts」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2061044139853283730" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">業務合作負面新聞。「Samsung」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2060646311469498784" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">工艺性能比较，非股票方向。「Samsung’s 2026 SF2 still lags」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2059995634632147217" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">券商盈利与薪酬资料。「Samsung Electronics and SK hynix」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2059624691548193229" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">公司客戶資訊。「Samsung also seems to have recently secured multiple customers.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2059568540840276017" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">预测三星股票为基金成分表现最好，构成明确相对看多；DRAM为ETF排除。「三星将会是 $DRAM 成分股里表现最好的」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2059370167034110292" ta