tps://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2028487006708539512" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">三星SKhynixPhison涨价新闻及产业需求赞誉，无股票方向。「Samsung Electronics and SK Hynix」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2028374385544093829" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确三星未来2.5倍市值与两家记忆体低估长多论点，看多；TSM为历史比喻。「Wouldn’t be surprised if Samsung were trading at $2.5T」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2027184821173416261" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">机构盈利预测的正面评论。「Samsung」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2026529571990839302" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">回顾三星及海力士历史高点，未给出新股票方向。「Samsung」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2026196965634326730" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">旧研究成绩与方向回顾。「SK Hynix/Samsung」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2025956208138649924" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">价格上涨语境和玩笑。「Samsung」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2025863154362884493" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">当前明确记忆体低估与结构性重估，四项投资看多；Sony为引文背景。「memory stocks still trade at single-digit forward earnings」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2025691750128398518" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确强调韩国两股估值折价，看多；MU、SNDK仅报道和相关曝光。「And yet Korean memory stocks still trade at 4-5x forward earnings.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2025464334315372750" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">盈利前景评论。「Samsung will be more profitable」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2024156014149357892" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确韩国两股估值折价，看多；三美股仅估值比较。「The Korean discount is absurd.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2023784201401634840" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者用Samsung和SK hynix相对利润估值建议韩国敞口，表达投资看多；美国公司为比较。「might be good to get exposure to Korean」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2022196582884790607" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明確做多信號。「biggest long signal.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2018792971907588226" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确三星海力士主语的当前估值判断。「they&#x27;re cheaper than ever」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2018506303736569942" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">产业利润正面评论。「Samsung」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2018369023738802437" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确看多南亚并预期上涨继续；其他存储持仓及自引清单仅为背景，没有逐股新方向。「alongside $MU, SK Hynix, and Samsung」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2016487104000446545" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">产品涨价业务评价。「Samsung increases NAND prices by 100%」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2015241123896369372" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确极度看多三星和海力士，基金只是获取敞口工具。「both of which I’m mega bullish on」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2010877487681835338" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者在供应链研究后明确新建LITE仓位；其余公司为业务供应链或客户背景，不能据此逐股投票。「Samsung Electronics: Secondary memory」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/1995543748353347989" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:MU</span><span class="s-n">223 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-04-01 → 2026-10-04</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="flip">5 人反轉</span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+2.0%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>April Arnzen</b>：2026-07 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li><li><b>Cleo Fields</b>：2026-02 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>David Tepper</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Donald Trump</b>：2026-03 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> → 2026-05 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> → 2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li><li><b>John Fetterman</b>：2026-03 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Josh Gottheimer</b>：2026-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Jukan</b>：2026-04 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> → 2026-08 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> → 2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li><li><b>Julia Letlow</b>：2025-04 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2026-02 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Michael Burry</b>：2026-07 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-02 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> → 2026-06 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> → 2026-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li><li><b>Ren</b>：2026-07 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> → 2026-09 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> → 2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-01 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Zephyr</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>大老师</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> → 2026-07 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> → 2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> → 2026-09 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者正面認同 AI 個股分化與瓶頸盈利論點，並以所列股票代表受益標的；MU 有最直接的成長證據。「that&#x27;s the most bullish thing that could happen to it.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2106553928913404087" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者直接認為客製 HBM 讓 Micron、SK Hynix 與 Samsung 的產品更黏著、合約更長。「bullish for memory.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2106546457167671735" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Unusual Whales</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">options_flow 帳號純粹播報 Micron 過去一年大漲逾480%與市值增加的數據，沒有加入自己對後續走勢的判斷。「Micron, $MU, is up more than 480% in a year.」 <a href="https://x.com/unusual_whales/status/2106535017430003734" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者用半導體低估值與 Micron 成長數據作論點，明確看多所點名的標的；NBIS 的個別論據較少。「Bullish AF for semis ⚡️」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2105875548475892161" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者認為 Micron 已簽約需求延伸至 2028，股票本益比應高於目前。「the P/E multiple should at the very least be higher」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2105544291800297587" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者直接稱 Micron 長約與高毛利可見度極度看多，同時指出宏觀改善的條件。「While this is extremely bullish」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2105449909298344337" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明確看多。「Memory is very much alive and thriving!

Bullish ⚡」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2105397139627225130" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面數據反應，沒有股票方向。「$MU just guided $61.5B revenue next quarter.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2105396359494824091" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">興奮不直接成為看多票。「LFG!!!」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2105388693167255631" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明確預期股票上漲。「MU ONLY KNOWS UP, BABY!」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2105388303927369851" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者預測財報反彈後出現股價下跌。「所以在电话会阶段，MU股价将会从1100-1135 逐步下跌到1000-1050」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2105385355172360348" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">美光已实现成长赞赏，无未来股价判断。「$MU has grown revenue 204% and EPS 425% since this photo was taken in March.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2105324335980491098" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">需求利多感想。「$AMD to $MU should be happy to hear this…」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2103232350348001701" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bear">放空</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-09-22 · 2 則報導 <a href="https://x.com/unusual_whales/status/2102502696804851816" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文1</a> <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2102492444713525360" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文2</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">重述歷史記憶體論點，未新增股票方向。「arguing memory is structural, not cyclical」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2102213021644836989" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">以需求與漲價支持記憶體獲利能力。「Memory like $MU / $SKHY is in it&#x27;s current supercycle.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2100938001077674262" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">转述记忆体供需与涨价，否认行业放缓但未明确股票方向。「Some color on current memory environments for the $MU / $SKHY bros:」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2099674926697545849" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">勞資衝突負面新聞無作者方向。「Micron Taiwan’s union at its Taoyuan plant rejected a package」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2099318774604386379" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确反駁崩盤並支持需求。「unfollow the clowns on X that predict AI stocks from $NVDA to $TSM to $MU will crash」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2099229447304122410" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，作者對列出的整組個股發出「血腥的一週」警告。「It&#x27;s going to be a bloody week. Are you prepared?」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2099179266852196638" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">純轉述韓媒關於美光HBM產能擴充與產品組合報導，作者未加入個人判斷。「Micron plans to add 60,000 wafers per month of HBM capacity by the end of this year」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2098658932839637463" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Evan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者只是轉述美光發放台灣員工高額現金獎金與股票獎勵的新聞，沒有對股價方向做出任何判斷，屬於市場新聞的單純轉述。「Micron $MU said it will give its Taiwanese employees a $31,600 cash bonus and additional stock rewards.」 <a href="https://x.com/StockMKTNewz/status/2098397752774234368" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明確指出記憶體採購支出將挹注MU等公司70-80%以上毛利率，且認為這些公司不受總體經濟疑慮影響。「when all that memory procurement spend hits the balance sheets of $MU, $SNDK, Samsung, $SKHY with 70-80%+ margins... I don&#x27;t think these companies care about short term macro scares.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2098306366167535766" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者批評美光台灣廠獎金太少並呼籲罷工，這是對勞資議題的評論，不是對股價方向的判斷。「This bonus is still far too small. Micron Taiwan workers should go on strike!」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2098238184513794311" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">列出持股清單並明說自己是全場最多方，喊「送它更高」「Tens of trillions, baby. Send it higher.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2098081185620467855" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，作者明確表態自己是記憶體多方「As someone who is long memory, I&#x27;m happy about memory causing this much inflation.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2097937708178186303" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者以「Bullish」作結，強調知道要持有什麼比每天交易更有價值，此檔列於其看好清單中「Let me help you pick winners for the long run and hold conviction...Bullish ⚡️」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2097530847351972083" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，此檔列於作者的agentic AI算力需求看多清單中「You are not bullish enough...Position yourself accordingly」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2097039199102730470" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者只把「$MU in Feb」列為動能交易的過去案例,未表態現在的方向。「$MU in Feb」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2097007843799171358" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者總結南韓記憶體缺貨與AI資本支出佔比提升的消息，認為MU在2027年可望受惠。「read through for other names like $MU / $SNDK might be happy for 2027 given demand causing shortages + infra spend share increase.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2096858276290015563" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者將MU列為自己至今仍上漲逾100%的記憶體主題持股。「3. $MU - Memory」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2096814311306129776" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者說MU出現大幅反彈後提醒『記憶體瓶頸沒有改變』，並在自我引用文字中重申仍看多MU。「Now that $MU to $SNDK have pulled a major recovery.  Good to have a reminder that the memory bottleneck hasn&#x27;t changed!」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2096149203278037407" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，此檔並列於作者長期看多的持股標籤中「Bullish, up and to the right ⚡️」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2095890322190389307" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者自稱「the biggest memory bull」並完全同意被引用推文稱兩檔「illegally Bullish」的看法「As the biggest memory bull. I couldn&#x27;t agree more.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2095691928285196776" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者宣告對Tier 1/2 AI名單全力做多，此檔在標籤列表中「I&#x27;ll go max long on my Tier 1 and Tier 2 quality AI names」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2095656252873335011" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者將此檔納入AI建置持股框架，屬於逢低加碼、長期持有的高信念部位「Prioritized across Memory, AI Clouds, Interconnect, Compute and Energy.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2095654354208313699" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">報導指美光今年底前將HBM產能較去年翻倍，透過積極資本支出擴產以縮小與三星、SK海力士的差距，屬明確的產能與市占追趕訊號。「Micron plans to double its high-bandwidth memory (HBM) production capacity from last year.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2095633416041689569" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上,MU被列為GPT-6 Astra潛在正面催化劑的受惠標的之一,但論證薄弱、用詞保留。「GPT-6 Astra的潜在影响 也许是一个新Catalyst了」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2095600255354261929" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者說明記憶體大廠(含Micron)因優先配置產能給AI/資料中心高階記憶體，排擠舊世代產能，隱含對其高階記憶體業務的正面看法。「your leading memory players prioritize AI/DC higher end memory and reduce allocations to older generations」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2095580088620449880" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者稱「看多AI基建全面建設」,並認真考慮複製引用清單中這份精簡持股的AI運算組合,MU為清單中第二大重倉。「Micron $MU [Long, 27.6%]」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2095228808278446221" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者僅表示對美光跟進開發High IOPS NAND技術感到「有趣」，屬觀察而非明確方向表態。「It looks like Micron is working on High IOPS NAND as well. Interesting.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2095096148419907950" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明確將Micron列為自己投資組合的核心持股，並認同其低估值高能見度的論點。「This looked similar to my H2 2026/early 2027 portfolio with Nebius, Micron, TSM」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2095087925822190023" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者提到美光台灣員工獲得高額獎金並好奇日本員工是否會跟進，語氣偏正面但只是轉述好消息，沒有明確表態看多股價。「Micron Taiwan employees just received a huge bonus. Micron Japan, NEXT???」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2094942629821895138" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同段落被列為記憶體股偏多標的之一，僅是beta相對SNDK較低。「Memory looks like a coiled spring here. If you want the higher beta, take $SNDK over $MU.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2094567154163015951" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明確寫「Bullish memory」，並指出CXMT技術落後這些龍頭廠商3-5年，暗示龍頭地位穩固。「CXMT is 3 to 5 years behind the leading memory chipmakers in HBM. Bullish memory.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2094484059850158554" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">同一分析指美光同樣未能達到HBM4最高速度規格,技術進度落後於三星。「SK hynix and Micron have struggled to achieve the highest HBM4 speeds.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2094204360800833602" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">末句產品遊戲比喻而非美光方向。「hardstuck &quot;Micron&quot; in League?」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2093805166655143988" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">歷史市值變化。「$MU: goes from $133B -&amp;gt; $1T+ in a year.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2093760498072485919" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者聲援美光台灣廠員工罷工訴求(『Taiwanese people, rise up!!』),雖凸顯台灣廠占美光全球產能約六成、且是HBM重鎮的罷工風險,但作者本身只是替勞方發聲,未直接對美光股價表態方向。「Taiwanese people, rise up!!」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2093169001295999455" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Donald Trump</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · several purchases · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-08-27 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2093056321041920188" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">Same opinion維持看多，減碼不直接变看空。「I&#x27;ve always been bullish on memory with $MU / Samsung」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2092851118233764178" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">與NVDA同列在標題並被「Bullish AF」涵蓋。「Bullish AF ⚡ ⚡ ⚡」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2092829182786982251" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">引用貼文指記憶體漲價讓MU仍在6倍本益比以下難以再看空，作者以「Michael Burry, you good?」調侃做空者，暗示看多。「it becomes much harder to justify $MU and $SKHY still trading below 6x earnings」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2092746640192913539" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者指出記憶體漲價是由MU、SNDK主導定價，暗示兩者在漲價循環中受惠。「$MU $SNDK are the ones setting that price.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2092727731402240222" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者稱前台積電董事長高點買進$MU後股價已上漲177%，並強調「別讓alpha溜走」，是明確看多語氣。「$MU up 177% since. Sometimes, a whale insider purchase will come along that&#x27;s genuine alpha.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2092658311049122000" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，MU被列為明確看多的記憶體股之一。「the future of memory is inevitably up... Bullish memory」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2092282443558469697" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者用一串笑哭表情符號回應「三星嘲諷美光HBM4設計是餿主意」的貼文，屬嘲諷美光的技術方案，不等於看空美光股價「🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2091579631975731566" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者將放空MU的想法視為瘋狂之舉，等同強力表態看多。「If you say $NBIS or $MU or $LITE I&#x27;m sending you to a mental hospital.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2091555024727953479" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者指出南韓NAND與DRAM八月出口單價暴衝，標註「Bullish AF memory」，對記憶體股全面看多。「South Korea NAND and DRAM export unit price for August goes parabolic. Bullish AF memory」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2090669354752839785" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者引用Cramer「Time to prep」並回應「God help us all」，語氣曖昧，看不出是嘲諷做頭訊號還是驚嘆即將噴出，方向不明。「$MU God help us all...」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2090514636164522203" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者呼應「美國製造享有溢價」的論點，指出美系雲端業者也願意為美光美國製造的DRAM支付溢價，暗示美光受惠於此趨勢。「U.S. hyperscalers will also be willing to pay a premium for Micron’s U.S.-made DRAM.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2090045731864539387" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确將需求承諾判為所列股票多頭論點。「That is exactly why it reads bullish to me.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2089827659794493538" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确预期记忆体股票回到历史高点且长期持有，作者看多；Kioxia身份待核实。「All memory is going higher. We will get back to the ATH prices we had just 2 months ago.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2089420093910401501" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">供需利多觀察。「demand imbalance visibility for $SNDK, $SKHY, $MU」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2089264987328151637" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面需求觀察不自動轉成股票看多。「Think about the inference demand」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2088662587818856504" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">供應商受益評述未直接表股價方向。「$MU, $SKHY, and Samsung are happy」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2088457278928412812" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">新文明确预期记忆体反攻近了，重新承诺旧文MU/SNDK多方逻辑。「存储反攻的那一天 或许快来了」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2088236600899833915" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明示所談MU存儲牛市回歸。「我认为存储的牛市还会到来」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2088227110829871512" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">主文仅称瓶颈未改变，自引旧看多不成为新承诺；SHKY代码无法解出。「$SHKY, Samsung, $SNDK, $MU memory bottleneck never changed」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2088226398708338889" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">本人買入記憶體的方向。「Buy the fear」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2087956934213218456" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">复盘已发生上涨和旧轮动预测；整体AI基础设施看多不直接新增MU/SNDK票。「$SNDK +16%, $MU +7% on the day.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2087924738135826659" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bear">放空</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-08-12 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2087648528428380602" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明說持有兩檔記憶股及願加倉，明確看多。「I’m long $MU $SNDK」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2087547754159444342" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">以未來收入及估值支持有實質上行，勸勿賣底，明確看多記憶股；ETF排除。「that is material upside from here.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2086844710522323276" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">存儲資金環境觀察，非明確MU前瞻方向。「每次三星、海力士、美光大跌」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2086700087737254037" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">自己明确向上預期，所引標的MU。「watch it rip higher」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2086484673438302578" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">具名MU對應持續做多。「I’m still long memory」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2086476013119123683" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者直接表達所列記憶體股票看多。「Bullish memory ⚡️」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2086473937299419168" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者重申三股利潤持續增长與看多，明確方向。「Bullish, just not crazy 1000%-in-a-year bullish.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2086177224940564928" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者表達逆向買入意願，對所提記憶股看多；ETF排除。「Nothing makes me want to buy something faster than everyone agreeing it&#x27;s over.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2086156884323557647" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者重新明确看多美光与三星，其他光学公司仅市场叙事及旧估值案例。「Yes, I&#x27;m still bullish on memory like $MU / Samsung.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2086148557187461412" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">長期持續多方並計畫加倉。「memory is now more than ever one of the best investments up until 2030.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2086088646600368607" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">他人降評及價格預測。「Citi cuts Micron price target on peaking memory prices」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2085865896090992746" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">業務利好讚賞。「Win for the whole memory ecosystem. Specially $MU $SKHY Samsung」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2085353865323372801" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者反駁供過於求說法，對供需正面但沒有股票方向。「Hard to see those memory &quot;oversupply&quot; claims」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2084468063228060092" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">美光罢工传闻及同业奖金比较，未给股票方向。「Micron’s labor union in Taiwan」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2083391030720868675" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明示股票多頭受益。「which is bullish on $MU to Samsung」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2083088870942642391" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bear">放空</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · entry ~$880 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-07-30 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2082942341019525339" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确保有Sivers/AAOI多方信念，其他公司为主题需求数据而非各自方向。「$MU point to structural memory demand」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2082230983487803755" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">跌幅情緒反應。「My god memory is taking a beating…」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2081916429981413811" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">赞赏美光与Meta白皮书，无股票方向。「Micron and Meta have jointly published a white paper」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2081243127797686457" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bear">放空</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · short increased at $934 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-07-25 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2080969026172264899" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">當日表現正面反應。「整体表现还行」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2080289513298104479" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">引用市占率背景，整體正面記憶體語境。「surpassed Micron and SanDisk」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2080201993189236857" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者以DDR5價格與利潤持續增長支持記憶股，明示看多；韓股和ADR均在原文列出。「Bullish memory.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2079349851448328447" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">需求正面評論未直接股票方向。「memory demand seems structural.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2077955479742173422" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bear">放空</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-07-16 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2077799122229174493" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">美光合约消息与已跌反应，未给未来方向。「Doesn’t quite feel like there’s anything individually wrong」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2077753660592033828" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明示持有SNDK與MU多頭但反對極端集中；STX/WDC僅類股提及，ETF排除。「I&#x27;m long at these levels SNDK, MU」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2076758159163822290" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">持倉過去表現回顧與推廣，無新方向判斷。「$MU +7%」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2075288227284422707" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">當前拒絕恐慌賣出並支持繼續加倉。「encourage you to keep adding.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2075247275144524059" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">美光期权买单报道及兴奋反应，目标价属于订单而非作者方向。「MU大单看涨终于来了」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2074855505252770260" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>April Arnzen</b> <span class="tag t-bear">賣出</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · sold 1/3 of her shares · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-07-08 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2074769263798141343" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">業務瓶頸與過去流入背景。「inflow poured into $MU」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2074240512593481955" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确美光短期受压判断；三星与海力士为事件变量，不外推方向。「我认为 MU 短期会受到压制。」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2074153915726410037" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">指定MU現價對抗空方并以自身持倉承諾。「I’ll come back to this post at the end of the year.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2073428137296150660" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">已發生價格正面反應。「MU确实V的很漂亮」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2072965852929093896" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">直接當前買入方向。「最终还是轰一点MU」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2072770787539656997" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Donald Trump</b> <span class="tag t-bear">賣出</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · up to $500,000 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-07-02 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2072690824039551109" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">當前明确買入所列記憶體標的。「Buy memory. Don’t overcomplicate things.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2072672100616167433" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bear">放空</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日 2026-07-02（原文：July 2nd） · 揭露 2026-07-07 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2074542791024066622" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面內容是Trump原話。「Micron, a truly GREAT American Company」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2072389455466623207" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">風險情緒改善非股票漲跌承諾。「或许不必 过度担忧存储 的问题了」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2072389020567720087" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">長約業務正面消息。「Even the auto guys are signing LTAs」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2072329865093951652" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">DRAM战略价值论述及自引旧Micron比较，不是新股票方向。「Yes, MU is not Nvidia.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2071188353131962740" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">记忆带宽技术评论，引用别人比较Micron與輝達不等于作者方向。「Yes, MU is not Nvidia.」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2071140098851373137" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產業重要性前瞻非股票投資方向。「it may become even more important than Nvidia.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2071139712082022855" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">引用成本風險，非作者個股價格預期。「影响MU三星海力士的LTA」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2070382980728754639" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">長約定價風險。「影响MU三星海力士的LTA」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2070381829107163422" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">條件風險情境，不是当前明确方向。「如果未来出现以下信号，MU 可能会有很大的市场波动」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2070379908107514344" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">價格反應。「ridiculous performance today」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2070189253573890167" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">券商評級新聞。「raises its Micron price target to $2,000.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2070069304108957819" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Micron与Wendy价格表现比较，无前瞻方向。「Micron beat Q2 earnings」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2070059976735830478" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">主管產業預測。「CEO predicts a multi-decade memory demand cycle」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2069990311296975133" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-24</div><div