class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">赞MicronCEO及两股历史收益，无未来方向。「Two legendary stocks. One mastermind.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2033689934100631950" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确重申记忆体多方立场，四家看多；其他为宏观例子。「I was one of the only few analysts that remained bullish the entire time.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2033651209371013588" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">驳斥内存业务需求减少论点，并未明确股票投资方向；EWY基金排除。「$MU」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2033632359061590383" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">既往涨幅及恐慌卖出评论。「$MU: +19.66%」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2033447091679416393" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">产业利润前景。「$MU」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2033320724291813503" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">肯定内存基本面论文，未明确个股交易。「invalidates memory bears」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2032540615783923909" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>John Fetterman</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日 2026-03-01（原文：March） · 揭露 2026-05-27 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2059630137755177216" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Donald Trump</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日 2026-03-01（原文：March） · 揭露 2026-07-02 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2072690824039551109" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Cleo Fields</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · up to $250,000 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-02-25 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2026669682904740145" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">成長循环對比當前低估值。「still trades at 11x forward earnings.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2026254529222615439" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">内存短缺业务前景。「The shortage could last through 2030. $EWY $MU $SNDK」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2025796590867268024" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">当前明确记忆体低估与结构性重估，四项投资看多；Sony为引文背景。「memory stocks still trade at single-digit forward earnings」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2025691750128398518" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">明确强调韩国两股估值折价，看多；MU、SNDK仅报道和相关曝光。「$MU」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2025464334315372750" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Micron企业历史宣传，McDonalds为历史背景，無投资方向。「one of the most interesting sectors」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2021639749606473870" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">当日行情惊叹。「everything down 15% from $MU to $SNDK」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2019123157672907018" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明確做多信號。「biggest long signal.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2018792971907588226" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">認為競爭無重大影響。「$MU」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2018703864409870379" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">引用内存周期业务。「$MU」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2018506303736569942" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">产业利润正面评论。「how profitable the memory supercycle is」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2018369023738802437" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">下一句明确MU为主语的估值低判断。「still dirt cheap.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2018353776676253960" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确看多南亚并预期上涨继续；其他存储持仓及自引清单仅为背景，没有逐股新方向。「alongside $MU, SK Hynix, and Samsung」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2016487104000446545" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者肯定美国产业政策对MU和INTC的业务护城河，其他公司为政策风险或引用背景，未作股票买卖表态。「&quot;Made in America&quot; is the greatest moat $MU and $INTC have.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2016126247869546583" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">业务毛利预期。「$MU」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2015241123896369372" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确以市场低估及未来大幅回报比较看多。「$MU looks like the next Nvidia.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2014278521741553793" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者给MU高于现价的合理目标与未来市值预测，明确看多；INTC仅为旧自引。「IMO Micron deserves at least a 20 fwd P/E at today」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2014051512142668047" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">内存需求背景。「$MU」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/1999575509462843833" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者回顾机构买入MU及过去涨幅，不代表作者的新股票方向。「The stock is up 92% in the past 3 months」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1993100643536715945" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-04-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Julia Letlow</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日 2025-04-01（原文：April） · 揭露 2026-01-14 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2011451964270531001" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:NBIS</span><span class="s-n">191 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-11-16 → 2026-10-04</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="flip">1 人反轉</span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+4.7%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Michael Burry</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Ren</b>：2026-07 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> → 2026-09 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> → 2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2025-11 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>大老师</b>：2026-07 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者語氣帶有不滿（no one gave a fk about pacing the frontier），暗示失望情緒，但沒有明確說出這些持股的漲跌方向。「My stocks on Monday after it turned out no one gave a fk about pacing the frontier.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2106823474098360335" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者正面認同 AI 個股分化與瓶頸盈利論點，並以所列股票代表受益標的；MU 有最直接的成長證據。「that&#x27;s the most bullish thing that could happen to it.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2106553928913404087" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者期待十月股市上漲並點名三檔作為該方向的標的，情緒強烈且論據較少。「This market wants to buy stocks so desperatley」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2106056040873935257" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者在自己的持倉上漲脈絡直接說讀者還不夠看多，屬持有與看多表態。「You guys are not bullish enough.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2106044829041864831" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者用半導體低估值與 Micron 成長數據作論點，明確看多所點名的標的；NBIS 的個別論據較少。「Bullish AF for semis ⚡️」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2105875548475892161" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">延长折旧提高回报，明确看多辉达及Nebius。「For $NBIS it means the fleet they are building today keeps paying long after the first contract ends, and that is where the margin comes from.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2105861371980071381" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明示新雲融資及回報受益，支持多頭論點。「The neoclouds benefit the most」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2105347306421916129" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">直接要求更看多並提出成長估算。「$NBIS YOU ARE NOT BULLISH ENOUGH」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2104662946357940358" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者把定價能力與持續需求納入明確看多論點。「$NBIS raising prices on some GPU instances by 17 to 21%」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2104449426710249796" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">以過去報酬反問持債理由，未提出未來方向。「your average day holding $NBIS outperforms that by 2x?」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2103612523799085513" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">模糊贊同。「This guy might be on to something...」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2103475838452969681" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">朋友持倉不是作者方向。「Nebius $NBIS is the top holding」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2103238839716483296" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">新的低估論點可作看多票。「I still think markets might be underestimating sum of parts growth」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2103139052363133062" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">以產業成長與平台化優勢看多NBIS；其餘僅背景。「That’s right $NBIS

Bullish」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2102953997514461573" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">排名稱讚與投資方向分離。「Great to see $NBIS finally reach Platinum status」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2102887582090822051" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bear">放空</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-09-22 · 2 則報導 <a href="https://x.com/unusual_whales/status/2102502696804851816" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文1</a> <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2102492444713525360" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文2</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Nebius涨价赞同反应没有股票方向，辉达仅供货品牌。「$NBIS 👌」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2102470398910894261" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Nebius定价新闻赞赏无未来方向。「News always follows price.

Nice!」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2102440745248460990" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">以AI投資回報轉為持續支出支持四股看多。「Use cases with proper ROI, become recurring spend lines.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2102206142956839081" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">負面價格反應，非前瞻看空。「bad influences dragging us down」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2100584504662659177" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">營運數據稱讚不直接當股票看多。「$NBIS raised GPU rentals by 2000 bps」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2100366175746334878" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Nebius涨价的赞赏反应，无新股票判断。「Noiiiiiiiiicee」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2100345903689449896" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明示投入現金買入三檔個股及ETF，個股看多；ETF排除。「5% cash into $CRDO, $LITE, $NBIS, and $DRAM.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2099518539938091347" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明確表示Oracle GPU產能以溢價轉售的消息對NBIS是正面意涵。「Implications for $NBIS to $IREN are pretty positive since」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2099048356345696391" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者以微軟大幅擴建資料中心的新聞為背景，強調「You guys are not bullish enough」，暗示此檔為受惠標的「You guys are not bullish enough.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2098183010671550758" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">列出持股清單並明說自己是全場最多方，喊「送它更高」「Tens of trillions, baby. Send it higher.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2098081185620467855" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，此檔列於作者長期看好清單中「Bullish ⚡️」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2097530847351972083" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，此貼文重點在評論他人持倉巧合，未明確表態自己對NBIS後市的看法「Look at the names Leopold was in」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2097521722954072202" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者直接寫「Bullish AF」回應NBIS與PLTR合作對比Michael Burry看法的推文「Bullish AF ⚡️⚡️⚡️」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2097334761190551917" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者對Palantir選定Nebius為首選主權AI基礎設施夥伴感到興奮，並說「You are not bullish enough」「Palantir just named Nebius its preferred sovereign AI infrastructure partner...You are not bullish enough ⚡️」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2097333852121264315" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者提到NBIS與PLTR的合作案是當天「Big morning for AI infrastructure」的一部分利多「Plus the $NBIS + $PLTR partnership. Big morning for AI infrastructure.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2097332258386403456" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者說Nebius與Palantir結盟後『強勢回歸』，並在自我引用中稱其為『最純粹的Neocloud與AI基建不對稱機會』，沒有一項同業具備的缺點。「Nothing even comes close to Nebius in terms of asymmetrical upside.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2097327653116363127" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者引用agentic AI運算需求將暴增的數據，說「You are not bullish enough」並要大家「Position yourself accordingly」「You are not bullish enough...Position yourself accordingly Send it ⚡️」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2097039199102730470" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者將NBIS列為自己至今仍上漲逾100%的Neocloud主題持股。「2. $NBIS - Neoclouds」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2096814311306129776" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者稱自己在196價位喊進NBIS是「good entry」，並表示這是重倉論點型的持股「$NBIS called a good entry at 196」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2096005979410206879" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者以反諷語氣回應Cramer表示在neocloud股中只看好CoreWeave的說法，暗示不認同其看法，仍延續其一貫看多NBIS的立場，但語意較模糊「$NBIS We are saved!」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2095972509594112329" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者對股價站上220興奮不已，並喊出目標價「See you at $300」「Oh my god, $NBIS above $220 only means one thing...See you at $300 ⚡️⚡️⚡️」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2095952716258218380" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，此檔並列於作者長期看多的持股標籤中「Bullish, up and to the right ⚡️」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2095890322190389307" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">此檔與ORCL、CRWV一起被標記在對AI建置整體看多的貼文中，作者結尾寫「Bullish the AI buildout」「Bullish the AI buildout」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2095879502882644467" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明確說要在Tier 1、Tier 2優質AI名單上「go max long」並持續看多到2030年「I&#x27;ll go max long on my Tier 1 and Tier 2 quality AI names, revisit once a quarter, and go max long the AI trade into 2030.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2095656252873335011" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者列出這檔為其AI建置主題的持股之一，並說明第一層持股「add to on every dip and hold through whatever the macro throws at me」，屬於高信念多頭部位「Tier 1, 70%, six names. Highest conviction, the ones I add to on every dip and hold through whatever the macro throws at me.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2095654354208313699" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上,作者將NBIS與GPT-6 Astra潛在催化劑並列,但語氣保留(「也许」),未具體說明原因。「GPT-6 Astra的潜在影响 也许是一个新Catalyst了」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2095600255354261929" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者以「我們回來了!」表達對NBIS止跌反彈的興奮與看多情緒。「$NBIS  We are so back!」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2095520291648622765" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上,作者將NBIS列為應繼續持有的「已證明有效」贏家之一。「$NBIS is the next $NBIS.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2095357790613065806" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上,作者表態看多AI雲端運算層並考慮複製此清單,NBIS在名單中屬第二梯隊持股。「Nebius $NBIS [Long, 6.1%]」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2095228808278446221" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">Nebius被列為作者自己投資組合的核心持股之一。「with Nebius, Micron, TSM, colo players and others as core focus」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2095087925822190023" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明確預期NBIS等高貝塔股在Fed立場明朗前會持續走低,直言「我認為我們會繼續走低」。「$NBIS is down 30% from its August 14 high...I think we trend lower until the Fed either does what it&#x27;s been signalling and hikes」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2094928754904535175" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者認為NBIS跌破200美元後「開始變得有趣」,暗示逢低偏多的態度,但用詞含糊、未明確表態要買進。「$NBIS sub $200 is when things start to get interesting.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2094776155110813934" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">文末明確寫「Bullish $NBIS」，並詳述賓州Gigafactory三期分區許可過關的正面進展。「Bullish $NBIS」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2094619336820334736" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，作者完全認同引用貼文對NBIS等公司財報優於預期的看多論述。「100% agreed. Fundamentals and capex demand are running circles around the macro panic.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2094559531376218224" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者將NBIS列為運算需求嚴重供不應求的證據之一，作為基本面看多論述的一環。「$NBIS, ... etc. massive demand imbalance for compute despite capex spend」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2094492628758999451" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者點名NBIS是德國擴大AI運算產能計畫的受惠NeoCloud公司。「I wonder which NeoCloud company could benefit from this… Oh yeah $NBIS」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2093869166272913733" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者表示盤後讀到的資訊讓他想在週一買進，並已為3個關鍵價位設好限價買單，明確看多。「I already set a limit buy, for 3 different key levels for $NBIS」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2093534238897287251" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">標註資料中心股並附上X官方揭露「電費上漲」敘事其實是中國殭屍帳號帶風向的調查，暗示看空資料中心股的說法是假消息，間接力挺這些股票。「we found 200 accounts posting in a manner that could manipulate a legitimate debate about American AI and energy policy」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2093347096711635402" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">與NVDA同列在標題並被「Bullish AF」涵蓋。「Bullish AF ⚡ ⚡ ⚡」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2092829182786982251" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者提到「Today all of my swings but one are green」，NBIS是列出的波段持倉之一，代表目前部位獲利、看多。「Today all of my swings but one are green $NBIS $MRVL $NVTS $AXTI $AEHR」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2092738683934003516" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，NBIS為作者持續看多並持有的標的之一。「Welcome back; we never left 😎」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2092724027936698540" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者自己的目標價（基準353美元、牛市560美元）高於高盛的328美元，並質疑「who&#x27;s actually right」暗示自己更看多。「Ren: $353 base case, $560 bull case」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2092099507622216004" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者將自己目標價從329美元上調至基準353美元、牛市情境上看560美元，並稱「Target held, entry got better」看多逢低承接。「After Q2 I raised my own base case to $353 from $329, bull case $475 to $560.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2092089559949451653" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">優先採用產品稱讚。「Guess we&#x27;re seeing that special treatment here.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2091909391238979970" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者表示如果有人提議放空NBIS，會覺得對方瘋了，等同強力表態看多。「If you say $NBIS or $MU or $LITE I&#x27;m sending you to a mental hospital.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2091555024727953479" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">个人帐号里程碑及旧投资回顾，无新方向。「saw 2025 ideas from $AXTI to $NBIS play out」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2091488091110531106" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者分析Nvidia伺服器漲價15%對NeoCloud的衝擊時，明確指出「NBIS is best positioned」，因其合約結構以短中期為主、可重新議價。「$NBIS is best positioned.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2091380164382843335" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者標註NBIS並寫「你還沒準備好迎接接下來的事」，搭配微軟資料中心首批Vera Rubin機櫃到貨的消息，暗示正面催化預期。「You are not ready for what comes next」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2091009171772629325" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者回應「集中重押」的建議，表示要「fully porting」全押進NBIS、LITE與SNDK，展現高度看多信念。「Ok damn. Danny, fully porting $NBIS $LITE and $SNDK then.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2090663756862836997" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者形容NBIS是「安全且卡位良好的AI概念股」，屬正面肯定，雖重點在尋找另一檔沒人談論的飆股。「Everyone is trading the same safe, well-positioned AI names. $NBIS $SNDK $AAOI $LITE. Great as an investor.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2090657349706928636" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者將NBIS列為「很可能跑贏5.2%債券殖利率」的成長股，引用營收年增454%與ARR季增數據佐證。「$NBIS: revenue +454% YoY, ARR $1.92bn to $3.0bn in one quarter」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2090639444709638405" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者表態「even more bullish」，並給出1年2.5倍、3年10倍的目標價，佐以Q2營收年增454%等數據。「I&#x27;m long $NBIS and after this Q2 ER I&#x27;m even more bullish.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2090514570473275431" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">對分析正面認可，無自己的新買賣宣告。「Grounded take by Nate.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2090300002681635068" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明確本人長倉。「NBIS is my largest position and I am long.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2090058444589912568" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">對NBIS熱情與模糊交易暗示，未說明自身買賣方向。「I can’t help myself around $NBIS」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2089857669179863145" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">對管理及營運正面信任，非明確股票方向。「In Arkady we trust to build responsible AI data centers.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2089829458278547708" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确將需求承諾判為所列股票多頭論點。「That is exactly why it reads bullish to me.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2089827659794493538" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">下跌情緒。「Can we stop dipping now?」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2089760123681984535" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明說NBIS多方估值上行及對抗空頭，明確看多。「I&#x27;m working on a new 12 month fair value for NBIS」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2089474970741051857" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面需求觀察不自動轉成股票看多。「Think about the inference demand」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2088662587818856504" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">對他人嘲笑空頭的正面反應，不新增看多。「Omg this is too funny」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2088636715481059572" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">庆祝击败Burry，未来最大痛点以疑问表达，未给明确新Nebius方向。「let’s see if we can reach his max pain level」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2087877457303027964" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">他人感謝及績效回顧。「Thx $NBIS」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2087684135728845264" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bear">放空</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · doubled down · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-08-12 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2087648528428380602" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">以Burry被擊敗戲謔公司消息，無前瞻股票方向。「NBIS这是铁了心要把Burry杀了啊」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2087628702947672377" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">已賣波段但明說保留最大核心NBIS倉位，持續多方。「My core $NBIS position is intact and still my largest position by a mile.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2087544146043035745" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者否定做空这些云公司的盈利可能，并以强成长指引建立多方股票论点。「Shorting cloud companies is the fastest way to burn money right now.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2087541434333163660" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">认可Nebius租价合理，经营定价反应非股票方向。「Reasonable」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2087525311760261296" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">結果反應不把舊自引倉位再算新方向。「We are eating good at my house today.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2087517772595040287" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">稱財報需求展望強勁，未說投資動作或股票方向。「$NBIS outlook is pretty insane yet again.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2087515371750490383" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确以财报总结看多Nebius，构成当前方向。「This ER couldn’t have been more bullish.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2087510542508269974" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明確預測做空者受損即股價向上。「Burry的空单要被干了」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2087506147754557711" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">財報正面反應。「NBIS大超预期」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2087505972214566958" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">漲幅回顧及嘲諷空頭，無前瞻方向。「$NBIS +12% after Coreweaver.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2087287916787572791" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">財報前興奮提問，無明确自身方向。「are you guys ready?」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2087286623973023810" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">三股強勁財報及需求讀穿讚賞，無明確股票方向。「Insane earnings today for the AI theme」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2087285356999958663" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面期待沒有明確股價方向。「Wednesday is going to be fun.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2086887912029774171" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">舊社交名單分類非新增投資票。「My fellow $NBIS bulls」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2086692238793282039" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面基本面支持嘲諷做空者，未直接本人股票方向。「Growing hundreds of percent to $7-9B ARR by Q4.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2086157318065168490" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">推薦帳號清單，其中自稱NBIS多頭同伴為明確自我立場。「My fellow $NBIS bulls」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2086101934780362890" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">自身估值預測並明言Bullish。「My own 2030 value-per-share estimate comes in 15% above theirs.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2085890253248753913" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">嘲諷別人賣股作反指標，未明言作者新交易或股票論點。「This guy is the perfect signal to do the opposite.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2085786582372475151" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span clas