status/2083110973900980253" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">當前持續買入承諾及折價投資論點。「I’ll keep buying as long as the thesis holds」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2082823772210438372" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">自身加倍投資規劃且選NBIS。「The risk/reward here is absurd.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2082688681274401231" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确保有Sivers/AAOI多方信念，其他公司为主题需求数据而非各自方向。「demand for $NBIS」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2082230983487803755" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面合作策略選項，非股票方向。「$NBIS Avride, other neutral players」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2080750537121874206" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">部署與需求驅動作者Neocloud看多結論。「Neocloud summer incoming.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2080173287196197225" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者以Google扩大外部产能开支明确看好Nebius受益；Google财报股价反应无未来方向。「直接利好 $NBIS」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2080040076869013784" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">推薦長期買入NBIS並預期打敗投資機構，明確看多。「I&#x27;d just buy NBIS and come back in 2030.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2079354807131721743" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者將多年算力短缺明確當作所列股票多頭投資論點。「the AI trade isn&#x27;t over.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2079341645091188854" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">輝達持股披露及盤後漲幅解释，無作者股票方向。「great for sentiment having Nvidia be a large shareholder」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2079319999915925938" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">商業模式正評。「validate Neocloud business models like $NBIS, $IREN」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2078175882620059719" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">現價與反彈幅度抱怨。「Tell me that when $NBIS is close to the 300s.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2078173339504288144" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">當前反駁顶部並明確支持折價投資。「I also enjoy buying stuff at a discount.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2077769328653463813" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="t