iv class="tl-detail">訂閱服務例子。「If you want to trade $NBIS」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2072406541940973852" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">本人買入及持續加倉。「I bought A LOT on this dip. If it keeps falling, I’ll keep adding.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2072368944393142721" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">澄清Meta算力与资本开支消息，预测支出增加不等于股票方向。「$CRWV and $NBIS」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2072314906729455876" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">競爭能力負面評價，非股價預測。「they don&#x27;t have the scale or compute required to support this」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2071511133362754018" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Meta/Google算力约束及Nebius合约资料，整体产业资本开支利好不形成个股方向。「Neoclouds like $NBIS」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2071135874100990438" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">担忧記憶漲價造成云厂商成本压力，未明说股票方向；自引旧观点不投票。「NBIS IREN 这一类首当其冲了」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2070406834226409506" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者重申AAOI高信念多头并认为空头错误，明确看多。「fast revenue ramp since $NBIS」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2067071462360666165" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面Meme認可，非明确自己股票方向。「Sometimes memes can be real alpha」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2066617801104908463" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者自己的長期成長投資預測。「I can see Nebius end up like AWS one day.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2066521694836330618" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">指数纳入新闻及公司成长祝贺，非股票投资方向。「got added to Nasdaq 100!」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2065262802328293497" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面融資與績效對比，未獨立上行預測。「from optimal structures」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2063571485739106593" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">同業FCF負面對比。「all burn cash」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2062201072463061056" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">回顾先前高信心选择。「highest conviction Neocloud pick in $NBIS age well」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2062116398210703462" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">NBIS表现赞叹与自引旧市值预测，無本次新方向。「plot armor confirmed with $NBIS」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2061479663181189201" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">回顧舊目標。「We’re currently sitting at $60B MC, getting close!」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2061425895307608561" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">相對評價及舊建議回顧。「nbis大于iren」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2057514462748512532" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">回答續抱问题，預期資產繼續升值。「keep letting them appreciate」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2055200705334395161" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">过去价格与业务成果。「$NBIS earnings were stellar」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2054524864866980010" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">既往價格回顧。「up triple digits now」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2054040580502745588" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确反对买入IREN稀释并认为NBIS提供更好股权升值机会。「the other Neoclouds actually allow equity appreciation」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2053928672202268993" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">公司业务成长判断。「I think we’re witnessing the rise of the next hyperscaler.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2051348607966875919" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确质疑继续做多IREN，投资看空；其他云企正面比较非明确股票看多。「looking derisked」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2046374163338912200" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">舊預測成績。「$NBIS」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2043724212159025534" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者预测IREN每股价值继续下降并主张等待稀释结束，明确当前看空。「$NBIS」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2042988968149684305" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">公司故事赞许及当前价格資訊。「greatest business comeback story」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2041930617391386763" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">既往价格比较。「up 48% YTD」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2041907945500504466" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">仅转述黄仁勋对NBIS服务评价，旧多头引用不算新投票。「$NBIS」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2041553933664145620" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明確看多。「extremely bullish for the Neocloud segment like $NBIS」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2041056589088702781" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">業務比較正評，無自身投資方向。「$NBIS」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2039657844392202498" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确选Nebius为赢家，看多；明确警告当前IREN投资者稀释及CRWV存活风险，看空；其他为客户伙伴。「From my take: Nebius is the clear winner.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2037896456179438049" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">友善语气。「sending love to the $NBIS investors」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2034073370325843983" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">投资者调侃。「The baggie mobile」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2034072847669465306" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">肯定融资形式。「vastly superior to straight equity ATM dilutions」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2033864202440610128" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">已發生合同与涨幅正評。「$NBIS」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2033486637553127865" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">假设改名提高估值的玩笑，未构成实际投资方向。「$NBIS」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2033033107557986332" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">NebiusCEO生平与业务赞誉，非股票方向。「built two generational companies」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2032168121956778063" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">三家云企业CEO比较，人物评价非股票买卖方向。「The Neocloud winner was already obvious based on their CEOs.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2031821990907298232" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">相對股值上行方向。「Very clear, which company leads to higher share value appreciation」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2031785810052465078" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Nebius未来业务规模与伙伴新闻，未股票价格或新投资方向。「Nebius is the next Amazon-level hyperscaler」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2031744017201848397" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确主张不持有IREN并推荐CIFR和NBIS替代多头。「There are much better longs out there.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2029993746658643978" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">融资经济性对照较正面，没有其股价方向。「in the way $NBIS does」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2029524132568994011" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">相對明確做多偏好。「I personally trust in $NBIS management more.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2028111150613959097" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确当前持有判断。「should be a positive hold through earnings.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2021050004627128695" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">行业业务顺风。「Every tailwind just hit at once for Neoclouds.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2019857047052022237" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者认为NBIS现价与盈利潜力严重不符，表达有条件看多；其他云服务公司是产业主题及交易背景。「this seems incredibly, incredibly off at $85」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2006013108817678779" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">价格回顾。「Never thought I’d see $NBIS at $80」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2000682225327857953" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者集中预期NBIS长期可能获得数倍回报；拥挤清单、历史案例和他人引文不构成其他股票新方向。「this might be that 3x-4x return」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2000208395832602786" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确持有AAOI和LITE并认为AAOI结构低估；其他公司为旧持仓或客户背景。「$NBIS」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/1999240464420250042" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确当前买入机会。「amazing buying opportunity」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/1998925429890261130" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确当前多头。「Long $RKLB, Long $NBIS.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/1997122660749529353" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">反驳卖空机构对NBIS公司结构的比较，未明确作者买卖方向。「$NBIS」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/1997034977524121633" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">嘲讽NBIS与IREN当日跌幅和投资者争论，不能从情绪推定股票投资方向。「Both stocks: -6.16% and -4.00%.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/1996994803503075542" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">合作定位正面，没有其股票方向。「$NBIS avride」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/1996371542369034395" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">认为市场评价失衡，但没有明确投资方向。「WHAT IS THE MARKET SMOKING???」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/1996263556527120521" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者质疑TSLA与NBIS消息后的定价差异，未直接表达任何一股的新交易或未来价格；UBER是引用合作背景。「Make this make sense...」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/1996232079890325753" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">本段为Avride商业化新闻；旧自引的NBIS估值论述不视为新的作者投资方向。「has now launched in Texas」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/1996198042664669557" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确股票非对称上行判断。「maintains highest asymmetrical upside」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/1995084174223651180" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">當前估值低估與成長論點。「market is mispricing $NBIS basket of hyper-growth companies.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/1994089931602579688" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">以NBIS子公司价值与市值折价形成作者看多投资论点；其余股票为竞争、客户或历史案例。「As discounted spare change of $NBIS at a $21B marketcap.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/1993657309986509242" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确称NBIS最被低估并预期突破90美元；其他公司是客户、投资组合和历史对比，旧评级清单不构成新判断。「the most undervalued growth company right now.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/1992984440960921604" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">當前價格的投資上行比較。「Nothing even comes close to Nebius in terms of asymmetrical upside.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/1990452960758042917" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">財報与價格反應。「$NBIS」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/1990065497547923800" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:LITE</span><span class="s-n">182 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-12-01 → 2026-10-04</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+17.8%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Leopold Aschenbrenner</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-02 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Ren</b>：2026-07 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2025-12 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>大老师</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者語氣帶有不滿（no one gave a fk about pacing the frontier），暗示失望情緒，但沒有明確說出這些持股的漲跌方向。「My stocks on Monday after it turned out no one gave a fk about pacing the frontier.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2106823474098360335" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者正面認同 AI 個股分化與瓶頸盈利論點，並以所列股票代表受益標的；MU 有最直接的成長證據。「that&#x27;s the most bullish thing that could happen to it.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2106553928913404087" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">感嘆供需缺口扩大並解釋本週股價強勢，未明確作新的買進或前瞻判斷。「No wonder we&#x27;ve seen so much strength in the stock this week.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2106486526888776082" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">轉述 Lumentum 執行長的供需缺口及供應分配，未明確判斷點名股票的未來價格。「projected deficit has now expanded to 70%」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2106450096808153311" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者在自己的持倉上漲脈絡直接說讀者還不夠看多，屬持有與看多表態。「You guys are not bullish enough.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2106044829041864831" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">引用執行長的供需缺口，另泛稱新增雷射產能的其他公司可能受到關注，沒有直接對 LITE 表態。「Any other players with laser capacity coming online」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2105943565918703696" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者直接認為限制措施有利於其點名的國內光學供應商。「These restrictions benefit domestic suppliers.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2105725080370356309" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者只以「Optics go brrr」表達光學領域的興奮，個股論點均在引文中，未逐股給方向。「Optics go brrr」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2105712095014851027" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者認為政策與雷射供應緊張會讓 Lumentum 與 Coherent 受益。「Of course $LITE / $COHR would be happy.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2105709782854435274" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者認為限制中國收發器可能對其點名的美國光學供應商帶來重大利多。「Potentially big for US optical suppliers.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2105698908416479284" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">報告 LITE 上漲及 Goldman 看多光學的傳聞，未把他人的觀點改成作者自己的票。「$LITE +9%」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2105677590304595981" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明確將 LITE 與互連 BOM 提升連結並標示 Bullish。「Bullish ⚡️⚡️⚡️」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2105667101038158155" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">需求報導與產品利多，無股價表態。「Demand for UHP lasers continues to exceed supply」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2102763548715753927" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">戲稱兩公司超級智能股票，無方向。「calling $SNDK or $LITE Super Intelligence stocks」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2102427727987179692" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确Lumentum上行目标1000。「$LITE wants 1000」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2102031950139572284" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">偏重網路股投資理由，為四股多方論點。「Why am I so focused on networking over raw compute?」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2101057160537084356" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明示投入現金買入三檔個股及ETF，個股看多；ETF排除。「5% cash into $CRDO, $LITE, $NBIS, and $DRAM.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2099518539938091347" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者直接點名LITE為雷射短缺下的受惠供應商。「Who benefits from supplying all that lasers during a shortage other than $LITE / $SIVE / $AAOI / $COHR?」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2098306366167535766" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，此檔列於作者重申看多立場的清單中「You guys are not bullish enough.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2098183010671550758" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者稱自己團隊比華爾街早看對光學市場規模6.5倍,並提到NVDA重金投資LITE推升該題材成為AI交易新寵,延續其對LITE的看多立場。「$NVDA invested billions in $LITE and $COHR, and the sector became the AI trade&#x27;s new sentiment leader」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2098121475190559054" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者自我引用先前貼文指出LITE供不應求，CEO量化缺貨超過30%，EML產能已鎖定LTA到2027年，屬於基本面轉好的具體證據「$LITE is sold out. Their CEO quantified undershipping demand by more than 30% and said they are having to choose which customers to support.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2098114790048583928" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">列出持股清單並明說自己是全場最多方，喊「送它更高」「Tens of trillions, baby. Send it higher.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2098081185620467855" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">列在 Bullish for 清單，理由是雷射需求「$LITE - lasers」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2097820413900276043" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者說花旗把雷射與光纖視為『下一個HBM』，並強調自己從2025年就開始看好LITE，早於市場共識。「I&#x27;ve been talking about lasers like $LITE / $AAOI since 2025... and architectural shifts toward CW, ahead of the current industry consensus.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2097660318369697875" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，此檔列於作者長期看好清單中，結尾寫明「Bullish」「Bullish ⚡️」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2097530847351972083" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者稱這是「追蹤我的光學題材持股的美好一天」,因高盛大幅上修光學模組市場規模預測,並列出LITE當日大漲的漲幅,是明確持有並看多的表態。「LITE: +12.88%」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2097367356523892915" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同一則貼文中列出LITE當日+8.1%的強勢表現，整體語氣為正面的「Insane strength」「$LITE +8.1%」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2097332258386403456" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者引用LITE官方說法『我們正享有顯著的價格溢價』，佐證雷射漲價趨勢對LITE有利。「For $LITE, they still supply lasers but stated: We are commanding a significant price premium for CW lasers」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2097200456090952096" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者引用高盛大幅上修全球光模組預測，結論是「You are not bullish enough on interconnect, photonics and optics」「You are not bullish enough on interconnect, photonics and optics ⚡️」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2097072930114969608" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，此檔列於作者的agentic AI算力需求看多清單中「You are not bullish enough...Position yourself accordingly」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2097039199102730470" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者以LITE為例說明雷射公司能跨足其他產品線大幅擴大市場機會，是他偏好雷射股的主因。「They don&#x27;t just have to stay laser companies... just look at $LITE!」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2096890295128625153" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者將LITE列為自己至今仍上漲逾100%的光通訊主題持股。「5. $LITE - Photonics」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2096814311306129776" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者引用高盛預估AI網通市場規模到2028年將擴大9倍，並明確表示「I know I&#x27;m not selling my interconnect shares. I&#x27;m seeing this through 2030」「I know I&#x27;m not selling my interconnect shares. I&#x27;m seeing this through 2030. Bullish ⚡️⚡️⚡️」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2096439098634313987" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者提到自己在650價位喊進LITE，屬於其長期持有的信念部位之一「That&#x27;s what I did with $LITE at 650 and $SNDK at 1100, at the bottom of the unwind.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2095890322190389307" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者宣告對其AI持股全力做多，此檔在標籤列表中「I&#x27;ll go max long on my Tier 1 and Tier 2 quality AI names」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2095656252873335011" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者將LITE歸入互聯（Interconnect）主題，納入其AI建置持股框架「Prioritized across Memory, AI Clouds, Interconnect, Compute and Energy.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2095654354208313699" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，作者完全認同引用貼文對LITE等公司財報優於預期的看多論述。「100% agreed. Fundamentals and capex demand are running circles around the macro panic.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2094559531376218224" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，被列為擁有實際產能與現金流因而抗跌的標的。「names like $COHR, $LITE, and $CRDO held up relatively well」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2094494253267157010" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">與NVDA同列在標題並被「Bullish AF」涵蓋。「Bullish AF ⚡ ⚡ ⚡」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2092829182786982251" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，LITE為作者持續看多並持有的標的之一。「Welcome back; we never left 😎」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2092724027936698540" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者將放空LITE的想法視為瘋狂之舉，等同強力表態看多。「If you say $NBIS or $MU or $LITE I&#x27;m sending you to a mental hospital.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2091555024727953479" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者表示因對AAOI管理層信任下降，將資金轉為加碼LITE，屬明確看多LITE的資金轉倉行為。「tilting heavier into $LITE」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2090986982088266149" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者回應「集中重押」的建議，表示要全押進NBIS、LITE與SNDK，展現高度看多信念。「Ok damn. Danny, fully porting $NBIS $LITE and $SNDK then.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2090663756862836997" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者形容LITE是「安全且卡位良好的AI概念股」，屬正面肯定。「Everyone is trading the same safe, well-positioned AI names. $NBIS $SNDK $AAOI $LITE. Great as an investor.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2090657349706928636" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者直指光学股跌幅不合理、需求可见及安心等待，明确低估多方论点；其余仅产业佐证。「$LITE, $MTSI and other comments」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2090490101260591481" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">光学产业供需与超级周期讨论，三家公司作为数据出处，没有明确逐股方向。「$LITE, $MTSI, $AAOI all pointing to extreme demand imbalances」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2089973586425766134" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确將需求承諾判為所列股票多頭論點。「That is exactly why it reads bullish to me.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2089827659794493538" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">引用正面財報與供需。「after what $LITE said last week.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2089067529490567209" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">VIAVI与Lumentum拆分历史及估值机制解释，没有当前股票方向。「WOW this is some fun lore about $VIAV and $LITE.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2088776240480104913" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面需求觀察不自動轉成股票看多。「Think about the inference demand」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2088662587818856504" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">推广团队财报报告的可读性，不是Lumentum股票方向。「our $LITE ER breakdown was one of our best reports ever.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2087992395308937366" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">財報獲利比較。「$LITE margin growth in terms of profitability」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2087675367595380783" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">財報與產品需求讚賞。「high margins, and extreme demand for qualified CW lasers.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2087447527595692180" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面營運引用，非作者投資方向。「There are some new things that we didn’t factor into our discussion」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2087370810243854678" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面盈利及短缺評述，未選股價方向。「Every layer of this chain is short at the same time.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2087336733218156608" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">财报电话会摘要肯定需求价格与业务时间，没有明确逐股投资方向；SIVEF代码未核实。「Basically just validated timelines + demand/pricing for Western CW laser players.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2087329770879197549" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明說資本應集中AI基建並支持成為持有人，對所提三股投資表態。「I just can&#x27;t relate to anyone who doesn&#x27;t have their capital highly concentrated in AI infrastructure.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2087290590086180951" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">三股強勁財報及需求讀穿讚賞，無明確股票方向。「Insane earnings today for the AI theme」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2087285356999958663" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">維護公司正面語氣但未新增方向。「I hope you ignored the noise. $LITE」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2087275871857942959" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">稱財報有多方引句，未直接作新股票方向承諾。「enough bull quotes to last until winter」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2087274218761453971" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">貼文唯一个股財報後明示該主題看多。「Bullish photonics ⚡️」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2087272654114103688" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面財報及業務需求分析，未表態股票投資方向。「very strong earnings」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2087271842696593764" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">營運進度正評。「Looks like they&#x27;re running ahead of schedule.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2087270523734749391" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">下跌及政策風險報導。「$COHR fell 14% and $LITE fell 10% yesterday.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2087181654724866357" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">開頭具名公司對應的投資持有建議。「Be sure to own the part of optics on the correct side of two transitions」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2087005727185383686" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者重新明确看多美光与三星，其他光学公司仅市场叙事及旧估值案例。「$AXTI to $LITE in the photonics sector」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2086148557187461412" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明確偏好光學股風險報酬，MU僅比較；他人記憶空頭非作者。「I personally like the r/r on photonics more here」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2086142717076308086" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者當前光子投資組合及短缺論點支持所列核心股。「great to have our thesis rewarded today.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2085811801988685950" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">光學恢復結果回顧。「$LITE $AAOI $SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2085762483944391024" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">已發生表現與舊論點宣傳。「$LITE is up 30% since my deep dive」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2085761011693355415" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">赞赏卖方渠道检查与复盘光学股回升，没有新作者方向。「$AAOI, $LITE, $SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2085649654059016387" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确更看多有产能的既有CPO激光公司，AAOI供需新闻不看空，其他仅客户/竞争资料。「Just more bullish on the existing few qualified CPO laser names that have capacity.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2085603590903902621" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">激光瓶颈经营消息及正面读穿，没有明确股票方向。「$SIVE and $LITE should be happy」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2085511646257332581" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">AAOI电话会数据与产业需求赞赏，没有股票价格或行动方向。「read through for $LITE, $SIVE / $JBL」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2085499853099208716" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">需求供給背景。「demand far exceeds what $AAOI $LITE $COHR can make.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2085486739448094901" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">需求週期正面分析。「Welcome to the multi year cycle.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2084920594139959305" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">新政策強化明確長倉方向。「Now it makes even more sense what I said about going long LITE.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2084633351470600387" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面情緒反應及引用政策，不直接成為個股看多。「BABY DON&#x27;T FEAR THE REAPER」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2084631786668097713" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">禁令的產業受益與供應鏈分析，未說股票投資方向。「A very material catalyst came about for Western supply chains」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2084597612175618342" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明確本人長倉及估值/成長論點。「I&#x27;m long $LITE.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2083928369993818281" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面供應瓶頸評價，不自動转成股票看多票。「glad this thesis is starting to see validation.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2083438823548293140" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">所列光子股票及ETF選擇後明示重新投入投資方向。「This is the time to get back in the saddle.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2082958254527664464" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者以AXT需求及供货协议明确看多。「agreement with Lumentum」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2082937549199208839" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">業務利好讀穿非股票票。「a strong read through on $SIVE / $LITE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2082513405219631384" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确保有Sivers/AAOI多方信念，其他公司为主题需求数据而非各自方向。「expecting $LITE, $SNDK」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2082230983487803755" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">折價比較，作者未選方向。「You can buy optics cheaper than Nvidia did now.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2082099596327547189" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Google產品增長及資本支出分析，無本次股票方向；LITE看法僅自引。「Should be good to go for $LITE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2080031508656746874" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">資本支出受惠期待。「Should be good to go for $LITE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2080027058063958323" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者直接投資方向。「Hyper bullish CPO $LITE $AAOI $SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2079694429951267289" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Innolight卖方目标转述及产业需求读穿，无作者明确股票方向；SOI不能误映射美国能源公司。「$AAOI to $LITE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2078228019584668121" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明確近底的股票價格觀點。「close to market bottom on semis from $INTC to $LITE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2077784594959725056" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">自己當前持续支持多頭及主流低估論點。「names I&#x27;ve been bullish for so long like $LITE $AAOI」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2077152287273922706" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明確看多讀穿。「bullish read through on US transceiver makers like $AAOI, $COHR, $LITE.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2076808331453415674" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">對兩股興奮反應，無可判方向。「ARE YOU NOT ENTERTAINED」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2075225312753750385" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确看多LITE/Sivers上游受益；雷达公司监管条件分析不等于无条件方向。「this is also bullish for upstream laser suppliers too like $LITE and $SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2074581698604593367" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">業務供應瓶頸評述。「laser bottlenecks like $LITE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2074240512593481955" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确长期持有Sivers、相信估值巨大扩张，其他公司为合作/同业资讯。「the next $LITE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2074046947434860971" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确持有光学组合与需求长线信念，支持其点名股票多方持有。「why I have conviction in it.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2072738199927926897" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">業務供需利好。「completely sold out for the next 2 years」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2072726120706007465" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者认为下一年会后悔没买CW瓶颈公司，明确聚焦低估的AAOI/Sivers/Tower。「$LITE went from $3B」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2069258326505140653" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">强调便宜组件对技术规格优势，公司技术观点不当股票方向。「cheap beats amazing RIN/linewidth」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2067326542431355375" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">歷史漲幅回顧。「Lumentum is $74.47B」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2066785056031670657" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Leopold Aschenbrenner</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-06-15 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2066641087792382374" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">以稀缺客户渠道及相对估值支持Sivers投资唯一性，明确多方论点；其他股为比较及客户。「grow into a $75B company」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2066498742942159288" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者预期WOLF及LITE主题篮子上涨，明确正向；SpaceX仅IPO事件，Hynix为历史宏观比较。「$LITE optical basket should go brrr」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2066360345774764496" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">持仓对出口放宽业务消息正面反应，未明示新股价方向。「My optical positions are very happy to hear this:」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2066340661633372452" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Lumentum上行愿望的反问，缺确定未来判断。「Now can $LITE go to 1000 please」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2065494845553103112" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">當日價格與宏觀消息。「$SNDK to $MRVL to $LITE are green now.」 <a hr