ITE backlog order fill into 2028」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2042533797405823299" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">预期光学三家公司业务受益于需求，并未明确股票买卖或价格目标。「$LITE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2042476441196241094" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者预计空头受向上价格压力。「Too many shorts on $AAOI to $LITE and $SMH right now that might be screwed.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2041740090691698750" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确预计所偏爱的三只激光股票在更好宏观环境继续上涨。「I expect many of them to be up more than they are now.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2041650903305089389" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">三项瓶颈持有信心与业务增长判断，未明确股票方向。「sleep a easier despite market volatility」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2041519692985344500" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">媒体引用趣闻与旧多头回顾，未新增股票方向。「$LITE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2040114262358839644" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">回調被稱為便宜投資機會。「$LITE」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2039333459366211801" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">当前较后期投资选择。「If you want a later stage pick, you can look at $LITE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2038943956697059637" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">批评Sivers激光技术劣势，技术评价不等于股票看空；同业为性能比较。「Lumentum literally presented an 800 mW laser」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2037404598835830902" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">供應業務受益。「$LITE」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2036797359720476713" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确当前高信念多头。「high conviction longs aside from $SIVE and $LITE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2036493814656106744" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明確建議繼續做多。「$LITE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2034634272733343835" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">LITE旧论点实现回顾，自引旧目标不当本次投票。「This thesis post aged well with $LITE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2034237409093878030" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">回顾IQE翻倍及旧论点，没有新投资方向；欧洲代码未核实。「$LITE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2034224630429630974" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者论证LITE供给缺口与未来增长尚未被定价，表达估值看多。「There&#x27;s probably something the markets haven&#x27;t priced in yet.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2033848250101616646" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">当前明确股票投资偏好。「still love the stock for Google TPU ramp/OCS」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2033695716938551350" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">转述黄仁勋光学供给不足，非作者投资方向。「$LITE」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2033634984096108588" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">已发生涨幅及学习机会，非当前交易。「$LITE」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2032884410018939191" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">当日价格回顾。「$LITE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2031014187401650192" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">讽刺光学股小幅盘后反弹并回顾行情，没有投资方向。「$LITE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2030056728650469846" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">批评新闻引发跌幅并更新项目状态，自引旧买点不构成新票。「$LITE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2030024185490329799" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确将新闻引发的三只芯片股下跌视为买点；其他公司是资金背景。「This looks like a buying opportunity for specific names」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2030020673570275618" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">历史涨幅赞叹。「$AAOI to $LITE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2029189271572365661" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确投资为五项光学股尾风，当前股票看多；NVDA投资者背景。「This is a massive tailwind for photonics stocks」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2028464631195574674" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">对行业机会正面但未给其独立投资判断。「We are early. $LITE $COHR $AAOI」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2027459009138114560" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面业务曝光介绍。「$LITE (High BOM of the TPU)」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2027275242628948103" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者披露LITE高权重持仓并明确认为应拥有该增长瓶颈。「You just need to own the bottleneck.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2027071333096677666" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">回顾LITE和AXTI旧论点及收益，没有新投资方向。「$LITE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2026670930966229323" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">他人仓位与历史收益。「LITE」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2025733639204663713" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">以AAOI及Marvell为核心论证股价重估，其余为微软芯片供应链背景。「$LITE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2003476197028852074" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">前瞻股票重估上行。「expect $LITE to re-rate more」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2003259964526330053" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确反驳当前投资时机已晚。「This is like saying $NVDA was &quot;late&quot; when price it was a $1T MC.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2003024646367740327" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确前瞻股票回报预测及买入论点。「might be 1000%+ by 2027」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2003019490871869644" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">产业受益与价格背景。「$LITE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/1999575509462843833" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确持有AAOI和LITE并认为AAOI结构低估；其他公司为旧持仓或客户背景。「one of the two photonics players I&#x27;m invested in」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/1999240464420250042" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者在供应链研究后明确新建LITE仓位；其余公司为业务供应链或客户背景，不能据此逐股投票。「I&#x27;m initiating a new position in $LITE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/1995543748353347989" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:SNDK</span><span class="s-n">170 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-10-30 → 2026-10-04</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="flip">2 人反轉</span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+0.4%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>David Tepper</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Donald Trump</b>：2026-01 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Gil Cisneros</b>：2026-01 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Josh Gottheimer</b>：2026-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Jukan</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2026-02 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Leopold Aschenbrenner</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Lisa McClain&#x27;s husband</b>：2025-10 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-04 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Ren</b>：2026-07 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> → 2026-09 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> → 2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-02 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>大老师</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> → 2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Unusual Whales</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">options_flow 帳號陳述 Sandisk 今年漲幅近650%與NAND供需吃緊的數據，純數據播報無方向判斷。「Sandisk, $SNDK, is up nearly 650% this year.」 <a href="https://x.com/unusual_whales/status/2106882305524642080" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者語氣帶有不滿（no one gave a fk about pacing the frontier），暗示失望情緒，但沒有明確說出這些持股的漲跌方向。「My stocks on Monday after it turned out no one gave a fk about pacing the frontier.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2106823474098360335" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者正面認同 AI 個股分化與瓶頸盈利論點，並以所列股票代表受益標的；MU 有最直接的成長證據。「that&#x27;s the most bullish thing that could happen to it.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2106553928913404087" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者用半導體低估值與 Micron 成長數據作論點，明確看多所點名的標的；NBIS 的個別論據較少。「Bullish AF for semis ⚡️」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2105875548475892161" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">回顧本週新聞交易與自稱勝率，沒有交代個股多空或下一筆方向。「What a week. 100% win rate.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2105674595701231661" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">他人盈利比較。「names currently profitable like $SNDK or Samsung.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2103869705509388694" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">AAOI业务看多但股价受增发抑制，2027跑赢附停止发行条件；其他为融资/机会成本案例。「names currently profitable like $SNDK or Samsung」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2103151990146801812" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">戲稱兩公司超級智能股票，無方向。「calling $SNDK or $LITE Super Intelligence stocks」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2102427727987179692" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">供需与涨价结论明确看多Sandisk；三星、海力士、美光仅供给数据。「Bullish for $SNDK」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2102385475176558771" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">企業NAND需求供需論點支持持有，明確看多。「Bullish $SNDK」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2102260218633523708" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明確看多。「$SNDK is one of my largest positions.

I’m hyper bullish on this name.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2102240978883031525" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">做多承諾。「I&#x27;m long $SNDK」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2099749705244606607" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">預期所討論記憶體長倉中期勝出。「It&#x27;s hard to not see Leopold&#x27;s positions pulling an Inverse Cramer due to overwhelming fundamentals.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2099659874892386678" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者列出這些記憶體/半導體股後直接警告「血腥的一週」，暗示看空後市走勢。「It&#x27;s going to be a bloody week. Are you prepared?」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2099179266852196638" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者只說這對SNDK有「有趣的意涵」，打算週末研究，尚未形成明確方向判斷。「Interesting implication for $SNDK / $Kioxia」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2098601582019416317" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，僅轉述第三方基金的選擇權操作，非作者本人立場。「he&#x27;s back guys... just in time for fomc」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2098407270551839059" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，作者將SNDK列為記憶體支出的高毛利受惠者之一。「when all that memory procurement spend hits the balance sheets of $MU, $SNDK, Samsung, $SKHY with 70-80%+ margins」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2098306366167535766" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，此檔列於作者重申「not bullish enough」的看多清單中「You guys are not bullish enough.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2098183010671550758" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">列出持股清單並明說自己是全場最多方，喊「送它更高」「Tens of trillions, baby. Send it higher.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2098081185620467855" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，此檔列於作者長期看好、值得持有信念的清單中「There&#x27;s so much more value in knowing what to hold than in trading every stock every other day.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2097530847351972083" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，作者同樣將SNDK的大漲歸功於自己的推薦，延續其一貫看多立場「Both ripped hard after I gave Kevin this recommendation.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2097523591990346099" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者把SNDK早期的成長軌跡拿來類比ESMT，暗示對SNDK的成長故事本身也持正面看法。「Reminds me of early $SNDK but for other segments (legacy/niche memory).」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2097348486635368686" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，此檔列於作者的agentic AI算力需求看多清單中「You are not bullish enough...Position yourself accordingly」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2097039199102730470" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同MU，作者認為記憶體缺貨與資本支出佔比提升將使SNDK在2027年受惠。「read through for other names like $MU / $SNDK might be happy for 2027 given demand causing shortages + infra spend share increase.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2096858276290015563" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者將SNDK列為自己至今仍上漲逾100%的記憶體主題持股。「13. $SNDK - Memory」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2096814311306129776" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者提到SNDK毛利率80%可望持續到2030年，是他看多記憶體題材的具體論據。「$SNDK expects 80% gross margins to continue into 2030」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2096149203278037407" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者具體提到SNDK自其呼籲的低點以來已上漲40%，自一月開始看多memory以來上漲600%，並在結尾寫「Bullish, up and to the right」「$SNDK is up 40% since I called it at the bottom of the Korean unwind, and up 600% since I started calling memory in January.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2095890322190389307" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者以自豪語氣說「it sure pays to be right」，暗示先前看多的判斷已獲驗證，延續多頭立場「Oh, it sure pays to be right 😎」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2095871021265846654" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者直接回應NAND相關新聞說「You are not bullish enough for NAND」，明確表達比市場更看多的立場「You are not bullish enough for NAND.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2095838869153321076" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，作者完全認同SNDK「illegally Bullish」的評價「As the biggest memory bull. I couldn&#x27;t agree more.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2095691928285196776" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，此檔列於作者持股標籤中，明確表達要全力做多AI主題持股「I&#x27;ll go max long on my Tier 1 and Tier 2 quality AI names」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2095656252873335011" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，作者將此檔列入其AI建置主題的四層持股框架，屬於高信念的長期多頭部位「Four tiers, 20 names, one concentrated bet. All of it on the AI buildout, across nine layers」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2095654354208313699" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者說明記憶體大廠(含Sandisk)因優先配置產能給AI/資料中心高階記憶體，排擠舊世代產能，隱含對其高階記憶體業務的正面看法。「if you&#x27;re in the $MU / $SKHY, $SNDK trade」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2095580088620449880" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者直言自己是「最大的記憶體多頭之一,尤其是$SNDK」,並認真考慮直接複製這份持股名單做三年不動的多頭組合。「I wonder who is also one of the biggest MEMORY bulls around here... especially $SNDK.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2095228808278446221" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者形容Sandisk與Micron同屬「遠期本益比低但2030年能見度高」的記憶體概念股，屬正面評價。「concentrated around memory (Sandisk, Micron), that have low forward multiples but high visibility into 2030」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2095087925822190023" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者建議「若要更高beta就選SNDK而非MU」，並稱記憶體股像「coiled spring」，明確偏多且更看好SNDK。「Memory looks like a coiled spring here. If you want the higher beta, take $SNDK over $MU.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2094567154163015951" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，作者完全認同引用貼文對SNDK等公司財報優於預期的看多論述。「100% agreed. Fundamentals and capex demand are running circles around the macro panic.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2094559531376218224" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">「谢谢大家 夜没白熬」顯示作者確認先前MSCI調倉尾盤買盤的看多預期已兌現。「谢谢大家 夜没白熬啊」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2094516431983636837" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">「截图在起飞前」呼應先前MSCI調倉引發買盤的看多預期，暗示股價即將上衝。「截图在起飞前！」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2094513535812514263" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者預期SNDK因MSCI指數今日調升權重，尾盤將出現巨量買盤，屬短線技術性看多判斷。「尾盘最后几分钟应该有巨量买盘」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2094512908701245831" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">NAND需求及PE上升直接看多。「整个板块的远期 p/e 倍数都有进一步上升的机会」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2093252439973777674" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">與NVDA同列在標題並被「Bullish AF」涵蓋。「Bullish AF ⚡ ⚡ ⚡」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2092829182786982251" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">盈利比較。「This earnings progression reminds me of $SNDK style price hikes」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2092789800428622128" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，SNDK被列為記憶體漲價的定價方，屬受惠者。「$MU $SNDK are the ones setting that price.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2092727731402240222" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，SNDK為作者持續看多並持有的標的之一。「Welcome back; we never left 😎」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2092724027936698540" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者直接寫「Bullish memory」並強調記憶體股長期只會漲，SNDK在列名之中。「the future of memory is inevitably up... Bullish memory」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2092282443558469697" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同一則貼文以南韓記憶體出口單價暴衝為由，對SNDK等記憶體股全面看多。「South Korea NAND and DRAM export unit price for August goes parabolic. Bullish AF memory」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2090669354752839785" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者回應「集中重押」的建議，表示要全押進NBIS、LITE與SNDK，展現高度看多信念。「Ok damn. Danny, fully porting $NBIS $LITE and $SNDK then.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2090663756862836997" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者形容SNDK是「安全且卡位良好的AI概念股」，屬正面肯定。「Everyone is trading the same safe, well-positioned AI names. $NBIS $SNDK $AAOI $LITE. Great as an investor.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2090657349706928636" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者引用SNDK營收年增251%、毛利率78.4%，列為看多的高成長標的。「$SNDK: +251% YoY, 78.4% gross margin」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2090639444709638405" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者轉述天風證券對 SanDisk IRD 的訪談紀要,內容提到市場依然吃緊、無降價跡象、客戶要求增加長約用量,但全篇只是轉述訪談內容,沒有加入自己的方向判斷。「The market remains tight. In fact, NBM customers are returning to request higher volumes or longer contract durations.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2090592449978851486" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确將需求承諾判為所列股票多頭論點。「That is exactly why it reads bullish to me.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2089827659794493538" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确预期记忆体股票回到历史高点且长期持有，作者看多；Kioxia身份待核实。「All memory is going higher. We will get back to the ATH prices we had just 2 months ago.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2089420093910401501" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">供需利多觀察。「demand imbalance visibility for $SNDK, $SKHY, $MU」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2089264987328151637" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">預測長期agent記憶需求，對SanDisk正面但未判斷股票或估值。「SanDisk didn&#x27;t even include it in their TAM estimates」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2089001556251480064" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面需求觀察不自動轉成股票看多。「Think about the inference demand」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2088662587818856504" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">價格資料。「TLC spot prices have finally started to go up again」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2088475006884004331" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">要求澄清及負面產品宣傳評價，未表投資方向。「I hope this is wrong」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2088283562479075716" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">負面產品宣傳評價，沒有股票看空主張。「They are deliberately misrepresenting HBM performance」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2088246901611315311" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">调侃Sandisk投资者日展示，产品/宣传质疑不当股票看空。「SanDisk could only pull off this finesse」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2088243482544816181" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">新文明确预期记忆体反攻近了，重新承诺旧文MU/SNDK多方逻辑。「存储反攻的那一天 或许快来了」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2088236600899833915" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明示所談SNDK存儲牛市回歸。「存储能牛回」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2088227110829871512" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">主文仅称瓶颈未改变，自引旧看多不成为新承诺；SHKY代码无法解出。「$SHKY, Samsung, $SNDK, $MU memory bottleneck never changed」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2088226398708338889" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">本人對所述股回落時買入的方向。「Buy the fear」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2087956934213218456" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">复盘已发生上涨和旧轮动预测；整体AI基础设施看多不直接新增MU/SNDK票。「$SNDK +16%, $MU +7% on the day.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2087924738135826659" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明說持有兩檔記憶股及願加倉，明確看多。「I’m long $MU $SNDK」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2087547754159444342" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">以未來收入及估值支持有實質上行，勸勿賣底，明確看多記憶股；ETF排除。「that is material upside from here.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2086844710522323276" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">自己明确向上預期，所引標的SNDK；ETF排除。「watch it rip higher」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2086484673438302578" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">具名SNDK對應持續做多。「I’m still long memory」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2086476013119123683" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者直接表達所列記憶體股票看多。「Bullish memory ⚡️」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2086473937299419168" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者重申三股利潤持續增长與看多，明確方向。「Bullish, just not crazy 1000%-in-a-year bullish.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2086177224940564928" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者表達逆向買入意願，對所提記憶股看多；ETF排除。「Nothing makes me want to buy something faster than everyone agreeing it&#x27;s over.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2086156884323557647" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">長期持續多方並計畫加倉。「memory is now more than ever one of the best investments up until 2030.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2086088646600368607" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">比较ETF及推广自有组合，多个股票仅历史权重与未纳入公司赞赏，无新股票方向。「aggressive weighting in $SNDK」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2085396410405707941" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">財報失誤猜測。「both Kioxia and SanDisk missed expectations.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2085227576776343896" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">質疑空方及价格觀察，非明確方向。「Let’s see how this ages, John.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2085214182173999268" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确看多Sandisk交易结构的长期底部及成长。「We finally have a floor for the trade thanks to NBM and LTA contracts.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2085183345198047416" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明確未來重估上行論點。「memory companies should be rerated, and they will be rerated.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2085153585185321469" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">預期過度賣壓短暫並鼓勵利用機會。「market overreactions to an ER are usually short-lived.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2085105143880532233" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">明确维持自己SNDK财报前空方判断，自引为当前重新承诺。「SNDK维持判断了」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2085090985785409870" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">五家公司各有独立明确偏空/偏好论点，非纯代码资料清单。「偏空：
SNDK」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2085031458692018432" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者以负gamma、期权平仓及高预期形成明确Sandisk空头逻辑。「gamma负 + call平仓 + 伙伴回踩 + 预期过高，财报前空头逻辑更清晰。」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2085019322100178981" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确看多Sandisk并论述未定价HBF再评级潜力。「Holy fk $SNDK. This is mega bullish.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2084498388188365264" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者反駁供過於求說法，對供需正面但沒有股票方向。「Hard to see those memory &quot;oversupply&quot; claims」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2084468063228060092" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">聯盟消息與暗示提問，無明確投資方向。「led by SK hynix and Sandisk」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2084430819242946683" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确保有Sivers/AAOI多方信念，其他公司为主题需求数据而非各自方向。「expecting $LITE, $SNDK」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2082230983487803755" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">跌幅情緒反應。「My god memory is taking a beating…」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2081916429981413811" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">主要投資論述為SanDisk，作者直接維持多頭。「I remain bullish on memory.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2080993607176409492" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">否定看空並不自動等於明確看多。「I’m not a NAND bear」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2080201993189236857" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者將多年算力短缺明確當作所列股票多頭投資論點。「the AI trade isn&#x27;t over.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2079341645091188854" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">當前反駁顶部並明確支持折價投資。「I also enjoy buying stuff at a discount.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2077769328653463813" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">他人NAND需求展望。「we are becoming more positive on NAND.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2077366994702332337" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">他人投資觀點引用。「don&#x27;t expect a 10x from here on $SNDK」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2077086067941839112" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明示剩餘正向收益預期與長持主题。「those of us who were early will still be printing.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2077067072832487486" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">他人市場評論。「Hynix, Samsung and SanDisk」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2076947502021190088" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明示持有SNDK與MU多頭但反對極端集中；STX/WDC僅類股提及，ETF排除。「I&#x27;m long at these levels SNDK, MU」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2076758159163822290" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">直接買入方向。「telling you to STILL BUY $SNDK」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2075634390252519883" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Substack推廣、兩股績效比較與CCXI研究預告，未給未來方向。「$SNDK up 700% YTD」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2075605302079008946" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">持倉過去表現回顧與推廣，無新方向判斷。「$SNDK up double digits」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2075288227284422707" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">當前拒絕恐慌賣出並支持繼續加倉。「encourage you to keep adding.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2075247275144524059" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明確持續加倉及未完週期論點。「I&#x27;m not backing down, and I&#x27;m only adding.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2074886787755839938" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">組合走勢比較，沒有SNDK新增方向。「just look at the chart of $SNDK. It has a big correlation.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2074516113195417669" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">負面價格事件反應，不推定新的看空。「stock plunges over 15% today」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2072787731302752675" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面估值數據不直接當股票買入。「12.4x forward vs a 20.2x semis median」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2072692139025211570" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">當前明确買入所列記憶體標的。「Buy memory. Don’t overcomplicate things.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2072672100616167433" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">價格反應。「ridiculous performance to