oreddit/status/2065434058474307866" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">當日價格與宏觀消息。「$SNDK to $MRVL to $LITE are green now.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2065136761077158061" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Josh Gottheimer</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-06-04 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2062528553372078205" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作为既往强股例子。「the next $SNDK」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2061498698098708676" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">歷史收益称讚。「$SNDK to $AAOI」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2060578117320904884" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">引用读者收益。「闪迪、三星、海力士」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2058527207145029854" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>David Tepper</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · $179 million · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-05-17 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2055936443025924231" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> 