增长，没有明确当前股价或买卖方向。「$SNDK」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2047688270231027947" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">祝贺Sandisk股价达千元，仅行情回顾。「$SNDK」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2047682753765011661" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">分析師數字感嘆，未採用其股價目標。「OPM of 71.5%?」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2047504600052498682" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">反對做空並支持投資基本面。「$SNDK」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2043810610169978988" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">SanDisk HBF技术开发新闻，无作者投资方向。「$SNDK」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2043453527985623144" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者預期前瞻成長與回補推動漲勢。「shorts are just fuel to the rally」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2042663323427311858" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">完整转述Bernstein价格目标与情景，非作者自身投票。「$SNDK」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2042197886541455506" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">三项瓶颈持有信心与业务增长判断，未明确股票方向。「sleep a easier despite market volatility」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2041519692985344500" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">产业需求前景，非明示股票买卖。「memory supercycle for $MU and $SNDK is safe」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2036829504648155222" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">过去收益比较。「100-200%+ YTD」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2036512077960061176" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">回顾指数相对表现和AXTI及Sandisk收益，没有新方向。「$SNDK」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2034752613246542215" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">赞MicronCEO及两股历史收益，无未来方向。「Two legendary stocks. One mastermind.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2033689934100631950" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确重申记忆体多方立场，四家看多；其他为宏观例子。「I was one of the only few analysts that remained bullish the entire time.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2033651209371013588" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">驳斥内存业务需求减少论点，并未明确股票投资方向；EWY基金排除。「$SNDK」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2033632359061590383" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">既往涨幅及恐慌卖出评论。「$SNDK: +31.75%」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2033447091679416393" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">产业利润前景。「$SNDK」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2033320724291813503" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">预期跟涨产品价格。「$SNDK」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2029889046399566190" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面情绪。「does not concern itself with the rest of the market」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2025986935047729194" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">内存短缺业务前景。「The shortage could last through 2030. $EWY $MU $SNDK」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2025796590867268024" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">当前明确记忆体低估与结构性重估，四项投资看多；Sony为引文背景。「memory stocks still trade at single-digit forward earnings」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2025691750128398518" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确当日买入。「Ended up buying the 7.8% drop today.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2021374206185963683" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">当日行情惊叹。「everything down 15% from $MU to $SNDK」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2019123157672907018" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明確反對做空及支持做多。「need to stop shorting $SNDK」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2018792971907588226" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">历史行情玩笑。「doesn’t know what a red day means」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2018765325974831126" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">盈利与估值正面评价。「the forward 2027 p/e is still single digits」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2018369023738802437" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">调侃Sandisk空头并转述财报指引，未明确当前投资方向。「$SNDK」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2016993953015615621" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Sandisk与Kioxia制造合作经营消息，无作者股票方向。「$SNDK」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2016988540744454279" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">业务周期评价。「$SNDK」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2015241123896369372" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">历史行情玩笑。「unless it’s $SNDK」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2014808195014001018" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Gil Cisneros</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日 2026-01-09（原文：January 9th） · 揭露 2026-05-04 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2051323126227542419" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Donald Trump</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日 2026-01-06（原文：January 6th） · 揭露 2026-06-25 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2070168632714313887" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Donald Trump</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日 2026-01-05（原文：January 5th） · 揭露 2026-06-03 · 2 則報導 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2066610436846256130" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文1</a> <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2062255987252166776" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文2</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Lisa McClain&#x27;s husband</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日 2025-10-30（原文：October 30th） · 揭露 2026-01-30 · 2 則報導 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2018401101196808232" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文1</a> <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2017271246556131595" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文2</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">KRX:000660</span><span class="s-n">158 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-12-01 → 2026-10-04</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="flip">2 人反轉</span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+4.1%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Jukan</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> → 2026-08 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> → 2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2026-02 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Ren</b>：2026-07 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-01 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Zephyr</b>：2026-07 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> → 2026-08 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li><li><b>大老师</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者直接認為客製 HBM 讓 Micron、SK Hynix 與 Samsung 的產品更黏著、合約更長。「bullish for memory.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2106546457167671735" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">质疑海力士公开否认的可靠性，不是股票看空。「Remember that SK hynix said」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2100166810238927213" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">解讀合資可能重要性，尚未判斷股價方向。「Hynix and Intel could form a JV」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2100126711455314156" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，作者明確將SK hynix(SKHY)列為記憶體支出高毛利受惠者，並指其為HBM/高階記憶體產能配置的領先者。「your leading memory companies are all allocating capacity for DDR5/HBM or high end memory」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2098306366167535766" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，純轉述CXMT擴產逼近SK hynix產能的報導，非作者本人表態。「CXMT is expected to rapidly narrow the production capacity gap with major Korean players such as Samsung Electronics and SK hynix.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2098239574443250137" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">文章以SK海力士良率已超過90%作為對比基準，凸顯中國CXMT技術落後，但並未直接對SK海力士股價方向表態「SK hynix, which has been mass producing the same product since 2022 and has secured yields above 90%」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2097451352310030599" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">因CXMT的LPDDR6供給仍吃緊，小米新款折疊機的LPDDR6同時採用CXMT與SK海力士，顯示SK海力士取得具體訂單。「Xiaomi’s new foldable will use LPDDR6 from both CXMT and SK hynix.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2096934443026153775" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">報導詳述SK海力士1c DRAM占比從今年第一季約10%快速拉升，預計明年第一季將超越1b成為主力製程，反映技術轉換執行順利。「SK hynix is rapidly expanding the production share of its sixth generation 10nm class (1c) DRAM.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2096729233943130328" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">SK海力士積極評估在龍仁、湖南擴充產能,並考慮與日本夥伴合資設廠,顯示對需求前景樂觀而擴大投資。「SK HYNIX EXPLORES FURTHER CAPACITY EXPANSION IN YONGIN AND HONAM, AS WELL AS A POTENTIAL JV FAB WITH A JAPANESE PARTNER IN JAPAN」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2094354650757829096" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">SemiAnalysis分析指SK海力士因需要重新設計base die,導致供應輝達Rubin平台的HBM4出貨延遲,技術進度落後。「SK hynix had to redesign its base die, delaying HBM4 shipments for NVIDIA&#x27;s Rubin platform.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2094204360800833602" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">報導指SK海力士NAND仍有過半產能停留在176層舊製程,尚未跟上三星236層的轉換進度,導致每片晶圓可產出位元數較少,處於成本劣勢。「This high dependence on 176-layer NAND puts the company at a cost disadvantage because it produces relatively fewer bits per wafer.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2093122005897977940" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">SK海力士執行長表示記憶體短缺將持續到2030年底,意味供需吃緊、有利公司訂價與獲利,屬偏多消息。「MEMORY SHORTAGE TO PERSIST THROUGH THE END OF 2030」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2093083595774849089" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">名稱SK Hynix採韓國普通股；仍長倉。「aside from Samsung/SK Hynix longs」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2092851118233764178" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者預估YMTC到2027年底產能將超越SK hynix，隱含對hynix在NAND市占地位轉弱的看法。「They will surpass Hynix (260k WPM by YE27) with that」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2092503684810998119" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">同一則新聞提到 SK hynix 也將增加供應給 Nvidia 的 8-high HBM4 比重,屬產業新聞轉述,沒有明確方向判斷。「Samsung Electronics and SK hynix are expected to increase the share of 8-high products in their shipments」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2092484503080206760" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">同一則新聞提到 SK Hynix 也計畫在中國取得約 3 萬片/月產能,屬產業新聞轉述,無明確方向判斷。「SK Hynix is also expected to secure around 30,000 wafers per month of production capacity」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2091999562340643274" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">SK海力士計畫斥資數十兆韓元在日本宮城興建記憶體晶圓廠，為韓國半導體業者首次在日本設立大型生產據點，屬產能擴張訊號，惟同時面臨美國施壓要求赴美設廠的複雜因素。「SK hynix is moving forward with plans to invest tens of trillions of won to build a memory semiconductor fabrication plant (fab) in Miyagi Prefecture in northeastern Japan.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2090575465157456352" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者反駁「HBM將被淘汰」的說法，主張高頻寬記憶體的重要性會持續，並點名SK hynix下一代3D封裝技術zHBM是未來重點，隱含看好其HBM業務地位「HBM will always be important」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2090419341942775994" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者認同SK海力士正為「後HBM時代」預作準備、主動因應記憶體解耦對傳統HBM商業模式的潛在衝擊，視為具前瞻性的策略布局。「SK hynix is preparing for a post-HBM era—a time when HBM may no longer be needed.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2090415722166161583" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">分析SK海力士將光通訊延伸至記憶體的CPO技術路線圖，認為此舉能解決GPU叢集的頻寬瓶頸，屬對其長期策略布局的正面評價。「SK hynix’s vision is to extend optical interconnects to memory... This would eliminate the need to fit all memory capacity within a single GPU package and enable horizontal scaling at the rack level.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2090415402723791104" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">董事會核准40兆韓元庫藏股買回並全數銷除，同時將股東回饋目標由「至多50%」上調至「至少50% FCF」，屬明確的利多資本回饋政策。「the board approved the repurchase and cancellation of KRW 40 trillion worth of treasury shares... plans to raise its shareholder return target from “up to 50% of cumulative FCF” to “at least 50%.”」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2089970758856704379" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者在澄清謠言時提到「自一月以來持有memory部位」，雖否認有槓桿操作，但透露自己對SK海力士（記憶體）抱持多頭部位。「I have held a memory position since January, and the part about buying leveraged Hynix in June was a joke.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2088194905051144380" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">券商重估報告非作者觀點。「Samsung Electronics and SK Hynix」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2087689684298461445" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">以未來收入及估值支持有實質上行，勸勿賣底，明確看多記憶股；ETF排除。「that is material upside from here.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2086844710522323276" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面配置條件改善觀察，未明說股價方向。「已经进入明确的左侧区间」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2086700087737254037" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">對HBM合約策略批評及產品分析，無股票方向。「Hynix idiots were the first to sign LTAs」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2086569303869108327" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">對過高預期负面反應，未明說新股票方向。「Flew too close to the sun」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2085569668950249843" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">明确看多Sandisk并论述未定价HBF再评级潜力。「SanDisk and SK Hynix」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2084498388188365264" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者反駁供過於求說法，對供需正面但沒有股票方向。「Hard to see those memory &quot;oversupply&quot; claims」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2084468063228060092" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">聯盟消息與暗示提問，無明確投資方向。「led by SK hynix and Sandisk」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2084430819242946683" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">法說內容滿意不等於看多股票。「I’m very satisfied.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2082646197911884032" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">別人目標調降非作者方向。「lowered its target again today to KRW 1.48 million.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2082366197098766362" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">感谢他人海力士分析，不把被引看多归作者。「SK Hynix missing numbers is BULLISH」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2082262347582718375" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">他人預期下調，不是作者票。「lowered their earnings estimates for SK hynix.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2082242051173937333" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确保有Sivers/AAOI多方信念，其他公司为主题需求数据而非各自方向。「SK Hynix」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2082230983487803755" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">合作消息正面反應。「Looks like we may get an Intel-Hynix JV」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2080054402342412372" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者以DDR5價格與利潤持續增長支持記憶股，明示看多；韓股和ADR均在原文列出。「Bullish memory.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2079349851448328447" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">供應增加的估值風險分析，無直接個股方向。「Samsung Electronics and SK hynix have announced massive fab expansion plans」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2078462124486283755" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">预测海力士ADR溢价压缩，但本地涨或ADR跌仍是不确定情境，无绝对股价方向。「Maybe lifting Korean shares or pressuring US shares.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2078338950150959558" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">本人長倉與低估論點；明示000660。「one of my top 5 favorite stocks to own, and I&#x27;m long since January」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2078180613534744858" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">他人引文的市場評論。「SK Hynix is hostage」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2076947502021190088" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">價格與語境為韓國本體，明確買入方向。「Bought positions of SK Hynix at 1.82-1.85M.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2076565579306041345" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Cramer言论与行业反应玩笑，不归作者海力士方向。「an SK Hynix deal」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2074864915970773215" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">業務供應瓶頸評述，不直接股價方向。「Sk Hynix that are bottlenecked」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2074240512593481955" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">自身明確市值上行預測。「both will cross $3T in market cap」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2074090115140591767" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">漲幅回顧。「SK Hynix +