ix together」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2067528626971799556" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">股價紀錄。「SK Hynix All time high」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2067111063645261914" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">券商估值轉述。「raises its SK Hynix price target」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2066719002249056394" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">當前維持記憶體結構成長投資論點。「potentially end up like a mini $NVDA」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2066521694836330618" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">材料供應風險背景。「SK Hynix, Samsung, $TSM」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2065736884752703865" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">公司上市期待，沒有ADR代碼或買入承諾。「I want SK Hynix on Nasdaq.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2065504511548969432" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">已發生反彈的正面反應。「SK hynix is up 10% from the bottom.」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2063837135032156401" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><