295851409801660" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">SK Hynix HBM技术路线新闻，无作者股票方向。「SK Hynix」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2034830769559151042" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">引用长期合同正面。「SK Hynix」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2034824813160931672" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确重申记忆体多方立场，四家看多；其他为宏观例子。「I was one of the only few analysts that remained bullish the entire time.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2033651209371013588" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">SK高管参会及HBM供应新闻，未表达作者股票方向。「SK Hynix」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2033586384427172278" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">既往涨幅及恐慌卖出评论。「Sk Hynix: +7.03%」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2033447091679416393" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">前句海力士市值与持续盈利，作者直接股票低估判断。「Then that itself looks undervalued.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2033320724291813503" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">结合明确三星海力士主语的当前长仓评价。「memory names serve as compelling longs」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2030816176029462616" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确这两家记忆体股票的恐慌低估买入观点。「precisely why it&#x27;s Korea is a buy」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2030667380855083222" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">供應鏈安全正評。「SK Hynix」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2030507767371596175" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确两家韩国记忆体股票卖压为买点，看多；EWY ETF排除。「statements suggest it&#x27;s a buying opportunity」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2030445000686014588" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">业务利润前景。「SK Hynix」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2029889046399566190" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">回顾三星及海力士上涨和旧论点，未新增投资方向。「SK Hynix」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2029358890778062900" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail