and SK Hynix」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2028374385544093829" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确三星未来2.5倍市值与两家记忆体低估长多论点，看多；TSM为历史比喻。「it looks like a no-brainer long」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2027184821173416261" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">机构盈利预测的正面评论。「SK」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2026529571990839302" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">回顾三星及海力士历史高点，未给出新股票方向。「SK Hynix」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2026196965634326730" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">旧研究成绩与方向回顾。「SK Hynix/Samsung」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2025956208138649924" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">价格上涨语境和玩笑。「SK」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2025863154362884493" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">当前明确记忆体低估与结构性重估，四项投资看多；Sony为引文背景。「memory stocks still trade at single-digit forward earnings」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2025691750128398518" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确强调韩国两股估值折价，看多；MU、SNDK仅报道和相关曝光。「And yet Korean memory stocks still trade at 4-5x forward earnings.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2025464334315372750" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">盈利预测评论。「SK Hynix projected $161B」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2024156014149357892" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确韩国两股估值折价，看多；三美股仅估值比较。「The Korean discount is absurd.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2023784201401634840" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者用Samsung和SK hynix相对利润估值建议韩国敞口，表达投资看多；美国公司为比较。「might be good to get exposure to Korean」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2022196582884790607" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明確做多信號。「biggest long signal.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2018792971907588226" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">認為競爭無重大影響。「SK Hynix」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2018703864409870379" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确三星海力士主语的当前估值判断。「they&#x27;re cheaper than ever」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2018506303736569942" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">产业利润正面评论。「SK Hynix」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2018369023738802437" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确看多南亚并预期上涨继续；其他存储持仓及自引清单仅为背景，没有逐股新方向。「alongside $MU, SK Hynix, and Samsung」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2016487104000446545" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">业务周期评价。「SK Hynix」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2015241123896369372" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确极度看多三星和海力士，基金只是获取敞口工具。「both of which I’m mega bullish on」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2010877487681835338" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">以AAOI及Marvell为核心论证股价重估，其余为微软芯片供应链背景。「SK Hynix」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2003476197028852074" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">内存需求背景。「Sk Hynix」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/1999575509462843833" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者在供应链研究后明确新建LITE仓位；其余公司为业务供应链或客户背景，不能据此逐股投票。「SK Hynix: HBM3E」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/1995543748353347989" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:INTC</span><span class="s-n">130 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-07-29 → 2026-10-05</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="flip">2 人反轉</span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+2.8%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Donald Trump</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Intel CEO</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Jukan</b>：2026-03 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> → 2026-09 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-04 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Nancy Pelosi</b>：2026-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Ren</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> → 2026-09 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> → 2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-01 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Tim Moore</b>：2025-07 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Trump administration</b>：2025-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>United States government</b>：2025-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Zephyr</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>大老师</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Unusual Whales</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">options_flow 帳號陳述 Intel 今年漲幅逾230%的事實數據，純播報無方向判斷。「Intel, $INTC, is up more than 230% this year.」 <a href="https://x.com/unusual_whales/status/2106897405165900224" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">CPU性能讚賞。「AMD or Intel completely destroy when it comes to RL sandboxes or agent sandboxes」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2104952140129304765" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">股價下跌情緒。「This tweet tanked my Intel stock.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2104780396546396470" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确看多CPU需求且点名三家；Meta仅需求案例。「$INTC  $AMD  $ARM」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2103277471579709556" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者對CPU數量需求翻倍提出看多結論。「$INTC  $AMD  $ARM」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2103263059770839412" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">供應流向預測。「They will switch to Intel for HBM5 (late 2028)」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2102332737902526548" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">需求受惠比喻。「I can hear all the $AMD, $INTC, and $ARM CPUs vrrrring in the background.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2102247915251224980" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">反問而非明確方向承諾。「Intel’s next, right?」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2102153257510752500" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">本人持倉與未来Agent需求論點。「I&#x27;ve owned CPU names like $ARM, $INTC and $AMD」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2102091972131393869" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">CPU需求預估低估消費採用，四股前瞻受益論點。「Could be an order of magnitude higher.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2102073980559692168" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">CPU股票当日庆祝，无新的未来方向。「Big day for the CPU trade

$INTC $ARM $AMD」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2102031462006419507" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">供應顧慮。「I’m not sure Intel has secured enough substrate capacity to support all these customers.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2101996196252495974" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">解讀合資可能重要性，尚未判斷股價方向。「Hynix and Intel could form a JV」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2100126711455314156" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">海力士与Intel合作的正面反应，未给股票方向。「Interesting combination」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2100100174463029368" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者只补充客户CPU偏好，引用分析师Intel目标价不归作者。「Intel mid-quarter update」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2099760267844522233" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">供應合作正面觀察，無本人股票方向。「Looks like both Hynix &amp;amp; Micron will get their base dies fabbed at Intel as well」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2099759011444949127" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">自身明确多方論點。「I can make a similar bullish argument with $BE, $INTC, $AMD, and others.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2099659874892386678" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，作者對列出的整組個股發出「血腥的一週」警告。「It&#x27;s going to be a bloody week. Are you prepared?」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2099179266852196638" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者提到SK海力士正尋求與英特爾代工合作，暗示對英特爾代工業務可能有利，但沒有明確表態股價方向「Now you see why SK hynix is looking to work with Intel」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2097561239115501741" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者提到INTC十月將調漲PC處理器價格一成，並認為市場會樂見這個消息。「$INTC is raising PC CPU prices by 10% apparently in October per Digitimes, which I think markets might appreciate.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2097232588796780856" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者對「英特爾還要再裁員5-10%」的消息以「DAMN」表達訝異與擔憂,但沒有明確說這對股價是好是壞。「DAMN Lip Bu is still cutting」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2097099451550818536" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">報導指Intel因成本壓力10月起再調漲PC CPU價格一成，並計畫再裁員5%到10%，且低毛利的Small Core產品線可能停產、讓出市場給高通與聯發科，反映公司持續承壓。「Intel will raise prices on PC CPUs by another 10% in October.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2097098974209675740" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，此檔列於作者的agentic AI算力需求看多清單中「You are not bullish enough...Position yourself accordingly」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2097039199102730470" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者將INTC列為自己至今仍上漲逾100%的晶圓代工主題持股。「4. $INTC - Foundry」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2096814311306129776" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者建議這個晶片新創的合資案應該去英特爾(而非台積電)綁定產能,言下之意若成真對INTC是新增訂單的正面消息。「I think they should look into securing capacity at Intel rather than TSMC」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2095937862915272832" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者認為SK海力士為HBM（高頻寬記憶體）基礎晶片產能分散一部分給英特爾代工「很合理」，暗示這對英特爾晶圓代工業務是正面的新訂單機會。「Diversifying to Intel makes a lot of sense」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2094357891893580180" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">獨家報導證實SK海力士考慮讓Intel Foundry代工下世代HBM4E的base die,結束過去完全仰賴台積電的局面,是Intel新增的重要客戶與訂單。「SK hynix is pursuing a plan under which base dies for HBM4E could be manufactured by both TSMC and Intel」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2094234328230482082" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">韓媒報導SK海力士將把下世代base die代工外包給Intel,對Intel Foundry是新增的代工設計贏單。「SK HYNIX TO OUTSOURCE NEXT-GENERATION BASE DIE PRODUCTION TO INTEL」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2094233685633782200" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者針對英特爾的光學運算互連技術OCI表示「很不錯」，屬對英特爾技術實力的正面評價「Intel&#x27;s OCI is pretty good」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2091780998690464247" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者指出英特爾只要維持現有台積電產能配額，就能阻止AMD搶到更多伺服器CPU產能，暗示這對英特爾競爭地位有利。「simply by increasing—or even maintaining—its current TSMC capacity allocation, Intel can prevent AMD from securing more server CPU capacity at TSMC and ramping its CPU shipments.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2090228827687645498" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Intel CEO</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · $10M at $95/share · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-08-15 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2088753660155011309" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者给AMD财报后上涨交易与止损，并认为Intel受益。「相关联的 $INTC 也会同样受益」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2084654596803416199" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品認可，不直接等於看多Intel股票。「MediaTek seems quite optimistic about EMIB-T.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2084116669274972313" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面產能引述反應。「WOW」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2082058122945044646" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">售價數據。「Server CPU ASPs Up 48%」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2081524186041004414" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Intel已涨的惊叹反应，没有未来方向。「You really can&#x27;t make this up」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2080428780766519786" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">批評分析師對14A時間預估，非股票方向。「Wall Street needs to own up to all the bullshit」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2080420787295846428" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者把較低價格定位為機會並承接多頭財報交易。「明天开盘intc应当还有110刀以下的机会」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2080386538760999056" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品營收正面評述非明確投資票。「Server CPUs are flying」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2080384306212671842" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">自己的明確多頭期權解讀。「财报押注整体以看涨为主」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2080289121445269744" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">合作正面語氣。「$SKHY 🤝 $INTC」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2080084566316867655" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">合作消息正面反應。「Looks like we may get an Intel-Hynix JV」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2080054402342412372" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">替代技術優勢消息。「Intel claims that EMIB-T can support reticle sizes of up to 12x」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2079568535093973274" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">反諷情绪不直接推定股票看空。「I wouldn&#x27;t want to be a $INTC bull right now.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2079336826221756514" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明確個股所屬下跌周期近底的價格方向。「close to market bottom on semis from $INTC to $LITE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2077784594959725056" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Nancy Pelosi</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · INTC call options · 交易日未知