80054" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确认为Qualcomm估值提供廉价AI上行并推荐CPU既有公司，虽低确信度仍有方向。「investors likely better off playing CPU supercycle with the incumbents」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2048512944947020048" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">历史分析师评价。「first sell-side analyst &amp;amp; firm to go bullish on Intel」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2048301725824733246" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确以CPU机会致富作为交易论点，看多Intel。「But that&#x27;s the trade.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2048285148693799195" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">完整转述广发Intel研报，买入评级与目标价非作者判断。「$INTC」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2048233256961876087" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">引述券商乐观研究。「Raise TP to $94.2」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2048163863611535382" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">称赞研报作者，引用Intel目标价未构成自身投票。「Intel」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2048075375226605582" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Intel CPU供应传闻，不含作者投资方向。「Intel」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2047918203461136841" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">旧价格回顾。「$INTC」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2047485717341987232" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">既往漲幅。「$INTC」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2047472057890513357" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">價格及收益回顧。「up 20% today」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2047471570847924292" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">技术成果肯定。「Intel 14A seems to be ramping much better」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2047467201075245356" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">欢呼Intel技术人才报道，引用他人判断不等于自身股票方向。「$INTC」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2047458399559024883" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">成本新聞。「Intel」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2047457585180320080" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">財報及預測批評。「miss it this badly」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2047447348746596672" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">称赞Intel财报惊喜，无明确投资方向。「$INTC」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2047438876445446619" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">欢呼Intel业务和财报，无明确股票买卖方向。「$INTC」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2047413257812717859" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">解释PC需求将受内存涨价影响，引用Intel管理层新闻非作者投票。「$INTC」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2047409206396162422" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">分析Google自研CPU对Intel份额影响，业务担忧并未明确股票方向。「Intel」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2047237363445993743" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">價格紀錄反應。「$INTC」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2045143735168815248" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">價格紀錄。「$INTC」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2045142673477324838" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">第三方公司稱讚。「Intel」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2045061306835931226" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">产业需求背景。「$INTC」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2044045150410919940" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">技術能力負評。「$INTC」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2043122090463961104" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">转述UBS封装发展研报，没有作者股票方向。「Intel」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2041873953342525630" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">业务订单正面。「Intel may be close to securing EMIB-related orders」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2041167415934107894" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">对第三方研究肯定，未採用股价目标。「NICE」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2041051973777342583" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">財務改善稱讚。「Intel」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2039353092500791534" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者当前CPU交易选择。「Second, Intel.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2036963841582784947" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">信任Elon执行能力与Tesla估值解释，非明确公司股票方向。「Then I do with $INTC」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2036238974747025683" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">批评Intel过去出售业务，Jabil为交易对手，无股票投票。「$INTC」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2035597851871588578" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者肯定美国产业政策对MU和INTC的业务护城河，其他公司为政策风险或引用背景，未作股票买卖表态。「&quot;Made in America&quot; is the greatest moat $MU and $INTC have.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2016126247869546583" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确以当前多头论点建议继续持有等待。「it’s probably best to wait for it to play out」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2014808195014001018" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确当前看多。「most asymmetrical longs in the semi space right now」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2013991833966113138" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确表示INTC高信念多头和潜在回报，也直接称TSM为好多头；其余公司作比较或客户背景。「this is a high conviction long on US policy.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2012492311092244821" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者反驳INTC悲观估值并赞同政策支撑，但没有明确买卖或未来股价判断；NVDA是政策背景。「The infinite money printer won’t let it fail.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2011006623893123154" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-08-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Tim Moore</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日 2025-08-01（原文：Back in August） · 揭露 2025-09-18 · 8 則報導 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2051666889655435466" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文1</a> <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2049516651209490628" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文2</a> <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2013998483817009382" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文3</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-08-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>United States government</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · ~10% stake; $8.9 billion · 交易日 2025-08-01（原文：August 2025） · 揭露 2026-04-30 · 3 則報導 <a href="https://x.com/DJTRadar/status/2073112625567707137" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文1</a> <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2052838339699470672" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文2</a> <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2049850078353821831" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文3</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-08-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Trump administration</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · ~10% stake for $8.9 billion · 交易日 2025-08-01（原文：August 2025） · 揭露 2026-07-11 <a href="https://x.com/DJTRadar/status/2075928314208735415" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-07-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Tim Moore</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日 2025-07-29（原文：July 29th） · 揭露 2026-01-13 · 2 則報導 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2043711225129771195" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文1</a> <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2011110107871158574" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文2</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:AXTI</span><span class="s-n">112 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-12-26 → 2026-10-02</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+16.6%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Ren</b>：2026-07 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2025-12 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者期待利率不變與殖利率下降，認為高 beta 股票還會走高並點名四檔；未核實未知代碼公司名。「high betas are screaming higher.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2106076184840667539" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者只以「Optics go brrr」表達光學領域的興奮，個股論點均在引文中，未逐股給方向。「Optics go brrr」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2105712095014851027" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者點出 InP 基板供應是關鍵變數並提及 AXT，但沒有直接給該股價格或持有判斷。「hello $AXTI」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2105709782854435274" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">AAOI业务看多但股价受增发抑制，2027跑赢附停止发行条件；其他为融资/机会成本案例。「Instead following $AXTI like LTA prepayments」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2103151990146801812" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">自嘲自己的供應鏈選股表現遠不如油輪航運 ETF，屬績效抱怨非賣出判斷「making $AXTI and $SIVE look like a bond fund」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2098066275691794531" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">列在 Bullish for 清單，理由是磷化銦基板需求「$AXTI - InP substrate」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2097820413900276043" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，此檔列於作者長期看好清單中「Bullish ⚡️」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2097530847351972083" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">AXTI當日+8.0%同樣被列為光學股全面走強的一員，作者整體語氣正面「$AXTI +8.0%」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2097332258386403456" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，此檔列於作者看多的光學/互聯股清單中「You are not bullish enough on interconnect, photonics and optics ⚡️」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2097072930114969608" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者藉InP基板成為產業關鍵風險的報導，強調自己去年就已看準AXTI這個關鍵環節。「I wonder who could have guessed this last year with $AXTI?」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2096904209371427277" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者將AXTI列為自己至今仍上漲逾100%、有效的InP基板主題持股。「1. $AXTI - InP substrates」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2096814311306129776" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者以AXTI、IREN等近期重挫個股為例，歸因於「九月是全年最差月份」的季節性迷思，屬市場/季節性觀察，非針對個股基本面表態。「After seeing everything from $AXTI to $IREN get nuked… I&#x27;m starting to believe in the: &quot;September is the worst month of the year&quot; myth.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2094831983306440746" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，AXTI為目前獲利中的波段持倉之一。「Today all of my swings but one are green $NBIS $MRVL $NVTS $AXTI $AEHR」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2092738683934003516" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">个人帐号里程碑及旧投资回顾，无新方向。「saw 2025 ideas from $AXTI to $NBIS play out」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2091488091110531106" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者引用AXTI營收年增164%、季增77%且轉虧為盈，列為看多標的之一。「$AXTI: +164% YoY, +77% sequential, swung to profit」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2090639444709638405" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">當前交易買入與明確光子多頭論點。「Trading it again at 80-90.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2089443720533819658" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">預期基板價格上漲而非明確股價方向。「I do have higher expectations for price hikes that comes next.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2089165155741622679" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">當前繼續持有及投資論點驗證。「I still long on both」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2087838176677376186" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面新供應合約背景。「new substrate deal with $AXTI」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2087336733218156608" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">财报电话会摘要肯定需求价格与业务时间，没有明确逐股投资方向；SIVEF代码未核实。「additional substrate help from $AXTI」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2087329770879197549" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者重新明确看多美光与三星，其他光学公司仅市场叙事及旧估值案例。「$AXTI to $LITE in the photonics sector」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2086148557187461412" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">支持性同業營運背景。「green light from AAOI, AXTI, and VIAV」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2085811801988685950" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">引用已發生上漲。「ripped 50% in a day after earnings」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2085452109018022396" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">讽刺贬低AXT的人并回应已上涨，未来CPO行业认可不形成新AXT方向。「It’s up 10% when every other name is down.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2085015078927994980" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者重申AAOI多頭並預測新高，明確看多；AXTI只在自引價格回顧。「ripped 50% in a day after earnings」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2084685159388074236" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">AAOI财报观察指标及历史波段复盘，没有当前确定方向。「$AXTI sits at the very bottom of the InP chain」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2084349399287910866" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">主題為作者喜愛AXT及供需投資論點，明確支持向上。「Bullish on upstream optical supply chains」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2083088870942642391" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者以AXT需求及供货协议明确看多。「Bullish!」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2082937549199208839" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确长期持有四家并认为便宜估值可恢复，构成保有多方承诺。「40% of the InP supply chain with $AXTI」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2074951295027568736" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">供應链地位與漲價利好。「leading players.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2074007618046345249" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">本人持倉及未來成長投資論點。「many of these names will have a major inflection point」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2069967746377662587" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确仍持有AXT并重申自身研究基础，保留多方承诺。「still holding shares btw」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2066823176785457323" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">歷史漲幅回顧。「AXT is $7.24B」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2066785056031670657" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">持仓对出口放宽业务消息正面反应，未明示新股价方向。「My optical positions are very happy to hear this:」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2066340661633372452" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">過往研究成果。「greatest thesis of all time after $AXTI.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2065779524248510758" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">地缘出口议题及泛供应链机会，未明确AXTI股票方向。「Should present some interesting opportunities」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2065650434644304165" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">供應風險情緒。「a major point of failure?」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2064942505553170886" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">投资方法反思；当前明确建议AAOI低估做多，余股是研究示例与泛品质判断，非单股方向。「Everyone called it a joke when I bought」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2063465386960736396" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">研究成就回顧。「$AXTI」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2060896847695384736" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确当前做多下一阶段CPO中的Sivers；其他已涨标的为旧交易回顾。「$AXTI」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2059646212803051722" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">个人粉丝经历与AXTI过去涨幅，未表达新投资方向。「$AXTI」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2059306154787062194" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">过去选股认可。「$AXTI」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2058839070122688829" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">歷史收益。「make 380% on it」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2057689020390580234" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">過去研究成果。「I present to you: $AXTI」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2057518759968190581" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">过去投资回顾。「Then went long on the quasi-monopoly in $AXTI.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2056157639760126294" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">回顾AXTI旧论点及贸易消息，未新增方向；多家海外公司身份未核实。「$AXTI」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2055379668195561657" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">旧观点验证。「Did you remember my $AXTI InP substrate bottleneck call」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2053270948414099915" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">回顾AXTI旧论点与十倍涨幅，未新增当前方向；SMTOY未核实。「$AXTI」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2052809650127708563" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">回顾AXTI旧论点及股价表现，未新增股票方向。「$AXTI」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2052105838396084622" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">AXTI瓶颈增长回顾与LITE供给解释，业务增长非新股票方向。「$AXTI will just keep growing as a critical bottleneck」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2051848666588303758" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">既往股价。「$AXTI +17.34%」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2050237030828052862" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">否定做空且支持當前估值與護城河。「Retail short sellers should really not touch $AXTI.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2049985874193195425" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">旧成果回顧。「$AXTI」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2045723587966107858" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">既往涨幅。「went up 30% yesterday」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2045160542256656611" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">歷史收益。「1000% unrealized gains」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2044796702218215832" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">既往收益比较。「$AXTI thesis」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2044682729128874210" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">回顾IQE过去涨幅并猜下一十倍股，未明确新持仓；IQE身份未核实。「$AXTI」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2042549185095045231" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">AXTI稀释投票通过会卖、失败会反弹，互斥条件没有单一当前方向；IREN为稀释比较。「If it passes for 50m more share authorized dilution, I personally would not hold.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2041249789195813291" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">反驳即时替代风险，非买卖或股价预测。「TFLN will take a long time」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2041001104029487202" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">旧引用收益回顾。「only up 215% YTD」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2040504686349090986" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">媒体引用趣闻与旧多头回顾，未新增股票方向。「$AXTI」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2040114262358839644" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">过去收益比较。「next 1000% chokepoint like $AXTI」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2040087774708252804" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">过去价格表现。「climbs 400% in the past 4 months.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2039375950509748678" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者重申Sivers未来百亿美元市值看多；AXTI供应链辩护与其他旧研究为背景。「$AXTI」 <a href="ht