原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">回顾AXTI涨幅与旧论点，SMTOY OTC代码未核实。「$AXTI」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2034743349337628803" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">回顾Macronix涨幅并解释业务；台湾身份未核实，Phison旧引用非新方向。「$AXTI」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2033792436892570083" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">已发生涨幅及学习机会，非当前交易。「$AXTI」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2032884410018939191" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">既往重估。「sending it to $2.6 billion+」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2032697006586786139" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者称TSEM为当前安全复利股并披露AXTI持仓，表达当前看多。「My positions are up over 550%+.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2032476428005220449" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">业务需求肯定。「Demand does not seem to be slowing down anytime soon.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2032239138980905334" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>S