投资并质疑低估值，偏多但保留地缘及稀释风险；其他公司是材料供需背景。「This is a &quot;tail-risk&quot; investment」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2005918544924664315" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">業務供應占比。「$AXTI CEO」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2005654662616387783" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">公司产业地位正面评价。「bottleneck within a bottleneck」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2005485130958430440" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">材料竞争地位肯定。「strategic chokepoint」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2004936335702753729" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">瓶頸公司重要性。「$AXTI」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2004577553714163817" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:META</span><span class="s-n">106 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-11-26 → 2026-09-30</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="flip">1 人反轉</span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+1.7%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Ren</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-01 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Zephyr</b>：2026-03 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>大老师</b>：2026-07 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> → 2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">持股祝福正面反应，没有新报酬预期。「Taking that as a blessing for my $META bags」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2105292227916292184" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品需求讚賞。「$META’s Muse proved ordinary consumers want AI agents」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2104562166292525353" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">企業產品計畫正面反應，無股票方向。「Zucc is serious」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2104554731351998727" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">前瞻股價上行論點。「未来Muse的每一段更新，每一个Milestone，都会是对Meta股价的提振」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2104551644067504328" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">直接投資立場。「I&#x27;m a $META bull」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2103996265105440868" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面產品採用預測不直接等於股票看多。「autonomous agents will spread through the mainstream like wildfire.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2103472742624338339" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">明确看多CPU需求且点名三家；Meta仅需求案例。「Meta just gave every Muse user their own always-on VM.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2103277471579709556" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">繼續持有並明示持續上行。「I decided to let my position ride.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2103202078491570280" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面情緒回顧，未明示作者買賣。「Now everyone loves $META again lol.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2103126833244102923" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品評價。「I have a feeling that even if OAI or Ant put out their own Muse, Muse will survive.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2103005414485082594" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">回顧短方論點及跌幅，自引Meta舊論點，無新承諾。「The asymmetric upside for $META is profound」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2102843025131245920" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">复盘META旧交易与跳涨，自引旧看多无新承诺。「The $META Muse trade was the most obvious one of the year.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2102828581693108639" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品稱讚。「Meta beat my expectations with this release.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2102247915251224980" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">期待有趣產品合作。「@bubbleboi x $META Muse」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2102221481736646965" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">本人考慮加倉。「I might need to up my $META shares.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2102207465408671751" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明確看多公司增量盈利。「So it&#x27;s pure upside on a brand new product that will complement the core business.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2102162571394740433" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">回顧今天Meta機會及定位優勢，未說未來方向。「If you didn&#x27;t hit a lick on $META today」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2102118068222820671" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">收益回顧。「FinX with a huge win today on $META」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2102106853828387005" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品為需求背景。「Meta&#x27;s Muse is just the latest and most obvious iteration」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2102091972131393869" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">支持产品普及。「The rich have always had personal assistants. Now everyone can.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2102063677642100771" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">复盘META旧永续交易与产品预期，无当前新方向。「$META was the first information arbitrage trade I&#x27;ve made」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2102056117560086888" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">上漲反應及自引產品分析。「$META up 7%.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2102037834789966286" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明確推介多方交易。「EASIEST TRADE EVER $META」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2102032241224478956" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">舊自引不新增票。「The asymmetric upside for $META is profound」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2101839914732253639" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Meta新业务探索无股票回报承诺；其他平台仅比较。「Muse may be the first glimpse of a broader consumer AI business.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2101824867775483913" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">Meta上行被市場低估，明確看多。「The asymmetric upside for $META is profound and still heavily discounted by the market.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2101816616929648954" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">直接看多並附產品價值論據。「Going bullish $META is simple.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2101381875126370639" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品進展與租用消息。「Meta is renting a massive number of virtual machines for Muse.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2101285687719030873" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">直接看多表態。「IF YOU&#x27;RE NOT BULLISH $META I DON&#x27;T GET IT.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2100992586559467669" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Muse排名消息，正面產品語氣非投資方向。「$META MUSE IS NOW #1」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2100817562892456138" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明說Meta多頭及聚合商空頭配對交易，方向明確。「Long $META, Short aggregators」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2100704362024820857" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者以Meta多倍永續多頭表達當前agentic策略信念。「a 5x $META perp to express my conviction」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2100685339837026515" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">自身明確看多。「One reason I&#x27;m so bullish $META right now.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2099872529141919849" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品創作機會不代表股價方向。「I&#x27;d pump 2-3 reels a day on use cases and prompts for $META muse.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2099639446950101023" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面產品及用戶價值觀點，不自動變看多票。「It will be a smash hit and give Zuck more data」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2099287158871994445" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者直接使用「bullish」一詞,認為META新推出的Muse應用程式將帶給數十億人第一次有用的agentic AI體驗。「Think about how bullish that is.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2098170540242698249" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">認為其在個人代理領域可比 OpenAI 更積極推進，因為伺服器處理器與記憶體採購量最大「Meta can probably move much more aggressively in the personal agent space compared to OpenAI」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2097881141114290467" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，被列為資本支出換取 2028 年後獲利的代表「when you look at $AMZN / $META / $GOOGL capex」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2097815176838017066" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">自陳是旗艦基金最大持股、加碼後已漲逾 18%，並反問誰能看空「$META is the largest position in my Flagship Fund up over 18% since I added」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2097756968962462036" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者對Meta最新發布的Muse Spark 1.3模型在Artificial Analysis智能指數上的高分表現表示「非常令人印象深刻」，反映對Meta AI競爭力的正面評價。「Very impressive」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2095254696609157443" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者認為Meta現在擁有「非常強的post-training（訓練後優化）流程」，暗示其AI模型競爭力提升，對公司基本面偏正面。「Meta has a very strong post training pipeline now」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2095242898896015669" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者說每次有利空把META股價往下打，Zuckerberg總能想辦法克服，就算最壞情況（前沿AI實驗室失敗）公司靠出售囤積的稀缺算力也能賺錢，顯示對META長期看多。「Feels like every time there&#x27;s doubt pushing $META stock down Zuck figures out how to overcome it.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2093806709555036493" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，META被列入看好的大型股輪動名單。「Large cap summer $AAPL $META $GOOGL $AMZN」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2093353130725417265" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者只是抱怨META沒有把AI功能整合進Instagram分析等產品體驗，屬於對產品功能的吐槽，未對股價方向表態「$META frustrates the hell out of me... I can&#x27;t chat with my Instagram analytics」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2091582160402837704" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品效果正評。「working really well」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2089301184960221522" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面產品期望。「I hope Meta opens source」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2087056972055236751" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">法院新聞。「ordered META to pay $567 million」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2085523216429400110" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确保有Sivers/AAOI多方信念，其他公司为主题需求数据而非各自方向。「$META compute」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2082230983487803755" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">赞赏美光与Meta白皮书，无股票方向。「Micron and Meta have jointly published a white paper」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2081243127797686457" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">解释Meta技术博客存储成本，无股票投资方向。「Meta Engineering blog post」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2081176155806380262" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">技術文章稱讚。「Meta’s Engineering Blog is full of hidden gems.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2080925112552022211" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品競爭反應，未明說股票方向。「$META is so back.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2079831344641695794" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">合約新聞。「$META in talks to lease compute」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2078175882620059719" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面業務擴張觀察。「revealing their neocloud ambitions.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2078161834125697417" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">模型攻勢正面公司語氣。「Zucc and Elon triggered it」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2075641672248283388" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">明確多頭獲利了結建議。「META短期反弹的一个多头止盈区间」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2075589582872256717" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">模型競爭正評。「Meta is not out of the race.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2075347152503788006" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">引用算力业务說法，作者未明示股票方向。「&quot;meta selling compute&quot;」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2075263032729677848" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">負面技術相對排名，未表股票看空。「Meta, xAI, and the Chinese labs are at Google level」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2075241700155625551" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Meta內部備忘錄資本支出及採購消息，無作者方向。「Showing AI ramping as usual:」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2075199849507762279" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Meta建設新聞與反駁媒体框架，無股票方向。「$META to build a new $10B DC」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2074965761345642660" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品性能負面語氣。「No Mythos from Meta」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2074738175050919966" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">對PR與新聞傷害負面評論，無股票看空。「doing damage control after crashing the market」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2074568161299771394" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">批评主题卖出并预测未点名机构重新做多，不对META/NVDA明确下股票结论。「$META compute news that’s not new」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2074405723816304743" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品嘲諷。「🤣🤣🤣🤣」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2072927954414539005" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">對公司算力需求正面澄清，無Meta股票方向。「things are likely to accelerate from Meta catching up」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2072922974345445511" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">澄清Meta技术报道，公司正面辩护不是股票方向。「Lot of misinformation recently about $META.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2072906728853881251" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品競爭力正面評價。「Who said they were out of the AI race again?」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2072902886712094919" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">嘲讽Meta高管模型认知，不当股票看空。「Zucc doesn&#x27;t have access to Claude Code or Codex??」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2072897418069426419" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">負面業務進展評價，未明說股票看空。「MSL/TBD are stumbling」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2072815734217146735" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">研發問題評價，非股票看空。「Meta is still facing problems」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2072678513690444004" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">同意Meta多余算力是业务需求正面信号，未表态股票价格或交易方向。「markets completely misunderstood Meta’s excess compute comment」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2072574465763111166" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">预测Anthropic向Meta采购容量，业务观点非股票方向。「Ant will be buying a lot of capacity from Meta」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2072518348819337473" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面业务框架评论，未明說股票方向。「Meta的新闻改变了这一现状」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2072431507646615629" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">澄清Meta算力与资本开支消息，预测支出增加不等于股票方向。「disinformation going around about $META」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2072314906729455876" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面業務策略及歷史漲幅，不直接股票看多。「Thought Meta should go up against」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2072301677211009426" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">負面業務競爭評價與股價方向分離。「Meta falls out of the AI race.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2072298808692834658" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">嘲讽Meta云业务消息，不当看空股票。「Zuck finally takes the L」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2072298455314436380" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Meta/Google算力约束及Nebius合约资料，整体产业资本开支利好不形成个股方向。「$META signed massive agreements」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2071135874100990438" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">算力供應新聞。「Google reportedly limited Meta’s use of Gemini」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2071126659307385321" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面業務驗證，未表股票方向。「Meta’s 30%+ Y/Y revenue growth」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2069655980456149142" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">業務策略評價。「it wouldn’t be a bad idea for Meta to get back into the stablecoin business」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2069572863536021716" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">訓練能力正面評估。「They have the compute」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2067908865757450616" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Meta编码模型及员工成本的产品嘲讽，不当股票看空。「MSL needs to ship a good coding model」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2065512160009028024" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">當下價格反應。「暴跌中」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2062962265570353365" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品品類负評。「Isn’t this already a failed category?」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2060509985893978253" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确主张避免中国股票敞口，担忧FUTU和TIGR政策风险。「$META」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2057780545292308506" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">批评Meta收购策略与交易行为，非股票看空。「meta又在操盘了」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2050261957778047188" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">財報資料反應。「$META」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2049580784613474583" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">转述MediaTek芯片与产能消息和研报，目标价来自他人。「Meta」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2048684249239412829" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">长文分析Nuvacore创业、CPU行业及企业战略，未表达上市股票买卖方向。「Meta」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2044684410289852753" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">已發生反彈。「$META」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2044507444962070817" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">泛正面评价。「orcl goog meta 都挺不错的」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2044094110030803283" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Meta发布新模型新闻，无股票方向。「META」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2041913295771496545" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者当前股价见底判断。「Meta bottom」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2037784716850700432" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">以Meta增长与低估论证当前买入。「I’m a buyer here.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2037320624746729756" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Meta期权数据与辱骂是负面情绪，非作者明确股票看空。「犹太公司早点死吧 求求了」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2037212783788646695" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">具体低估股票的未来资金轮动及反弹预期。「we should see capital rotations back into the American tech sector soon.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2036448156280561850" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">META裁员传闻和个人内容业务讨论，未表达股票方向。「$META」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2032910690563010921" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确认为META卖幅过大，表达股价低估方向。「selloff for a total of -16.92% this past month is a bit too much.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2032533634218184965" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">支持Google及Meta资本支出的企业价值策略，未明确股票买卖或价格方向。「$META」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2019216672004141282" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确上行价格预测及做多。「see Meta at $800+ in the upcoming weeks」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2016973892674630066" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">当前明确上行期待并有自身加仓论点。「Hope it goes up even more over the next few weeks」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2016621132632510939" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确自身加仓。「I added positions in $META at $625」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2011114186265513999" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者回顾META买入后的盈利并谈持仓原则；TTD的买入建议为旧自引，没有新增判断。「all the $META buys post-earnings are green」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/1996586822189613538" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">以NBIS子公司价值与市值折价形成作者看多投资论点；其余股票为竞争、客户或历史案例。「$META」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/1993657309986509242" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:AMD</span><span class="s-n">104 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-04-08 → 2026-10-04</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="flip">3 人反轉</span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+4.3%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>ARK</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li><li><b>Josh Gottheimer</b>：2026-04 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Jukan</b>：2026-07 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> → 2026-08 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> → 2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li><li><b>Marjorie Taylor Greene</b>：2025-04 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-04 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Ren</b>：2026-07 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> → 2026-09 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> → 2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Zephyr</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> → 2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li><li><b>大老师</b>：2026-07 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者語氣帶有不滿（no one gave a fk about pacing the frontier），暗示失望情緒，但沒有明確說出這些持股的漲跌方向。「My stocks on Monday after it turned out no one gave a fk about pacing the frontier.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2106823474098360335" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者稱先進封裝產能是 AMD 的大問題並預期其積極爭取供應，但未據此表達股價下跌或賣出立場。「Advanced Packaging capacity is a huge problem for AMD」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2106719792891851255" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">质疑AMD报价合理性不是股票看空，辉达仅比较代码。「Not possible
Just 432GB of HBM costs $12k-$14k」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2105304786728051173" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">CPU性能讚賞。「AMD or Intel completely destroy when it comes to RL sandboxes or agent sandboxes」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2104952140129304765" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确长期看多CPU，以AMD订单双年延伸和良率支持。「I remain bullish on CPUs over the long term. When I first saw AMD&#x27;s 2027 Venice booking numbers」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2104781562684555451" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">營收資料無個股表態。「AMD EPYC data center revenue has more than doubled YoY.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2104562166292525353" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确看多CPU需求且点名三家；Meta仅需求案例。「$INTC  $AMD  $ARM」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2103277471579709556" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">CPU需求成長與Bullish共同指向代碼。「$INTC  $AMD  $ARM」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2103263059770839412" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">需求利多感想。「$AMD to $MU should be happy to hear this…」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2103232350348001701" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">CPU市場規模推論。「it is hard to believe $220B will be the last revision.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2103135209767981198" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">歷史新高回顧，非前瞻方向。「$AMD back to back ATH」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2102489528699117941" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">需求受惠比喻。「I can hear all the $AMD, $INTC, and $ARM CPUs vrrrring in the background.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2102247915251224980" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">以AI投資回報轉為持續支出支持四股看多。「Use cases with proper ROI, become recurring spend lines.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2102206142956839081" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">上漲祝賀不等於新的看多。「Congrats to AMD holders.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2102153257510752500" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">本人持倉與未来Agent需求論點。「I&#x27;ve owned CPU names like $ARM, $INTC and $AMD」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2102091972131393869" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">CPU需求預估低估消費採用，四股前瞻受益論點。「Could be an order of magnitude higher.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2102073980559692168" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">CPU股票当日庆祝，无新的未来方向。「Big day for the CPU trade

$INTC $ARM $AMD」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2102031462006419507" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">庆祝AMD持股及复盘月初买进，未新增方向承诺。「Oh, it&#x27;s such a great day to be an $AMD shareholder.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2100631485090795982" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">自身明确多方論點。「I can make a similar bullish argument with $BE, $INTC, $AMD, and others.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2099659874892386678" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，作者對列出的整組個股發出「血腥的一週」警告。「It&#x27;s going to be a bloody week. Are you prepared?」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2099179266852196638" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">純轉述AMD超車高通成為全球第三大無晶圓半導體公司的新聞標題，未附加作者個人論點。「AMD overtakes Qualcomm to become the world&#x27;s third-largest fabless semiconductor company.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2099018934293016847" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，僅轉述第三方基金的選擇權操作，非作者本人立場。「he&#x27;s back guys... just in time for fomc」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2098407270551839059" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者針對Leopold買入AMD選擇權的消息評論「Smart」，等於認同這是聰明(看多)的操作。「AMD.... Smart」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2098406809329656002" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">列出持股清單並明說自己是全場最多方，喊「送它更高」「Tens of trillions, baby. Send it higher.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2098081185620467855" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">與ARM相同,AMD只是被列為同一主題下的受惠股之一,並非作者本篇的主要看法對象。「names like $ARM and $AMD have been surging on the thesis」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2097327800537714984" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>ARK</b> <span class="tag t-bear">賣出</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · trimmed · 交易日 2026-09-08（原文：Tuesday） · 揭露 2026-09-10 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2098016354250973657" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，此檔列於作者認為市場對agentic AI算力需求仍不夠看多的標的清單中「You are not bullish enough...Position yourself accordingly」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2097039199102730470" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">此檔與SNDK、BE、LITE等並列於作者的長期持股標籤中，貼文整體以「Bullish, up and to the right」作結「Bullish, up and to the right ⚡️」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2095890322190389307" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者宣告全力做多AI持股名單，此檔在標籤列表中「I&#x27;ll go max long on my Tier 1 and Tier 2 quality AI names」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2095656252873335011" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者將AMD納入其AI建置主題的持股框架，屬於長期看多部位「Four tiers, 20 names, one concentrated bet. All of it on the AI buildout」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2095654354208313699" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明確表示因 NVIDIA 已鎖定大量記憶體產能,非 NVIDIA 陣營(包含 AMD)的出貨預測可能要下修。「We may need to lower our shipment forecasts for the non-NVIDIA camp, including AMD and Broadcom.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2092728744754774338" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">同一句話中作者將AMD與Nvidia並列，認為前沿實驗室的自研能力比兩者都快，構成競爭威脅。「Frontier labs can co-design and develop their hardware-software stack at a much faster pace compared to Nvidia/AMD due to them having access to cutting edge internal models」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2092377713256587514" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者說黃仁勳與蘇姿丰「今天大概很不好過」，暗示博通（Hock Tan）相關的競爭消息對AMD是壞消息「Jensen and Lisa Su are probably having a super bad day today」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2092263334188114080" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">同一測試顯示AMD也被OpenAI自研晶片超越，屬於對AMD的負面競爭訊號。「OpenAI&#x27;s Jalapeño chip beat $NVDA and $AMD on inference efficiency, per SemiAnalysis testing.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2092259903561666737" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者以驚呼「WTF!!!」回應OpenAI自研Jalapeño晶片效能超越AMD的分析報告，反映對其競爭地位受威脅的負面情緒「it outperformed $NVDA, $AMD and Google accelerators on several inference efficiency metrics」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2092255035354984777" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">个人帐号里程碑及旧投资回顾，无新方向。「we got $AMD bandanas」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2091488091110531106" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者認為市場對AMD在台積電產能配額擴大的樂觀預期「可能被高估」，對其伺服器CPU出貨成長前景存疑。「I think the estimates may be somewhat overstated.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2090228827687645498" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品性能称讚。「AMD&#x27;s Venice absolutely mogs Vera CPU for agent sandboxes」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2088489847526944992" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品競爭力稱讚。「it will get destroyed by AMD」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2088223836638761201" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">公司收購正面評價與股價方向分離。「Good acquisition from AMD」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2085486115549741102" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">預期過度賣壓短暫並鼓勵利用機會。「market overreactions to an ER are usually short-lived.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2085105143880532233" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">突出產品比較加表情，引用券商目標價非作者方向。「MI500 expected to outperform Nvidia’s Rubin Ultra」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2084934092047745252" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">讽刺资本开支循环，引用AMD已下跌不是看空方向。「$AMD stock down almost 10%」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2084765591492075922" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者给AMD财报后上涨交易与止损，并认为Intel受益。「去做一个财报后整体上涨的走势」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2084654596803416199" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">AMD中國研發效率歷史故事，無股票方向。「The Chinese team far outperformed the American team」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2080871812553134267" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">AMD光学技术供货猜测无股票方向，辉达仅技术比较。「MI500 brings optical interconnects」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2080660364224807034" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品能力正面但仍條件疑問。「Big, if true」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2080598301586632797" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">引用AMD技术分析笔记，无作者独立方向。「AMD AI Takeaways Note」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2080596432235717058" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">對他人能力稱讚不能生成自己的多票。「most logical and prescient AMD bull」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2080483379208941684" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">AMD与社区互动的正面反应，没有投资方向。「a small chip company trying to make it」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2080445106054729983" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面時程資訊非股價主張。「no indication of CPO scale up supply chain delays.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2080394259535221222" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品性能負面比較。「AMD&#x27;s HBM4 has a much lower data rate per pin」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2080382231718351212" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">因贈品表示喜愛公司及CEO，非股票方向。「I love AMD and Lisa Su now.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2080379612736221325" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">AMD推理需求TAM分析，未直接投資股票表態。「Training is a phase. Inference is forever.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2080375958494667039" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">他人產品生態肯定。「Claude can bootstrap @amd Instinct + ROCm.」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2080343648995283340" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">人物及活動正面情緒。「Lisa from $AMD likes AI.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2080334612807758136" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者本次明说AMD看多；NVDA看空僅旧自引，不能作为新方向。「One reason I’m bullish on AMD」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2080207595722469687" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-de