ener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">平台量產新闻。「$AMD」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2057598767394959604" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">回顾AMD匿名短期期权兑现，无新增作者方向。「$AMD」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2054583708448120849" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">期權市場流向觀察，非作者投資方向。「$AMD」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2053849143454716246" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">软件生态采用与AMD性能引文，無作者股票方向。「AMD ROCm software stack has improved performance」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2053521814706618607" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">回顾AMD旧供应理论获验证，未表达当前股票方向。「AMD」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2052918751344103555" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">供應瓶頸風險，非股價方向。「AMD will be crying」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2052051861637927101" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產業成長而非股價方向。「Will be over 50%」 <a href="https://x.c