ephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">獲利期待非投資操作結論。「AMD」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2048726308113510732" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">AMD供给与财报期待属业务赞誉，無作者股票方向。「AMD’s earnings could be worth getting excited about」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2048725249722917370" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确认为Qualcomm估值提供廉价AI上行并推荐CPU既有公司，虽低确信度仍有方向。「investors likely better off playing CPU supercycle with the incumbents」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2048512944947020048" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">过去股价祝贺。「Congratulations to the AMD bulls.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2047097361990865012" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">欢呼AMD封装份额预测，未表达股票方向。「AMD」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2046604785840005533" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">肯定业务消息可信。「AMD has secured additional customers for Helios」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2044927875909112107" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">称自己对AMD积极并惊讶新客户采用产品，未明确股票买卖方向。「AMD」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2044901765418717315" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">AMD单词赞叹，无明确股票方向。「AMD YES」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2044771417414320474" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">過去漲幅。「AMD is now up 30%」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2044697390813446438" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">产业需求背景。「$AMD」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2044045150410919940" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">称银行看好AMD，券商方向不能归给作者。「Banks are getting excited again」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2039331728377237812" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Josh Gottheimer</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日 2026-04-01（原文：last month） · 揭露 2026-05-20 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2057094506118316137" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">不愿推荐及产能风险，未明确卖出或下跌。「hard to recommend AMD outright」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2036963841582784947" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-04-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Marjorie Taylor Greene</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日 2025-04-08（原文：April 8th） · 揭露 2025-10-06 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/1975197760124297432" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:MRVL</span><span class="s-n">88 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-12-23 → 2026-10-04</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="flip">1 人反轉</span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+8.1%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Byron Donalds</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Jukan</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Maria Salazar</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-04 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Ren</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> → 2026-09 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2025-12 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>大老师</b>：2026-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者語氣帶有不滿（no one gave a fk about pacing the frontier），暗示失望情緒，但沒有明確說出這些持股的漲跌方向。「My stocks on Monday after it turned out no one gave a fk about pacing the frontier.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2106823474098360335" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">代碼出自被引用的先前互連論點，本篇自己的標題只點名 LITE，其他不新增方向票。「[引用 @ren_stocks]: $LITE $COHR $GLW $MRVL $AAOI $SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2105667101038158155" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">假設競爭風險，非明確看空。「cause bottlenecks across your main ASIC competitors:」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2101402656845808007" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，作者對列出的整組個股發出「血腥的一週」警告。「It&#x27;s going to be a bloody week. Are you prepared?」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2099179266852196638" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">列出持股清單並明說自己是全場最多方，喊「送它更高」「Tens of trillions, baby. Send it higher.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2098081185620467855" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">列在 Bullish for 清單，理由是訊號仍需傳輸「$MRVL - the signal still has to travel」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2097820413900276043" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，此檔列於作者看多的光學/互聯股清單中「You are not bullish enough on interconnect, photonics and optics ⚡️」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2097072930114969608" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者將MRVL列為自己至今仍上漲逾100%的ASIC主題持股。「15. $MRVL - ASICs」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2096814311306129776" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，此檔為作者提到不打算賣出、持有到2030年的互聯（interconnect）持股之一「I know I&#x27;m not selling my interconnect shares. I&#x27;m seeing this through 2030.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2096439098634313987" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，此檔並列於作者長期看多的持股標籤中「Bullish, up and to the right ⚡️」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2095890322190389307" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者宣告全力做多AI持股名單，此檔在標籤列表中「I&#x27;ll go max long on my Tier 1 and Tier 2 quality AI names」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2095656252873335011" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者將MRVL納入其AI建置主題的持股框架，屬於長期看多部位「Four tiers, 20 names, one concentrated bet. All of it on the AI buildout」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2095654354208313699" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">引述MRVL表示客戶最快2027年即積極規劃規模化光學升級部署，屬於正面需求訊號。「$MRVL also said customers are actively planning scale-up optics deployments as early as 2027」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2094704372831920324" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者將MRVL與聯發科並列為Nvidia扶植的「下一代ASIC贏家」，屬於受益方。「kingmaker with the next generation of ASIC winners like $MRVL / Mediatek」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2094416430032896428" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者以「若Celestial(MRVL收購標的)是獨立上市公司」的假設思考，主張應以2028年CPO機會的長期營收潛力評價此資產而非近期虧損，並明確表態「我認為壓倒性地是後者」，隱含看好MRVL旗下光通訊資產的長期價值。「with CPO hyperscaler opportunities for 2028, it should be valued at $6-10B? ... I&#x27;d argue overwhelmingly the latter.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2094353950040592854" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">Marvell法說會透露規模擴展光通訊業務展望從先前3億美元上修,新增1.5億美元Celestial AI CPO貢獻,且CXL與客製晶片設計贏單持續增加,業務動能轉強。「Scale-up optics has accelerated further from the roughly $300 million FY28 outlook provided last quarter, including $150 million from Celestial AI CPO.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2093103613535289723" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明確表示「incredible long」並列為「Top 10 long holds into 2030」。「You are not bullish enough on this company. Top 10 long holds into 2030.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2092962171101524166" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，MRVL為目前獲利中的波段持倉之一。「Today all of my swings but one are green $NBIS $MRVL $NVTS $AXTI $AEHR」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2092738683934003516" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者用自己誇張喊話朋友的例子反諷黃仁勳「MRVL是下一個兆元公司」的說法，質疑其可信度，但沒有給出具體看空股價的判斷「Like I say crazy shit to hype up my boys all the time.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2091612914063114288" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Marvell合约增长与他人旧市值目标，未明确作者股票方向。「Which could translate into ~$120 billion ​in revenue through 2033.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2090103899302826302" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">業務勝利讚賞不等同股票看多。「Big W for Marvell」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2086838680212340905" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面業務競爭評價，不自動成為股票方向。「This is very positive news for Montage and Marvell.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2079105217346601204" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">他人評級不歸作者票。「Maintain Buy &amp; $280 TP」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2078056661550588377" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">持倉過去表現回顧與推廣，無新方向判斷。「AMD and Marvell ripping」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2075288227284422707" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确长期持有Sivers、相信估值巨大扩张，其他公司为合作/同业资讯。「$MRVL Celestial」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2074046947434860971" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Marvell下跌引起他人旧市值目标联想，无作者方向。「Jensen’s comment “The next $1T company”」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2072781715916169660" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面研究與反駁内容，非作者投資方向。「MRVL is expected to generate $2.8B / $13.0B」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2072621970542538937" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">券商收入轉述。「MRVL is expected to generate $2.8B / $13.0B in revenue」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2072620185673179391" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">舊自引技術評論，沒有新增承諾。「GEX整体 变的更健康」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2071953488825979198" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">MRVL期權結構與賣壓可能結束的觀察，未明示作者投資方向。「MRVL的期权GEX整体 变的更健康」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2071951421499687017" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面引用研究，不歸為自己的價格預期。「The Marvell puzzle has more pieces」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2071497488415252777" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面產業收購背景。「Celestial have been acquired by Marvell」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2070691462354993543" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">歷史漲幅。「$MRVL up 291%」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2069246038935065076" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">对他人Marvell批评的讽刺回应，作者未给股票方向。「My sweet summer child...」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2069181208412721377" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">指數納入消息。「is officially in the S&amp;amp;P 500 today.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2069029628858019886" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">引用Jensen上行说法并反问，未独立作未来价格判断。「Jensen said this stock can 4x from here.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2069014147052851610" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确Sivers为最喜欢的激光瓶颈长仓，其他公司为合作佐证。「$MRVL Celestial」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2068651355422814294" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">尾盘MU/MRVL卖盘的历史行情回应，不新增方向。「MRVL从330暴跌到310」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2067700059718975954" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">纳入指數新闻的确定性不是方向。「我认为确定性相当高」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2067617858516066620" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">多頭估值来自Jensen且有條件，不歸作者票。「Jensen called it the next trillion-dollar company」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2066612577103118686" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">當日價格與宏觀消息。「$SNDK to $MRVL to $LITE are green now.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2065136761077158061" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">过去做多纪录获认可，没有新的买卖承诺。「$MRVL」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2063798063035228188" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">過去成果回顧。「It&#x27;s now up 246%.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2063752945842422159" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">投资方法反思；当前明确建议AAOI低估做多，余股是研究示例与泛品质判断，非单股方向。「good names everyone kinda agrees like $TSM, $INTC, $MRVL」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2063465386960736396" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">風控持股泛論。「hold indiviudal stocks like $AAOI or $MRVL」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2063118835105014006" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">MRVL盘后涨幅回顾，无新方向。「MRVL盘后又拉飞了」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2063007253750493484" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Byron Donalds</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-06-04 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2062609356084944964" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">引述与可能受益评价。「$MRVL $1T company」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2062322546809381094" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">價格上漲反應。「extends gains to over +45%」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2062173746367205655" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Maria Salazar</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-06-03 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2062169103532462116" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">歷史行情自引。「$MRVL $HPE 暴涨」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2062164907907543064" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">两股涨幅及直播宣传，無未来方向。「$MRVL $HPE 暴涨」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2062157708078510491" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">自引明确MRVL并说明当前正股持仓。「还好我有正股」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2061926218593976573" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Marvell涨幅及Jensen目标价回顾，無作者独立方向。「Marvell up 35% with one remark」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2061914361120362678" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Byron Donalds</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-06-02 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2061832469817557027" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">看漲期權流資料。「353万美金的 300CALL」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2061810128639390046" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Marvell匿名期权已获利回顾，非作者新方向。「上涨343%」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2061809822807609485" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">業務需求背景正面。「interconnect bottleneck for a reason」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2061725603477532763" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者确认当前持仓。「I have positions in Marvell」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2061671824388403368" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">对他人MRVL价格预测引用回应，未自行投票。「看到300以下的mrvl 时间不多啦」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2061670465316552990" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Jensen未来市值说法与盘后涨幅新闻，無作者独立方向。「迈威尔科技夜盘直线拉升」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2061668350405857790" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">回顾后悔没有买，不是新买建议。「I SHOULD HAVE BOUGHT MARVELL」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2061657341393846354" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确认为Sivers相对未来收入低估；其他公司为合作背景。「MRVL」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2061538735595069534" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">持倉回本喜悅。「$MRVL」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2061474647393353844" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">研究被報導。「$MRVL」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2060837455881031876" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">回顾MRVL匿名期权及盘前涨幅，未作作者新方向。「MRVL」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2059972210987773974" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">认为旧MRVL期权可能失败，订单损失评论非未来股票看空。「感觉这185万美金已经GG了」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2059900704186364211" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">MRVL财报支持CPO及Sivers业务假设，未明确股票买卖方向。「MRVL」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2059830121117446415" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Byron Donalds</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-05-14 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2054935049040966064" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Maria Salazar</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-05-11 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2053830438108410155" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">以Sivers为核心论证未来市值上行，伙伴名单仅供应链背景。「$MRVL」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2051566667009073315" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">直接正向投资选择。「going long on Broadcom and Marvell doesn’t hurt too.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2048929438679896317" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">競爭位置非股價方向。「not Marvell, but MediaTek」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2048622395255321029" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">旧价格回顾。「$MRVL」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2047485717341987232" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">既往漲幅。「$MRVL」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2047472057890513357" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">以Sivers市值及未来需求错配论证上行，其他公司仅客户供应链背景。「$MRVL」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2047209727738957983" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">引用AI互连基础设施研报，未表达作者自身股票方向。「$MRVL」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2044039436443468103" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明示未来股票收益及多头观点。「50-100% seem reasonable here.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2041963517071519963" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">批评短期期权并明确估计MRVL两三年可能翻倍；其他股票为过去交易例子。「probably would have been $6M in 2-3 years.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2040269140855083041" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">回調被稱為便宜投資機會。「$MRVL」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2039333459366211801" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">调侃Cramer做多Marvell，未形成作者股票方向。「$MRVL」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2038980162214347005" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">英伟达投资Marvell及Sivers供应关系推测，未明确股票方向。「$MRVL」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2038954532944875733" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">惊讶英伟达投资Marvell新闻，没有作者股票方向。「MARVELL」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2038951257306775645" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者重申Sivers未来百亿美元市值看多；AXTI供应链辩护与其他旧研究为背景。「$MRVL」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2038934006734135572" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确主张做多Sivers和Win供应链；Win海外身份未核实，同行为架构背景。「$MRVL」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2037442444367974907" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确三股回调为买点，看多。「Recent drop across the board presents a good opportunity for these three.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2023600495353622546" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者直接股票买点判断。「the recent sell-off looks like a solid buying opportunity.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2006301094394335399" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">以AAOI及Marvell为核心论证股价重估，其余为微软芯片供应链背景。「We&#x27;ll likely see a large re-rating in Marvell」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2003476197028852074" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:IREN</span><span class="s-n">76 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-01-01 → 2026-09-26</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="flip">1 人反轉</span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+0.1%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Cleo Fields</b>：2025-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Leopold Aschenbrenner</b>：2025-01 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Ren</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2025-11 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> → 2026-03 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> → 2026-07 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">他人增發批評。「I had the same criticism with $IREN with their $6B ATM」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2103869705509388694" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">AAOI业务看多但股价受增发抑制，2027跑赢附停止发行条件；其他为融资/机会成本案例。「I had the same criticism with $IREN with their $6B ATM, which is why it&#x27;s been rangebound for half a year.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2103151990146801812" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者支持IREN現有需求論點並認為恐慌不影響建設；輝達Google為歷史比較。「These scares once or twice a year all turn out to be immaterial to the overall AI buildout.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2099458250240618861" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，作者認為此消息對IREN同樣是正面意涵。「Implications for $NBIS to $IREN are pretty positive since」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2099048356345696391" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，此檔列於作者因微軟資料中心擴建利多而看多的清單中「You guys are not bullish enough.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2098183010671550758" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">列出持股清單並明說自己是全場最多方，喊「送它更高」「Tens of trillions, baby. Send it higher.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2098081185620467855" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，僅列為他人過去持倉之一，未表態自己看法「Look at the names Leopold was in」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2097521722954072202" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者說IREN面臨全端執行的不確定性疑慮，用來凸顯Nebius相對優勢，未直接論斷IREN股價走向。「Plaguing uncertainty that $IREN, $ORCL face from  full-stack execution.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2097327653116363127" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上,作者表態看多AI算力建設並考慮複製此清單,IREN為名單第三梯隊持股。「IREN $IREN [Long]」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2095228808278446221" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者以AXTI、IREN等近期重挫個股為例，歸因於「九月是全年最差月份」的季節性迷思，屬市場/季節性觀察，非針對個股基本面表態。「After seeing everything from $AXTI to $IREN get nuked… I&#x27;m starting to believe in the: &quot;September is the worst month of the year&quot; myth.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2094831983306440746" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，與NBIS、CRWV同被標註在這則反駁資料中心負面敘事為造謠的貼文中。「we found 200 accounts posting in a manner that could manipulate a legitimate debate about American AI and energy policy」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2093347096711635402" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明確維持AAOI多頭及大倉位；對其他公司融資批評不等於看空股票。「I&#x27;ve said this before with $IREN + $POET.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2091843192639672553" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者用「開始用新的眼光看待你」形容自己對IREN觀感轉為正面，並詢問財報預期，顯示轉趨看多。「$IREN Crowd, I&#x27;m starting to see you with new eyes.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2091711666463359263" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者指出IREN的微軟合約已由Dell融資與微軟預付款支應約95%的GPU成本，硬體漲價風險不需IREN自行承擔，屬正面評價。「its Microsoft deal has the GPUs ~95% pre-funded through Dell financing and Microsoft&#x27;s prepayment」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2091380164382843335" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">三股強勁財報及需求讀穿讚賞，無明確股票方向。「Insane earnings today for the AI theme」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2087285356999958663" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Riot合約、AMD擴約與收入時間線，讚賞成長非股票方向。「It’s cute to see all the former miners like $IREN」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2086988264448409739" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">給NBIS多頭止損與相對強勢操作建議，明確短期多方；市場反轉悲觀不直接等同看空該股。「NBIS依然要远远好于IREN」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2083197390639812926" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明說新持有一股IREN，即使因聲援也為買入方向。「I now own 1 share of IREN.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2082557648298516918" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">商業模式正評。「validate Neocloud business models like $NBIS, $IREN」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2078175882620059719" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面業務猜測，沒有股票方向。「stating to make more sense connection wise?」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2073704784398528599" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">負面揶揄不等同看空股價。「public transport for their bagholders」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2073120659668894023" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">批评IREN股权薪酬及增发，公司负面语气而非明确股票看空。「$IREN founders award themselves $1.14B+」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2072610437817078056" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">讽刺IREN管理层股票报酬，不等于看空股票。「$IREN sometimes the jokes just tell themselves.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2072543934807445759" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">担忧記憶漲價造成云厂商成本压力，未明说股票方向；自引旧观点不投票。「NBIS IREN 这一类首当其冲了」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2070406834226409506" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Leopold Aschenbrenner</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-06-15 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2066641087792382374" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">引用者的負面CEO玩笑。「Aussie banker bro backtracking」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2066617801104908463" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">價格及稀釋負面回顧，未明示新的下跌預期。「is still stagnant due to the $6B」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2066521694836330618" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">對稀釋與上漲賣壓的直接負面投資論點。「likely selling into every rally (structural overhang)」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2063571485739106593" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">相對偏弱不等於看空股價。「nbis大于iren」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2057514462748512532" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">批评POET及IREN营销与稀释融资，负面公司情绪不等于股票看空。「Fake it Until you make it award」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2056171199512891790" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">公司品質批評，非明示股票看空。「something trash like $IREN」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2055200705334395161" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确反对买入IREN稀释并认为NBIS提供更好股权升值机会。「just buy in it to get diluted」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2053928672202268993" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Leopold Aschenbrenner</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-05-08 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2052762103560241589" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确持续看空IREN并担忧稀释；NVDAAmazon为协议比较。「I still am bearish on $IREN.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2052494142765441301" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">公司嘲諷不等於股票看空。「even the shitco」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2052488740027998217" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Leopold Aschenbrenner</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-05-07 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2052259039900234228" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Leopold Aschenbrenner</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-05-05 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2051749707756556525" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Leopold Aschenbrenner</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-05-01 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2050185881819001157" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">明确认为SLNH及比较公司均为糟糕多头且将稀释股东，表达看空。「They’re all absolutely terrible longs.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2049969772251709921" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">批评Anthropic产品并调侃IREN投资者，没有IREN股票方向。「$IREN」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2049446281039446474" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">針對投資人集中度的負面情緒。「$IREN」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2048143244673081730" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确质疑继续做多IREN，投资看空；其他云企正面比较非明确股票看多。「How are there people still long on an F-tier Neocloud like $IREN.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2046374163338912200" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">IQE过去收益与嘲笑别股持有者，情绪非本次股票投票。「bagholding $BKKT or $IREN」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2043315043455176826" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者预测IREN每股价值继续下降并主张等待稀释结束，明确当前看空。「people&#x27;s share values will decrease.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2042988968149684305" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者结构性稀释压制股东回报与追涨风险判断。「shareholder equity goes down.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2041907945500504466" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">AXTI稀释投票通过会卖、失败会反弹，互斥条件没有单一当前方向；IREN为稀释比较。「$IREN excessive $6B dilution」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2041249789195813291" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">否定當前買入並預期稀釋壓制上行。「Better to wait after current shareholders get diluted first before going long.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2039657844392202498" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">明确反对追买并判断未来股份稀释压制股价。「There are better longs out there than $IREN.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2038163974437659019" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">明确选Nebius为赢家，看多；明确警告当前IREN投资者稀释及CRWV存活风险，看空；其他为客户伙伴。「The winners will be whoever enters after holders get fully diluted.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2037896456179438049" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">稀释风险提示，未当前明示交易。「$6B ATM filings」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2037690441668419778" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确反对多头与持续稀释风险。「then still being bullish?」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2036512077960061176" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">假设改名提高估值的玩笑，未构成实际投资方向。「$IREN」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2033033107557986332" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确对IRENPOET过量ATM看空；AAOI融资抱怨但仍预计增益，无单一空方。「I’m extremely bearish when it comes to excessive ATMs for any company like $IREN or $POET」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2032198562877227199" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">三家云企业CEO比较，人物评价非股票买卖方向。「Aussie banker bro」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2031821990907298232" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">融資壓制股價上行。「suppresses momentum」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2031785810052465078" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者预计IREN稀释损害每股价值并提醒相应调整投资，表达当前看空。「you should expect them to use it and position accordingly.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2030761150292615564" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">明确主张不持有IREN并推荐CIFR和NBIS替代多头。「zero compelling case to hold $IREN」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2029993746658643978" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">融資例子。「$IREN」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2029675551980679177" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者对该股投资者回报持负向观点。「not if you’re an existing shareholder」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2029524132568994011" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">當前否定做多與稀釋風險。「Not a fan of $IREN as a long」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2028111150613959097" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">行业业务顺风。「Every tailwind just hit at once for Neoclouds.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2019857047052022237" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Cleo Fields</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · up to $100K · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-02-04 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2019067097771376757" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者认为NBIS现价与盈利潜力严重不符，表达有条件看多；其他云服务公司是产业主题及交易背景。「I&#x27;m especially bullish thematically too with $IREN」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2006013108817678779" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Cleo Fields</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2025-12-18 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2001678798656262358" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">价格回顾。「$IREN at $35 again」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2000682225327857953" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确当前买入机会。「amazing buying opportunity」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/1998925429890261130" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">嘲讽NBIS与IREN当日跌幅和投资者争论，不能从情绪推定股票投资方向。「Both stocks: -6.16% and -4.00%.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/1996994803503075542" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">调侃比较。「right choice over $IREN」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/1995969036203819444" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确股票上行判断。「has the highest upside potential」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/1995084174223651180" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Cleo Fields</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2025-10-14 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/1978133996379803992" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Cleo Fields</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2025-10-09 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/1976290815707128074" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Cleo Fields</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2025-10-07 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/1975626784659153003" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Cleo Fields</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2025-10-06 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/1975206717597093998" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-07-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Cleo Fields</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日 2025-07-01（原文：Three months ago） · 揭露 2025-10-10 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/1976652340578152653" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-06-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Cleo Fields</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日 2025-06-01（原文：this summer） · 揭露 2025-09-15 · 7 則報導 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/1974144428429414857" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文1</a> <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/1973784305949368474" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文2</a> <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/1973068932182335696" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文3</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-01-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Leopold Aschenbrenner</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日 2025-01-01（原文：last year） · 揭露 2026-05-30 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2060830452739424301" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:BE</span><span class="s-n">69 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-01-01 → 2026-10-04</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="flip">1 人反轉</span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+10.0%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Donald Trump</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Gil Cisneros</b>：2025-01 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Leopold Aschenbrenner</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-01 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> → 2026-06 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> → 2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li><li><b>Nancy Pelosi</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Ren</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>大老师</b>：2026-06 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者語氣帶有不滿（no one gave a fk about pacing the frontier），暗示失望情緒，但沒有明確說出這些持股的漲跌方向。「My stocks on Monday after it turned out no one gave a fk about pacing the frontier.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2106823474098360335" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">電力瓶頸受益論點及末尾Bullish。「where the grid can&#x27;t deliver fast enough, a name like $BE comes into play.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2104449426710249796" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">自身明确多方論點。「I can make a similar bullish argument with $BE, $INTC, $AMD, and others.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2099659874892386678" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Donald Trump</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-09-11 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2098412551721607626" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Nancy Pelosi</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-09-11 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2098412551721607626" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，僅轉述第三方基金的選擇權操作，非作者本人立場。「he&#x27;s back guys... just in time for fomc」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2098407270551839059" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">列出持股清單並明說自己是全場最多方，喊「送它更高」「Tens of trillions, baby. Send it higher.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2098081185620467855" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Nancy Pelosi</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · $12 million · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-09-09 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2097588806161469939" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，作者未針對BE本身給出明確方向判斷，只是轉述他人持倉表現「Look at the names Leopold was in」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2097521722954072202" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Donald Trump</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-09-08 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2097322421103517821" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Nancy Pelosi</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · $12 million · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-09-08 · 2 則報導 <a href="https://x.com/DJTRadar/status/2097442657576378631" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文1</a> <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2097322421103517821" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文2</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者稱盤後大漲7%為「god candle」，並直接寫「Bullish AF $BE」「$BE +7% is printing a god candle in after-hours...Bullish AF $BE」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2097161686373355834" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者僅回顧「$BE in January」是一次成功交易案例,沒有表達對BE現在或未來股價方向的看法。「$BE in January」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2097007843799171358" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Nancy Pelosi</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · $12 million · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-09-05 <a href="https://x.com/DJTRadar/status/2096339811858559140" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者稱讚Pelosi在S&amp;P納入前「bottom sniped $BE」,是對BE先前買點精準度的肯定,延續其一貫看多立場。「bottom sniped $BE before S&amp;amp;P」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2096011862727168423" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者稱自己在200價位喊進BE是「good entry」，屬於論點型長期持股「$BE called a good entry 200」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2096005979410206879" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者直接喊出目標市值「$BE to $100B」,並自誇最早提出BE論述,是明確的看多表態。「$BE to $100B」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2095987582199111740" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">以Bloom Energy執行長為傲喊出「選總統」慶祝BE成功納入S&amp;P 500,延續作者對BE的正面立場。「KR SRIDHAR FOR PRESIDENT」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2095985293778374839" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者以興奮語氣宣布BE被納入S&amp;P 500指數，屬於明顯利多消息且用「BOOM」強調正面態度「BOOM $BE ADDED TO THE S&amp;amp;P 500」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2095984556113293648" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者稱BE大漲為「ripper +8%」並喊出目標價400「$BE ripper +8%...See you at 400.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2095964546208850058" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者主動預測Bloom Energy會被納入S&amp;P 500指數,認為經濟已高度仰賴電力這個主題,語氣正面看待其入指前景。「I think $BE is going to be added.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2095946493496873223" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者提到BE自其呼籲以來已上漲20%，並強調自己看好的是「WHY you should bet on BE」的長期論點「I could tell you BE is up 20% since I called it...But I would rather be tell you WHY you should bet on BE」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2095890322190389307" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者直接寫「Bullish $BE」並提到自己持續加碼此股「Bullish $BE」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2095695913779863949" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者宣告全力做多AI持股名單，此檔在標籤列表中「I&#x27;ll go max long on my Tier 1 and Tier 2 quality AI names」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2095656252873335011" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者將BE歸入能源（Energy）主題，納入AI建置持股框架中「Prioritized across Memory, AI Clouds, Interconnect, Compute and Energy.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2095654354208313699" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者主張資金稀缺的市場應堅守「已經證明有效」的贏家而非追逐潛力股,並點名BE應該繼續持有。「allocate to proven winners, not to potential up-and-coming companies. This is the time to be defensive and own the ones that already work.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2095357790613065806" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者表態「看多AI基建全面建設」並考慮複製此份持股名單做多三年,BE為名單中的能源層重倉。「Bloom Energy $BE [Long, 9.4%]」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2095228808278446221" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">與NVDA同列在標題並被「Bullish AF」涵蓋。「Bullish AF ⚡ ⚡ ⚡」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2092829182786982251" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Donald Trump</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-08-25 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2092259230132634028" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Nancy Pelosi</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-08-25 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2092259230132634028" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Donald Trump</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-08-24 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2091902928923627945" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者指出BE能在不增加用電成本的前提下為資料中心供電，是資料中心議題升溫下的主要受惠者，明確看多「$BE is a major beneficiary, powering AI without increasing energy costs.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2091888439214141545" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Nancy Pelosi</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · $12 million · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-08-24 · 3 則報導 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2091912729418252706" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文1</a> <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2091902928923627945" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文2</a> <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2091879957127463128" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文3</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确保有Sivers/AAOI多方信念，其他公司为主题需求数据而非各自方向。「$BE to $TER reported blowout results」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2082230983487803755" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">引用負面調查，作者無直接採納股價方向。「existential threat to Bloom Energy’s story.」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2074905279981088953" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">跌價原因回顧。「原来今天BE下跌是这个啊」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2070530429040672784" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">當前技術位置正面評價，未明确看多。「BE还不错 $BE」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2069800521452712109" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Leopold Aschenbrenner</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-06-15 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2066641087792382374" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">技術位正面觀察，未給买卖承诺。「236-255是一个极好看的支撑」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2063991029922238657" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确BE集中卖压可砸缺口并建议避免重仓，空方交易观点。「避免在重组日前后重仓持有。」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2062257579624128696" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">明確退出倉位。「Closed $BE after 200%」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2061488431851827559" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">自引旧文被低估评价。「$BE」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2057532805903679775" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">旧文公司质量比较。「$BE remains a way better company」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2057507211287634319" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确持有FCEL小仓位并论证上行赔率；BE为业务比较。「$BE remains a way better company」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2057245346263380086" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Donald Trump</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-05-14 · 2 則報導 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2054966449043595282" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文1</a> <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2054919028393574455" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文2</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Leopold Aschenbrenner</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-05-08 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2052762103560241589" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Leopold Aschenbrenner</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-05-07 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2052259039900234228" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Leopold Aschenbrenner</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-05-05 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2051749707756556525" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Leopold Aschenbrenner</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-05-01 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2050185881819001157" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">随后点名BE作为买股范例。「Buy stocks run by RELENTLESS people.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2049301272004845665" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">價格及既往持倉收益回顧。「surged 12% after hours」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2049287442197516539" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">既往交易回顧及方法教學。「why I bought $BE at $120」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2045649276395770329" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">明確回顧過去交易收益。「$BE」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2044792665666138167" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者未來估值目標。「$BE to $100B!」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2044509509062926763" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">BE历史收益与旧自引论点，無新股票方向。「$BE is up 15% after hours」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2043891650318217592" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者股票未来价格上涨预测。「BE is on the way to new highs.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2026323065773379791" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">業務與訂單成長稱讚。「$BE」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2026033069430554901" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">他人仓位与历史收益。「BE」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2025733639204663713" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确高上行投资判断。「highest upside trade」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2024211642624725120" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">業務產能成長預測。「$BE」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2019526627408113788" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">將今日回調視為買入優惠。「$BE」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2019218741234659614" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Gil Cisneros</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-02-02 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2018363211200827846" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">称赞Bloom Energy安装速度，Oracle为客户背景，无投资方向。「$BE」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2015096349285568835" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确自身组合买入策略中的股票。「My investing strategy is to buy small companies」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2014814859112960424" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">现金与业务机会评价。「generational demand opportunity」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2014524919946916280" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">已上涨后仍低估的投资判断。「still heavily underestimated」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2014051853210996891" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者当前买入。「start out a position at $120 avg. cost.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2010909510182060132" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Gil Cisneros</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2025-10-29 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/1983544187531284977" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-01-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Gil Cisneros</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日 2025-01-01（原文：Last year） · 揭露 2026-04-29 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2049547282144477406" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:COHR</span><span class="s-n">66 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-12-12 → 2026-10-03</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+19.3%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-04 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Ren</b>：2026-07 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-03 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">轉述 Lumentum 執行長的供需缺口及供應分配，未明確判斷點名股票的未來價格。「projected deficit has now expanded to 70%」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2106450096808153311" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者直接認為限制措施有利於其點名的國內光學供應商。「These restrictions benefit domestic suppliers.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2105725080370356309" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者只以「Optics go brrr」表達光學領域的興奮，個股論點均在引文中，未逐股給方向。「Optics go brrr」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2105712095014851027" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者認為政策與雷射供應緊張會讓 Lumentum 與 Coherent 受益。「Of course $LITE / $COHR would be happy.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2105709782854435274" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者認為限制中國收發器可能對其點名的美國光學供應商帶來重大利多。「Potentially big for US optical suppliers.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2105698908416479284" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">代碼出自被引用的先前互連論點，本篇自己的標題只點名 LITE，其他不新增方向票。「[引用 @ren_stocks]: $LITE $COHR $GLW $MRVL $AAOI $SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2105667101038158155" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">偏重網路股投資理由，為四股多方論點。「Why am I so focused on networking over raw compute?」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2101057160537084356" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，作者將COHR列為雷射短缺受惠供應商之一。「Who benefits from supplying all that lasers during a shortage other than $LITE / $SIVE / $AAOI / $COHR?」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2098306366167535766" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者稱自己團隊比華爾街早看對光學市場規模6.5倍,並提到NVDA重金投資COHR推升該題材成為AI交易新寵,延續其對COHR的看多立場。「$NVDA invested billions in $LITE and $COHR, and the sector became the AI trade&#x27;s new sentiment leader」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2098121475190559054" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者將COHR與LITE、AAOI並列在光學股「還有更多成長空間」的討論中，暗示看好但未提供COHR專屬細節「For $LITE $COHR $AAOI, I think the more useful question now is what the next round of growth depends on.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2098114790048583928" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">列在 Bullish for 清單，理由是雷射需求「$COHR - lasers」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2097820413900276043" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者將COHR列入雷射股稀缺溢價論述中『較知名』的標的，並揭露自己對此主題有實際部位。「For lasers: $LITE / $SIVE / $AAOI / $COHR / $MTSI / Furukawa / Sumitomo are your better known ones. *disclosure, personal exposure to theme」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2097660318369697875" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者將COHR列為「我的光學題材持股」之一,並在高盛上修市場規模後列出其當日漲幅,明確表態持有看多。「COHR: +9.02%」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2097367356523892915" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">COHR當日+8.0%被列入作者稱為「Insane strength」的光學股全面走強名單「$COHR +8.0%」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2097332258386403456" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，此檔列於作者因高盛上修光模組預測而看多的互聯/光學股清單中「Goldman just raised its global optical module forecast to roughly $68bn in 2026, $131bn in 2027, $148bn in 2028.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2097072930114969608" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，此檔為作者明確表示長期持有到2030年的互聯股之一「I know I&#x27;m not selling my interconnect shares. I&#x27;m seeing this through 2030.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2096439098634313987" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者稱COHR等在回檔中「held up relatively well」，因為手上有實際晶圓產能與訂單而非只是白皮書故事。「names like $COHR, $LITE, and $CRDO held up relatively well」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2094494253267157010" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">財報成長讚賞。「$COHR revenue go brrr」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2087675367595380783" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">财报电话会摘要肯定需求价格与业务时间，没有明确逐股投资方向；SIVEF代码未核实。「$SIVEF, $COHR, and others」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2087329770879197549" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面財報及業務需求分析，未表態股票投資方向。「Great read through on other CPO players」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2087271842696593764" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">下跌及政策風險報導。「$COHR fell 14% and $LITE fell 10% yesterday.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2087181654724866357" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明示買入且逢低加倉，明確看多。「Bought some, they dip? I add.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2086865770529665034" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者重新明确看多美光与三星，其他光学公司仅市场叙事及旧估值案例。「$COHR / $LITE lasers were completely sold out」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2086148557187461412" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明確偏好光學股風險報酬，MU僅比較；他人記憶空頭非作者。「I personally like the r/r on photonics more here」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2086142717076308086" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者當前光子投資組合及短缺論點支持所列核心股。「great to have our thesis rewarded today.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2085811801988685950" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确更看多有产能的既有CPO激光公司，AAOI供需新闻不看空，其他仅客户/竞争资料。「Just more bullish on the existing few qualified CPO laser names that have capacity.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2085603590903902621" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">需求供給背景。「demand far exceeds what $AAOI $LITE $COHR can make.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2085486739448094901" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">需求週期正面分析。「Welcome to the multi year cycle.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2084920594139959305" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">業務優勢讚賞。「The most vertically integrated player in photonics.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2084659580236390455" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面情緒反應及引用政策，不直接成為個股看多。「BABY DON&#x27;T FEAR THE REAPER」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2084631786668097713" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">禁令的產業受益與供應鏈分析，未說股票投資方向。「A very material catalyst came about for Western supply chains」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2084597612175618342" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面供應瓶頸評價，不自動转成股票看多票。「glad this thesis is starting to see validation.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2083438823548293140" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">所列光子股票及ETF選擇後明示重新投入投資方向。「This is the time to get back in the saddle.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2082958254527664464" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者以AXT需求及供货协议明确看多。「three-year Coherent deal」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2082937549199208839" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">折價比較，作者未選方向。「You can buy optics cheaper than Nvidia did now.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2082099596327547189" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面候選觀察，未明說買入或股價方向。「higher velocity set ups」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2080370552800199161" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明確看多讀穿。「bullish read through on US transceiver makers like $AAOI, $COHR, $LITE.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2076808331453415674" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產業正面解讀非明確個股方向。「read is very positive for $SIVEF, $COHR」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2075634064518955297" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确持有光学组合与需求长线信念，支持其点名股票多方持有。「why I have conviction in it.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2072738199927926897" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">業務供需利好。「$COHR is bottlenecked」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2072726120706007465" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确将AAOI和Sivers视为最看好投资并指出未来营收扩张，COHR为整合例子。「像 $COHR 那样」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2067542382523122001" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Coherent工厂及当前最大持仓描述，没有新的方向承诺。「$COHR is the largest position」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2067032543791284414" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确当前做多下一阶段CPO中的Sivers；其他已涨标的为旧交易回顾。「$COHR」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2059646212803051722" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者认为CPO重估尚未开始；Soitec代码身份无法核实。「$COHR」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2058594141727060106" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确做多CPO并认为Sivers买点有吸引力；仍预期LITE和COHR上行。「I still think there’s upside for Lumentum and $COHR」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2056558267896311996" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">已發生漲幅。「$COHR」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2053865558668435916" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确称此时应提前布局CPO相关股票，结合具体三家公司时间线表达看多。「ideal time to frontrun CPO names」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2052278391928500502" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">最佳光學投資曝險。「$COHR」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2051014522610372712" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">质疑COHR相关VCSEL技术可靠性，属于产品判断。「$COHR」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2047345451545047504" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">预期光学三家公司业务受益于需求，并未明确股票买卖或价格目标。「$COHR」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2042476441196241094" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明示未来股票收益及多头观点。「50-100% seem reasonable here.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2041963517071519963" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">回調被稱為便宜投資機會。「$COHR」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2039333459366211801" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">供應業務受益。「$COHR」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2036797359720476713" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明確建議繼續做多。「$COHR」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2034634272733343835" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者论证LITE供给缺口与未来增长尚未被定价，表达估值看多。「$COHR」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2033848250101616646" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">转述黄仁勋光学供给不足，非作者投资方向。「$COHR」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2033634984096108588" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">已发生涨幅及学习机会，非当前交易。「$COHR」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2032884410018939191" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">当日价格回顾。「$COHR」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2031014187401650192" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">讽刺光学股小幅盘后反弹并回顾行情，没有投资方向。「$COHR」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2030056728650469846" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确新投资对AXTI、AAOI及COHR的股票多方催化；旧自引目标无新承诺。「most of all the direct beneficiary is $COHR」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2028465538444427584" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确投资为五项光学股尾风，当前股票看多；NVDA投资者背景。「This is a massive tailwind for photonics stocks」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2028464631195574674" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">对行业机会正面但未给其独立投资判断。「We are early. $LITE $COHR $AAOI」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2027459009138114560" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面供应链介绍。「$COHR (huge part of supply chain)」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2027275242628948103" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">供應链重要性。「$COHR」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2012436515868352958" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">以AAOI及Marvell为核心论证股价重估，其余为微软芯片供应链背景。「$COHR」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2003476197028852074" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">产业受益。「$COHR」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/1999575509462843833" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:SPCX</span><span class="s-n">63 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-12-21 → 2026-09-28</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="flip">1 人反轉</span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+9.3%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>ARK</b>：2026-07 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Cathie Wood</b>：2026-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Dan Meuser</b>：2026-07 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Donald Trump</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Google</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Jared Moskowitz</b>：2026-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>John James</b>：2026-07 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>John McGuire</b>：2026-07 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Maria Salazar</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Ren</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>William Timmons</b>：2026-07 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>大老师</b>：2026-06 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> → 2026-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">任務失敗反應。「好了 又失败了」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2104557746645585996" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明確期待任務催化股價上行。「我倾向于走好」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2104539239681802547" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">他人競爭看法。「SpaceX will reach pole position in about 6 months.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2103475838452969681" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">SpaceX图形赞赏，未再次承诺自引旧催化方向。「K线上也非常好看」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2102640793962119209" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">把近期發射催化劑視為大交易機會，明確正向。「这是一个大波的机会。」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2102640083589586961" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">SpaceX的營收預測同樣只是佐證資本支出趨勢的數據引用，非作者對其直接表態。「$SPCX Wells Fargo forecasts are ~$263B for 2027.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2098306366167535766" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Evan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">轉述 SpaceX CFO 談 AI 主機代管合約金額的事實新聞，沒有作者自己對後市方向的判斷。「SpaceX&#x27;s $SPCX CFO said the company signed an AI hosting agreement worth about $1.11 billion a month」 <a href="https://x.com/StockMKTNewz/status/2098174494493773975" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Maria Salazar</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · two purchases · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-09-10 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2098043292298408300" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，此檔列於作者長期看好清單中，結尾以「Bullish」總結整篇貼文立場「Bullish ⚡️」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2097530847351972083" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者打算把新開的退休帳戶全部押注在太空股上，認為這類題材風險報酬最不對稱，屬明確看多「I think I&#x27;m going to full port it in space stocks... There is nothing more asymmetrical.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2091701369472467284" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Donald Trump</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-08-23 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2091320363581845835" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">已發生漲幅。「$SPCX +6.5%」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2089354272408530964" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Google</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · almost $100,000,000,000 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-08-07 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2085721617125068882" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Cathie Wood</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · ~$20 million · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-08-06 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2085282584573919503" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">已確認SpaceX上市身份；營收風險語氣但非明確股票方向。「近期SPCX关于 Starlink出现连续两个月的负增长」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2084651479655424348" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">強調SpaceX算力建設規模消息，沒有股價方向。「SpaceX plans to build 4 GW of compute capacity」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2082704028354707943" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jared Moskowitz</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-07-27 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2081740776698954041" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Cathie Wood</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · ~$14 million · 交易日 2026-07-27（原文：yesterday） · 揭露 2026-07-28 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2082018645757087783" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">負面合併炒作反應沒有明確方向。「Anything to justify the market cap.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2081076095315570834" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Cathie Wood</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · kept buying the whole way down · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-07-23 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2080365440736391203" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">對過度預測的玩笑。「we see &quot;$100T&quot; in revenue」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2079687189387235546" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Cathie Wood</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · ~$21 million · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-07-21 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2079530870940000284" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">對IPO價格貪婪的負面語氣，無未來股票預測。「Greed = off charts.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2079307812744896575" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>William Timmons</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · up to $100,000 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-07-20 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2079198912934449503" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">合約比較。「$SPCX $45B compute deal」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2078175882620059719" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">發射點火失敗感慨，引用自己假設方案，無新股票方向。「行 星舰 点火失败」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2077889795968344441" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>John James</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-07-13 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2076683318972604651" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>John McGuire</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-07-09 · 2 則報導 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2075208270877192555" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文1</a> <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2075240964956758523" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文2</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>ARK</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 181,847 shares · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-07-09 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2075119357139595586" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">模型產品正評。「Never doubt Elon」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2074979055410266452" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Dan Meuser</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-07-06 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2074070053490688266" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Dan Meuser</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-07-03 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2073052701659635888" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">支撐上移資訊，舊嘗試交易不再算新票。「今日 $SPCX 的支撑 变成了160刀」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2071954660488020074" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">當前走勢正面反應，不自動新增多票。「SpaceX这一段还行」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2071685612009357778" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">以支撑和浅止损建议尝试SpaceX交易，明确做多。「相当浅的止损，值得尝试」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2071590928385761538" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面收購業務資訊。「acquires Mesh, an optical networking startup.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2070691462354993543" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">負面已發生價格事件，不自動看空。「down over $583B in MC」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2069068801329774691" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Cathie Wood</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · ~$35 million · 交易日 2026-06-22（原文：yesterday） · 揭露 2026-06-23 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2069372779393102123" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">对Cramer推荐后股价反应的玩笑，無自己方向。「Even $SPCX can’t withstand his blessing.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2067604528959238272" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">自身加倉計畫。「我是打算在150-180这一段进行加仓的」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2067602373892358198" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">估值分類負面比較，非股票票。「with SpaceX is honestly pretty disrespectful.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2067528626971799556" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">舊自引空頭分析獲驗證，未新增股票方向。「基本上完美验证吧」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2067287760772431885" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">價格回顧。「眼见着从200刀跌到191了」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2067260892514075097" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">自己的直接股價下行預測。「跌幅会进一步加速」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2067245899148116268" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">极端长期市值与老股东玩笑，不能视为严肃新股票投资方向。「In 50 years when $SPCX is worth $100T.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2067040992835121551" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确以SKM作为Anthropic上市交易，正向机会；SpaceX是历史涨幅。「$SPCX has added $1T」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2066988235033899420" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">市場風格負評而非股價方向。「buy anything futuristic without caring about valuations」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2066676986324648239" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">已發生漲幅。「is up 40%」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2066610865286332800" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者预期WOLF及LITE主题篮子上涨，明确正向；SpaceX仅IPO事件，Hynix为历史宏观比较。「$SPCX successful IPO」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2066360345774764496" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Cathie Wood</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · $444 million · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-06-13 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2065728185644257281" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">對熱門股票情緒描寫非投資票。「big beautiful rockets」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2065256279946547498" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jared Moskowitz</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日 2026-06-12（原文：June 12th） · 揭露 2026-07-27 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2081732080216522890" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">期待IPO市場反應，不直接股價預測。「Excited to see how markets react」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2065073494220849660" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">质疑需求。「市场依然不想要SpaceX的份额」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2062804430626697302" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">讨论零售误认代码与IPO需求，不表达股票买卖方向。「Instead of $SPCX」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2060806434963763294" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">合併猜測。「SpaceX」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2059698310487908812" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">推荐XOVR ETF不计股票信号；SpaceX上市消息本身没有作者股票方向。「SpaceX」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2059275168044941510" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">肯定资产转换及IPO财务结构，非股价判断。「SpaceXAI IPO」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2052957921563316619" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">估值疑虑，未明示做空或下跌。「asymmetry is just hard to see at $1.75T」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2039484213901291707" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">疑虑SpaceX IPO股东首日出售与高估值，未明确股价目标或空方承诺；VCX为基金排除。「Who thought it was a good idea to allow everyone」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2037218261218255248" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">公司品质及IPO背景，不是SpaceX买入。「generate billions in EBITDA.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2037049096218063089" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">明确看多EchoStar代理交易但SATS当前名册缺失，不能自动假定历史身份。「SpaceX」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2036863170804146536" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者肯定Starlink服务并回顾通过SATS持有SpaceX敞口，没有新增股票方向；SATS身份未核验。「Grateful to have SpaceX stock」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2002845536714678341" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:NOK</span><span class="s-n">62 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-04-09 → 2026-09-17</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+4.7%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2026-04 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Ren</b>：2026-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>大老师</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">赞赏Nokia合作数量，转述合作不形成股票方向。「$NOK gathering hyperscaler partnerships like infinity stones」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2100602168935862560" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">嘲讽Nokia股价缺反应，未给可明确归因的新方向判断。「Could find the cure for cancer and still trade at $10.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2100597976007876734" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者正面看待NOK因Google芬蘭130億歐元投資帶動股價大漲近7%，並期待公司發揮全部潛力。「Always nice to see this beast fulfil its full potential.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2098535111738405094" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者列出Nokia在AI/光學/AI-RAN多項業務進展，並說「love to see these developments」，明確正面看待公司發展「Still very early, but love to see these developments.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2095971395352084674" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者強調Nokia是Nscale全球資料中心建置的首選網路夥伴，且參與其B輪與SAFE融資，屬正面基本面論述。「$NOK is Nscale&#x27;s preferred networking partner btw」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2092790552999711011" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者只是引用Nokia過去因宣布光通訊收購案而股價大漲175%的歷史做類比，並未對Nokia現在的方向表態。「Do you guys remember what happened to $NOK when they announced their optical acquisition? the stock ran 175% after infinera closed.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2090837479213420655" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者強調Nokia是Nscale資料中心建置的首選網路夥伴，並多輪參與其募資，暗示對Nokia這塊業務前景看好。「Nokia is Nscale&#x27;s preferred networking partner for their entire global data center buildout.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2090458399385297029" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面營運與相對價格觀察，未明示買入或前瞻股價。「Surprised $NOK is still lagging」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2089067529490567209" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">直接股票多頭主張。「how bullish this is for $CIEN and $NOK」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2087610369153900627" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Soitec持續持有論點但身份未驗證；其他股為業務與舊自引背景。「Unlike $NOK on their recent earnings」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2080691091062587419" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明確長持方向及低於10美元估值吸引。「this is a long not a trade.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2080370552800199161" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">重新肯定低估投資論點，並指出現價額外折扣。「Except you get all of this at a 40% discount.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2080273689925374073" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面數據與產能評述，無投資承諾。「sales to AI and cloud customers grew 105%」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2080265707107783035" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明確估值高於原基準與股票市場正面預期。「I expect the market to like this.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2080170907079934204" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Nokia期權流樂觀與市場範圍預測，無作者獨立股價方向。「整体期权流还行 很乐观」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2080031527933825471" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明說自身Nokia多頭且預期強財報，明確看多；SHAZ含義待驗。「for those of us long」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2079933450933387386" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">待驗證財報條件。「tomorrow comes down to whether AI and cloud is growing fast enough」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2079919579409600567" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面產品發布。「FIRST AI-RAN platform.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2077445684366856283" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">直接买入及低估論點。「Buying $NOK under $13 feels like robbery.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2072380248507773258" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">收購正面評價。「a massive turning point for $NOK」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2069984082189078950" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者認為股價忽略新業務價值的金融論點。「The market is still pricing this with a legacy telecom valuation.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2069803749950832645" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Nokia获总统宣传制造业新闻，未给股票方向。「$NOK is officially a Trump stock.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2069687131547509070" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者以完整产品栈及AI合作明确看多Nokia。「Bullish for $NOK.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2069134707732648033" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">期權流數據。「NOK进了170万的call」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2069124027344629872" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Nokia历史涨幅加模糊未来预告，未提供股票方向或行动。「The world doesn&#x27;t know what&#x27;s coming」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2067616469035458919" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确长仓Nokia并认为市场误价，明确看多。「Bullish AF $NOK」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2067294757211066542" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">直接股票上行論點。「Our modelling shows major upside in $NOK.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2066959736021623143" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">維護持倉情绪，無新投資票。「the company&#x27;s insiders are bagged with you.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2066959294474723683" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确Nokia被低估及分部估值上行，其他股票为估值比较。「The numbers tell a very different story than where this stock trades.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2066956573377798564" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">赞赏分析师及其Nokia/Sivers/MXL目标价，不归作者方向。「raised $NOK PT to $20」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2062249961463418970" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">当下低估论点。「The market still underestimates $NOK」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2061520898700853404" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">新增配置與看多理由。「Brand new $NOK - 20% of fund」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2061488431851827559" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">报道Nokia内幕买入及业务利好，买入语句来自引用他人。「Nokia」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2061185245899284827" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">讨论XFAB产业论点和媒体报道，海外股票身份未核实。「$NOK」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2059848338028241193" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">研究自評。「this $NOK valuation deep dive」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2059439289373712860" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者披露自身NOK期权赌注并认为当前估值有吸引力。「an attractive valuation」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2059438636467380659" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">肯定内幕买盘。「Unreal $NOK」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2059401512569241844" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">内幕人士交易观察。「$NOK insider buying is going vertical.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2059375889654423898" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">已發生漲幅反應。「$NOK」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2059305634395492791" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">研究认可。「Great thread from @amitisinvesting on $NOK」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2058989325547655218" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">公司合作或訂單資訊。「$NOK」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2057930829213401291" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">過去重估解釋。「why $NOK rerated」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2057874029227266283" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">已發生漲幅與業務說明。「$NOK」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2057839122228617667" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">董事背景或公司資訊。「$NOK」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2057571465311195178" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">肯定语气。「NOK YES!」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2057550441374986452" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者直接预计这两只股上涨。「这俩应该能吃到一波beta上涨」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2057156429988172081" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确认为NOK仍低估且正在加仓期权；同行只是背景比较。「This is still an undervalued business」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2056782169746624646" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">称赞PENG管理层与董事会，未明确投资方向；同行为履历背景。「$NOK」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2056489383692472798" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">既往重估回顧。「$4 to $15」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2056487632692019635" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">公司資訊或舊引用背景。「$NOK」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2056487090779816246" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确逢低加仓NOK，看多；BB只今日表现。「I added to my $NOK position on this dip.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2056377918566060041" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确极度看多Sivers，并称AEVA放量对双方看多；其他为业务背景。「$NOK」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2054868760629272850" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">NOK产品新增AI功能新闻，引用旧产业论点不形成新投资方向。「$NOK」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2054191372802941255" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Nokia和Cisco发布产品，LITE上涨为他人行情解释。「Nokia」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2053866116842410090" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">研究光学记忆主题与两家公司技术，无作者股票方向。「Bell Labs has been doing foundational photonics research」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2053838524911104050" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者未來輪動及重估交易構想。「Cheap telco stocks getting re-priced for AI」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2050475969484599638" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品和業務變化新聞。「$NOK」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2050027377892196550" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">Nokia仍低市值对高增长论点，明确投资低估；其他为股权或比较背景。「Still only $67B market cap on a business guiding ~50% operating profit growth」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2049525426863685637" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">業務需求正面新聞。「Nokia」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2046636300124778731" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">引用AI互连基础设施研报，未表达作者自身股票方向。「$NOK」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2044039436443468103" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Nokia业务增长分析与他人评级，不等于作者股票方向。「$NOK」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2043688754972365082" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">分析Nokia业务及英伟达分销战略，没有明确作者股票方向。「$NOK」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2042337208951325062" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:AAPL</span><span class="s-n">60 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-08-18 → 2026-09-24</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bear">賣出</span></span><span class="flip">1 人反轉</span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-1.4%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Adam Schiff</b>：2025-09 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li><li><b>Donald Trump</b>：2025-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Jukan</b>：2026-06 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> → 2026-09 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> → 2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li><li><b>Pete Sessions</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li><li><b>Ren</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>大老师</b>：2025-10 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Pete Sessions</b> <span class="tag t-bear">賣出</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · up to $250,000 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-09-24 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2103083780005318833" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">他人歷史產品稱讚。「Apple was the most valuable company on earth for over a decade」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2102221481736646965" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">對產品合作感興趣。「Apple will use NVLink Fusion」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2100221502968975399" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">用微軟 Surface Duo 反諷新摺疊機不新鮮，是產品揶揄不是股票判斷「The new IPhone Duo looks so awesome… Oh wait…」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2098022993859326374" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">批評摺疊機外觀難看，屬產品評價而非對股票的判斷「First impressions of the iPhone Duo: Why is it so ugly?」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2097822355141857590" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">稱自己稍早的看多判斷最終是對的，並提到當沖獲利「Nevermind I was right 🤣 Fun little 0 day.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2097762394139427027" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">承認市場對摺疊機反應冷淡、自己看多判斷錯誤「Market just faded the new iPhone Duo. I was wrong.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2097752218355311048" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">直播開場時提到蘋果股價跳水，屬盤中現象描述而非判斷「来看苹果跳水了」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2097738108708257810" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">列出新執行長、史上最大機構變革與買家對價格不敏感等理由，預期市場會買單「I think the market could like $AAPL&#x27;s new foldable phone launch today.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2097736636704719296" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">韓媒報導鉸鏈與可折疊面板良率問題，可能導致iPhone Fold在發表後無法立即全球同步上市（包括南韓），反映新品量產進度不如預期。「difficulties improving hinge and foldable panel yields will likely prevent a global rollout」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2096844666780221607" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Apple產品需求新聞及戲謔讚賞，未承諾股票方向；RPI身分待驗。「I&#x27;ve never seen a company win so hard by doing nothing.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2094306322812666156" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">「Large cap summer」搭配引用「鷹派Fed有利大型股，V型反彈」，暗示看好大型科技股輪動。「Large cap summer $AAPL $META $GOOGL $AMZN」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2093353130725417265" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者僅以「很酷」回應蘋果M5伺服器的消息，屬對產品的興趣反應，未表態股價方向「Pretty cool」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2092181476720906448" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">讨论他人历史成功及IPO估值反问，不产生作者方向。「buying $AAPL and $MSFT at IPO」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2089374997580251236" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">他人投资生涯与慈善故事，历史交易不归作者立场。「He bought $AAPL at the 1980 IPO」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2089132875992175031" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">供應商選擇受限的負面業務反應。「urges $AAPL not to buy Chinese memory chips」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2088457278928412812" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品良率負面消息。「iPhone got cancelled due to yield issues」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2086769484610883729" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">成本壓力嘲諷，非明確股票看空。「Bad for the Fruit Man.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2085353865323372801" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">嘲諷封裝缺DRAM的消息，無股票方向。「Apple processors because they can&#x27;t get the DRAM」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2085282634037645436" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">嘲諷Apple議價失敗，無股票方向；三星海力士為供應比較。「CXMT rejected Apple prices
LMAO」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2084885949717356879" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">對Apple供應商接觸照片發笑，無股票方向。「LOL」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2084854925318930891" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明確股價突破預期。「这里可以认为是一个突破310的预期 浅止损」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2084640921367535866" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品定價風險與他人降評。「creating demand uncertainty」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2083139948329464029" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">對Apple議價引文發笑，無股票方向。「🤣🤣🤣」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2083090218387746902" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">成本發言引用。「Apple earnings call」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2083033961786490913" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">負面產品價格玩笑，不代表股價方向。「you can leave the remaining balance to your kids」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2082095553169490382" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">批評Apple採購行为而非股票前景；記憶公司為背景。「Apple acting like a spoiled child」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2080829171044147401" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">批评Apple价格与监管论据，公司负面语气而非股票看空。「Cut your margins, Apple.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2080822662180536721" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品與資本支出情境，不明确该股方向。「what if Apple joined the others after M&amp;A?」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2077421268991926703" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">公司競爭負面語氣。「pissing off every Mag7 like $AAPL.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2075894311741440041" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">轉述NVIDIA運算份額，自引旧Apple看空沒有新承諾。「I am increasingly bearish on Apple.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2075866694917194116" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明說Apple越来越看空並給供需壓力前瞻，NVIDIA为技术背景。「I am increasingly bearish on Apple.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2075477320270520665" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">採購限制資訊。「it does not seem easy for Apple to purchase DRAM from CXMT」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2071505314357375275" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面業務研究，但不是作者股票預期。「record-high market share」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2071181361956983138" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明言看空理由並以供應商轉向AI支持。「isn’t that itself a bearish point on Apple?」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2071029953001570708" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">負面業務競爭評價，未明示股票看空。「Apple can&#x27;t maintain its market share in China」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2070701580442313052" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品供應限制語氣。「No memory anon」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2070196144832143821" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">成本訊息解讀。「Apple signaled everyone」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2070144804470796776" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品負評。「Apple Intelligence is currently dog」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2069990311296975133" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">推测Sivers/Aeva/Apple产品合作及收入潜力，尚无明确股票方向。「SIVE + Apple」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2069388279355756826" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品供應與成本負面風險。「Apple may have to cut iPhone production.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2067418881002725737" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">预期Apple涨价会破坏消费需求，负面经营预测尚未明确转成股票看空。「Demand destruction will be huuuge」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2067354846907568546" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">PC产业销量与成本预测，Apple业务赞誉不等于股票投票。「Apple is an exception」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2061106392455622830" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">产品竞争与Windows界面批评，非股票看空。「how clean Apple OS is」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2060755595515547753" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">评价AI发现Apple系统漏洞，属于产品安全消息。「Apple」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2054942077021299040" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">庆祝AppleIntel合作新闻，不等于投资看多。「Apple and Intel」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2052794627238105301" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">回顾Himax业务预期获验证并引用财报，没有当前买卖方向。「Apple」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2052347442742661512" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">以Sivers为核心论证未来市值上行，伙伴名单仅供应链背景。「$AAPL」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2051566667009073315" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">产品架构称赞兼成本分析。「no AI platform that can really match Apple’s unified memory architecture」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2050024550176522452" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">AppleCEO性格媒体消息及弱点评价，非股票看空。「risk-averse personality」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2046492060644176113" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Apple提高产品产量目标新闻，无作者股票方向。「$AAPL」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2043560029320823285" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品延後新聞。「Apple」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2041346791082492064" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">评价Apple高管供应链策略，没有股票方向。「Apple」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2039745369240948968" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">短期營運風險。「Apple stock」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2039716785180799042" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">市占及經營策略正評。「$AAPL」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2039716783226314998" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">产品正面评价。「Apple is finally adopting a 200MP image sensor」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2037004220231229518" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">明确电脑购买意愿而非股票。「I’m buying it the moment it comes out.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2035621721219473578" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明確投資看多。「目前比较看好的是Apple的股票。」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/1981008878243598579" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-09-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Adam Schiff</b> <span class="tag t-bear">賣出</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · up to $15K · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2025-09-30 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/1973079828707320281" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-08-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Donald Trump</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日 2025-08-18（原文：August 18, 2025） · 揭露 2026-07-01 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2072209361238372446" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">EPA:SOI</span><span class="s-n">58 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-03-05 → 2026-09-07</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="flip">1 人反轉</span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2026-03 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-03 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-03 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> → 2026-03 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者將SOI列為自己至今仍上漲逾100%的矽光子基板主題持股。「12. $SOI - SIlicon Photonics Substrates」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2096814311306129776" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者在盤點歐洲供應鏈壟斷者時，將SOI(Soitec/Photonics-SOI)列為歐洲關鍵壟斷地位企業之一，延續他先前對SOI的看多立場。「European monopolies like: - $ASML (EUV) - $SOI (Photonics-SOI)」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2095823005595439615" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者重申自己先前的SOI論點，引述Soitec訪談指出$200M光子SOI營收「絕對是底線」且80%產能保留協議即將完成，並以「掌握瓶頸的壟斷地位，營收通常會流向你」總結看多邏輯。「$200M Photonics-SOI revenue now described as &quot;absolutely a floor&quot;」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2094378666927239596" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">明稱Soitec與光子晶圓確認巴黎股票；財報行情與他人目標價無作者方向。「Soitec shares surged 22%」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2080702990021726373" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">全文Soitec硅光晶圆与显式巴黎代码共同确认Euronext普通股SOI，官方IR吻合；当前肯定业务执行并回顾旧选股，未新增股票交易或价格目标，不映射未核验SLOIF。「($SLOIF / $SOI.PA)」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2080691091062587419" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">明确光子SOI晶圆需求确认Soitec巴黎普通股，不能映射美国SOI；需求读穿没有作者股票方向。「SOI wafer demand for $SOI」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2078228019584668121" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者反对负面机构报告并谈行业周期，但不给 Soitec 新的独立股票目标或交易建议。「With Soitec」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2069967746377662587" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">全文西方CHIPS补贴及光学半导体供应链语境明确Soitec巴黎股票，非US:SOI能源公司；旧自引业务支持。「$SOI」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2065114293767741950" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确预期所举上游供应链股票走高，Soitec 是明确点名的晶圆瓶颈公司。「$SOI for Silicon Photonics substrates」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2062378784855368077" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">全文明确Soitec及SOI硅片企业，核验巴黎普通股；政策业务支持未直接赋个股股票方向。「SOI wafers, with Soitec and Siltronic」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2062176094162428410" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">当前回顾四倍涨幅与重整需求，旧引用买入和三倍目标不当作新增当前方向。「nothing new with Soitec」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2059965358455619764" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Soitec光子晶圆语境确认引用中SOI为巴黎普通股；主段OTC SLOIF论述不能改映射为巴黎股份，引用无独立新方向。「Soitec&#x27;s Photonics-SOI revenue」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2058594141727060106" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">他人引用中的历史投资比较，不是作者当前 Soitec 股票方向。「Soitec, which re-rated violently」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2057864175175753876" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">歐洲光子股票確認Soitec而非油服同碼；作者預期此價回檔均被買走，明確看多。「These are all core players going forward, hard to see any dip not being bought out at these levels.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2057008127917347125" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">明确Soitec欧洲报道及股价确认巴黎普通股；历史战绩及机构目标无新作者方向，旧OTC交易不可映射。「Soitec is now trading at 140」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2056594930232135705" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Tower原始光子基板與CPO確認Soitec；供應鏈營收受益及舊选股稱呼無明確新股價或交易方向。「raw substrates upstream with $SOI (more revenue).」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2054532386239693206" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">同文明稱Soitec、歐元估值與CPO基板確認巴黎股票；本則回顧舊持倉及券商目標價，沒有新方向。「$SOI」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2052698113874518527" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">明确Soitec背景的歷史漲幅。「Now $SOI up a few hundred percent.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2052325056429384165" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">維護成長或供應鏈論點，無新交易。「$SOI」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2051863264624353314" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">CPO光子曝險及基板供應公司語境確認Soitec；作者當下重申持倉捕捉超級循環起步。「This is exactly why I have positions in $SIVE, MSScorps, Shunsin, $TSEM, $SOI and others for high beta exposure to the start of the CPO supercycle.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2051801908344771022" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">CPO光子成長語境確認Soitec；作者明說市場未理解未來兩年成長，為前瞻投資看多。「But everything happens in the next two years with $SIVE to Shunsin to MSSCorps to $SOI.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2051593478245851178" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">舊自引多倍股論點，無當前新承諾。「Soitec at €54.00」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2051359004115542078" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">当前SOI通过同篇自引Soitec及SOI衬底业务明确识别，官方IR确认巴黎普通股；当前庆祝已发生涨幅，旧买入和三倍目标不是新增方向，SLOIF保留。「Changed my mind about Soitec」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2051319157552267710" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Soitec晶圓上下文明確，歷史收益。「$SOI (silicon photonic substrates)」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2051202378058346567" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">明确SOI为硅光子衬底供应商，满足Soitec产品识别限制，官方IR确认巴黎普通股；回顾发现研究标的没有新买卖方向。「$SOI, which was the SiPH substrate」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2050790690591048002" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">否定舊評論並回顧漲幅。「Soitec was overvalued」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2050272539851821157" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">舊自引明稱Soitec及CPO基板確認巴黎股票；本則已發生三倍漲幅回顧無新方向。「$SOI」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2050040294205448401" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">明确Soitec光子业务确认巴黎普通股；以其旧重估作为QCOM比较，没有新的Soitec方向。「While Soitec was a photonics trade」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2048512944947020048" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">當日漲跌或訂單新聞，未明示方向。「$SOI」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2046894773706035638" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">光子CPO及Tower供應語境確認Soitec；舊自引首選不等於本則新投資方向。「$SOI」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2045175383210000444" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Soitec前文研究上下文明確，收益回顧。「$SOI」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2045160542256656611" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明示當前持倉及上行，Soitec光子晶圓身份明确。「creating asymmetric upside.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2045151745509372168" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">明确Soitec光子晶圆与欧元巴黎代码确认巴黎普通股；作者回顾GTC荐股及过去收益，旧引用不新增当前方向。「Soitec owns 95%+ market share in Photonics-SOI wafer」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2044827104685244789" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">同篇Soitec全名与衬底产品明确当前SOI身份，官方IR确认巴黎普通股；主体回顾过去翻倍，旧自引三倍观点不算新方向，OTC的SLOIF不清除。「Changed my mind about Soitec」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2044822095931306149" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">明確回顧過去交易收益。「$SOI.PA」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2044792665666138167" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明示未來投資收益方向。「Probably expect them all to compound another triple digits from here」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2044682729128874210" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">股票代表供應鏈壟斷地位，未明示買賣。「When you buy Soitec stock」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2044146695970386248" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者預期投資資金流向具名Soitec。「The rotation into CPO names is inevitable.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2044142867703066815" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者当前重申Soitec便宜与多倍收益观点，看多；其余为过去业绩或合作背景。「it&#x27;s still ridiculously cheap」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2044103771173859785" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">当前称这些股票为自己的长仓。「But my longs, especially with CPO/Silicon Photonics」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2044077799338881108" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确Soitec下一项多倍收益投资观点，看多；AAOI为旧收益，客户伙伴背景。「$SOI is my favorite next multi bag in photonics」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2042645172253790355" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">既往收益回顧。「only up 39.28% since last month」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2042526193375940878" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">歐洲光子產業確認Soitec而非美國油服同碼；當日反彈及宏觀評論無單股方向。「$SOI」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2041791434525962584" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确股票投资选择，欧洲身份明确。「I decided to front-run the CPO market into Soitec」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2040150189722554508" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者当前欧洲Soitec投资选择。「The second, $SOI / $SLOIF, is a trade」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2037579761443340547" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">基板業務受益。「Soitec」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2036797359720476713" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明示股票投资选择及未来受益。「The real winner-agnostic play?」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2035065197946446189" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者当前明确股票做多选择。「I think best CPO long is Soitec」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2034688670943650139" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">既往股票收益回顾。「now up, a lot since my post a week ago.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2034212267487793348" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">光學漲幅回顧。「$SOI」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2033643128390095328" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">历史收益。「now up over +44.3%」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2033512244244529396" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">既往重估。「Gets re-rated 40%+.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2032697006586786139" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">前瞻上行判斷。「This has a long way to go」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2032178441064534389" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确计划持有Soitec一至两年；官方巴黎普通股身份已核实，OTC代码仍未核实。「I plan to hold my positions over the next year or two」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2031896692283621696" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确TSEM做多与估值上涨催化，Soitec为当前第二首选看多，其他为背景。「My top two picks for CPO are $SOI and Tower Semi.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2031820871170736570" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">既往价格回顾。「Send it up 20%」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2031802127421751329" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确认为Soitec可持有多年并预期催化，表达看多。「a name that people can hold for many years」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2031751619117744443" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">明确负面事件方向，光学语境核验Soitec。「While net negative to CPO companies like Soitec.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2029698209199837354" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:TSM</span><span class="s-n">58 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-11-24 → 2026-09-13</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+4.4%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Cleo Fields</b>：2026-04 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Jared Moskowitz</b>：2025-11 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Jukan</b>：2026-03 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Ren</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2025-12 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Zephyr</b>：2026-04 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>大老师</b>：2026-07 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确反駁崩盤並支持需求。「unfollow the clowns on X that predict AI stocks from $NVDA to $TSM to $MU will crash」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2099229447304122410" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">對 1.4 奈米量產比原訂計畫提早一年表達驚訝與正面看待「Mass production of 1.4nm by the end of 2027??」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2097855233921892542" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上,作者表態看多整體AI建設並考慮複製此清單,TSM在名單中屬第二梯隊重倉。「Taiwan Semiconductor $TSM [Long, 6.3%]」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2095228808278446221" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者將TSM列為自己H2 2026/2027投資組合的核心持股之一，稱其為「各方面的核心贏家」。「With core winners of everything such as $TSM (but less high-beta)... This looked similar to my H2 2026/early 2027 portfolio with Nebius, Micron, TSM」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2095087925822190023" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">報導具體指出台積電A16製程的背面供電技術已領先英特爾與三星一步，屬明確的技術優勢描述。「TSMC has secured a technological edge in backside power delivery with A16, putting it a step ahead of Intel and Samsung in the competition.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2089664982510457163" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确Sony股票便宜且实体AI巨大上行空间，构成看多；TSMC为合作伙伴无方向。「$SONY and $TSM are putting ¥1 trillion」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2086868356645433676" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">嘲諷封裝缺DRAM的消息，無股票方向。「LMAO
TSMC is sitting on $1B」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2085282634037645436" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">封裝技術風險消息。「if CoWoS-L with a 9.5x reticle is unsuccessful」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2079568535093973274" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">不論財報的直接下跌方向。「就是要跌呗」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2077756434994126933" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">資本支出及需求正面預測。「TSMC capex will be waay more than $200B」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2077649066985685186" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">維護公司供應鏈語氣。「blowing it out of proportions」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2076266613675069628" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">關注事件與券商觀點，未表自身方向。「I&#x27;m watching the 16th, with pop corn in hand.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2074930024193679430" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">競品技術進度正面。「TSMC has already secured stable yields」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2073682227586818371" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面合資業務背景。「signed a JV with TSMC」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2073078859495301576" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">指责新闻威胁TSMC的错误叙事，公司正面辩护不当股票看多。「threat to TSMC」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2071812092907446560" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面辯護估值敘事，不直接預測股價方向。「framing Taiwan’s $TSM ~23.6x forward p/e」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2069399639154213281" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">混合键合技术成本与BESI业务机会讨论，BESI身份未核实。「TSMC&#x27;s COUPE &amp; Tower」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2067915761331618074" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">技术成本评论无已核实股票方向，BESI缺身份。「TSMC&#x27;s COUPE &amp; Tower」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2067912731122872684" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">分析師技術時程引用。「TSMC is aiming to start mass production」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2067440482524029088" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">庆祝TSMC/Amkor合约，不是股票方向。「LFG!!!」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2066882770002128940" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面技術消息反應。「WOW」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2066670776561127728" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">對產品消息興奮。「LFG!!」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2066652359875539430" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">材料供應風險背景。「SK Hynix, Samsung, $TSM」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2065736884752703865" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">技術進度正評。「TSMC has pulled in CoPoS from 2029 to 2028!」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2064912426559304141" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">同業技術成長消息。「TSMC and Intel Surge Ahead」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2064254581333209275" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">負面經營策略評價。「TSMC was too naive」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2064127637296189752" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Google技术补充与他人Intel市场份额预测引用，不归作者股票方向。「TSMC fumbles Copackaged optics」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2063759822340993129" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">投资方法反思；当前明确建议AAOI低估做多，余股是研究示例与泛品质判断，非单股方向。「good names everyone kinda agrees like $TSM, $INTC, $MRVL」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2063465386960736396" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">嘲讽TSMC产能说法及客户分散逻辑，不是股票看空。「🧢🧢🧢」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2062428688529146306" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">TSMC董事长增长原话转述，无作者方向。「Company still expects full-year revenue growth」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2062363751236681734" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者預期上游股票受益上漲。「Upstream ecosystem from $LITE to $AVGO to Mediatek to $TSM to $MU should go brrr.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2061596599588114444" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">评价TSMC高管薪酬过低，未表达股票方向。「TSMC」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2059656798228168757" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-20</d