-range">2025-04-01 → 2026-09-29</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bear">賣出</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+2.2%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Bill Ackman</b>：2025-04 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Cathie Wood</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>David Tepper</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Davis Advisors</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Donald Trump</b>：2026-07 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li><li><b>Jeff Bezos</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2025-12 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Ren</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Seth Klarman</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Stanley Druckenmiller</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jeff Bezos</b> <span class="tag t-bear">賣出</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · $346.5 Million · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-09-29 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2104862685053485359" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Donald Trump</b> <span class="tag t-bear">賣出</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · up to $25 MILLION combined across AMZN and MSFT · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-09-28 <a href="https://x.com/DJTRadar/status/2104506526983446538" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">不滿封鎖。「$AMZN bans $META muse agents.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2102063677642100771" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Evan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">純粹轉述 Amazon Leo 衛星網路擴大 Ariane 6 發射合約數量的事實新聞，沒有作者自己對股價方向的評論。「expanding its total Arianespace commitment from 18 to 24 launches」 <a href="https://x.com/StockMKTNewz/status/2098193139685040156" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">標題稱AMZN為「不對稱的賭注」，暗示認為上漲空間大於下跌風險，屬看多語氣。「$AMZN is an asymmetrical bet」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2098191770576417148" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">以 2028 年後獲利大幅成長解讀當前資本支出造成的自由現金流壓力，屬長線偏多「short term FCF headwinds (but massive projected profitability post 2028)」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2097815176838017066" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者提到AMZN與QCOM多世代AI基礎設施與光通訊合作，列為「Big morning for AI infrastructure」的正面消息之一「$AMZN + $QCOM: multiple generations of AI infrastructure and optical connectivity up to 1.6T and beyond.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2097332258386403456" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Stanley Druckenmiller</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · $110 million (calls) · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-09-08 · 2 則報導 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2097330735975637434" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文1</a> <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2097331475167281576" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文2</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者認為AMZN透過認股權大舉入股半導體公司，形容其正變得像半導體ETF，對雙方都是好事。「Good for both companies, moreso Qualcomm.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2097321349555306512" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者將AMZN與QCOM合作案視為1.6T光學超級週期的一環，語氣正面興奮「$AMZN + $QCOM teaming up on AI data centers and 1.6T optics?! NO WAYYY.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2097315161732272580" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者把AMZN列為算力需求失衡的證據之一，並以『AI股怎麼可能不噴出』作結，屬看多。「$MSFT / $GOOGL / $AMZN stating compute demand imbalances into next year, with Nvidia projecting $1.3T spend for 2027.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2095882424932766163" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者「100% agreed」認同引用貼文中「每家重要AI公司財報與展望都優於預期」的名單，AMZN在列其中。「100% agreed. Fundamentals and capex demand are running circles around the macro panic.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2094559531376218224" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，AMZN被列入看好的大型股輪動名單。「Large cap summer $AAPL $META $GOOGL $AMZN」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2093353130725417265" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者直言AMZN是他最愛的Mag7成分股，看好其AWS+自研晶片優勢及未來十年最劇烈的業務轉型「In 10 years, Amazon will see the most radical business transformation out of the Mag 7.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2091633258148823256" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">明說NBIS多方估值上行及對抗空頭，明確看多。「it reads like AWS for inference」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2089474970741051857" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Seth Klarman</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-08-13 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2088030689845285229" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者否定做空这些云公司的盈利可能，并以强成长指引建立多方股票论点。「Shorting cloud companies is the fastest way to burn money right now.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2087541434333163660" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Davis Advisors</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-08-12 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2087462016743043247" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jeff Bezos</b> <span class="tag t-bear">賣出</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · $346.5 million · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-08-07 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2085632330064920662" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jeff Bezos</b> <span class="tag t-bear">賣出</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · ~$347 million · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-08-05 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2085109316701319614" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jeff Bezos</b> <span class="tag t-bear">賣出</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · $4 billion · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-08-04 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2084642375725457814" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Cathie Wood</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · ~$21 million · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-08-04 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2084531846600135095" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">赞叹他人Amazon历史交易，不是作者方向。「all in on Amazon weeklies」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2083351481353404734" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Amazon已涨与芯片执行赞赏，自引旧暗马观点无新承诺。「$AMZN +15%.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2083246083543801941" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面需求背景，不將上游方向套给Amazon股票。「Bullish on demand side from Amazon」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2083088870942642391" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">券商投資分析轉述。「Amazon Earnings Commentary: A Virtuous Cycle Is Beginning」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2083032607496049073" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面業務評價，不直接當股票看多。「Token as a Service is great for Amazon」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2082920342616748432" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Donald Trump</b> <span class="tag t-bear">賣出</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · up to $25 million each · 交易日 2026-07-20（原文：July 20） · 揭露 2026-09-22 <a href="https://x.com/unusual_whales/status/2102452943043932654" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">需求與價格解釋。「Amazon’s 20% GPU price increase」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2074765232124408119" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">机器人劳力替代技术发展论述，Amazon及Agility为案例，没有股票方向。「$AMZN leaked strat」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2073351980131754203" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">工厂机器人的業務驗證及社会評論，無上市股票方向。「companies like $AMZN」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2071532870859149617" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面產業前景，非該股明確方向。「programs within large players like $AMZN or $TSLA」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2070789923108798545" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">股票偏好與未來盈利投資論點。「probably my favorite hyperscaler right now」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2069655980456149142" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">对Amazon晶片开放消息感兴趣，非股票方向。「this will be very interesting」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2067640824113123560" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">业务成長比较。「AWS growth is so high」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2065917834912522662" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">條件式法律/業務風險。「then Amazon would get sued」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2065874690888093791" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">當下價格反應。「暴跌中」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2062962265570353365" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">他人業務新聞。「more companies are moving from on-prem to the cloud」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2062932483151368192" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">称赞AWS产品。「Graviton is the best server CPU」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2059847117683011616" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>David Tepper</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-05-17 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2055936443025924231" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">机器人经营收益肯定。「Amazon’s robotics program have the simplest route」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2054728301806256484" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">價值被低估的投資判斷。「$AMZN for robotics is extremely underrated.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2054706428431286655" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">技术业务乐观。「AWS Trainium」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2052010162769301810" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">财报惊叹。「HOLY」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2049580095787188478" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">他人券商估值看法。「$AMZN」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2047974859125465105" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">长文分析Nuvacore创业、CPU行业及企业战略，未表达上市股票买卖方向。「Amazon」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2044684410289852753" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">已發生漲幅解釋。「$AMZN」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2042335200110322131" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">批评Amazon网络产品，引文合作不是作者投资方向。「Amazon&#x27;s networking is basically junk」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2040267700958867641" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">产品网络批评。「Amazon can finally ditch its trash networking」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2039346115989135784" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">惊讶Amazon采购与团队新闻，引用他人判断非自身方向。「$AMZN」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2037295400433160361" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">批评Amazon进入手机的企业策略，没有股票方向。「Amazon」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2035011150627447118" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">芯片业务竞争评价。「AI&#x27;s dark horse」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2001138626865033251" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">产品及业务战略评价。「Trainium 3 chips are really exciting」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1999192376578048241" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确新买AMZN；EchoStar估值看多代码未核实，其他为直播预告。「I just bought AMZN」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1998438940488110564" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-04-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Bill Ackman</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日 2025-04-01（原文：April 2025） · 揭露 2026-09-02 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2095095410691826129" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:CRWV</span><span class="s-n">49 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-10-03 → 2026-09-22</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="flip">3 人反轉</span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+5.3%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>David Tepper</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Leopold Aschenbrenner</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Michael Burry</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> → 2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Ren</b>：2026-07 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> → 2026-08 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> → 2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2025-11 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> → 2026-04 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> → 2026-06 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">以AI投資回報轉為持續支出支持四股看多。「Use cases with proper ROI, become recurring spend lines.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2102206142956839081" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">负面價格反應，非前瞻看空。「bad influences dragging us down」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2100584504662659177" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">負債顧慮未明言做空。「Only Situational Awareness position I&#x27;m in disagreement with is $CRWV due to debt interest eating FCF」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2099659874892386678" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者只是興奮轉述 Leopold Aschenbrenner 基金重新活躍並買入該股買權的消息，未表達自己對股價方向的判斷。「he&#x27;s back guys... just in time for fomc」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2098407270551839059" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，此檔列於作者因微軟擴建資料中心消息而重申看多的清單中「I&#x27;m going to say this 100x times a year. You guys are not bullish enough.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2098183010671550758" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bull">回補</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · covering part of his short position, reducing bearish bet size · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-09-09 <a href="https://x.com/unusual_whales/status/2097757177482199422" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>David Tepper</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 1.08 million shares, ~$105 million · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-09-09 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2097632659065258075" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，作者僅對他人過去持倉表達佩服，未給出自己的方向判斷「Look at the names Leopold was in」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2097521722954072202" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者提到CRWV背負高利率債務，作為凸顯Nebius財務體質較佳的對照，非直接看空CRWV股價。「High interest debt that $CRWV, $APLD, and others face.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2097327653116363127" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，此檔與ORCL、NBIS一起被標記在整體看多AI建置的貼文中「Bullish the AI buildout」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2095879502882644467" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上,作者表態看多AI雲端層並考慮複製此清單,CRWV為名單第三梯隊持股。「CoreWeave $CRWV [Long]」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2095228808278446221" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，與NBIS、IREN同被標註在這則反駁資料中心負面敘事為造謠的貼文中。「we found 200 accounts posting in a manner that could manipulate a legitimate debate about American AI and energy policy」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2093347096711635402" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者指出CRWV雖能對新約提高報價，但因自行持有GPU、負債逾350億美元且有大量長年期舊約（尤其對微軟）正好是漲價成本轉嫁不到的地方，屬看空風險論述。「it owns its GPUs, carries $35B+ in debt, and its big long-dated legacy book (Microsoft especially)」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2091380164382843335" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bear">放空</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-08-22 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2091145945492672637" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者標註CRWV並寫「你還沒準備好迎接接下來的事」，搭配微軟資料中心首批Vera Rubin機櫃到貨的消息，暗示正面催化預期。「You are not ready for what comes next」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2091009171772629325" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者引用CRWV營收將自76億成長至126億美元、成長逾100%，列為看多標的。「$CRWV: ~$7.6bn TTM heading to ~$12.6bn, roughly 100%+ at the top line」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2090639444709638405" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确將需求承諾判為所列股票多頭論點。「That is exactly why it reads bullish to me.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2089827659794493538" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">完整转述广发证券CoreWeave评级与目标价，不归为贴文作者方向。「GF Securities Overseas Electronics and Communications: CoreWeave 2Q26 Earnings Comment」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2087732870521757855" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">券商論述例子。「CoreWeave&#x27;s recent earnings release」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2087689684298461445" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者否定做空这些云公司的盈利可能，并以强成长指引建立多方股票论点。「Shorting cloud companies is the fastest way to burn money right now.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2087541434333163660" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明說資本應集中AI基建並支持成為持有人，對所提三股投資表態。「I just can&#x27;t relate to anyone who doesn&#x27;t have their capital highly concentrated in AI infrastructure.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2087290590086180951" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">財報前興奮提問，無明确自身方向。「after $CRWV print」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2087286623973023810" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">三股強勁財報及需求讀穿讚賞，無明確股票方向。「Insane earnings today for the AI theme」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2087285356999958663" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明說neocloud大幅看多，文中唯一該股CoreWeave。「Mega bullish for NeoClouds」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2087279119029420372" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">部署與需求驅動作者Neocloud看多結論。「Neocloud summer incoming.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2080173287196197225" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品效率落差而非股票票。「746 tokens per second against 480 and 290.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2073862090578891121" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">澄清Meta算力与资本开支消息，预测支出增加不等于股票方向。「$CRWV and $NBIS」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2072314906729455876" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">融資風險語氣。「留意发债的特殊风险」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2071956207036940443" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Leopold Aschenbrenner</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-06-15 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2066641087792382374" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">引用者的負面CEO玩笑。「Gas trader turned ETH miner」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2066617801104908463" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面業務引述認可，不直接轉看多票。「YUP」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2065030604794802502" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">高利息損害股東FCF，明確避免投資。「stay far away from toxic financing structures or toxic overhang」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2063571485739106593" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">同業FCF負面對比。「all burn cash」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2062201072463061056" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">他人期权流观察。「HERO CALL」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2061465759768023149" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">历史表现庆祝。「单日拉升15%」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2061463520345313683" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Leopold Aschenbrenner</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-05-08 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2052762103560241589" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Leopold Aschenbrenner</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-05-07 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2052259039900234228" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Leopold Aschenbrenner</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-05-05 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2051749707756556525" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Leopold Aschenbrenner</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-05-01 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2050185881819001157" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明確同列看多。「$CRWV」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2041056589088702781" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">明确选Nebius为赢家，看多；明确警告当前IREN投资者稀释及CRWV存活风险，看空；其他为客户伙伴。「If any company goes down, $CRWV is the first to go」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2037896456179438049" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">三家云企业CEO比较，人物评价非股票买卖方向。「Gas trader turned ETH miner」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2031821990907298232" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">历史跌幅及风险评论，不是当前新增空头。「$CRWV down ~28% in the past month」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2028109409948508531" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">行业业务顺风。「Every tailwind just hit at once for Neoclouds.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2019857047052022237" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">明确反对CRWV多头并推荐Nvidia，表达一空一多。「doesn&#x27;t make Coreweave a good long.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2016361080117961170" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">明确投资回避及资本风险。「but not companies tied to OpenAI like $ORCL and $CRWV」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/1998925429890261130" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">反驳卖空机构对NBIS公司结构的比较，未明确作者买卖方向。「$CRWV」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/1997034977524121633" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">明确中长期投资回避。「stay away medium long term」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/1995084174223651180" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">CoreWeave历史IPO故事与年内涨幅，英伟达为GPU供应背景，未有新股票方向。「$CRWV +242% YTD」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1974161332217000022" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:AEHR</span><span class="s-n">47 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-02-26 → 2026-09-11</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+8.9%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-04 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Ren</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-02 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Zephyr</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者稱讚提早發掘 AEHR 的研究者，並轉述該公司在晶圓與晶粒級檢測幾乎沒有競爭對手，是對其基本面的正面背書。「Their team told him they had virtually no competitor in wafer and die level inspection.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2098515154468282813" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">直接列在 Bullish for 清單，理由是測試是共同封裝光學的實際瓶頸「$AEHR - testing, the actual gate on CPO」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2097820413900276043" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者聲稱是自己給Kevin的建議讓AEHR大漲，屬於自我肯定過去看多判斷正確的表態「Both ripped hard after I gave Kevin this recommendation.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2097523591990346099" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者將AEHR列為自己至今仍上漲逾100%的設備主題持股。「9. $AEHR - Machines」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2096814311306129776" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">延續前一則對AEHR的看法，作者說「the recovery will be violent」並要大家「be ready for it」，明確表達耐心持有等待反彈的多頭立場「The job now is just being patient enough to let the market come back to it. And when it does, the recovery will be violent.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2095918375939592296" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者認為市場超跌後通常會出現機會，並明確說「I think $AEHR could easily end up being one of those」，暗示他看好AEHR的反彈機會「I think $AEHR could easily end up being one of those.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2095622238187700501" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者稱其為「genuinely good company」，認為近46%的回檔是資金從小型股輪動所致而非基本面問題，屬逢低看多論述。「genuinely good company, and the drop looks more like funds rotating out of small caps than anything wrong with the business.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2094567154163015951" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，AEHR為目前獲利中的波段持倉之一。「Today all of my swings but one are green $NBIS $MRVL $NVTS $AXTI $AEHR」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2092738683934003516" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者引用AEHR FY27財測年增160-200%，列為看多標的。「$AEHR: FY27 guided +160-200% ($50m to $130-150m)」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2090639444709638405" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">漲幅與訂單資料。「$AEHR is up 87% since its last earnings call.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2088282372378595571" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面歷史價格反應及反問不直接等於新看多。「$AEHR + 110% in 12 trading days」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2088260532071498194" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">新訂單讚賞，未新增投資承諾。「It’s cool to see this tiny company grow up so fast across so many verticals」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2087505570941239683" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">比较ETF及推广自有组合，多个股票仅历史权重与未纳入公司赞赏，无新股票方向。「other incredible names like $VIAV, $TSEM, $AEHR, or $GLW」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2085396410405707941" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">模糊喜爱光学股与引用历史业绩跳涨，不构成特定股票新方向。「$AEHR +50%」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2084826016107917466" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">已發生漲幅反應。「$AEHR you good?  +66% in 4 trading days.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2084671806250549512" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确NVEC仍有机器人股票上行空间；PENG/AEHR仅旧成功案例。「following $PENG and $AEHR」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2080348641823171026" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">AEHR財報需求與收入潛力正面分析，但未明示股票投資方向；其他為自引客戶猜想。「I don’t quite think that $130-$150m guidance is representative」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2077208587005542464" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者持有AEHR且以市場所忽略的前瞻估值與成長支持投資論點，明確看多。「Everyone staring at 60x trailing sales missed that the guide compresses it to ~21x forward.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2077144125867184508" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">財報指引讚賞。「2.6 times to three times」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2077142990649164009" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">持倉績效回顧。「Up over 100% on $AEHR.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2077135710583472299" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">舊論點與獲利宣傳不作新方向票。「100% returns too?」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2077132045793497209" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">稱讚引用研究不等同自己買入。「🎯」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2077124987169730893" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Aehr财报前数据与测试优势分析，最后问读者持有/减仓，未表达作者股票方向。「Holding, trimming, or waiting?」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2077098700145639571" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面訂單進展。「this is the volume ramp starting.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2075210832401604870" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面價格與訂單反應。「Now up 11.29% today」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2067267047781015579" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">明說無新消息且回顧成果。「there’s nothing too new.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2061958857132585076" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确重申AEHR多方立场。「We have been bullish on AEHR」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2056162640762929593" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">既往选股及收益。「$AEHR is up close to 3x」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2053990690477195313" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">訂單及漲幅回顧。「+13% today on the news」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2044794468193476955" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">明確回顧過去交易收益。「$AEHR」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2044792665666138167" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">AEHR新订单业务评论与他人旧收益回顾，無作者股票方向。「they are winning HBM burn in orders」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2042464233036922983" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">持倉收益回顧。「$AEHR」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2042329398788178088" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">回顾AEHR过去涨幅与旧供货论点，未表达新投资方向。「$AEHR」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2042324781916438621" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">AEHR过去涨幅及未到业务催化，未明确新股票方向；他股为客户背景。「$AEHR is up +66%」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2041885544435609977" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">过去股价庆祝。「Up +20% today.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2041872946424377430" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">产品放量研究肯定。「$AEHR」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2041706026068799877" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">业务预期确认。「we got that confirmation.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2041612047058924009" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">条件性业务机会肯定。「If it can validate this with revenue, still super early.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2041229454215876757" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">过去涨幅及估值判断。「Up +14.28%」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2041157377928700262" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确用市场潜力与旧峰值市值论证AEHR当前投资不对称上行。「you can still buy the business today for a lower MC」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2040869275112812550" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">产品技术与客户背景。「$AEHR」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2040429214927568955" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">业务护城河肯定。「$AEHR owns Stage 2.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2040232894363512924" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">称烧机测试技术重要并引用他人AEHR论点，未形成作者投票。「$AEHR」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2039389419061588175" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">业务及相对估值赞许，非明确买卖方向。「looks extremely promising」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2039388766083944750" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">AEHR订单及盘前上涨消息，无明确作者新方向。「$AEHR」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2038971821635326368" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确预期该股估值上修。「trigger a massive rerating cycle for $AEHR」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2028893030330318868" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确当前多头持仓。「One of my long positions」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2027080026051731630" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:MSFT</span><span class="s-n">45 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-08-18 → 2026-09-28</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bear">賣出</span></span><span class="flip">3 人反轉</span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+1.6%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Bill &amp; Melinda Gates Foundation</b>：2026-01 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li><li><b>Davis Advisors</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Donald Trump</b>：2025-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> → 2026-07 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li><li><b>Josh Gottheimer</b>：2026-04 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> → 2026-08 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li><li><b>Jukan</b>：2026-04 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Kevin Hern</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li><li><b>Michael Burry</b>：2026-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> → 2026-08 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li><li><b>Rep. Cisneros</b>：2026-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-03 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Donald Trump</b> <span class="tag t-bear">賣出</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · up to $25 MILLION combined across AMZN and MSFT · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-09-28 <a href="https://x.com/DJTRadar/status/2104506526983446538" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Wolf Financial</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">轉述 Microsoft 擴大資料中心容量計畫的企業新聞，沒有作者自己對股價方向的評論。「Microsoft $MSFT plans to more than triple its global data center capacity from about 12 GW today to over 38 GW by 2032」 <a href="https://x.com/WOLF_Financial/status/2098156815695708668" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者把MSFT列為算力需求嚴重失衡、支撐輝達2027年1.3兆美元資本支出預測的證據，用來論證AI股只會續漲。「$MSFT / $GOOGL / $AMZN stating compute demand imbalances into next year, with Nvidia projecting $1.3T spend for 2027.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2095882424932766163" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Kevin Hern</b> <span class="tag t-bear">賣出</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · $50k · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-09-02 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2095151676474749173" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Windows負面玩笑不等同看空股價。「$MSFT Windows wiped out the Korean retail.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2094129989071536351" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">讨论他人历史成功及IPO估值反问，不产生作者方向。「buying $AAPL and $MSFT at IPO」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2089374997580251236" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">他人投资生涯与慈善故事，历史交易不归作者立场。「$MSFT at the 1986 IPO」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2089132875992175031" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Josh Gottheimer</b> <span class="tag t-bear">賣出</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · combined purchases and sales roughly $1.5M–$3M · 交易日 2026-08-14（原文：August 14） · 揭露 2026-09-16 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2100186364687835208" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Josh Gottheimer</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · combined purchases and sales roughly $1.5M–$3M · 交易日 2026-08-14（原文：August 14） · 揭露 2026-09-16 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2100186364687835208" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者否定做空这些云公司的盈利可能，并以强成长指引建立多方股票论点。「Shorting cloud companies is the fastest way to burn money right now.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2087541434333163660" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Davis Advisors</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-08-12 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2087462016743043247" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bear">賣出</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-08-04 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2084753613465833560" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-07-30 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2082908168351293908" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Donald Trump</b> <span class="tag t-bear">賣出</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · up to $25 million each · 交易日 2026-07-20（原文：July 20） · 揭露 2026-09-22 <a href="https://x.com/unusual_whales/status/2102452943043932654" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">競爭壓力。「$GOOGL, Apple, Microsoft, and others had some genuine disruptors.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2075894311741440041" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">担心Microsoft發債，無看空股價或投資動作。「其实很担心MSFT也会发债」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2075231275301081421" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品嘲諷語氣。「BRUH」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2075176016461656407" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · LEAPS expiring December 2028, $700 strike, stock at $352 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-07-08 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2074931666347286651" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">業務與員工事件負面情緒，不代表股價方向。「Sad to see Xbox getting gutted」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2074130729039212575" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-06-26 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2070403275636031748" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">預期業務與市場情緒改善，未明說股票方向。「think that will change down the road」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2069655980456149142" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">公司資源分配觀察。「MSFT will kill a lot of loss-making units to fund the CAPEX」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2069096193259663635" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">嘲讽Microsoft决策，非股票看空；两同业为引文比较。「Another Microsoft L」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2062992216600215869" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">评价Windows产品与英伟达推动作用，未形成股票投票。「Microsoft」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2061302971863040118" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Rep. Cisneros</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · up to $100k in shares · 交易日 2026-06-01（原文：this month） · 揭露 2026-06-28 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2071120921964765486" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Josh Gottheimer</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · up to $1.5M in options · 交易日 2026-06-01（原文：this month） · 揭露 2026-06-28 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2071120921964765486" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日 2026-06-01（原文：this month） · 揭露 2026-06-28 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2071120921964765486" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">产品竞争与Windows界面批评，非股票看空。「Windows OS UI weren’t a flaming pile of garbage」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2060755595515547753" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">讨论Qualcomm潜在客户并引用Microsoft芯片新闻，未形成股票方向。「Microsoft」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2057456522477899863" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品部署嘲諷。「LMAO」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2055005538069729451" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">预测MSFT提高资本支出，其他公司为引文财报背景，無股票方向。「MSFT will increase it」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2049574309358968847" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">已發生跌幅反應。「$MSFT」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2048758306492285055" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">赞同前句明确微软新长仓。「This might be the first time I’ve ever agreed with Burry.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2047440842856743388" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">惊讶微软员工买断新闻，没有股票方向。「$MSFT」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2047351530316300771" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品競爭正評。「$MSFT」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2047338240613769426" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确质疑继续做多IREN，投资看空；其他云企正面比较非明确股票看多。「looking derisked」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2046374163338912200" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确预期Riber重估上涨，但海外上市身份未核实；其他为供应商客户背景。「$MSFT」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2044695311764099291" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">已發生反彈。「$MSFT」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2044507444962070817" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">目前買入機會的正面類比。「It feels just like buying $MSFT right now」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2043661562096111751" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Josh Gottheimer</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · up to $1,000,000 in calls · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-04-09 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2042242945663803567" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">讨论Microsoft模型与AGI发展，非投资方向。「Microsoft」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2039738416834003053" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品時程負評。「Microsoft」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2039708104951222472" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">具体低估股票的未来资金轮动及反弹预期。「we should see capital rotations back into the American tech sector soon.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2036448156280561850" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Bill &amp; Melinda Gates Foundation</b> <span class="tag t-bear">賣出</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · ~7.7M shares worth $3.2B · 交易日 2026-01-01（原文：Q1 2026） · 揭露 2026-06-27 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2070780816460812444" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-08-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Donald Trump</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日 2025-08-18（原文：August 18, 2025） · 揭露 2026-07-01 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2072209361238372446" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:POET</span><span class="s-n">45 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-01-22 → 2026-08-31</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></span><span class="flip">1 人反轉</span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+5.1%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li><li><b>Ren</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-01 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> → 2026-03 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> → 2026-04 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">與ALMU、LWLG同被列為缺乏現金流支撐、跌回原點的早期光子概念股。「quantum stocks and early-stage photonic moonshots such as $ALMU, $POET, $LWLG gave back their entire runs」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2094494253267157010" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明確維持AAOI多頭及大倉位；對其他公司融資批評不等於看空股票。「I&#x27;ve said this before with $IREN + $POET.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2091843192639672553" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者在思考可放空的標的時表示「$POET always comes to mind」，暗示認為其估值過高，雖然最終認為做空不划算。「$POET always comes to mind, but at these valuations it doesn&#x27;t seem worth it.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2091555024727953479" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">被問到「哪檔股票最不理性/最誇張」時，作者直接回答POET，暗示認為該股評價脫離基本面，屬嘲諷性的看空表態。「The answer is always $POET」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2091395958990901276" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">競爭風險推測無明確股價方向。「Marvell probably vertically integrated players them out this year」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2090735668532224224" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者小倉買入POET且提出現金估值催化上行，AAOI明說清晰多頭；Sivers為技術比較。「that I thought it was compelling to take a risk.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2087846074027295020" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明示買入POET以催化與資產論點支持，Sivers為正面業務讀穿。「I actually took tiny positions in POET again after reading this news」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2085628664528662818" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">量產進度正面。「stating &quot;production&quot; with Sivers lasers projected EOY 2026.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2083114743729107236" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确长期持有Sivers、相信估值巨大扩张，其他公司为合作/同业资讯。「$POET starting HVM」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2074046947434860971" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">條件業務正評且無投資承諾。「I don&#x27;t own Poet, but if management delivers on these projections it directionally looks very positive.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2071488272245944399" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">供應鏈業務背景。「as seen with Ayar to $POET」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2070691462354993543" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">供應商猜測正面語氣。「$POET / $SIVE are going to power a Top-3 hyperscaler」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2069775271562289299" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确Sivers为最喜欢的激光瓶颈长仓，其他公司为合作佐证。「like $POET」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2068651355422814294" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确认为Sivers相对未来收入低估；其他公司为合作背景。「POET」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2061538735595069534" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">产品放量消息。「$POET H2 volume ramp」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2060002002994971046" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">業務及供應鏈資訊。「$POET」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2059057639238365336" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">批评POET及IREN营销与稀释融资，负面公司情绪不等于股票看空。「Fake it Until you make it award」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2056171199512891790" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">公司調查嘲諷。「LMAO」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2055465651020701948" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">相對估值批評，無其股價看空。「HAVE A HIGHER VALUATION THAN FOCI」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2055127004970938373" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">價格及訂單新聞。「$POET is up 22% premarket」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2054896661672210817" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确极度看多Sivers，并称AEVA放量对双方看多；其他为业务背景。「$POET」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2054868760629272850" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">情緒及價格反應。「does the universe just not like short sellers?」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2051694795270365584" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">以Sivers为核心论证未来市值上行，伙伴名单仅供应链背景。「$POET」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2051566667009073315" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">嘲讽POETCEO持股少，非股票看空。「CEO of $POET has shares」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2050791504147530193" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">公司及投資論點負評。「$POET」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2048876124852363498" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">中游角色負面評論。「$POET」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2048833654336729213" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">说明缺乏看多条件，主要为产品设计风险。「For me to be bullish, $POET would have needed」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2048817355141337188" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">取消訂單及跌幅。「$POET」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2048785899610427809" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">批评POET披露及管理行为，明确没有持仓但未表达股价方向。「$POET」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2048777474851610689" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">致敬他人POET订单损失报道，不能推作者股价立场。「$POET getting spanked」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2048762715003560208" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">嘲笑POET订单取消，情绪不等于投资方向。「POET」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2048754271764824352" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">批评POET CEO并引用旧供应关系观点，未明确股票买卖方向。「POET」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2048752304174792887" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">以Sivers市值及未来需求错配论证上行，其他公司仅客户供应链背景。「$POET」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2047209727738957983" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确POET及Sivers未充分定价，低估看多；Marvell为客户背景。「Markets haven&#x27;t fully priced in either yet imo.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2046918449168085183" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">當日漲跌或訂單新聞，未明示方向。「$POET」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2046894773706035638" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">已發生漲幅。「$POET」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2046879187076817237" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">供應商消息。「POET」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2046719740664791275" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确预计所偏爱的三只激光股票在更好宏观环境继续上涨。「$POET」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2041650903305089389" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">质疑他人相对估值选择，但未明确卖出或股价下跌。「calling for $POET at 7x the valuation」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2037698708612210693" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确主张做多Sivers和Win供应链；Win海外身份未核实，同行为架构背景。「$POET」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2037442444367974907" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确继续持有Sivers并给出百亿美元多头情景；同行为业务比较。「$POET」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2033535833085718996" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">假设改名提高估值的玩笑，未构成实际投资方向。「$POET」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2033033107557986332" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确对IRENPOET过量ATM看空；AAOI融资抱怨但仍预计增益，无单一空方。「I’m extremely bearish when it comes to excessive ATMs for any company like $IREN or $POET」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2032198562877227199" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确POET价格的长期风险报酬吸引及重估预期，看多；其他为合作比较。「Risk/reward at $6.64 with a Celestial backdoor to hyperscalers seems promising」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2029839589444374560" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者当前买入行动。「I personally ended up buying at this level」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2014444695821472218" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">LSE:IQE</span><span class="s-n">42 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-02-25 → 2026-09-07</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-02 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">彭博報導指磷化銦基板正成為半導體產業關鍵風險，作者把IQE放入同一脈絡強化其供給稀缺看多論述。「New report from Bloomberg on $IQE: &quot;indium phosphide substrates is emerging as a key risk for the semiconductor industry.&quot;」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2096904209371427277" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者將IQE列為自己至今仍上漲逾100%的磊晶圓主題持股。「6. $IQE - Epiwafers」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2096814311306129776" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者稱IQE是「量子點代工的領導者」，並對其與Quintessent簽訂採購協議稱為「好消息」。「$IQE is actually a quantum dot foundry leader believe it or not... Good news nevertheless」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2095460499769155944" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">对材料涨价受益正面，未明确股价或仓位方向。「I also wrote a thesis on $IQE, which benefits here too」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2089165155741622679" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">英国英镑收入与光学III-V外延片IQE明确，核验AIM:IQE；作者仍做多。「my $IQE thesis Feb this year got validated alongside $AXTI and others. (I still long on both)」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2087838176677376186" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">讨论上游光材料价格和机构报告，不直接给该股方向。「$AXTI and $IQE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2074007618046345249" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">InP外延片供应商IQE明确，核验AIM:IQE；业务协议称赞非投资方向。「$IQE and $TSEM sign a multi year InP epiwafer deal.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2066421816793714938" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">外延晶圆语境明确IQE plc，官方公告标明AIM:IQE；作者乐见产业产能解除，未给该股的新交易或价格判断。「$IQE (epiwafers)」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2066340661633372452" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确当前持有该股。「have positions in IQE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2065333919252418913" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">全文西方光学供应链制造企业语境明确IQE，核验AIM普通股；旧自引政策支持非新增股票票。「$IQE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2065114293767741950" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">明确欧洲光子供应链股票IQE，对应官方公告AIM伦敦IQE；庆祝旧买入后的价格上涨，没有新增投资方向。「only European stock green today: $IQE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2061466217911853429" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">欧洲半导体政策与明确IQE持仓语境，对应官方公告AIM伦敦IQE；旧持仓披露没有新股票交易或价格方向。「my longs there (aside from $IQE)」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2059561586956837085" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">光子供应链、自引AXTI比较明确IQE外延业务，对应官方AIM:IQE；作者仍预期超过已获三倍回报，表达未来上涨期待。「I had higher hopes so far with $IQE than 3x+」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2058938658045239481" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">歐洲光子股票確認IQE；作者預期此價任何回檔被買走，為前瞻看多。「These are all core players going forward, hard to see any dip not being bought out at these levels.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2057008127917347125" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">全文明确IQE外延晶圆业务，官方公告AIM:IQE吻合；作者预期包括IQE在内的标的三四年后显著更高，表达长期看多。「important players in the Western word for epiwafers」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2055822766600016238" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">明确IQE光子供应链股票代码确认伦敦AIM普通股，非IQEF；历史上涨回顾没有新方向。「$IQE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2055107276575588612" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">光子供應鏈自引確認IQE；本則回顧四倍漲幅沒有新投資方向。「$IQE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2053794972663754849" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">明确股票代码IQE且未涉及OTC或其他股类，官方公司公告确认AIM伦敦IQE；回顾机构买入自己旧研究标的，不等于新增作者方向。「institution start buying up names like $AXTI, $SOI, or $IQE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2052662451418861957" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">机构持股与历史行情/媒体批評，未给该股当前方向。「or Point72 with $IQE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2050272539851821157" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">明确光学外延片供应商及Macom战略投资业务语境，核验AIM:IQE；业务进展非作者新投资方向。「$IQE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2048822871527682152" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">當日漲跌或訂單新聞，未明示方向。「$IQE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2046894773706035638" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">旧成果回顧。「$IQE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2045723587966107858" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">明確回顧過去交易收益。「$IQE」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2044792665666138167" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明示未來投資收益方向。「Probably expect them all to compound another triple digits from here」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2044682729128874210" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">明确IQE股票流通盘确认伦敦AIM普通股；机构争抢与行情评论无明确作者方向。「$IQE float」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2043599807487652112" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">明确股票IQE且无OTC或其他份额指称，官方公司公告确认AIM伦敦IQE；作者讽刺并庆祝历史涨幅，没有新增股票方向。「$IQE a “pump and dump” stock」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2043315043455176826" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">英镑债务、外延晶圆业务与IQE股票代码确认伦敦AIM普通股；主段回顾涨幅与过去10倍比较，旧持仓引用不新增方向。「$IQE (Epi-Wafers)」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2042549185095045231" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">歐洲光子產業確認IQE普通股；當日反彈及宏觀壓力判斷無單股新方向。「$IQE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2041791434525962584" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">IQE过去收益与自引旧研究，無新方向。「$IQE turned out well」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2036792154463551658" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">外延晶圆及英镑财务、IQE股票语境确认伦敦AIM普通股；主段回顾一月收益，旧持仓引用不新增方向。「the epiwafer level」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2034224630429630974" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者未来估值上行及当前愿承担投资风险。「to be re-rated as a billion dollar company」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2032943522891051319" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">旧引用中的投资论点，当前没有新的方向。「$IQE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2029189271572365661" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">涨幅回顾，没有新增买卖方向。「up 62.53% this week」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2028754498710290457" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者预期AXTI及IQE还有上涨空间，投资看多；LITE和NVDA为催化背景。「Companies like $AXTI and possibly $IQE likely have a long way to go.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2028511702288085093" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确投资为五项光学股尾风，当前股票看多；NVDA投资者背景。「This is a massive tailwind for photonics stocks」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2028464631195574674" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">旧业务拖累评价，不直接提出投资方向。「similar to $IQE, there’s tons of legacy drag」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2028203665430057068" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确认为IQE重估及AAOIAXTI相关业务价值未计价，看多；其他为订单背景或估值拥挤比较。「to be rerated more like their $3.65B friend」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2027830093247300016" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明確做多。「I personally decided to enter this long」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2027318568728273305" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确近期加仓。「I’ve personally added recently」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2027275242628948103" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确高回报股票判断。「10x return-stock」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2026934223416734052" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确作为光子供应链股票介绍IQE，确认伦敦AIM普通股；潜在赢家希望与未来复盘玩笑未明确买卖或估值方向。「$IQE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2026647347237966298" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">外延晶圆及英镑财务确认伦敦AIM普通股；作者明确拥有股票并论述可能重估，表达多头。「I do own $IQE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2026638711941902461" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:PLTR</span><span class="s-n">42 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-01-01 → 2026-10-04</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="flip">2 人反轉</span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+0.7%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>ARK</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li><li><b>Alex Karp</b>：2026-02 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li><li><b>Cleo Fields</b>：2025-10 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Donald Trump</b>：2026-03 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Gil Cisneros</b>：2025-12 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>James Comer</b>：2025-01 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Jonathan Jackson</b>：2026-01 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Marjorie Taylor Greene</b>：2025-03 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Michael Burry</b>：2025-01 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> → 2026-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> → 2026-08 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> → 2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> → 2026-09 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li><li><b>Peter Thiel</b>：2026-03 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li><li><b>Ren</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-02 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> → 2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Unusual Whales</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">options_flow 帳號純粹陳述 Palantir 內部人持續賣股、無人買進的數據，沒有作者對股價方向的明確判斷。「Palantir, $PLTR, insiders keep selling, and nobody is buying.」 <a href="https://x.com/unusual_whales/status/2106761511049830673" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bear">放空</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-09-22 <a href="https://x.com/unusual_whales/status/2102502696804851816" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，作者對PLTR與NBIS合作表達明確看多態度「My quant gets it. Be on the right side of history or be forgotten. Bullish AF ⚡️⚡️⚡️」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2097334761190551917" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，作者對PLTR與NBIS的主權AI合作案表達興奮並看多後市「$NBIS x $PLTR is exactly the kind of news that has you grinning ear to ear」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2097333852121264315" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，PLTR與NBIS合作被作者視為當天AI基建正面消息「Plus the $NBIS + $PLTR partnership. Big morning for AI infrastructure.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2097332258386403456" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者認為Palantir將Nebius選為首選主權AI基建夥伴意義重大，且強調Palantir與美國政府/企業的既有關係。「Palantir also named Nebius its preferred sovereign AI infrastructure partner. The implications are potentially significant considering Palantir&#x27;s existing relations with the US Gov + Enterprises.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2097327653116363127" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>ARK</b> <span class="tag t-bear">賣出</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · trimmed · 交易日 2026-09-08（原文：Tuesday） · 揭露 2026-09-10 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2098016354250973657" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bull">回補</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · big win · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-08-19 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2090185752709616113" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bear">放空</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-08-11 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2087276225727271035" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">已發生漲幅反應，不將舊自引當新票。「盘后+15.88%」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2084534252138643603" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Alex Karp</b> <span class="tag t-bear">賣出</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · another $86 million · 交易日 2026-08-01（原文：in August） · 揭露 2026-10-04 <a href="https://x.com/unusual_whales/status/2106761511049830673" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Gil Cisneros</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日 2026-07-01（原文：July） · 揭露 2026-09-07 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2096953457076768902" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">私人Flock业务与监控产业文章预告，Palantir仅成长类比。「I found the next $PLTR.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2070829495095804187" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bull">回補</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-06-25 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2070249062134129005" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Donald Trump</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 100-250K, again · 交易日 2026-06-24（原文：June 24th） · 揭露 2026-08-22 · 4 則報導 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2094502266619281612" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文1</a> <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2091280865196155079" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文2</a> <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2091342813317181493" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文3</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Donald Trump</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-05-29 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2060277367298204149" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Donald Trump</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-05-28 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2060119682510725400" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Donald Trump</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-05-14 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2054919028393574455" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bear">放空</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-05-12 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2054245428531536109" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">對持有PLTR的明確否定並偏好其他投資。「Don&#x27;t really understand people holding $PLTR」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2051745678108577997" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bear">放空</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · puts on 5 million shares · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-05-03 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2050913184677003450" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>James Comer</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-04-10 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2042666799280644549" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Gil Cisneros</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-04-08 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2041879760129712331" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">产品价值维护，非股票方向。「Palantir’s black box AI programs」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2032287950403485764" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">看好整体AI产业并称Palantir发挥作用，未明确个股投资方向。「$PLTR」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2028007393582621071" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Peter Thiel</b> <span class="tag t-bear">賣出</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 2 million shares for $290 million · 交易日 2026-03-01（原文：in March） · 揭露 2026-10-04 <a href="https://x.com/unusual_whales/status/2106761511049830673" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Donald Trump</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · up to $530K · 交易日 2026-03-01（原文：March） · 揭露 2026-05-14 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2054966449043595282" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">媒体引用趣闻及旧观点回顾，没有新投资方向。「$PLTR」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2024197302278377541" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">反驳Burry比较方法，旧自引高估判断不构成新投票。「$PLTR」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2022849280386699683" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确认为Palantir股票高估；Hubspot是比较背景。「I think Palantir is overvalued」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2022570998525235566" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Alex Karp</b> <span class="tag t-bear">賣出</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · $65.9 million · 交易日 2026-02-01（原文：in Feb） · 揭露 2026-10-04 <a href="https://x.com/unusual_whales/status/2106761511049830673" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jonathan Jackson</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-01-09 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2009651203685429731" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bear">放空</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-01-05 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2008255886851240041" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Gil Cisneros</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · up to $30K · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2025-12-16 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2000942989791912410" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">生成内容中的条件性负面风险。「股价短期或跌5-10%」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/1992649855601410502" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bear">放空</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2025-11-03 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/1985464359750140237" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Cleo Fields</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2025-10-31 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/1984262129835450387" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">旧价格跌幅与风险新闻。「pltr -8%」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/1974176380113072395" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-07-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bear">放空</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · ~$912M notional (puts) · 交易日 2025-07-01（原文：Q3 2025） · 揭露 2026-06-25 · 2 則報導 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2090185752709616113" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文1</a> <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2070249062134129005" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文2</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-03-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Marjorie Taylor Greene</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日 2025-03-31（原文：on the same week） · 揭露 2025-10-02 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/1973831573943238699" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-01-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>James Comer</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日 2025-01-01（原文：at the start of this year） · 揭露 2025-09-19 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/1969080923703382162" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-01-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bear">放空</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · put options on 5 million shares · 交易日 2025-01-01（原文：2025） · 揭露 2026-05-08 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2052628472154013794" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:QCOM</span><span class="s-n">42 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-04-14 → 2026-09-27</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="flip">1 人反轉</span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-1.4%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Jukan</b>：2026-04 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> → 2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-04 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">活動稱讚。「Incredible time at the $QCOM Snapdragon Summit.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2104346402495279300" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">股價低估XR上行機會。「Investors give XR no credit on the stock, but it feels like free upside.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2103250877150814578" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">穿戴产品与高通供货预测，没有明确股票方向。「all will be $QCOM powered.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2102848921274138649" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">高通CFO访谈预告，公司正面语气而非股票方向。「a $200B chip giant is reinventing itself to own the future.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2102747308924555352" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">CEO言論及HBC技術說明，無股票方向。「higher AI performance with much better power efficiency」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2102483643092681160" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">尋找機會的研究計畫，尚未明說股票看多。「I&#x27;ll be hunting for asymmetric upside around $QCOM&#x27;s role」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2102200852744376655" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">CPU需求預估低估消費採用，四股前瞻受益論點。「Could be an order of magnitude higher.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2102073980559692168" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品代號稱讚。「Qualcomm’s CPU is codenamed Rolex? That’s pretty cool.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2101996196252495974" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者興奮確認先前提到高通為字節跳動與亞馬遜提供ASIC客製晶片服務的消息已正式官宣，語氣暗示看好高通跨入這項新業務「It&#x27;s finally been officially announced.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2097451916611682708" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，QCOM與AMZN合作被作者列為當天AI基建利多消息之一「$AMZN + $QCOM: multiple generations of AI infrastructure and optical connectivity up to 1.6T and beyond.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2097332258386403456" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者以「第二個雲端大廠客戶」形容QCOM與AMZN的40億美元客製晶片合作案,並重申先前「QCOM近期上檔在其CPU業務」的看多論述。「A SECOND HYPERSCALER FOR $QCOM.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2097327800537714984" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">AMZN與QCOM簽約使QCOM有機會獲得最多60億美元里程碑營收，作者明確說對QCOM更有利。「This of course is linked with up to $60B in milestone revenue from Amazon/Qualcomm custom silicon partnership. Good for both companies, moreso Qualcomm.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2097321349555306512" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者以興奮語氣強調QCOM與AMZN合作AI晶片與1.6T光通訊是搶佔光學超級週期紅利的好消息「Now $QCOM is partnering with $AMZN on custom AI inference chips AND optical connectivity up to 1.6T and beyond.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2097315161732272580" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">他人競爭風險分析。「Handset remains a drag」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2078056661550588377" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">要求更换高通管理层，公司负面语气而非股票看空。「replace the current management team」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2066657381740933419" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">公司人才負評。「All the Nuvia people have left」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2066629071015149840" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">供需正面。「Qualcomm」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2059649209142505641" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">确认旧预测的Qualcomm业务消息，不等于股票投票。「$QCOM」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2059286760866361584" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者當前股票推介及低估論點。「Look no further than $QCOM.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2057864175175753876" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">希望Qualcomm并购成功属于公司战略偏好，无股票买卖观点。「Qualcomm」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2056905041660031048" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Qualcomm出货与客户传闻，未表达作者投资方向。「$QCOM」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2055079495774949439" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">持倉加未來催化論點。「The real catalyst is still ahead.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2053864381339898002" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">期權市場流向觀察，非作者投資方向。「$QCOM」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2053849143454716246" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">当前持有看涨期权并肯定未来催化。「have no intention of selling」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2053836604364800336" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">过去交易回顾。「Textbook multiple / IV expansion trade.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2051813885930549517" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">觀察清單及業務低估論點。「$QCOM」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2049965509198889094" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">團隊離職負面故事。「QCOM」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2049825120311755229" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者怀疑QCOM今年能股价反弹，当前对其投资观点看空；Apple为成本背景。「I’m skeptical that Qualcomm can stage a meaningful rebound within this year.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2049625970198589689" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确当前做多。「I&#x27;m long $QCOM as an asymmetrical bet.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2049608562788454823" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">既往研究成功及價格回顧。「CALLED IT.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2049588055003263315" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">前瞻經營成本負評。「Memory prices will bite Qcom hard」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2049580429683143073" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明示股票重估上行。「there is clear potential for multiple expansion.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2049237999217783119" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">對重估条件保持疑慮，未明示看空股價。「until it proves it can supply data centers.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2048777928276918692" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">转述MediaTek芯片与产能消息和研报，目标价来自他人。「Qualcomm」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2048684249239412829" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">询问是否撰写Qualcomm多头论点，尚未表达自己的投资结论。「$QCOM」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2048588853150396790" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确认为Qualcomm估值提供廉价AI上行并推荐CPU既有公司，虽低确信度仍有方向。「very cheap AI upside」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2048512944947020048" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">條件性催化及情緒研究，無交易承諾。「reverse the current overly short-biased sentiment.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2047816848058794440" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品傳聞質疑。「Qualcomm」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2047670286825537775" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Qualcomm产品上市传闻，无股票方向。「Qualcomm」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2047667356294680962" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">批评Qualcomm过去战略，自引CPU创业分析，非当前股票看空。「legendary stupid moves」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2044685702764609783" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">长文分析Nuvacore创业、CPU行业及企业战略，未表达上市股票买卖方向。「Qualcomm」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2044684410289852753" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">产品合作评价。「Qualcomm working with CXMT」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2043955358713126927" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:SKHY</span><span class="s-n">42 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-03-24 → 2026-09-21</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+7.3%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Ren</b>：2026-07 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Zephyr</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li><li><b>大老师</b>：2026-07 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者仍長倉且以估值與合約支持看多所述記憶體公司。「I&#x27;m still long memory」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2101906175046635887" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明確SKHY cashtag已驗證為美國ADR；超級週期看多。「Memory like $MU / $SKHY is in it&#x27;s current supercycle.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2100938001077674262" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">海力士与Intel合作的正面反应，未给股票方向。「$INTC $SKHY」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2100100174463029368" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">转述记忆体供需与涨价，否认行业放缓但未明确股票方向。「Some color on current memory environments for the $MU / $SKHY bros:」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2099674926697545849" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明確ADR代碼，配合中期多方結論。「With names like $SKHY / Samsung」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2099659874892386678" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">列出持股清單並明說自己是全場最多方，喊「送它更高」「Tens of trillions, baby. Send it higher.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2098081185620467855" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">質疑其高頻寬記憶體龍頭地位能否保住，理由是三星基底晶片更好且擴產更快「Not too sure if Hynix will retain the number 1 position in HBM」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2098018599466111294" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">高頻寬記憶體推升中國 AI 加速器售價 20 到 50%，作者明說記憶體廠應該樂見，且自陳做多記憶體「So $SKHY, Samsung, $MU, should be happy to hear this」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2097937708178186303" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上,作者將SKHY與BE、NBIS並列為應繼續持有的贏家標的(公司具體背景不確定,但看多語氣明確)。「$SKHY is the next $SKHY.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2095357790613065806" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">需求及短缺支持估值上升。「整个板块的远期 p/e 倍数都有进一步上升的机会」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2093252439973777674" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确预期记忆体股票回到历史高点且长期持有，作者看多；Kioxia身份待核实。「All memory is going higher. We will get back to the ATH prices we had just 2 months ago.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2089420093910401501" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">明確ADR代碼供需觀察。「demand imbalance visibility for $SNDK, $SKHY, $MU」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2089264987328151637" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">明示ADR代碼，業務受益評述。「$MU, $SKHY, and Samsung are happy」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2088457278928412812" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">本文明確SKHY cashtag；買入方向。「Buy the fear」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2087956934213218456" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">具名SKHY對應持續做多。「I’m still long memory」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2086476013119123683" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者直接表達所列記憶體股票看多。「Bullish memory ⚡️」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2086473937299419168" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者重申三股利潤持續增长與看多，明確方向。「Bullish, just not crazy 1000%-in-a-year bullish.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2086177224940564928" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明確ADR代碼長期多方。「memory is now more than ever one of the best investments up until 2030.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2086088646600368607" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">引用明確ADR比較，負面總反應不直接看空。「SKHY ADR shrs」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2085569668950249843" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">明確ADR cashtag；業務利好。「Win for the whole memory ecosystem. Specially $MU $SKHY Samsung」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2085353865323372801" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">漲停價格回顧，無作者方向；明示SKHY。「SK HYNIX HITS THE DAILY LIMIT UP」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2083064642524610962" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">海力士股价不要回落的情绪呼吁，未给确定预测。「Don’t you dare rolling over $SKHY」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2082982160080814479" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">海力士已下跌的情绪反应，无未来股票方向。「Look at how they massacred my boy $SKHY」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2082297666722033874" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">財報澄清正面語氣，價格反應非股票票。「headline miss was way overblown.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2082256353561661663" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">明確美國ADR背景的財報揶揄，不是股票看空。「US ADR listing」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2082253001490641022" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">海力士业绩失望反应，不是看空方向。「Yikes 😬 $SKHY」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2082243271951094196" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面財報類比，未明示股票上漲或買入。「$SKHY reports tonight into the same setup.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2082220837264900453" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">自己的明確價格支撑預測，明示ADR美元交易。「财报后 不会跌破 90刀」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2082127174006673848" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">跌幅情緒反應。「My god memory is taking a beating…」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2081916429981413811" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">合作正面語氣。「$SKHY 🤝 $INTC」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2080084566316867655" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者以DDR5價格與利潤持續增長支持記憶股，明示看多；韓股和ADR均在原文列出。「Bullish memory.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2079349851448328447" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">预测海力士ADR溢价压缩，但本地涨或ADR跌仍是不确定情境，无绝对股价方向。「likely compress the ADR premium.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2078338950150959558" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">本人長倉與低估論點；明示SKHY。「one of my top 5 favorite stocks to own, and I&#x27;m long since January」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2078180613534744858" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">他人建議非作者方向。「This Is Not the Time to Sell Samsung Electronics and $SKHY」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2077955479742173422" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">他人財報預期。「positive view on SK hynix’s second-quarter results.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2077366994702332337" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">明確ADR身份，價格新聞。「SK HYNIX ADRS INDICATED TO OPEN AT $180」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2075579792221741135" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">持倉過去表現回顧與推廣，無新方向判斷。「$SK Hynix debuting」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2075288227284422707" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">研究SKhynix預告與他人認購意向新聞，無作者明確方向。「SK Hynix $SKHY is raising」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2074283158074253316" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确美光短期受压判断；三星与海力士为事件变量，不外推方向。「海力士上市决定资金会不会重新分流。」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2074153915726410037" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">上市新聞情緒。「BOOM $SKHY」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2071992500554772922" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">明示ADR，第三方上市與估值預期。「SK hynix ADR issuance timeline」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2064500667004416258" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">ADR新闻与可能重估，非作者买卖。「SK hynix begins selecting underwriters for potential U.S. ADR issuance」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2036304579734938063" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:AVGO</span><span class="s-n">41 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-12-01 → 2026-10-01</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="flip">2 人反轉</span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+1.6%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Jukan</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> → 2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2025-12 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> → 2026-08 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> → 2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li><li><b>Shelley Moore Capito</b>：2026-03 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Zephyr</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>大老师</b>：2026-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">轉述 Anthropic 向 Broadcom 購買算力的數字，只說很有趣，没有股票方向判斷。「Very interesting」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2105607529372004492" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者認為 Broadcom 2027 年採購量將大幅增加並提升議價能力，屬基本面改善。「Broadcom’s volumes in 2027 will be massive.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2105581560632312312" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">在反駁股價崩盤的投資論點中明示成長保障。「$NVDA / $AVGO supply constrained 70-100%+ Y/Y growth」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2099229447304122410" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者指出AVGO的AI營收未來兩年年增率上看100%以上、從約500億衝到2300億美元，明確看多。「$AVGO AI revenue growing 100%+ Y/Y for next 2 years from mid ~$50B -&gt; $230B」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2095882424932766163" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者將OpenAI公布的資料中心電力目標換算成Jalapeno（博通為OpenAI設計的客製化AI晶片代號）出貨量，估計2028年出貨將暴增至約450萬顆，並形容這是「Big ramp（大幅放量）」，顯示看多博通的出貨成長。「nearly 4.5M Jalapeno Gen1 equivalents in 2028 Big ramp」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2095572252654026991" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者形容AVGO執行長宣布AI晶片營收三倍成長、明年再翻倍、2028再翻倍的說法「insane」，顯示對公司成長前景高度看多。「The CEO of $AVGO just said something insane. They tripled AI chip revenue. They&#x27;ll double AI chip revenue next year.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2095561716822352175" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者引述Hock Tan說法,強調Anthropic將於2027年部署到5GW TPU、2028年再增至10GW,且與Google的多年期供貨持續加碼,呈現明確的成長性正面敘事。「Anthropic is on track to become our largest XPU customer in 2027 and sustain that in 2028.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2095526205403418928" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者反問市場：AVGO是押注兩大最具變革性公司（OpenAI、Anthropic）的槓桿標的，共識卻認為這兩家很可能無法有效變現稀缺算力，形容這是「不對稱的投資機會」，暗示他看多AVGO被低估。「It&#x27;s giving asymmetric bet.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2095322648678965557" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者引述AVGO執行長表示雷射需求「遠超供給」，並稱這是「對雷射類股振奮人心的驗證」。「Exciting validation for laser companies」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2095279986701951461" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同一句話中作者將博通與輝達的財測並列形容為「monstrous」，顯示對博通同樣高度看多。「Monstrous guides from Nvidia and now Broadcom」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2095263732935065972" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者直接表態財報後的盤後跌幅是「反應過度」，因為財測遠高於市場預期。「think the few percent AH selloff was an overreaction」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2095261816767283663" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">同上,屬於財報預測命中率的事後戰績回顧,非目前新立場。「4中3 谢谢大家」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2095244650944897202" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者直言Nvidia此舉會產生「侵蝕AVGO地位」的次級效應。「a second order effect of eroding $AVGO position」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2094416430032896428" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者推測此舉「或許也是為了防堵$AVGO」，暗示對AVGO競爭地位略偏負面，但未明確斷言看跌。「(maybe to fend off $AVGO as well)」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2094405648293482965" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">博通長期仰賴三星供應HBM,先前三星HBM3E技術落後曾是博通ASIC業務的劣勢,如今三星HBM4反超後,同樣的供應關係轉為博通的優勢。「now that Samsung has pulled ahead of its competitors with HBM4, the same sourcing relationship has become an advantage for Jalapeño」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2094204360800833602" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">股東批評Sivers溝通與資本配置，沒有看空或賣出；其他公司為業務比較與自引背景。「$AVGO style acquisitions」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2093652781928448279" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明確表示因 NVIDIA 已鎖定大量記憶體產能,非 NVIDIA 陣營(包含 Broadcom)的出貨預測可能要下修。「We may need to lower our shipment forecasts for the non-NVIDIA camp, including AMD and Broadcom.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2092728744754774338" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者只表達對$AVGO股價轉跌感到困惑意外（「literally insane」「Topsy turvy land」），未說明自己認為後市會漲或跌。「watching $AVGO flip red today is literally insane. Topsy turvy land, gents.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2092312860873613807" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">提到2027年量產爬升後緊接標註$AVGO，暗示Broadcom是Jalapeño晶片量產的受惠廠商。「Mass production ramps in 2027. $AVGO」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2092259903561666737" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确更看多有产能的既有CPO激光公司，AAOI供需新闻不看空，其他仅客户/竞争资料。「Just more bullish on the existing few qualified CPO laser names that have capacity.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2085603590903902621" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">毛利競爭顧慮非股票看空。「I also have doubts about whether Broadcom can continue to defend its high margins.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2074765232124408119" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">自己的明確前瞻正面股價方向。「明天将会走出阴霾」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2071953488825979198" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Broadcom高管議價能力正面比喻。「Jensen (more like 2400 pound) &amp; Hock」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2070674114600436039" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">建設規模可行性與融資風險。「physically impossible for a new player to deploy 20GW in 2 years」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2062936282922463324" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">反驳媒体叙事，肯定需求但无独立股票方向。「Broadcom projected insatiable demand into 2028」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2062927167936504133" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">财报需求肯定。「$AVGO earnings transcript」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2062322546809381094" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Broadcom利润率可持续性反问，不是明确看空。「Do you really think Broadcom’s margin is sustainable?」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2062305379099480092" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确买入Broadcom并预期拉回445，杠杆ETF不当股票。「NFA 我自己夜盘先买了点」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2062288282617339992" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者預期上游股票受益上漲。「Upstream ecosystem from $LITE to $AVGO to Mediatek to $TSM to $MU should go brrr.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2061596599588114444" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">供需正面。「Broadcom」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2059649209142505641" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">GoogleCOT传闻与Broadcom营收利润担忧，业务负面不等于股票看空。「makes me more worried about Broadcom」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2048992506851868780" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">直接正向投资选择。「going long on Broadcom and Marvell doesn’t hurt too.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2048929438679896317" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">三星电机供应Broadcom新闻；三星电机及其他海外零件公司身份未核实。「Broadcom」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2046521336106004977" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Shelley Moore Capito</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-04-10 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2042598745401950500" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">转述CPO量产和良率产业消息，未表达作者股票方向。「Broadcom」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2042152380934893600" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">批评短期期权并明确估计MRVL两三年可能翻倍；其他股票为过去交易例子。「$AVGO」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2040269140855083041" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Shelley Moore Capito</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-03-05 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2029584915839291503" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Shelley Moore Capito</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-03-04 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2029252206046609446" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确三股回调为买点，看多。「Recent drop across the board presents a good opportunity for these three.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2023600495353622546" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确当前股票买点。「Is this a buying opportunity?

Yes.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/1999575509462843833" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者在供应链研究后明确新建LITE仓位；其余公司为业务供应链或客户背景，不能据此逐股投票。「Broadcom [ $AVGO ]」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/1995543748353347989" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:GOOG</span><span class="s-n">40 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-04-01 → 2026-10-02</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+0.4%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Berkshire Hathaway</b>：2025-11 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Katie Britt</b>：2025-04 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-10 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>大老师</b>：2026-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者認為 Google 的既有密碼資料將成為 agent 產品的真正護城河，正面看待基本面。「will be the real moat.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2106133816935088623" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">列出股價回撤與 Gemini 能力改善，屬原因解讀，沒有明確買進或價格方向。「Their latest model Gemini 4 Argon closes several gaps」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2105432526634602861" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品競爭力稱讚，未表投資方向。「Google is 39% cheaper than Astra and 67% cheaper than Opus.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2105399799067693421" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品讚賞不直接代表股價方向。「This is literally the best model in the world. Congrats, Google.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2105389362078691336" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">條件式廣告風險比較，無直接股票票。「$GOOG which could see ads disrupted.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2102162571394740433" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Berkshire Hathaway</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · $4 billion stake · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-08-28 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2093426380939632733" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">人事情緒而無股票方向。「The jig is up for Google ☹️」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2086138994136608823" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">惊讶Google高层离职传闻，未把他人股价预测变成作者方向。「What the f is this.... Hassabis was planning to leave DeepMind?」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2086079364148641933" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">業務盈利称讚。「GCP is basically a money-printing machine.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2085568297148580004" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">明确看多Sandisk并论述未定价HBF再评级潜力。「Google and Tenstorrent now in the consortium」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2084498388188365264" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">需求正面背景，非Google投資方向。「$GOOG revised their capex up yesterday」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2080295546179465262" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">市場對盈利回報的正面解讀，不直接作者股價方向。「市场对CapEx的担忧至少阶段性消失了」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2080221517309432162" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">纠正Google云营收资料解读，不是股票方向。「This is the actual cloud business」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2080090198117884406" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者以Google扩大外部产能开支明确看好Nebius受益；Google财报股价反应无未来方向。「GOOG财报利好 $GOOG」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2080040076869013784" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面財報反應。「$119B in ONE fucking quarter.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2080034930189541385" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面業務投資效益評價。「keeps a $180B to $190B capex year defensible」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2080030275707285976" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">预计Google资本开支不会减少是经营需求判断，没有股票回报方向。「Nothing about tonight points toward less. IMO」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2080004954467828034" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品負評。「why is Gemini Pro 3.5 so shitty and Google is postponing」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2078169236439175526" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品與供應顧慮。「engineers are hitting capacity constraints」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2077838168959922576" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">負面產品能力評價，未表股票看空。「Google is a lot behind」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2075241700155625551" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">本人前瞻上行看法，超過純資金流數據。「个人看法是 7.2之后的走势也许会更好」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2071955190786506980" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">算力供應新聞。「Google reportedly limited Meta’s use of Gemini」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2071126659307385321" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">舊自引訴訟背景。「向 Google 索赔」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2070602591831200048" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Klarna诉讼胜率与期权状态观察，没有明确股票回报方向。「向 Google 索赔 83 亿美元」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2070222767644127434" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">嘲讽Google模型开发能力，不当股票看空。「They are bad at LLM development」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2069411867068600651" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面產品與研發消息，不等於股票方向。「developing Google’s CPU as well?」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2069266963965350136" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">公司策略負評。「should have allocated compute to GDM」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2068015347735974261" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">业务成長比較。「GCP isn&#x27;t showing similar growth」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2065917834912522662" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">肯定技术路径。「Google and Huawei are adopting NPO first」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2063621156444455165" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">當下價格反應。「暴跌中」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2062962265570353365" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">模型性能稱讚。「Google」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2056790445343322438" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">技术业务乐观。「Google V9」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2052010162769301810" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">业务订单乐观。「Expect another 5GW TPU deal」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2047710440608891212" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">公司AI能力稱讚。「Google」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2044945035108790572" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">泛正面评价。「orcl goog meta 都挺不错的」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2044094110030803283" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">产品放量称赞。「Impressive Axion ramp projection」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2041448101077291098" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">論文負面評論。「Google」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2037579531285102748" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Berkshire Hathaway</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · $4.3B · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2025-11-24 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/1992975674726924657" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Berkshire Hathaway</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · $4.3B · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2025-11-14 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/1989444137767333943" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-04-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Katie Britt</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日 2025-04-01（原文：April） · 揭露 2026-01-27 · 2 則報導 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2016932328610685304" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文1</a> <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2016175548209250789" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文2</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:GOOGL</span><span class="s-n">39 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-02-05 → 2026-10-01</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="flip">1 人反轉</span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+0.2%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Berkshire Hathaway</b>：2026-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Ren</b>：2026-07 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> → 2026-09 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Warren Buffett</b>：2026-04 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>大老师</b>：2026-06 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">回顧本週新聞交易與自稱勝率，沒有交代個股多空或下一筆方向。「What a week. 100% win rate.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2105674595701231661" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">模型回歸的讚賞沒有股票方向。「But yeah, looks like Google is back.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2105397070681248021" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">明確表達賣出交易方向。「talk about trading the news and selling the fk TOP!」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2105390232455577956" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Google排名回顧，無方向。「Google back at Number 3」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2105388983329104051" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">讚賞Gemini產品，無股票方向。「You guys have absolutely no idea how much Google cocked with Gemini 4 Argon」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2105388811450482693" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">最大持倉與低估成長論點，末尾明說Bullish。「It&#x27;s hard to bet against a company this integrated across the whole stack.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2105348695969427508" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，並總結 AI 相關股權資產將取得絕大部分增量所得「essentially all of the incremental GDP accrues to capital」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2097815176838017066" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明說是最喜愛的公司之一，若只能選一檔持有十年就選它「If I had to pick one stock to hold for the next ten years, for me it would be this one.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2097737010635235835" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者把GOOGL列為算力需求失衡的證據之一，支持其『AI股只會續漲』的看多結論。「$MSFT / $GOOGL / $AMZN stating compute demand imbalances into next year, with Nvidia projecting $1.3T spend for 2027.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2095882424932766163" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者稱讚Google與Nvidia聯手投資聯發科的操作「是GOAT等級的投資」，展現正面評價。「Google/Nvidia are goats with investments」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2094704372831920324" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，GOOGL被列入看好的大型股輪動名單。「Large cap summer $AAPL $META $GOOGL $AMZN」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2093353130725417265" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者呼應分析師給Google的21GW算力預估並補充明年Google加Nvidia合計約45GW，語氣正面但未明確表態股價方向。「Between Google &amp; Nvidia we are looking at around 45GW of compute added next year.」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2092940730159522219" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">公司策略負面反應沒有股票方向。「Still can&#x27;t believe $GOOGL sold Boston Dynamics」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2091612406900564407" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者否定做空这些云公司的盈利可能，并以强成长指引建立多方股票论点。「Shorting cloud companies is the fastest way to burn money right now.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2087541434333163660" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">聯盟消息與暗示提問，無明確投資方向。「Google has joined the HBF consortium」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2084430819242946683" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确保有Sivers/AAOI多方信念，其他公司为主题需求数据而非各自方向。「$GOOGL capex raised」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2082230983487803755" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">合作競爭優勢背景。「distribution funnel that Google needed」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2080750537121874206" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">自己的明確向上方向，並明說Bullish。「send it higher!!!」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2080037243519930436" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Google產品增長及資本支出分析，無本次股票方向；LITE看法僅自引。「Absurd growth adding 200 million more users」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2080031508656746874" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">公司業績讚賞，不直接股票方向。「WOW what a quarter! $GOOGL beats across the room.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2080029591994020064" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">財報業務正評。「Google Cloud accelerating growth with expanding margins」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2080027058063958323" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品競爭嘲諷。「Google won AI? 6 months later, a laggard.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2078188062501200358" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品延遲負面語氣。「Gemini 3.5 Pro is delayed」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2077855396174401554" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">競爭壓力。「$GOOGL, Apple, Microsoft, and others had some genuine disruptors.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2075894311741440041" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">條件合作風險，無股價方向。「cancels the Anthropic &amp;amp; Google agreements」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2074925863158878254" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">澄清Meta算力与资本开支消息，预测支出增加不等于股票方向。「$GOOGL are so compute constrained」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2072314906729455876" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Meta/Google算力约束及Nebius合约资料，整体产业资本开支利好不形成个股方向。「$GOOGL reportedly restricted Meta」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2071135874100990438" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">採購限制。「getting HBM supply is extremely hard」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2070674114600436039" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">舊自引融資風險，沒有新直接股票方向。「这对价值投资者来说，会是个暴击。」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2070431844399759469" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">現行股權稀釋及Capex壓力對投資回報的負面方向判斷。「这对价值投资者来说，会是个暴击。」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2070386133155094801" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明示第二股票偏好及AI業務投資論點。「probably 2nd right now」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2069655980456149142" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">技術供應量正面消息。「Google is actively pushing substrate manufacturers」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2069351024155099382" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品競爭力負面，無股票方向。「They have missed the agentic coding train」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2068010867648835772" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">對股東回報有疑慮，無明確看空指令。「Not sure if the Google holders are though」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2061596599588114444" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Berkshire Hathaway</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · roughly $10B · 交易日 2026-06-01（原文：last month） · 揭露 2026-07-27 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2081839851775684745" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品命名批評。「Google’s naming scheme is truly awful.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2048637051143340119" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">预期SpaceXAnthropicIPO对Google有利，未股票买卖方向。「going to be great for Google」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2041807232212607156" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Warren Buffett</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日 2026-04-01（原文：Q2 2026） · 揭露 2026-09-29 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2104842432051396966" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">支持Google及Meta资本支出的企业价值策略，未明确股票买卖或价格方向。「$GOOGL」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2019216672004141282" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:CRDO</span><span class="s-n">38 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-11-24 → 2026-10-02</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="flip">2 人反轉</span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+13.5%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Donald Trump</b>：2026-03 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2026-07 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Ren</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> → 2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li><li><b>Robert Bresnahan</b>：2025-11 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-01 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>大老师</b>：2026-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> → 2026-09 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者期待十月股市上漲並點名三檔作為該方向的標的，情緒強烈且論據較少。「This market wants to buy stocks so desperatley」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2106056040873935257" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者將 CRDO 稱為公開恐慌買進並重申其研究的 alpha，屬明確買進立場。「my public fear buy」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2106032699094053029" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者認為市場先前低估 Credo 的光學上行空間，並肯定價格開始反映其論點。「the market hasn&#x27;t been giving their photonics upside enough respect.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2105747909216174124" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">當前估值低估成長空間。「At today’s valuation, we think investors are giving too little credit to Credo’s growth opportunities beyond copper」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2105350676515786885" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">認為市場低估光學成長及估值，明確多方論點。「The market is improperly discounting $CRDO&#x27;s optical stack」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2105343052638478416" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">核心为Credo估值最划算与长期成长的明确多方投资论点，四档同业只是估值比较而非大量代码清单。「$CRDO is the best deal in AI networking by forward P/E.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2105104768767234342" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">Credo扩展光学平台的长期投资成长论点；尾部同业代码不外推。「Why the $CRDO long-term growth story is much bigger than AECs.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2104538766559822222" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">祝賀先前買入後漲幅，自引舊買入無新方向。「The stock is up over 40% in the last 10 days.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2103557697425825960" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Credo已涨过200的情绪观察，没有未来判断。「$CRDO back over $200. Suddenly everyone likes the business again」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2103533616080855494" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">偏重網路股投資理由，為四股多方論點。「Why am I so focused on networking over raw compute?」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2101057160537084356" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明示投入現金買入三檔個股及ETF，個股看多；ETF排除。「5% cash into $CRDO, $LITE, $NBIS, and $DRAM.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2099518539938091347" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">標題明確指出在股價回落時加碼CRDO，屬明確看多動作。「Adding $CRDO On Selloff」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2098191770576417148" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，此檔列於作者看多的光學/互聯股清單中「You are not bullish enough on interconnect, photonics and optics ⚡️」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2097072930114969608" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者先前已明確表態「CRDO從來不是值得買的標的」,此處以反諷語氣回應「X共識是滿倉CRDO,懂了」,暗示不認同市場一致看多的態度。「X consensus is to full port $CRDO. Got it.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2095282358677110882" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者直言「CRDO從來都不是一個值得買的標的」,寧可押注AI基建各層真正的最終贏家,對CRDO只做交易不做長期持有。「To me CRDO was never a buy...I would only trade it, not go long on it.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2095225141537955933" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者在股價重挫18%後逢低加碼CRDO，詳述財報優於預期（營收年增114.7%、FY27展望上修至80-85%成長），並把現金部位SGOV減碼轉入CRDO、持股比重由14.34%提高到約17%，明確表態看多。「I just bought the FEAR on $CRDO after an 18% crash... At the end of the day, this was a strong beat and raise quarter.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2095177394088997182" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">同上,僅為戰績宣布,未附加對CRDO方向的新評論。「五中五」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2094880788978553301" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者自評CRDO財報前情緒為「中性偏負,負面程度較高」,雖預期180附近有GEX防守,整體判斷仍偏空。「$CRDO 中性偏负 负面程度较高」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2094877460521496975" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者詳細說明CRDO發明AEC線纜並掌控88%市場、五大雲端巨頭中五家採用,並讚賞其產品線橫跨銅纜、retimer、光學收發器等多層,展現明確看多立場。「Did you know $CRDO invented the AEC cable, and now controls 88% of that market.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2094817405046272440" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，被列為擁有實際產能與現金流因而抗跌的標的。「names like $COHR, $LITE, and $CRDO held up relatively well」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2094494253267157010" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者反駁市場只把CRDO當成銅纜公司的看法，強調收購DustPhotonics後光通訊業務可能佔營收一半甚至超越銅纜，屬看多論述。「he said a case for 50-50 exists and that optical could eventually pass copper which is wild since this company is mostly framed as a copper company.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2090837479213420655" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面情緒反應及引用政策，不直接成為個股看多。「BABY DON&#x27;T FEAR THE REAPER」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2084631786668097713" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明確當前股票持有論點。「copper is the reason to own it today.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2076689764560904259" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">推广朋友交易风格并引用其历史交易，不归作者方向。「$OUST, SK Square, $CRDO」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2072750104189047063" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者以CRDO為具體研究目標，明確正向估值重塑論點。「这将给铜通信板块带来重塑估值的直接叙事」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2065417468265582922" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">本人認為銅互連交易仍有前景。「这条线我觉得市场还没讨论到高点。」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2064715007154401752" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">回顾CRDO涨幅并解释收购降低业务风险，没有新增股票方向。「$CRDO」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2046753674588787168" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">引用AI互连基础设施研报，未表达作者自身股票方向。「$CRDO」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2044039436443468103" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">收購改善業務論點。「$CRDO」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2043798719263391830" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Donald Trump</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日 2026-03-23（原文：March 23rd） · 揭露 2026-06-22 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2069082660245303792" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">CRDO过去低点收益与业绩回顾，無本次新投资方向。「52.6%+ gain in a week」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2020975054411137326" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">当日行情惊叹。「$CRDO is down 13%」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2019123157672907018" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Robert Bresnahan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-01-12 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2010751635396706332" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">过去收益和业务评论。「now back up 15.47%+」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2010255341196628117" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者直接买入。「I&#x27;ve added $CRDO on the 25.7% drop」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2008854319806787681" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">回顾旧投资及赞赏未具名公司增长；不能由营收及子公司数量猜上市主体。「$CRDO」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/1996560529679327449" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Robert Bresnahan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2025-12-02 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/1995920556764340652" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Robert Bresnahan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2025-11-24 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/1993006775663313274" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">TSXV:PNG</span><span class="s-n">34 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-10-05 → 2026-06-18</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2025-10 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2025-10 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明確加拿大普通股價目標。「roughly C$13 on PNG.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2067713003479585105" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确表明做多Kraken两个市场代码。「LONG $KRKNF $PNG」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2060083991651520788" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同公司加拿大上市股票的收益前景。「$PNG.V」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2040107296781672919" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同公司加拿大股票明確做多。「$PNG.V」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2036827087580057941" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">同公司不同股份上市市场的业务预测。「A multi-billion $ order is coming.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2032116314509361651" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者以保守分析师目标支持更高上行。「If THESE guys have 30% upside above current prices.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2032105781093679492" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">旧Kraken集中仓位与涨幅及未给出答案的问题，無新方向；两市场分别确认。「$KRKNF / $PNG.V」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2031745912574468409" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">以Kraken相对同业低估及技术需求论证投资价值，表达看多两个市场代码。「still trades at a fraction of the multiples」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2031565394096668780" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">当前明示未来股价上涨。「The rise to the top will be bibilical.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2031395349852815773" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">同公司上市股份业务需求。「our entire economy depends on safe waterways」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2031374690795794731" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确认为Kraken最具不对称收益，投资看多并确认两市场。「makes Kraken the most asymmetric drone stock」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2031098764224782803" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Kraken供应链及关注度评价，没有明确股票方向。「$PNG.V」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2030000864656822539" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同一 Kraken 股票的加拿大挂牌，明确低估论点。「$KRKNF / $PNG.V&#x27;s Anduril exposure」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2029280741373427967" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确增持Kraken两个市场代码并宣告LONG；同行为估值比较。「opening red today and I am adding.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2029217460683993275" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确称Kraken收购对股票极度看多，虽财务仍待核算。「this is extremely bullish」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2028947388610822227" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">供应链机会介绍。「Kraken Robotics $KRKNF / $PNG.V」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2014016733569237472" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">明确TSX-V代码，业务风险减轻。「defense products are tariff exempt」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2013307931329208382" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同公司明确做多。「$PNG.V」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1998526207902536187" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Kraken领导团队调整新闻，没有股票方向。「$PNG.V」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1996609163057623171" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">同公司政策新闻关联。「$KRKNF / $PNG.V」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1996276426589495526" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者认为上调后的Kraken目标价仍保守，明确赞同更高估值。「Still conservative in my view.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1993479210698993946" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">报Kraken当日上涨与业绩和产能，未作新投资判断。「up 10% today.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1993448938322751717" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">个人成功愿望和表情式持仓宣传，没有明确股票方向。「When I finally make it」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1991146375233351917" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">推荐他人的Kraken研究阅读，没有采纳其投资方向；其他为引用中的研究文章名称。「$PNG」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1990132087047754136" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">讨论Kraken机构持股比例造成的估值折价；明确重估价格目标来自他人，作者未采纳目标或给出买卖方向。「$PNG.V」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1983665240567840805" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者肯定Kraken供应商切换壁垒，业务护城河观点未形成股票方向。「such a strong moat.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1982968977157500939" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">同公司他人買入故事。「$PNG.V」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1980607491638477197" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Kraken代码加澳洲Anduril订单新闻，没有作者方向。「$PNG.V」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1980351312291356969" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">推介他人Kraken文章及其ASTS历史战绩，没有本作者股票方向。「$PNG.V」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1980275896796787146" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者直接称Kraken为最被低估的防务科技投资，表达看多；引用行业名单不转作作者对其他股票的判断。「$PNG.V」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1978140268483281059" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">社群活動。「$PNG.V」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1977821563454927262" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同公司明确持有建议。「$PNG.V」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1975242675151642828" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">同公司社群口号。「$PNG.V」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1975241862593323151" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同公司目前價格低估論點。「$PNG.V」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1974940277979959720" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:ARM</span><span class="s-n">34 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-03-20 → 2026-09-25</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+8.5%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Jukan</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-04 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Ren</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-03 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确看多CPU需求且点名三家；Meta仅需求案例。「$INTC  $AMD  $ARM」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2103277471579709556" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">CPU需求成長與Bullish共同指向代碼。「$INTC  $AMD  $ARM」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2103263059770839412" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">需求受惠比喻。「I can hear all the $AMD, $INTC, and $ARM CPUs vrrrring in the background.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2102247915251224980" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">本人持倉與未来Agent需求論點。「I&#x27;ve owned CPU names like $ARM, $INTC and $AMD」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2102091972131393869" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">CPU需求預估低估消費採用，四股前瞻受益論點。「Could be an order of magnitude higher.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2102073980559692168" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">CPU股票当日庆祝，无新的未来方向。「Big day for the CPU trade

$INTC $ARM $AMD」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2102031462006419507" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者引用自己先前貼文,提到ARM是CPU/GPU比例轉變主題下「一直在飆漲」的受惠股之一,但沒有進一步給出明確方向判斷。「names like $ARM and $AMD have been surging on the thesis」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2097327800537714984" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同一則報導指Arm參與三星終端裝置晶片共同開發案，潛在最終客戶OpenAI可能為Arm帶來新的授權收入來源。「Samsung has begun co-developing an on-device chip with Arm」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2096967899537907945" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者將ARM列為自己至今仍上漲逾100%的CPU主題持股。「18. $ARM - CPUs」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2096814311306129776" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">價格恢復反應。「ARM 也非常漂亮 算是走出阴霾」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2071967055671439697" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">戏谑市值反应。「Peak Performance」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2061499858201219402" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">歷史漲幅感嘆。「$134 straight to $413」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2061486607870652876" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">回顾ARM涨幅及CPU需求并提问，引用旧看多不构成新投票。「ARM」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2061233888454988260" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產業需求或產品背景。「Arm」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2058054994084147204" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">历史选股收益。「$ARM is now #18」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2052126435721318528" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">歷史收益。「Almost triple digit return」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2052095835903852564" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">持有領導者與兆美元市值論點。「$ARM」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2049216533461946488" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确认为Qualcomm估值提供廉价AI上行并推荐CPU既有公司，虽低确信度仍有方向。「investors likely better off playing CPU supercycle with the incumbents」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2048512944947020048" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">旧价格回顾。「$ARM」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2047485717341987232" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">既往漲幅。「$ARM」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2047472057890513357" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">已發生漲幅回顧。「$ARM」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2047054864040308895" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明示看多。「Bullish on $ARM」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2046419572203683922" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">长文分析Nuvacore创业、CPU行业及企业战略，未表达上市股票买卖方向。「ARM」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2044684410289852753" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">产业需求背景。「$ARM」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2044045150410919940" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">合作猜測。「ARM」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2044005900588130306" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">担忧ARM手机业务萎缩，没有明确股价方向；SUMCO身份未核实。「ARM」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2041368876777398428" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">授權架構背景。「Arm」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2040438876213252542" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">业务收入风险。「smartphone royalties」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2036963841582784947" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">本地AI应用受益判断。「Implications might be bullish for $ARM」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2036862433319583898" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">庆祝ARM持有者当天表现，无新方向。「great day for ARM holders」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2036821410946150533" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者实际买入及当前多头论点。「I went long on $ARM at $139.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2036746039588434165" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">前瞻股價應更上行。「deserves to be up more than 5%」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2036543096817852663" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">业务产品前景或客户背景。「$ARM」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2036532579638399109" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">考虑交易及正面催化，但未明示买卖方向。「thinking about making a short-term event-driven trade.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2035122016723116535" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:SONY</span><span class="s-n">33 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-03-16 → 2026-10-04</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+2.1%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明確表示偏好買入 SONY 選擇權，理由是 GTA6 相關收益尚未反映在股價上，且預期市場將重新給予遊戲業務更高的平台本益比。「I think the stock will move up not only with earnings growth, but the market soon paying the platform multiple $SONY deserves in the mid 20&#x27;s」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2106859515207627095" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者預告自己的 Sony 交易論點並認為該股定價有誤，引用其低估與上漲論點。「why $SONY is mispriced.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2105736910635458960" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明確表示Sony執行長說明了股價將創新高的理由，記憶體缺貨反而利多，且高毛利遊戲軟體業務將獲得更高本益比評價。「$SONY CEO just laid out why the stock will rip to new all time highs.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2098515061384114221" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">標題稱SONY的GTA交易「被錯誤定價」，暗示認為股價被低估、看多。「Mispriced $SONY GTA Trade」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2098191770576417148" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者表示逢日圓走強造成的下跌是加碼SONY的好時機,並詳細解釋這只是匯率干擾、獲利指引未變,明確表態論述不變。「Was a good day to pick up more $SONY with a big hit to the stock today on Yen strength.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2097408837531935065" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者提到「$SONY options in June」作為過去交易範例,未表態現在的方向。「$SONY options in June」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2097007843799171358" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者提出SONY「清楚的路徑上看$30以上」,理由是既有PS5用戶群將轉化成長期加購內容的獲利機器。「the stock&#x27;s clear path to $30+ isn&#x27;t about growing the console base」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2096299357184434310" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者看到SONY預告GTA6主題手把後直言「我們還不夠看多」，明確表態極度看多。「WE&#x27;RE NOT BULLISH ENOUGH.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2095581999566364773" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者預期SONY會在1-2季內重返歷史高點，理由是PS5 Pro因GTA6需求提前三個月售罄、黃牛價炒高，顯示硬體業務已從損益兩平轉為獲利。「I think $SONY will reclaim an ATH within 1-2 quarters...」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2095221544016638221" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者列出兩個理由支持SONY是他2026下半年最高確信度標的：震盪總經環境下容易吸引輪動資金，且GTA6帶動的需求不受升息影響。「Another reason why $SONY is my highest conviction set up for H2 2026.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2094809766040330366" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者稱SONY是他2026剩餘時間「最高確信度」的交易，即使原始選擇權部位已經+150%仍持續看多，理由是GTA6會帶動SONY遊戲業務回到成長軌道。「$SONY is now my highest conviction trade for the rest of 2026, even after I&#x27;m +150% on my original options」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2094483946763657311" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者先前預測PS5會因記憶體短缺缺貨一年以上，如今看到PS5 Pro全面顯示售罄，認為自己的預測提前應驗，代表他看好SONY的產品需求與定價力。「I now predict $SONY may be sold out for a year plus with memory shortage. My prediction is coming true months ahead of schedule.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2093881044772569528" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者慶祝六月買進的選擇權部位「approaching a triple」，顯示他持續看多並已從$SONY部位獲利。「Options from June are now approaching a triple. BANG!!!!!」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2093344703077069186" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者稱「You know my horse」延續先前對$SONY的看多主張，並強調其相對$TTWO走強。「$SONY and $TTWO are surging up overnight... You know my horse.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2093217234114199763" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者稱GTA6將推升$SONY非主機遊戲營收創新高，質疑市場為何沒看見此利多而給出保守財測，是明確看多論點。「GTA 6 will explode these revenue streams to new records... How does the market not see this?」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2093178322863956411" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明確表示自己持有SONY的LEAPS選擇權，看多GTA6帶動的效應「I&#x27;m long $SONY LEAPS here.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2091969064302465311" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者認為即使總體環境惡化，消費者仍會擠出錢購買PS5、GTA6與PSN，暗示SONY遊戲業務需求具韌性，看多「8/10 military aged males in the West would find the $ to: Get a $SONY PS5」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2091911449425936703" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明確表示自己「went long」SONY，並下了他做過最大的選擇權交易，押注GTA6效應被市場低估「went long the real mispriced GTA bet in $SONY, with the largest options trade I&#x27;ve ever made」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2090895096694857804" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确Sony股票便宜且实体AI巨大上行空间，构成看多；TSMC为合作伙伴无方向。「That&#x27;s massive physical AI upside sitting inside a cheap stock the market forgot about, at well under 20x forward.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2086868356645433676" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">持有Sony看漲期權且希望展期迎接催化，明確多方。「I&#x27;d like to roll into 1/28 to see Q4 and Q1 go CRAZY.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2085838908948873244" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">持有看漲期權並預期市場重新定價。「Don&#x27;t see reason to sell yet as it doesn&#x27;t seem the market is putting two and two together yet on the GTA thesis.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2083100440401715239" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Sony漲幅與自己期權績效回顧，自引舊論點無新方向承諾。「my $SONY leaps up 130% in a month」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2082532254878933130" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明確現行低估與成長投資論點。「The market still prices this as a memory constrained console maker at ~16x forward」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2081766138271453567" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Sony今日漲幅回顧，自引舊估值論點沒有新承諾。「$SONY +3.3% today.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2077872183792070890" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">交易收益回顧。「I&#x27;m already up 50% on my $SONY trade.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2074490462572839406" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">直接股票多頭及估值重估論點。「god tier robotics long.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2073078859495301576" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">自己的多頭投資論點。「Insanely bullish signal for $SONY.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2072367845418086709" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Sony游戏预购新闻的兴奋号召，未明确股票回报方向。「Get ready $SONY」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2070936364623835645" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品銷量預測，沒有股價或倉位表態。「will sell every Playstation it can make」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2070500966508470470" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Sony当日潜在游戏收入的兴奋反应，无明确股票方向。「how much money $SONY made today.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2070274845548433860" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Sony游戏销售预期与指引比较，未明确股票价格方向。「$SONY&#x27;s pure margin cut on every sale ~30%.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2070160177467207889" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">本人以低估及GTA盈利催化下注。「I&#x27;m taking an options trade」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2070144308368322688" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">良率風險新聞。「Sony」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2033364907681525976" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:TSEM</span><span class="s-n">33 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-03-11 → 2026-09-07</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+6.6%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Ren</b>：2026-07 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-03 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Zephyr</b>：2026-04 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者說TSEM已『跌出』上漲逾100%的名單範圍，暗示表現不如預期，但沒有明確表態未來股價方向。「Since many like $TSEM / $HPS.A / $LPK / $ALRIB fell out of the range.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2096814311306129776" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者宣告全力做多AI持股名單，此檔在標籤列表中「I&#x27;ll go max long on my Tier 1 and Tier 2 quality AI names」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2095656252873335011" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">比较ETF及推广自有组合，多个股票仅历史权重与未纳入公司赞赏，无新股票方向。「other incredible names like $VIAV, $TSEM, $AEHR, or $GLW」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2085396410405707941" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Tower与AAOI扩产消息的成长赞赏，没有明确股价/行动方向。「glad to see both of these companies」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2077039373711970804" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">Tower扩产与政府支持被作者认定投资确认、明确看多光学；其他为卖方比较。「This is the type confirmation I want」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2077003926172221442" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者认为下一年会后悔没买CW瓶颈公司，明确聚焦低估的AAOI/Sivers/Tower。「personally just focusing on that bottleneck」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2069258326505140653" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">今日涨幅及事后仓位懊悔，自引旧TSEM看多非新方向。「$TSEM up 10%+ today.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2069188398825566318" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">混合键合技术成本与BESI业务机会讨论，BESI身份未核实。「TSMC&#x27;s COUPE &amp; Tower」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2067915761331618074" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">技术成本评论无已核实股票方向，BESI缺身份。「TSMC&#x27;s COUPE &amp; Tower」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2067912731122872684" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面合作消息。「sign a multi year InP epiwafer deal.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2066421816793714938" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">公司喜好與舊論點，未新增方向。「which I also wrote a thesis on awhile back and also like」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2065009883133644963" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">被用作成功放量比较。「the next $TSEM」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2063178421497221604" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">感谢粉丝并回顾过去想法，未新增投资方向。「$TSEM」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2059479203746296219" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">仍有很大上行空間。「$TSEM」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2054687492750889323" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">預付款新聞，未有該股方向。「$TSEM」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2054532386239693206" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">維護成長或供應鏈論點，無新交易。「$TSEM」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2051863264624353314" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">持倉並期待CPO循環上行。「$TSEM」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2051801908344771022" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确看多列举CPO受益者；SiversTSEM看多，另三公司待验证。「Win Semi / $TSEM (Foundry)」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2050762148545216899" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">否定賣壓理由並期待更高高點。「$TSEM」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2049160131641004263" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者當前明示看多。「we are bullish on Tower Semi &amp;amp; UMC」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2045855510323421638" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">已發生持倉收益。「$TSEM」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2045175383210000444" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">收益回顧。「$TSEM」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2041062144884797685" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确做多Soitec但海外上市身份未核实；AAOI和Kraken是当前持仓对照。「$TSEM」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2037254062421533091" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">回顾Tower旧买入和两周涨幅，自引旧多头不形成新票。「$TSEM」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2036794525000274273" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">已發生漲幅。「$TSEM」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2034740497953243439" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明確建議繼續做多。「$TSEM」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2034634272733343835" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">光學漲幅回顧。「$TSEM」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2033643128390095328" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者称TSEM为当前安全复利股并披露AXTI持仓，表达当前看多。「my safer photonics compounder.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2032476428005220449" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确称Tower为最偏爱的光学复利股。「one of my favorite photonic names」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2032474260179149056" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">合作业务。「partnered with $TSEM」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2032145772532416676" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">合作业务肯定，引用他人长仓不属作者。「partnership with $TSEM」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2031849944118669522" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">合作方。「Tower Semiconductor ($TSEM)」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2031843702335775085" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确TSEM做多与估值上涨催化，Soitec为当前第二首选看多，其他为背景。「I&#x27;m long $TSEM as an asymmetrical upside」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2031820871170736570" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:RDDT</span><span class="s-n">32 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-02-09 → 2026-09-20</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2026-02 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-02 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-02 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">平台風險未提出股價或投資方向。「$RDDT to other social media like X more at risk due to AI.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2101818303216013812" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">引用市場負面稱呼，非自己的方向。「&quot;Garbage stock&quot;」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2093760498072485919" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">可能業務機會但無股票承諾。「if any company could get some kind of dynamic, use based pricing deal」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2083236937394278584" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Reddit财报赞赏及批评市场下跌叙事，未给明确未来股票方向。「Blowout financials」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2083225872207937687" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">已發生價格反應；方向語句在舊自引中。「taking back most of last Wednesday&#x27;s selloff」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2081787683412795519" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Reddit已回涨及业务合约续约预期赞赏，无新明确股票价格方向。「Nearly made back the senseless dump」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2081771613666869476" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者認為股價損失與合約價值不相稱。「The market shaved $3B of $RDDT&#x27;s market cap over a $60M deal that&#x27;s likely to get increased.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2081469550802166170" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明確股票上行及錯誤定價論點。「the upside is significant once the Nasdaq finds a bid.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2081407560502907077" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">已發生復甦的正面反應。「glad it&#x27;s finally back above $200」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2074240512593481955" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">業務盈利正評。「One of the few names that&#x27;s actually profitable AND still growing fast」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2074221791522787607" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">內容商業價值正面論點。「the beneficiaries will be」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2067825364722995559" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">当下仍延续明确看多。「I’ve been bullish on $RDDT since $140.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2064150385749815384" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Reddit业绩及近期关注赞赏，引用旧低估观点未新增承诺。「Glad to see it getting more attention.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2062552171502330188" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">个人粉丝经历与AXTI过去涨幅，未表达新投资方向。「$RDDT」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2059306154787062194" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">對社群嘲諷。「lower IQ」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2057689020390580234" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">称赞公司利润及成长。「One of the most profitable names right now with high growth」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2057146050084045024" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者仍认为RDDT极具吸引力，明确投资看多。「I still think $RDDT is one of the few non-AI names that is extremely compelling.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2052760996784349455" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">前瞻價格目標。「Personally think it heads back to $200+ over time」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2050242891117900233" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者披露当前Reddit持仓并强调增长与盈利论点。「I do have Reddit positions.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2049949682022203738" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">預期回到200以上。「$RDDT at $163」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2046005919637733430" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">已發生反彈。「$RDDT」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2044507444962070817" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确预计所偏爱的三只激光股票在更好宏观环境继续上涨。「$RDDT」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2041650903305089389" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">以Reddit财务与过度抛售论证当前买入。「I’m a buyer here.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2037320624746729756" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者当前低估投资偏好。「better mispriced choices out there like $RDDT right now」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2032334155053470177" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确认为Reddit当前错价并论证重估增长，表达投资看多。「Looks completely mispriced.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2032194165690548623" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确RDDT超卖且现价吸引，看多；引文同业为背景。「$RDDT looks oversold」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2031061827392602494" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确称Reddit为战争期间不对称多头，同行为广告业务比较。「is an asymmetric long」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2031055797086728366" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">认可当前估值下的买入机会。「selloff created opportunity」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2023751789175079396" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">實際新增買入。「Added $APP and $RDDT」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2022396779082453071" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">将当前价格下的盈利能力视为有吸引力投资。「Reddit is a money printer at $141.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2021615793159704628" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确当前多头持仓。「Day 1 of holding $RDDT」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2021359576575246505" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确在139做多Reddit；HOOD和WMT为盈利估值对照。「I&#x27;m long $RDDT at $139.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2020702873458463137" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:ORCL</span><span class="s-n">31 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-10-29 → 2026-10-02</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+7.3%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Michael Burry</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Ren</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2025-12 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li><li><b>Stephen Rusckowski</b>：2026-10 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>大老师</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Stephen Rusckowski</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 25,000 shares; $3.48 million · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-10-02 · 2 則報導 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2106109915123130869" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文1</a> <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2106011865126253012" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文2</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">風險報導背景，沒有ORCL股價方向。「Oracle was reportedly seeking payment protection」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2103139052363133062" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">ORCL財報中GPU產能溢價轉售的事實被拿來當數據佐證，作者未直接對ORCL股價表態。「surprised I missed this from $ORCL earnings」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2099048356345696391" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">只是影片時間軸標題「Nailed the $ORCL trade」，未說明交易方向為多或空。「Nailed the $ORCL trade on GPT 6 Astra」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2098191770576417148" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>The Kobeissi Letter</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者純粹轉述 Oracle 因 AI 需求財報優於預期而股價上漲逾 8% 的事實新聞，沒有加入自己對後市的判斷，屬轉述不算表態。「Oracle stock, $ORCL, rises over +8% after the company posts stronger than expected earnings due to AI demand.」 <a href="https://x.com/KobeissiLetter/status/2098149934985777275" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Wolf Financial</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">轉述 Oracle 財報後盤後股價上漲 6% 的事實，並引用自己先前的財報快訊，沒有加入方向判斷。「Oracle $ORCL stock is initially up by 6% in after-hours following its earnings」 <a href="https://x.com/WOLF_Financial/status/2098148434477801896" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Wolf Financial</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">純粹播報 Oracle Q1 財報數據（營收、EPS 優於預期、上調財測），沒有作者自己對股價後市的判斷。「Revenue: $19.3B, beating est. of $19.14B」 <a href="https://x.com/WOLF_Financial/status/2098142300660699360" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明確表示對ORCL財報「中性偏空」，觀察到170上方出現大量賣call與call平倉壓抑漲幅預期，判斷即使財報優於預期也難大漲「ORCL：中性偏空 现价174，日内-4.6%...更像是在赌：财报即使Beat，也很难大涨。」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2098137811874648179" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">同IREN，作者提到ORCL面臨全端執行不確定性，用以對照Nebius優勢，未直接論斷股價方向。「Plaguing uncertainty that $IREN, $ORCL face from  full-stack execution.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2097327653116363127" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者確認自己先前對ORCL的交易預測成真,已實現8000美元獲利,是對該看多立場的驗證。「Just as I predicted $ORCL is one of the biggest movers today」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2097320539585118385" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者表示已主動建立ORCL短線交易部位,認為這檔「beaten down」的AI基建股即將迎來情緒反轉。「this beaten down AI hyperscaler is due for a sentiment boost」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2097028667813863653" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者興奮轉述Jensen Huang宣布AGI已透過ORCL提供的Stargate算力達成,延續其ORCL受惠於OpenAI基建的看多論述。「OpenAI&#x27;s AGI was achieved using the 100K+ GPUs from the compute $ORCL provided at Stargate」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2096703262368137306" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者認為ORCL來自OpenAI的3000億美元訂單積壓,價值遠超過目前19倍遠期本益比所反映的水準,暗示股價被低估。「$ORCL&#x27;s $300B OAI backlog worth more than 19x fwd」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2096671639786356916" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">引用OpenAI研究副總裁證實Astra在Stargate用超過10萬張GPU訓練的紀錄規模並標註$ORCL,呼應作者一貫將此規模當作ORCL基建承包利多的敘事。「It&#x27;s the first time we&#x27;ve pre-trained on more than 100,000 GPUs at our Stargate site in Texas.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2095929935336730770" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明確說ORCL因深度綁定OpenAI基建而「well positioned」,預期財報前有情緒推升行情,並表示已親自建立短線交易部位。「$ORCL looks well positioned for a pre-earnings run up, as it&#x27;s one of the most levered names to OpenAI」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2095911856435241243" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者與Oracle VP級高管開會，指出他們正以100% FCF全力投入AI建置，認為這是安全的賭注，並明確寫下「Bullish the AI buildout」「No one is as bullish as them, 100% FCF into the AI buildout seems like a safe bet from their perspective.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2095879502882644467" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bear">放空</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-08-12 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2087648528428380602" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bear">放空</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-08-11 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2087276225727271035" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bear">放空</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · entry ~$144.63 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-08-06 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2085437390227747002" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bear">放空</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-05-12 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2054245428531536109" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确质疑继续做多IREN，投资看空；其他云企正面比较非明确股票看多。「looking derisked」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2046374163338912200" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">泛正面评价。「orcl goog meta 都挺不错的」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2044094110030803283" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">惊讶Oracle裁员新闻，没有投资方向。「Oracle」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2039022947319574868" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">否定不实报道。「false and incorrect」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2030855466696495396" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确将新闻引发的三只芯片股下跌视为买点；其他公司是资金背景。「Oracle」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2030020673570275618" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">旧自引信用风险论。「$ORCL」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/1999575509462843833" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">市场下跌批评，没有作者股票卖出方向。「Oracle带崩科技股」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/1999046739672899914" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">明确不认可当前买入并批评资本风险。「but not companies tied to OpenAI like $ORCL and $CRWV」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/1998925429890261130" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">历史行情及信用新闻的负面评论。「然后真带崩了」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/1989222077682085959" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">负面信用风险报道。「严重的融资缺口」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/1988477669403770989" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者认为ORCL没有债务风险，属于财务观点而非明确股票买卖方向；机构及数据源只是新闻背景。「我认为是没有债务风险的」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/1983588977606324717" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">TSE:285A</span><span class="s-n">29 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-01-29 → 2026-08-17</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+8.5%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Jukan</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Ren</b>：2026-07 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">记忆体股票及Kioxia明确确认铠侠普通股；作者预期全部记忆体回到历史高点并建议持有。「Kioxia at 285」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2089420093910401501" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">NAND語境確認鎧俠；需求正面未形成該股投資方向。「Kioxia」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2089264987328151637" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">NAND厂Kioxia及技术明确，核验285A；技术称赞非股票方向。「Kioxia&#x27;s XL SLC Flash」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2085598759501885686" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">XL-Flash产品明确铠侠，官方IR确认东京普通股285A；作者看好SLC需求，未表达股票方向。「Kioxia&#x27;s XL-Flash」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2085577004603379769" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">转述 NAND 量产及未达预期，未直接股票方向。「Kioxia began mass production」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2085227576776343896" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">恺侠名稱確認鎧俠；舊文股價回顧無新投資方向。「恺侠（Kioxia）」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2085095245176549700" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">记忆体同业名称确认铠侠普通股；回顾其盘中下跌不构成新的股票方向。「伙伴股恺侠（Kioxia）」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2085090985785409870" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">存储同业铠侠确认TSE普通股；伙伴股历史回踩仅辅助SNDK观点。「伙伴恺侠回踩」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2085031458692018432" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">记忆体同业确认铠侠普通股；历史回踩没有铠侠自身买卖方向。「伙伴股恺侠（Kioxia）」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2085019322100178981" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Kioxia及产品ASP语境明确，核验285A；被Apple议价评论非卖出。「Kioxia: &quot;expected that ASP」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2083349853799583775" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">财报新闻明确铠侠，官方IR确认东京普通股285A；作者负面感叹不等于看空股票。「*KIOXIA 1Q OPER INCOME」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2083079129533222964" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">日文铠侠社长及供应商会面确认铠侠普通股，照片与玩笑没有方向。「キオクシア」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2077674966292771039" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">SLC NAND市场主体Kioxia明确，核验285A；业务份额背景。「Kioxia (20%)」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2077228758491386121" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">涨幅回顾及行业需求评价，没有新个股承诺。「Kioxia +9.23%」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2073078711260180783" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">亚洲记忆体及价格反弹语境确认铠侠普通股；买入来自他人引用而作者主要是节日玩笑。「SK Hynix Kioxia」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2072865847299723747" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">前句明确Kioxia为作者推荐内存股票，核验285A；直接买入建议。「Buy memory. Don’t overcomplicate things.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2072672100616167433" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">明稱Kioxia股價確認鎧俠普通股；JPM目標價轉述非作者方向。「Kioxia」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2068107984908251479" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">铠侠分析师目标与历史涨幅语境确认铠侠普通股；批评旧预测和回顾上涨没有新股票方向。「Stock proceeds to skyrocket right after」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2067896191338311750" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">引用公司市场份额前景。「The biggest beneficiary should be Kioxia」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2062810448874111129" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">日本NAND產能確認鎧俠；市占業務受益預測無股價方向。「Kioxia」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2062809398284812532" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">记忆体及卖方评级确认铠侠普通股；Buy来自他人，作者简短回应无独立方向。「Kioxia upgraded to Buy」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2061050046611857668" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">技术成本优势。「Kioxia&#x27;s lateral (horizontal) scaling architecture」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2060234657430642804" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">日本NAND及BiCS製程確認鎧俠；技術競爭新聞未表達股票方向。「Kioxia」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2058032314496745711" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明稱Kioxia與市值確認鎧俠普通股；作者預測年內市值超越Toyota，屬前瞻上行判斷。「Kioxia will surpass Toyota’s market cap within this year.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2053807032223023576" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">地震停產風險新聞。「Kioxia」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2046153826080575872" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">SKhynix持Kioxia股权与收益回顾，無新方向。「Kioxia is up 244% YTD」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2043862710262345939" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">评论Kioxia商业定价方式，没有投资方向。「Kioxia」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2043016576224711114" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">引用经营需求利好。「Kioxia President Kawamura」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2041733280861651030" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Sandisk与Kioxia制造合作经营消息，无作者股票方向。「Kioxia」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2016988540744454279" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:TSLA</span><span class="s-n">29 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-09-15 → 2026-09-11</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+3.7%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Cathie Wood</b>：2026-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Elon Musk</b>：2025-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Michael Burry</b>：2026-06 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>大老师</b>：2026-04 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Wolf Financial</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">轉述摩根士丹利對Tesla Semi軟體業務可帶來170億美元營收與75億美元EBIT的樂觀預測，是分析師觀點的轉述而非作者自己的判斷。「Morgan Stanley thinks Tesla Semi software could generate roughly 150x more monthly revenue per vehicle than consumer FSD.」 <a href="https://x.com/WOLF_Financial/status/2098355490720043087" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">負面估值嘲諷沒有明確做空或下行主張。「Anything to justify the market cap.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2081076095315570834" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">明确区分Tesla产品赞赏与投资问题，不给方向。「But let&#x27;s not forget how incredible the product is.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2080695330476261395" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bear">放空</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-07-24 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2080600305603903960" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Tesla逐字稿与供應链觀察，強烈方向歸屬Musk，非作者股票表態。「He seems extremely bullish on humanoids.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2080149813065396454" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Tesla实际财报失望反应，自引旧多方不重投方向。「TSLA 盘后挺差的 财报算miss了」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2080027546834620582" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">期权市场状态对比与宏观风险，无明确作者股票方向。「$TSLA 显著乐观于 $IBM」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2080019747606061299" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">Tesla财报前瞻明确整体看涨，IBM仅相对比较。「整体以看涨为主」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2080018561414943065" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">對過度預測的玩笑。「we see &quot;$100T&quot; in revenue」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2079687189387235546" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">機器人量產疑問，無股票方向。「mass production with $TSLA?」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2075302956581449892" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品商業化預測，非直接Tesla股票方向。「Tesla likely taking the lead a year from now」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2072741541404406008" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bear">放空</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-07-02 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2072681424793071729" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">供應链依賴風險，不是看空股票。「forcing $TSLA and others to use Chinese suppliers」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2072630036600103340" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Cathie Wood</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 96,935 shares · 交易日 2026-07-02（原文：yesterday） · 揭露 2026-07-03 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2072970201784516874" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">當前圖形與走勢稱讚，不推定新股價方向。「整体走的极强」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2071954438265426283" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bear">放空</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日 2026-06-30（原文：today） · 揭露 2026-06-30 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2072077150166098224" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">工厂机器人的業務驗證及社会評論，無上市股票方向。「large players like $AMZN or $TSLA」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2071532870859149617" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面產業前景，非該股明確方向。「programs within large players like $AMZN or $TSLA」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2070789923108798545" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Cathie Wood</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · nearly $20M · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-06-19 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2067951104952778954" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">认为Tesla机器人未计价并将估值重塑，明确多方；其余为涨幅背景。「不免让人怀疑 $TSLA 在估值重塑上即将会叠加 机器人概念」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2062625310370308384" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">合併猜測。「Tesla」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2059698310487908812" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">預期泛用機器人公司表現佳。「$TSLA」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2054706428431286655" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">主題期待及供應鏈策略。「$TSLA」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2054696650539688271" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确公司好感及无持仓。「I really like Tesla, though I don’t own the stock.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2048276078700253652" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者称TSLA止跌并可尝试，明确短线买入方向。「阻力在400 可以试试」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2044774335697887596" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">信任Elon执行能力与Tesla估值解释，非明确公司股票方向。「Tesla is not a conventional company」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2036238974747025683" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者质疑TSLA与NBIS消息后的定价差异，未直接表达任何一股的新交易或未来价格；UBER是引用合作背景。「Make this make sense...」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/1996232079890325753" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">旧价格跌幅。「tsla -4%」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/1974176380113072395" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-09-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Elon Musk</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · approximately $1B · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2025-09-15 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/1967600251872919566" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:DELL</span><span class="s-n">28 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-02-10 → 2026-10-04</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+3.5%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Donald Trump</b>：2026-02 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Jukan</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Ren</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Unusual Whales</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">options_flow 帳號陳述 Dell 今年漲幅逾340%與AI伺服器營收成長數據，純數據播報無方向判斷。「Dell, $DELL, is up more than 340% this year.」 <a href="https://x.com/unusual_whales/status/2106837006982746505" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">條件笑談而非確定加倉。「I might have to increase my $DELL position after he subscribed」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2099707838893642021" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明確標註「Bullish $DELL」，並提到財報前後都有買進。「Bullish $DELL」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2098427346780836249" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者宣告全力做多AI持股名單，此檔在標籤列表中「I&#x27;ll go max long on my Tier 1 and Tier 2 quality AI names」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2095656252873335011" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者稱讚Dell創辦人的慈善承諾「是傳奇」，屬於對創辦人個人行為的讚賞，未對DELL股價表態。「$DELL founder is a legend」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2095565402223038651" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者引用Dell對推理需求成長的預測後,發表「訓練是階段,推理才是永恆」的產業趨勢感想,並未針對DELL股價本身表態。「We need more compute...Training is a phase. Inference is forever.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2094991955444777174" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">內容是對作者先前財報預測準確度的事後檢討與評分,引用的方向標籤(如「中性偏弱」)是財報前的舊預測,不代表現在的立場。「DELL中性偏弱,但防 Beat 后反包日内跌幅」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2094909826577072206" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">貼文只是宣布五檔財報預測「五中五」全部命中,屬事後戰績回顧,沒有針對DELL提出新的方向判斷。「好了 今天全对 五中五」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2094880788978553301" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明確表示「我真心認為Dell這裡會走高」,並提到AI伺服器業務今年全年營收指引有大幅上修空間。「I really think we can see Dell running higher here!」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2094627777831936311" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">看漲流量數據。「整个期权流也相对Bullish」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2071954068441010354" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">第三方降級與負面研究，不歸作者空票。「Dell Down from Buy to Hold」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2070116698284597532" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Donald Trump</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 50-100K · 交易日 2026-06-24（原文：June 24） · 揭露 2026-08-22 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2091280865196155079" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">交付能力比較。「$DELL  可以量产」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2069501595377946957" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Rubin量产与HBM验证资料、研究预告，无明确股票方向。「$DELL $HPE Lenovo $SMCI」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2068948199084367969" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">供應風險觀察。「Managing memory procurement is the hardest challenge」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2062932483151368192" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">这是他人原文，作者庆祝命中。「I am personally going to long $DELL on Monday open」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2061599990305448280" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确给出HPE进场区间，同行涨幅和供货属于背景。「DELL」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2061459248270499853" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者投資論點及未來上行。「And traditional general-purpose server leaders like Dell stand to benefit just as much as the CPU makers.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2060621480208355415" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Donald Trump</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · up to $5 million · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-05-29 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2060363241910411355" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">財報正評。「Dell blowout earnings」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2060359822076477876" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">分析戴尔订单及PENG业务，未明确股票买卖方向。「DELL」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2060335406550261857" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">已發生涨幅。「Dell直接拉了40%」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2060281570695733485" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">过去错过投资机会感想。「I couldn’t buy Dell because I didn’t have enough cash.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2060138429950865690" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">点名群体有明确未来估值扩张预期。「I believe we could see multiples expand FAST in this cohort.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2057845989126635757" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">业务成长判断。「Dell has significant growth potential thanks to CPUs.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2057828710536114453" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Donald Trump</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-05-14 · 2 則報導 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2054966449043595282" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文1</a> <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2054919028393574455" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文2</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Donald Trump</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · up to $5,000,000 · 交易日 2026-03-23（原文：March 23rd） · 揭露 2026-06-23 · 3 則報導 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2079969812407546041" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文1</a> <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2071982272471798062" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文2</a> <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2069472971035430916" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文3</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Donald Trump</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · up to $5,000,000 · 交易日 2026-02-10（原文：February 10th） · 揭露 2026-05-14 · 8 則報導 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2097773857075548623" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文1</a> <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2095948866495398366" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文2</a> <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2098425679289233609" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文3</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:HOOD</span><span class="s-n">27 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-09-24 → 2026-10-04</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="flip">1 人反轉</span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-3.2%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>ARK</b>：2026-07 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> → 2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li><li><b>Jonathan Jackson</b>：2025-10 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2025-12 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Renaissance Technologies</b>：2025-11 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>In The Assembly</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">trade_disclosure 帳號提到自己（The Assembly）在 HOOD 上獲利逾60%，屬於交易揭露性質而非明確方向判斷，依規定標為不明。「Robinhood is a stock that the Assembly is up over 60% on, from entering just a few months ago.」 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2106638595906060756" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品評價不等同看多股票。「I thought the $HOOD agentic demo was cool.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2105419963167277061" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者認為HOOD入股Crypto.com後金融業正向Stripe/Robinhood集中，並稱讚其代幣化鏈、預測市場與銀行業務擴張成功。「It does feel like the future of the finance industry is slowly consolidating around Stripe/Robinhood. Especially after the successful expansion of Robinhood Chain, Prediction Markets, and Credit Cards/Banking.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2097309699645546763" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>ARK</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 27,083 shares, ~$3.1 million · 交易日 2026-09-08（原文：Tuesday） · 揭露 2026-09-10 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2098016354250973657" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者說南韓散戶站在HOOD這邊、贏得代幣化辯論，但這只是輿論站隊，看不出對股價方向的判斷。「Korean retail is firmly siding with $HOOD over the $AMC CEO.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2095851749127188691" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者強調HOOD被選為Trump Accounts(資金分配給2500萬名兒童)計畫的唯一初始券商，並稱「讓大眾及早開始投資意義重大」。「$HOOD (up 14.83%+ today) as the initial sole brokerage」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2095565402223038651" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>ARK</b> <span class="tag t-bear">賣出</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · $9.8M · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-07-11 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2075931103702008031" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">已發生復甦反應。「nice to see some recovery with familiar faces」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2074240512593481955" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">欢呼交易平台开放Kraken并询问是否做多HOOD，未作明确承诺。「$HOOD」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2060395925487697997" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">仅回顾HOOD及期权既有收益。「HOOD」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2060379989607174275" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">推荐更换券商产品，非买卖公司股票。「I’m not sure why anyone still uses Robinhood」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2051070690032566401" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">经营策略批评。「$HOOD missed earnings」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2049360475046224050" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">缺國際股票產品比較。「$HOOD」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2047238732382876064" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">称赞Robinhood信用卡并询问是否做多，尚未表达投资决定。「Long Robinhood?」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2045344287429415403" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">业务模式肯定。「legitimate disruptors, like the next $HOOD」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2044916474008191162" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">券商产品批评。「Robinhood and other useless brokers」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2031789022830608859" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">RVI为创投基金排除；HOOD为基金发行背景，非股票看空。「$HOOD concentrates in firms」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2030288379179614287" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">RVI明确为投资基金排除；HOOD产品策略批评不等于股票方向。「$HOOD」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2023944611765592084" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">明確預期盤整，未強制看空票。「likely stay rangebound for awhile.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2021518590219079692" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">业务逆风批评，没有直接卖出方向。「revenue deceleration or disruption」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2021359576575246505" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">回顾旧投资及赞赏未具名公司增长；不能由营收及子公司数量猜上市主体。「$HOOD」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/1996560529679327449" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者从Robinhood产品体验预测公司将达一万亿美元，表达股票上涨方向。「This company is going to $1T」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1995680056912585172" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">以NBIS子公司价值与市值折价形成作者看多投资论点；其余股票为竞争、客户或历史案例。「$HOOD」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/1993657309986509242" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Renaissance Technologies</b> <span class="tag t-bear">賣出</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · approximately $1.3B · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2025-11-13 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/1989063282293154037" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jonathan Jackson</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · up to $50K · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2025-11-11 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/1988251789099995528" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jonathan Jackson</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2025-10-16 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/1978822757140840528" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-09-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">交易产品可用性肯定。「log on to Robinhood and trade」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1970859516964327513" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:JBL</span><span class="s-n">26 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-03-01 → 2026-08-27</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-4.6%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Donald Trump</b>：2026-03 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-04 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Sivers业绩逐项解析与业务供给赞赏，没有明确股票投资方向。「Initial production orders with $JBL expected in the first half of 2027」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2093054882282651723" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">客戶帶動Sivers收入期待。「I&#x27;m most excited about $JBL」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2092186856792506435" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">AAOI电话会数据与产业需求赞赏，没有股票价格或行动方向。「read through for $LITE, $SIVE / $JBL」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2085499853099208716" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">禁令的產業受益與供應鏈分析，未說股票投資方向。「A very material catalyst came about for Western supply chains」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2084597612175618342" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">量訂單預期非股票票。「volume orders from across $JBL to $POET, should hit in H1 2027.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2083114743729107236" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品讀穿。「Positive for SiPH penetration eg. $SIVE / $JBL」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2076808331453415674" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确长期持有Sivers、相信估值巨大扩张，其他公司为合作/同业资讯。「$JBL 1.6T LRO」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2074046947434860971" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">估值比較。「profitable companies like $JBL」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2070754658868687086" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确Sivers为最喜欢的激光瓶颈长仓，其他公司为合作佐证。「$JBL went god-mode」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2068651355422814294" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">直接当前多頭想法，並预测40%重估。「compelling long idea at $38B.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2064237083510952402" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确认为Sivers相对未来收入低估；其他公司为合作背景。「JBL」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2061538735595069534" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">業務管線資訊。「$JBL photonics 1.6T LRO」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2061365325741101442" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">产品放量消息。「$JBL 1.6T optical transceiver ramp」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2060002002994971046" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">業務及供應鏈資訊。「$JBL」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2059057639238365336" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">合作产品需求。「Jabil 1.6T extreme demand」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2057117978014126372" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">量產合作與供需正面評論，無單獨股票方向。「$JBL」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2056993753882345818" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">研究方法舉例，無新個股買賣。「$JBL」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2055865012565254591" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确极度看多Sivers，并称AEVA放量对双方看多；其他为业务背景。「$JBL」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2054868760629272850" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">以Sivers为核心论证未来市值上行，伙伴名单仅供应链背景。「$JBL」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2051566667009073315" target="_blank" rel