 class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">財報行情回顧。「rocketed over 25% after earnings」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2076416450265583981" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">PENG新高與財報重要性回顧，無未來方向。「$PENG hit an ATH today」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2074994395485495525" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Donald Trump</b> <span class="tag t-bear">賣出</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-07-08 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2074916904221708344" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">他人交易成果，非作者票。「Did you listen anon? $PENG」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2074904286186623353" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">事件觀察非投資承諾。「Some future catalysts to watch」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2071982559085363708" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Penguin成为辉达伙伴的公告引用，无作者股票方向。「$PENG Penguin Solutions Becomes an NVIDIA」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2069437935842181223" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">高管偏好与合作对象暗