et="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">公司資訊或舊引用背景。「$PENG」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2056487090779816246" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">推广PENG历史涨幅报告，未来内容未提供，无新方向。「why it&#x27;s up 145%」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2056154728443125788" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">他人PENG持仓收益及DELL购买新闻，無作者方向。「$PENG at +145%」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2056149932537520131" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确认可PENG极具吸引力价格，低估投资论点；其余为引文比较。「all at an extremely compelling price」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2056037118909268090" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">業務受益分析。「Penguin」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2054329153923760190" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">表達持倉相關喜悅，沒有新交易。「I DON&#x27;T WALK I WADDLE」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2054307030408868225" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确新买PENG并判断低估，看多；客户伙伴为背景。「I just bought $2M of a brand new stock」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2054269011047919839" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Donald Trump</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日 2026-03-04（原文：March 4） · 揭露 2026-07-08 · 2 則報導 <a href="https://x.com/DJTRadar/status/2075177347108479200" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文1</a> <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2074916904221708344" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文2</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:ASTS</span><span class="s-n">23 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-10-08 → 2026-09-02</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-4.2%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Adriana Cisneros</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2026-02 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-02 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-03 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Adriana Cisneros</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-09-02 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2095082109106848234" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者說如果再出現2022式升息重挫，就能用更便宜的價格買進$ASTS和$RKLB這類太空股，形容報酬會大到「retire your bloodline」，顯示他長線看多這兩檔逢低更值得買。「how cheap you could get space stocks like $ASTS and $RKLB that would literally retire your bloodline?」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2093483462455873697" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者打算把新開的退休帳戶全部押注在太空股上，認為這類題材風險報酬最不對稱，屬明確看多「I think I&#x27;m going to full port it in space stocks... There is nothing more asymmetrical.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2091701369472467284" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">財報結果反應而非看空主張。「asts 大miss」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2086913539990786114" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">相對估值可能利好，無直接股價方向。「relative valuation anchoring.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2074838397341065516" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">别人历史交易表现。「$ASTS」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2042015776916566424" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">称赞ASTS股票故事并描述社区持仓，未明确自身买卖方向。「$ASTS」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2041202902275117214" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">相对市值比較。「$ASTS」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2039484213901291707" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">历史价格或IPO事件背景。「$ASTS」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2039428282815316144" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">市场资金流资讯，未表達自身方向。「看跌期权卖方（看涨信号）」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2039360488849686669" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者当前明确维持多头持仓。「I remain long $ASTS」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2037049096218063089" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明確當前估值看多。「$ASTS and $RKLB are extraordinarily undervalued」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2030376402743369940" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确认为ASTS更低估并论证未来政府订单。「makes $ASTS even more underpriced.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2029628851740119155" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">主语明确包含ASTS的作者上涨预期。「are going to be parabolic around the time of IPO day」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2029270327247962447" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确持仓与前瞻股价上涨判断。「a 4 figure share price for this company by 2030」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2027127218095452206" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者直接做多建议。「go all in on $KRKNF or $ASTS」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2024885970282430674" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确想象ASTS未来250美元，当前多方价格预期；AT&amp;T为广告伙伴。「I open my port to $250 a share」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2021739249549070493" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">將今日回調視為買入優惠。「$ASTS」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2019218741234659614" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">業務收入模式稱讚。「$ASTS」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2013691702611980787" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">推介他人Kraken文章及其ASTS历史战绩，没有本作者股票方向。「$ASTS hit 100 dollars」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1980275896796787146" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">ASTS技术、历史财富效应与合作新闻赞赏，没有明确新的股票方向。「This stock is minting millionaires.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1976685638260064752" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">产品社会价值称赞。「AST will make it a basic human right.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1976360724307103894" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者直接称深海KRKNF和TMC为当前真正alpha，表达看多；ASTS和RKLB仅为喜爱语气。「I love $ASTS」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1975975486770774319" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:AVEX</span><span class="s-n">23 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-04-20 → 2026-08-24</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-5.9%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2026-04 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-04 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者將AVEX列為他看好的「neoprime無人機builder」之一「the neoprime drone builders $AVAV, $KTOS, $AVEX」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2091969064302465311" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者認為無人機股今年秋天可能因兩黨立法支持與國防預算大漲，並具體點名此股作為受惠標的「I think drone stocks could go on a tear this fall.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2091681510739054761" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">引用舊訂單資訊。「$AVEX received a fresh $50M order」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2086125033462677749" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">板塊反問與正面語氣。「Defense summer loading???? $AVEX $AVAV」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2072679059348209790" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">訂單与底部投資論點。「We&#x27;re calling the bottom on defense stocks」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2072024859563987322" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面技术及他人推薦，不能歸作者股價方向。「immense value of asymmetric warfare」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2070526153102672001" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">基本面信心，无明确再买或上涨承诺。「I still believe in its undeniable fundamentals」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2062619242072355023" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">現有持倉收益情緒。「$AVEX」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2051776592096223610" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">觀察清單及業務低估論點。「$AVEX」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2049965509198889094" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">旧亏损回补感慨。「Glad I could claw back on $AVEX」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2049643684061458588" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">基本面偏好，非明示投資方向。「the best pure play small cap drone stock」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2048950183342542908" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">当前持仓及继续持有观点。「My newest position $AVEX」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2048244936798306631" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">当前股票偏好及持有。「still my favorite public drone stock even though I&#x27;m bagged 11%.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2047762110336348551" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者未来增持计划。「Will continue to accumulate on dips」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2047047509093314601" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确当前买入。「Loaded more $AVEX here.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2046974055673479299" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">当前股票偏好与上行逻辑。「$AVEX I do really like the stock.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2046650038592602341" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">需求及市值比較。「$AVEX」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2046608717039509939" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">公司技术能力肯定。「$AVEX makes $ONDS look like a joke.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2046310610347192689" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确本次预期进一步股票表现。「$AVEX is just getting started.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2046300680458260974" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">軍用業務稱讚。「$AVEX」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2046286850130677863" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确认为AVEX价值优于不应持有ONDS，AVEX看多ONDS看空。「Still can&#x27;t figure out why anyone is long $ONDS when $AVEX exists.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2046274419887153448" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者實際買入及未來估值上行。「I just put 20% of my $6,200,000」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2046270360627315057" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者具体投资上行预测。「could be the next 5x drone stock.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2046228271214600605" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:CBRS</span><span class="s-n">22 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-03-22 → 2026-10-02</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="flip">1 人反轉</span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Cathie Wood</b>：2026-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> → 2026-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li><li><b>大老师</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">以 friendzone 嘲諷合作關係，未明確推導到 Cerebras 股票的方向。「Did Sama just friendzone $CBRS?」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2106152339325469010" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">負面護城河評價與再投資意願混合。「Cerebras moat deteriorated with this release.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2105854916971405529" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">競爭及產品評論，未判斷股價。「$NVDA is eating $CBRS&#x27;s lunch, and then some.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2105848503952117973" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">回顧本週新聞交易與自稱勝率，沒有交代個股多空或下一筆方向。「What a week. 100% win rate.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2105674595701231661" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">交易暗示未交代方向；公司讚賞不等於看多。「I love what Cerebra’s is doing.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2105300501214720355" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">條件式風險，仍等旗艦硬體結果。「If it&#x27;s Nvidia, it&#x27;s a real problem for CBRS.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2105128873121714549" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">已發生漲幅。「$CBRS +16%了」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2089354272408530964" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者標題明確財報後看漲，並提供強勢與目標價理由。「CBRS财报后看涨」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2087623075747836299" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">表情正面，從嚴不當股票票。「$CBRS 🚀」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2080376463480541494" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">推理需求與產品機會。「launching GPT-5.6 inference on Cerebras」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2074765232124408119" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Cathie Wood</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · $32.8M · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-07-03 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2072970201784516874" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Reddit用户使用Cerebras容量困難的故事，非作者股票方向。「how few players / limited capacity there is for fast inference」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2071961279380791729" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">新增買入与持续技术论点。「I actually picked up starter positions on Cerebras for the first time」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2070754658868687086" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Cathie Wood</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · $32.8M · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-06-24 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2069733591894954132" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">歷史價格負面反應，舊看衰財報不自動成為新票。「CBRS财报后暴跌了」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2069523984362922359" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Cathie Wood</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · $32.8M · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-06-04 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2062569871808860456" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者當前明示看多。「$CBRS 还是非常Bullish的」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2056732515034137016" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">預期催化及被動買盤上升。「CBRS上市后的潜在利好」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2056380008533545105" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">不接受當前估值並預期修正。「Not a fan of $CBRS, especially at ~$90B-100B MC valuations.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2055068788975157672" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者披露CBRS持仓并邀请买入，表达当前投资看多但语气抱怨亏损。「你们可以买了」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2054985071682294037" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">估值及客戶依賴負評。「Cerebras」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2044987382974620109" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">GTC技术复盘与他人译文，Nvidia优势与Cerebras成本评论不是股票方向。「Cost competitiveness is nonexistent」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2035581499597275615" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:VIAV</span><span class="s-n">21 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-03-27 → 2026-09-10</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="flip">1 人反轉</span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+15.2%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2026-07 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-04 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> → 2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者認為隨速度提升測試需求更嚴格，VIAV的測試業務因此受惠「testing at $VIAV as higher speeds make qualification more demanding」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2098114790048583928" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者將VIAV列為「我的光學題材持股」之一,並在高盛上修市場規模後列出其當日漲幅,明確表態持有看多。「VIAV: +8.63%」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2097367356523892915" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">VIAVI与Lumentum拆分历史及估值机制解释，没有当前股票方向。「WOW this is some fun lore about $VIAV and $LITE.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2088776240480104913" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">支持性同業營運背景。「green light from AAOI, AXTI, and VIAV」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2085811801988685950" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">比较ETF及推广自有组合，多个股票仅历史权重与未纳入公司赞赏，无新股票方向。「other incredible names like $VIAV, $TSEM, $AEHR, or $GLW」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2085396410405707941" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">收入與時程訊息。「Seeing CPO test revenues hit for $VIAV to $FORM around now.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2085174977272360987" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">VIAVI CEO电话会观点转述，不给作者看多票。「$VIAV CEO Oleg Khaykin was asked」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2085117258490138896" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">VIAV財報電話數據筆記及自引兩股財報，無新方向。「$VIAV Q4 notes from the call:」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2085115764504510568" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">两家公司财报数据赞赏，明确尚待电话会后意见。「$VIAV: revenue $443.1M」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2085106446446776588" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面業務候選觀察。「VIAVI owns the optical test market」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2085079553215766601" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">喜歡業務競爭結構，沒有明說投資買入或股價方向。「why I like VIAVI」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2084980237973311663" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">模糊喜爱光学股与引用历史业绩跳涨，不构成特定股票新方向。「$VIAV reports tomorrow」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2084826016107917466" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面候選觀察。「higher velocity set ups」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2080370552800199161" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明確預期錯誤定價由財報糾正。「I think earnings will wake people up again.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2076757192229953707" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">当前明确未来减持计划。「take some profits and rebalance tommorow」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2049643684061458588" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">欢呼VIAV财报并回顾设备供应链，未明确作者股票方向。「$VIAV」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2049586934612177231" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">分析VIAV验证设备的供应链需求并称关注财报，未明确买卖方向。「$VIAV」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2048953908547006809" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品、產業及併購資訊。「$VIAV」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2046734699255439573" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">产品技术与客户背景。「$VIAV」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2040429214927568955" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">业务护城河肯定。「$VIAV owns Stage 6.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2040232894363512924" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">測試業務正評。「$VIAV」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2037616253859139942" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">TPEX:3105</span><span class="s-n">20 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-03-16 → 2026-09-23</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-03 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者辩护其量产能力，属于公司业务乐观而非股票方向。「Win Semi」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2102763548715753927" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Sivers激光代工晶圆配置确认稳懋普通股，供应商业务预测无买卖方向。「Win Semi」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2074046947434860971" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">代工伙伴降低量产风险的业务评论，不是 WIN 股份方向。「Win Semi and others de-risking volume ramp」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2068603148311404902" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">激光供应链代工与AVGO关系明确WIN Semiconductors，核验3105；肯定制造能力非股票方向。「Win Semi volume scaling」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2061456212303221196" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">明确全球激光晶圆代工厂WIN Semiconductors，核验3105；制造规模肯定非股票方向。「Win Semi… one of the worlds most important foundries」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2060615296357196178" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">激光晶圆代工与产能语境明确稳懋，官方TPEx名录3105；业务信心不等于股票方向。「confident in Win Semi scaling capacity」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2060597940461486513" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">CW激光晶圆代工产能语境明确稳懋，官方TPEx名录3105；作者肯定供应能力而非该股投资方向。「Win Semi volume ramp」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2055822766600016238" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Sivers激光代工合作确认稳懋普通股，供货能力赞赏无股票方向。「high-volume supplier Win Semiconductor」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2054868760629272850" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">激光CPO产业的代工公司明确稳懋，官方TPEx名录3105；板块增长乐观未明确该股交易或价格目标。「Win Semi / $TSEM (Foundry)」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2050762148545216899" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">激光晶圆代工确认稳懋普通股，供应商背景无方向。「Sivers lasers is mass produced by foundries like Win Semi」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2047209727738957983" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者認為未來12個月具有吸引力，並預期CPO相關股跑贏宏觀環境及創新高，屬前瞻看多。「Win is very compelling over the next 12 months, despite short term volatility.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2047168499211235609" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">當前段落具体推介WIN半導體。「make very compelling longs.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2046043070538633618" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者直接当前长仓且名称代码明确。「long the $SIVE laser ecosystem with Win Semi (3105)」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2044597208860016877" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确股票增发事件仍正向。「It&#x27;s nuanced but actually bullish.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2042687596166615445" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">DFB激光晶圆代工语境明确稳懋，官方TPEx名录3105；供应支撑赞许不是对稳懋股价或交易的判断。「volume production / capex spend for scaling dfb laser is de-risked from Win Semi」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2042507141618004372" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者当前低估判断，Win名称代码明确。「$5.4B price tag is underselling its importance」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2041363738327204264" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">称赞研究及产品增长。「Nice pick」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2037391075145638295" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">当前明确持仓及长期上行。「I am long Win Semi (3105.TWO)」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2037387801285841118" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">激光量产代工伙伴确认稳懋普通股；供应商合作无独立股票方向。「Win Semi partnership」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2036289688227684729" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">激光晶圆代工资格及放量确认稳懋普通股；作者持有对象为Sivers，稳懋业务利好无独立方向。「Win semi ongoing qualification」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2033535833085718996" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:GLW</span><span class="s-n">20 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-03-26 → 2026-10-01</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="flip">1 人反轉</span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+8.3%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Maria Salazar</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Ren</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>大老师</b>：2026-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> → 2026-06 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">代碼出自被引用的先前互連論點，本篇自己的標題只點名 LITE，其他不新增方向票。「[引用 @ren_stocks]: $LITE $COHR $GLW $MRVL $AAOI $SIVE」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2105667101038158155" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者認為機會延伸到整個供應鏈，包括GLW的光纖業務「The opportunity also extends across the buildout, from fiber at $GLW」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2098114790048583928" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者將GLW列為光纖供應鏈中『較知名』的曝險標的，同樣揭露自己對此主題有實際部位。「For fiber: $GLW / Furukawa / Fujikura / Sumitomo are your more well-known exposure ... *disclosure, personal exposure to theme」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2097660318369697875" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">GLW當日+7.4%，且作者提到GLW與VZ簽訂延續到2032年的數十億美元光纖合約，是具體利多「$VZ + $GLW: multibillion-dollar fiber deal extending through 2032.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2097332258386403456" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，此檔列於作者看多的光學/互聯股清單中「You are not bullish enough on interconnect, photonics and optics ⚡️」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2097072930114969608" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，此檔並列於作者長期看多的持股標籤中「Bullish, up and to the right ⚡️」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2095890322190389307" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者宣告全力做多AI持股名單，此檔在標籤列表中「I&#x27;ll go max long on my Tier 1 and Tier 2 quality AI names」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2095656252873335011" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者將GLW納入其AI建置主題的持股框架，屬於長期看多部位「Four tiers, 20 names, one concentrated bet. All of it on the AI buildout」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2095654354208313699" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">比较ETF及推广自有组合，多个股票仅历史权重与未纳入公司赞赏，无新股票方向。「other incredible names like $VIAV, $TSEM, $AEHR, or $GLW」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2085396410405707941" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Corning下跌感叹与观察价位，没有明确买卖方向。「关注190-的价格」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2074156789571154399" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">直接個股負面價格方向。「警惕 $GLW 下行风险」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2073971091161395378" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">舊交易结果回顧。「伟大撤退成功」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2073326626197381266" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">當前過高估值與價格上限，結合止盈論點支持防守看空方向。「目前已然在过高估值区间」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2072007449587208628" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">自身獲利了結意向。「这里我打算止盈了」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2071983222452564290" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">直接股價上行預測。「GLW在 7.2之后会正式进入300刀区间」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2071962065691185604" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">本人具體買入傾向。「我只想买点Dram GLW INTC」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2070431844399759469" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Maria Salazar</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · up to $100,000 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-05-06 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2052068925286896093" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">产品技术采用肯定。「Corning is pretty much confirming」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2052025205128843520" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">公司領先新聞。「$GLW leads glass core substrate」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2046173276473614388" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">表情认同光纤价格行业新闻，未表达GLW投资方向。「$GLW」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2036963337708462529" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:RKLB</span><span class="s-n">20 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-10-08 → 2026-09-22</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+2.4%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Cathie Wood</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-03 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2025-12 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Cathie Wood</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · ~$26M · 交易日 2026-09-22（原文：yesterday） · 揭露 2026-09-23 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2102733493268591099" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Evan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">轉述Rocket Lab完成第95次Electron任務的營運里程碑新聞，屬正面消息但未表態股價方向。「Rocket Lab $RKLB has now completed 95 missions with its Electron rocket」 <a href="https://x.com/StockMKTNewz/status/2098363144586338779" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Wolf Financial</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">報導Rocket Lab完成2026年第16次Electron發射、累計95次任務，屬營運正面消息但無方向性表態。「Rocket Lab $RKLB just completed its 16th Electron launch of 2026, bringing the rocket to 95 missions overall.」 <a href="https://x.com/WOLF_Financial/status/2098355043720470533" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同一段話中作者將$RKLB與$ASTS並列為值得逢低買進、報酬驚人的太空股，顯示對兩者皆看多。「how cheap you could get space stocks like $ASTS and $RKLB that would literally retire your bloodline?」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2093483462455873697" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者打算把新開的退休帳戶全部押注在太空股上，認為這類題材風險報酬最不對稱，屬明確看多「I think I&#x27;m going to full port it in space stocks... There is nothing more asymmetrical.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2091701369472467284" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Cathie Wood</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · $12.6M · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-08-19 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2089974756770455748" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">舊增發新聞背景。「RKLB发新股了」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2087853868541784353" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">負面價格與增發反應，非新看空票。「其股价在盘前交易中下跌3.1%」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2087852539962372292" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Cathie Wood</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · $23M · 交易日 2026-08-12（原文：today） · 揭露 2026-08-12 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2087451309473447979" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">相對估值可能利好，無直接股價方向。「relative valuation anchoring.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2074838397341065516" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">指数纳入新闻及公司成长祝贺，非股票投资方向。「got added to Nasdaq 100!」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2065262802328293497" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">合約消息與敘事評論。「$RKLB」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2057620897796878725" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">相对市值比較。「$RKLB」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2039484213901291707" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">历史价格或IPO事件背景。「$RKLB」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2039428282815316144" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明確當前估值看多。「$ASTS and $RKLB are extraordinarily undervalued」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2030376402743369940" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">主语明确包含RKLB的作者上涨预期。「are going to be parabolic around the time of IPO day」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2029270327247962447" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确当前多头。「Long $RKLB, Long $NBIS.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/1997122660749529353" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">回顾旧投资及赞赏未具名公司增长；不能由营收及子公司数量猜上市主体。「$RKLB」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/1996560529679327449" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确自身高信念多头。「highest conviction longs」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/1995865990341496999" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者直接称深海KRKNF和TMC为当前真正alpha，表达看多；ASTS和RKLB仅为喜爱语气。「I love $RKLB」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1975975486770774319" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">TWSE:2454</span><span class="s-n">19 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-02-05 → 2026-08-31</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+0.8%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Jukan</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">補充說明聯發科39億美元可轉債案由輝達認購35億美元、Google認購其餘4億美元,雙大廠同時加碼顯示市場信心。「NVIDIA subscribed to $3.5B and Google participated in the remaining $400M」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2094565589838885027" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">輝達直接投資聯發科35億美元,屬於重大策略入股,對聯發科是明確的正面訊號。「NVIDIA invests $3.5B in MediaTek」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2094403503586419091" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者引述 DigiTimes 報導聯發科的 EMIB 封裝方案已符合 Google 的技術、良率、成本與產能要求,屬新聞轉述,未明確表態方向。「MediaTek’s EMIB solution has met Google’s original requirements for technology, yield, cost, and production capacity.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2092786880920297611" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">联发科EMIB技术明确，核验2454；技术乐观非股票方向。「MediaTek seems quite optimistic」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2084116669274972313" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者预测客户丢失对业务的打击，未明确股票卖出或价格方向。「MediaTek will take a major hit.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2072533892129755167" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">台湾ASIC公司语境确认联发科普通股；公司未来盈利赞赏未明确股票买卖或估值方向。「MediaTek is going to make so much money」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2072457892712890715" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">CPU/TPU设计公司联发科明确，核验2454；技术业务惊讶非股票方向。「MediaTek now developing Google’s CPU」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2069266963965350136" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Google TPU開發語境確認聯發科；研報引用與表情未表達作者股票方向。「MediaTek」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2068926089800593705" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">认为业务受益，没有股票方向。「Mediatek (2454) primary beneficary」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2062322546809381094" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者預期上游股票受益上漲。「Upstream ecosystem from $LITE to $AVGO to Mediatek to $TSM to $MU should go brrr.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2061596599588114444" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">业务利好评价。「MediaTek」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2054172581981470972" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">手机芯片客户确认联发科普通股；引用订单收缩无作者股票方向。「Qualcomm and MediaTek apparently cut their TSMC 4/5nm orders」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2052918751344103555" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">預測供應商。「MediaTek」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2051530610880221667" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">人事及技術新聞。「MediaTek」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2050136199621456079" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">GoogleCOT传闻与Broadcom营收利润担忧，业务负面不等于股票看空。「major negative for Broadcom and MTK」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2048992506851868780" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">公司相對竞争位置。「not Marvell, but MediaTek」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2048622395255321029" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">第三方客戶訂單研究。「MediaTek」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2048619956032655833" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">TAM受影響。「MediaTek」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2044750394719715585" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">MediaTek业务验证与無仓披露，自引旧行业多股论点无本次新方向。「Mediatek is an interesting part」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2019203090931675298" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:ASML</span><span class="s-n">19 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-03-19 → 2026-07-27</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Jukan</b>：2026-04 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">直接評價股票過度下跌，提出正向價格修正論點。「The sell-off in semiconductor equipment names such as ASML looks overdone.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2081887384531357952" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">ASML技術優勢評價，未說股票方向。「Its performance is inferior to ASML’s.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2081729771415949370" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產能澄清正面訊息。「this is not a hard limit at all.」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2077369803476779400" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">指設備產能數量，不是股票價格。「raise its target to 90」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2077363650588000334" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">ASML出口怀疑消息惊叹，不是股票看空。「suspects that ASML exported EUV」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2067777637192434052" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">負面指控新聞及驚訝反應，沒有作者股票方向。「HUH???」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2067773191913873727" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面技術消息反應。「WOW」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2066670776561127728" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產業供應瓶頸評論。「ASML is the true guardian」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2057089825011110200" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">法案背景，無單股投資方向。「ASML」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2046699418284671219" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產業、财报或產品價格資訊，無個股投資方向。「$ASML」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2045565771234021468" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">空頭風險提示，非作者買入或價格目標。「you might want to be careful」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2044287982086348936" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">持倉與期待上行催化。「so my ASML shares can go up」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2043117943194890240" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确ASML仍便宜，重申低估看多；客户为新闻背景。「ASML is still cheap.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2041076972177285495" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">三星ASML设备采购长文，没有作者股票方向。「$ASML」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2041076290711847131" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明確做多。「Long $ASML」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2039733794710896979" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">业务销量预测。「continue to sell a substantial amount of DUV equipment」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2038890721026191659" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">SK hynix购买ASML设备新闻，没有作者股票方向。「$ASML」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2036303653389344904" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">設備需求背景。「$ASML」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2034748167296803266" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">MicronEUV订单技术利弊判断，非股票买卖方向。「positive for ASML」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2034726127030476973" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:VST</span><span class="s-n">19 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-09-02 → 2026-10-05</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+1.4%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Bill Pitesa</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>David Tepper</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Donald Trump</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Harry Burn</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>James Burke</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Julia Letlow</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Kristopher Moldovan</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Nancy Pelosi</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Peter Thiel</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Ro Khanna</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Scott Hudson</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Nancy Pelosi</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-10-05 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2106983968692421059" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>In The Assembly</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者用「We told you」宣傳追蹤成效，引用內容提及 Pelosi 買進 Vistra，依交易揭露判準維持不明立場。「Do you understand now? ⏎  ⏎ We told you.」 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2106983968692421059" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Nancy Pelosi</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-09-15 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2099898537236435050" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Nancy Pelosi</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-09-14 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2099456067147108736" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Peter Thiel</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 14.1% of portfolio · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-09-12 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2098671715937038341" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Donald Trump</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · undisclosed · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-09-08 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2097267887727681753" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Julia Letlow</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · ~$15K · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-09-08 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2097267887727681753" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ro Khanna</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · ~$30K · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-09-08 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2097267887727681753" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Harry Burn</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · $55M · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-09-08 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2097267887727681753" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Peter Thiel</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · $59M · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-09-08 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2097267887727681753" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>David Tepper</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · $255M · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-09-08 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2097267887727681753" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Bill Pitesa</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · $200K · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-09-08 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2097267887727681753" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>James Burke</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 1M+ · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-09-08 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2097267887727681753" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Nancy Pelosi</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · ~$200K · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-09-08 · 2 則報導 <a href="https://x.com/DJTRadar/status/2097260510659961269" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文1</a> <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2097267887727681753" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文2</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Kristopher Moldovan</b> <span class="tag t-bear">賣出</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · $3.02 million via family trust, around $151-153/share · 交易日 2026-09-08（原文：September 8） · 揭露 2026-09-11 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2098313199527272787" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Scott Hudson</b> <span class="tag t-bear">賣出</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · $6.75 million, around $151-153/share · 交易日 2026-09-08（原文：September 8） · 揭露 2026-09-11 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2098313199527272787" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Nancy Pelosi</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-09-06 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2096496665834238063" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Nancy Pelosi</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · around $180 price level · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-09-05 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2096349541062619455" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者驚訝列出Pelosi、Thiel透過13F揭露申購VST，加上執行長兩週內在公開市場加碼買進逾100萬美元股票，將這些內部人買進動作視為正面訊號。「Now the CEO just bought another $600K of the stock on the open market. That&#x27;s $1M+ in two weeks?」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2095231661407686962" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:AVAV</span><span class="s-n">18 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-10-09 → 2026-10-02</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="flip">1 人反轉</span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-4.4%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Gil Cisneros</b>：2025-12 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2026-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2025-10 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> → 2026-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-01 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">僅以近期跌幅說明防務股票行情，沒有對這兩檔作新的價格或交易判斷。「$AVAV and $KTOS are down 60%」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2106083350159253575" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者指出AVAV財報後大漲,並準備說明其在無人機/反無人機這波超級週期中的優勢地位,明確看多。「$AVAV is surging today after earnings」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2098146489017192853" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者將AVAV列為他看好的「neoprime無人機builder」之一「the neoprime drone builders $AVAV, $KTOS, $AVEX」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2091969064302465311" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者認為無人機股今年秋天可能因兩黨立法支持與國防預算大漲，並具體點名此股作為受惠標的「I think drone stocks could go on a tear this fall.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2091681510739054761" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">引用舊財報讚賞。「$AVAV had a monster quarter」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2086125033462677749" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">AeroVironment历史底部及回报复盘，旧自引观点不新增方向。「Wow I really called the bottom on defense huh?」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2072679815161708657" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">板塊反問與正面語氣。「Defense summer loading???? $AVEX $AVAV」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2072679059348209790" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">國防股票底部與訂單成長投資論點。「We&#x27;re calling the bottom on defense stocks」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2072024859563987322" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">目前底部與訂單需求投資論點。「We&#x27;re calling the bottom on defense stocks now」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2071999343926608358" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面技术及他人推薦，不能歸作者股價方向。「immense value of asymmetric warfare」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2070526153102672001" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">同行比較，無股票下跌預期。「6% and negative EBITDA margins.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2067713003479585105" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">质量军工及估值评价，未单独买卖或预测。「$AVAV down 50%」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2062619242072355023" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">需求及市值比較。「$AVAV」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2046608717039509939" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">已完成交易回顧。「sold for solid 6 figure loss on $AVAV」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2036855404656033913" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确推荐CVX与AVAV为战争对冲多头；JBSS只业务猜想，XLS未核实。「might be good longs/hedges here.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2024322169376035019" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确在AVAV下跌时加仓；VPG旧自引不构成新投票。「I’ve added to my $AVAV positions on the 16% dip.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2013691795130228801" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Gil Cisneros</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日 2025-12-15（原文：December 15th） · 揭露 2026-01-13 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2011156631661527374" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确大额押注Kraken并称AVAV、KTOS严重高估，形成看多与看空的相对价值判断。「$AVAV AND $KTOS are grossly overvalued」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1976395025052561556" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:COIN</span><span class="s-n">18 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-10-23 → 2026-09-29</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-4.6%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>大老师</b>：2026-07 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">肯定產品便利性，沒有股價論點。「少一些跨平台搬钱的麻烦，做组合和对冲也更方便。」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2104911803017023767" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Coinbase安全与用户服务推广，长期账户指平台使用而非股票。「会更愿意把它当成一个长期账户，而不只是单纯拿来交易的平台。」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2103510126363922933" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Coinbase注册推广及旧服务评论，无新股票承诺。「欢迎大家来注册一下Coinbase」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2102043723823820975" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品業務正評。「Coinbase这次真的不一样。」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2102043166631456896" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面業務觀察及推薦連結，不等同投資買入。「这也是我觉得 $COIN 值得持续观察的地方.」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2099925325790793775" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者認為COIN股價走勢漂亮,市場正在重新定價Coinbase為越來越大的加密用戶入口,並稱讚其開戶流程大幅簡化帶來的護城河效應。「最近 $COIN 的走势确实漂亮...Coinbase 正在变成一个越来越大的 Crypto 用户入口」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2095529451656532153" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者以「186了 谢谢大家」慶祝股價來到186美元，延續先前對Coinbase併購Deribit可能重塑估值的正面看法。「Coinbase 186了 谢谢大家」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2094484039394824684" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">業務策略正評。「感觉Coinbase下一阶段可能不只是个交易所」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2087984336532607070" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">認為合併可能帶來估值重塑機會，為公司股票正向論點。「合并或许会给Coinbase带来估值重塑的机会」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2087469426853683568" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">有交易機會但無明確漲跌方向。「但强调Coinbase下一财报前的交易机会」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2084228800540541123" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">自己的前瞻多頭財報觀點，而非純數據引用。「但看好下一季度财报」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2082930703864598869" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Coinbase跨资产服务推广为公司赞赏，不是股票方向；私营OpenAI永续代码不当股票。「Coinbase要开始发力了」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2080660538296861048" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">描述期權流非作者自身方向。「Coinbase 期权流 看涨彻底疯狂了」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2079580216511570124" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">回顾COIN匿名期权收益，无作者新方向。「$COIN」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2054965064105685367" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">回顾COIN匿名交易收益及直播成果，无当前作者方向。「$COIN」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2054955869377568776" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">競爭業務背景。「$COIN」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2034559475533910175" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">品牌背书正面，没有 COIN 股票方向。「Coinbase提供了资金支持和背书」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2014729044026392796" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">期權流与政策猜測。「COIN」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/1981248586718597319" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:CRCL</span><span class="s-n">18 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-10-22 → 2026-08-03</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></span><span class="flip">1 人反轉</span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-5.3%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>ARK</b>：2026-07 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-06 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2025-12 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>大老师</b>：2025-10 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> → 2026-06 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">具名加密股對應避開投資指示。「可以避开加密板块」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2084228800540541123" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>ARK</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 217,896 shares worth $13.7M · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-07-11 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2075931103702008031" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">公司負面情緒。「但是骂CRCL会被一堆人骂」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2075580044341379161" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确预期Circle指数排除卖压并否定捡便宜，形成空方投资判断。「卖盘将会变成150-250M卖盘」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2072010287277064259" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">明確退出倉位。「Closed $LASR and $CRCL」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2061488431851827559" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">资金流觀察。「空头跑路了」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2051365591953608829" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">相對估值評論。「$CRCL is only worth $24B」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2050475969484599638" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明示投资方向。「why I’m bullish on $CRCL」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2040469708739375399" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">競爭業務背景。「$CRCL」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2034559475533910175" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">已發生收益回顧。「$CRCL」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2034166166676230238" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">回顾Circle旧推荐及翻倍收益，没有新的股票方向。「$CRCL」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2031079292474650686" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">历史风险例子，没有当前价格或空头行动。「$CRCL at $200」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2028109409948508531" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">CRCL过去涨幅及旧买点回顾，无本次新方向；AXTI为方法例子。「$CRCL... is now back up 53%」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2027068051749998875" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">回顾CRCL涨幅与旧推荐评论，没有新方向。「$CRCL」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2026683292679024811" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明確當前買入估值偏好。「I really, really like $CRCL at $54.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2018724759262085467" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确当日加仓TSM和CRCL；其他持仓与计划为旧自引，不能当成新方向。「Also added a decent amount in $CRCL positions」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/1998453391203389533" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">期權流与政策猜測。「CRCL」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/1981248586718597319" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者看漲機會判斷。「也许也有看涨的机会」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/1981008878243598579" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">XETRA:LPK</span><span class="s-n">18 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-04-16 → 2026-08-14</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2026-04 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-04 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-04 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">玻璃基板製程語境確認LPKF；量產延後未表達股價方向。「Volume ramp for some players eg. $LPK / Philoptics (161580) / E&amp;R (8027) likely track these  mass production timelines.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2088115008827715971" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确当前持有 LPKF 股份。「$LPK (that I own)」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2072986020640076052" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者当前持有并明确预期高于现值的市值上行。「Maybe $3B-$5B seems reasonable」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2069005921318281566" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">LIDE及玻璃封裝設備明確確認LPKF；作者明說低估與持倉，屬看多。「I do think LPK is very undervalued based on these discussions (disclosure: own positions).」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2067958378488623499" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">全文LPKF名称和玻璃基板设备明确核验Xetra:LPK；作者披露own LPK及预期定价。「selected LPKF equipment」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2067216066905088237" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">当前LPK通过同篇自引的玻璃载板和激光深蚀刻产品被明确识别为LPKF，官方交易所确认Xetra普通股LPK；回顾涨势无新方向，不清除OTC的LPKFF。「laser induced deep etching」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2058879435726836152" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">LIDE設備上下文明確，作者推介投資機會。「one of the cleaner ways to play the next Glass Substrate supercycle.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2052308880961810532" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">LPKF玻璃基板上下文明確，歷史收益。「$LPK (glass core substrates)」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2051202378058346567" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确LPKF Laser、LIDE和欧洲财报确认德国普通股；作者重新强化量产核心投资论点，表达看多，OTC代码仍未解决。「Thoughts on LPKF Laser &lt; $LPK / $LPKFF&gt; earnings」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2049876593674440706" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确股票长逻辑，名称及LIDE身份已核验。「The only reason why LPKF is a long anyway is 2027 LIDE glass core substrate mass production.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2049737227677421908" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">回顾旧论点与市场表现。「glass core substrates」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2049390824673456494" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">名称及玻璃基板身份明确，作者重申投资机会。「However… time seems right now?」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2049212010660049008" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">當日漲跌或訂單新聞，未明示方向。「$LPK」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2046894773706035638" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">全文明稱LPKF、LIDE與玻璃基板設備確認Xetra普通股；本則舊論點及市場反應無新方向。「$LPK」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2046620208387981538" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">全文显式LPKF、LIDE激光深蚀刻与玻璃载板共同确认LPKF，官方交易所确认Xetra普通股LPK；作者明确称极佳上涨多头并持仓。「selected LPKF equipment」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2046449839626670369" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">全文LIDE、玻璃基板與LPKF確認Xetra普通股；作者當下持有三股並預期快速重估，為看多。「European AI supply chain is about to get repriced FAST.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2045927271622746585" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者持倉及未來多倍收益。「where 4 to 10x is on the table.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2045151745509372168" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确LPKF及LIDE激光工艺、德国代码确认普通股；作者相对Besi估值比较形成上游低估投资论点。「LPKF&#x27;s LIDE process」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2044883190188568579" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:ALAB</span><span class="s-n">16 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-12-11 → 2026-08-07</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-0.3%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Ren</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-02 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>大老师</b>：2026-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">已完成交易與價格績效回顧，自引舊買賣不變成新方向。「$ALAB +13%」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2085713926776365403" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">已結束交易獲利。「$ALAB +13%」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2085497449263620140" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">复盘CAT和ALAB历史交易回报，Bullish指总体AI建设，未新增逐股方向。「$ALAB + 13%」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2084741398209679372" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">漲幅回顧。「$ALAB +39%」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2084725475327508978" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">本人新建倉及預期獲利方向。「Next in line is $ALAB already entered last night at 331.48.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2084700370111012890" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">價格突破反應而非新增方向。「目前已突破 call wall」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2084673395552350275" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">自身方向看漲。「ALAB整体以看涨为主」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2084658687059394736" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">引用業務受益背景。「Montage Technology, Astera Labs, and PrimeMass」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2079105217346601204" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面分析師預期屬第三方。「UBS raises $MRVL ´s PT to $340 and $ALAB」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2071497488415252777" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">歷史漲幅。「$ALAB up 276%」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2069246038935065076" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">指数纳入新闻及公司成长祝贺，非股票投资方向。「got added to Nasdaq 100!」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2065262802328293497" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">ALAB今日反弹与自引旧期权盈利回顾，無新方向。「ALAB盘中再拉回，收复所有下跌」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2062595933284798715" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者当前持有看涨期权。「我自己的370 call 目前接近ITM」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2062239289107456143" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">转述retimer行业及Astera业绩新闻，未表达股票方向。「$ALAB」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2058398967097139268" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确三股回调为买点，看多。「Recent drop across the board presents a good opportunity for these three.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2023600495353622546" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确持有AAOI和LITE并认为AAOI结构低估；其他公司为旧持仓或客户背景。「$ALAB」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/1999240464420250042" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:SMCI</span><span class="s-n">16 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-03-21 → 2026-08-31</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+4.6%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>大老师</b>：2026-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">引用SMCI逾600億美元新伺服器訂單作為需求強勁的證據。「$SMCI $60B+ new server orders」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2094492628758999451" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">嘲讽Supermicro CEO回避问题，负面公司语气不等于看空股票。「I’ve never seen a guy dodge so many questions」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2087345398130282801" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明說資本應集中AI基建並支持成為持有人，對所提三股投資表態。「I just can&#x27;t relate to anyone who doesn&#x27;t have their capital highly concentrated in AI infrastructure.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2087290590086180951" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">三股強勁財報及需求讀穿讚賞，無明確股票方向。「Insane earnings today for the AI theme」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2087285356999958663" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明示估值上行及當前部位。「I think there&#x27;s a lot of room for rerating」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2087280662802026931" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">反驳便宜模型减少算力的产业判断，没有具体股票价格或行动方向。「$SMCI reporting gross margin growth」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2079932080260075635" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">引用正面分析師預期。「SMCI (U/G on June 22)」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2070116698284597532" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者預測订单兑现带来高弹性上行。「SMCI 这种公司对订单预期的股价弹性，一定会比 Dell、HPE、Lenovo 更大。」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2069501595377946957" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">回顾SMCI涨幅并骂公司，非看空股价。「虽然它依然是个弱智公司」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2069085337843068933" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">資金流播報。「SMCI 出现大量看涨期权」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2069054843134836813" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Rubin量产与HBM验证资料、研究预告，无明确股票方向。「$DELL $HPE Lenovo $SMCI」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2068948199084367969" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者认为SMCI极度低估，明确看多。「被极大的低估了」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2061890841506173089" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确给出HPE进场区间，同行涨幅和供货属于背景。「SMCI」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2061459248270499853" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">嘲讽SMCI合规问题，Jensen增长言论属于引文。「Lmao」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2058127278878634134" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">转述黄仁勋对产品和Supermicro预期，未表达作者投资方向。「Super Micro Computer」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2058125914471608752" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">笑声回应Supermicro违规新闻与股价回顾，无作者投资方向。「$SMCI」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2035229388011339961" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:CCXI</span><span class="s-n">15 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-06-30 → 2026-09-23</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-0.5%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Ren</b>：2026-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">核實SPAC身分吻合，正面介紹無买入。「listing through a Klein SPAC, $CCXI into $AGLT.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2102869588895473834" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">SPAC目標產品介紹，未明示買入。「$CCXI releases their Digit 5 next-generation humanoid.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2099830591663513642" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明確表示下半年新論點放在CCXI，看好人形機器人／下游實體AI題材。「For H2, my new thesis was on $CCXI for humanoids/downstream physical AI shift」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2096814311306129776" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确要求INDI上涨；引文其他股票及合并代码不归作者方向。「$CCXI is the pure play.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2089890179389563009" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">業務政策受益評價，不直接當股票看多。「should be happy to hear this」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2082175588555702410" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">本人明確長倉SPAC。「I&#x27;m am personally long on Agility through $CCXI」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2075302956581449892" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确长期持有四家并认为便宜估值可恢复，构成保有多方承诺。「leader of US humanoids with $CCXI」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2074951295027568736" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">低上市投資估值對比高私募估值的目前金融論點。「At closer pricing that $AMZN, $NVDA, SoftBank, and Foxconn vaulted it at.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2074214669808717906" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">机器人劳力替代技术发展论述，Amazon及Agility为案例，没有股票方向。「robots like $CCXI」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2073351980131754203" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">板塊上市熱度，未給CCXI投資方向。「robotics sector excitement is palpable」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2072913865458004014" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面業務與他人持倉披露，舊自引偏好不變新票。「I knew Agility Robotics would be popular」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2072765527764971642" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">自己的当前股票偏好及相對估值論點。「my personal preference is $CCXI.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2072741541404406008" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">對所選投資標的的現行偏好與供應鏈論點。「Which is why I’ve liked Agility Robotics $CCXI」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2072630036600103340" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">當下投資承諾並對開端前景乐观。「the only humanoids stock I’m invested in is $CCXI」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2072013036647588011" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确Agility/CCXI为当前最喜爱机器人仓位；第三方其他持仓表述不归作者新方向。「Agility Robotics is currently my favorite humanoid/robotics position.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2071995924172394695" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:FLY</span><span class="s-n">15 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-04-08 → 2026-08-24</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-3.3%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2026-04 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-04 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者打算把新開的退休帳戶全部押注在太空股上，認為這類題材風險報酬最不對稱，屬明確看多「I think I&#x27;m going to full port it in space stocks... There is nothing more asymmetrical.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2091701369472467284" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">直接對股票估值吸引力與高毛利成長的投資論點。「looks very attractive at $27/share ($4.5B MC).」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2074237701021421900" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">FLY订单融资新闻与旧涨幅回顾，未新增当前买卖方向。「$FLY」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2059367529689338362" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者当前认为股价未反映业务能力。「still feel like the market is sleeping on its unique capability mix」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2057894288990896511" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">現有持倉收益情緒。「$FLY」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2051776592096223610" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">觀察清單及業務低估論點。「$FLY」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2049965509198889094" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">合同增长新闻。「Huge news for $FLY」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2047854194179375346" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">防務業務重新定位稱讚。「$FLY」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2047438271136043057" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">既往涨幅及研究成效。「up 16% today」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2044850583002079234" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">过去股价。「$FLY is leading the space stock rally today」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2044841329398776032" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">公司业务分类及质量评价。「an AI missile defense software stock」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2044157167427826036" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者强调FLY大幅估值折价与未定价业务，明确投资看多；其他为比较背景。「7x valuation discount to its closest public comp」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2043821418920481108" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者實際買入及未来股价上行。「I just put 15% of my $5,000,000 fund in $FLY」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2043816381830111683" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确当前股票投资机会。「$FLY looks to be the next asymmetric space stock」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2042015776916566424" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确论证FLY相对RKLB估值折价及增长潜力，表达看多FLY。「a 7x valuation discount」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2041894267052777570" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:HIMS</span><span class="s-n">14 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-02-06 → 2026-07-06</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-03 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">已發生復甦反應。「nice to see some recovery with familiar faces」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2074240512593481955" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">既往股价及业务改善。「up +8.64% today.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2046282147036909941" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">預期回到40。「$HIMS at $28」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2046005919637733430" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者认为HIMS跌幅与利好不匹配，并论证空头回补限制股价下行，表达投资利好。「inherent buying pressure to cover over time」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2045196575010587104" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Huberman关于HIMS股价引述，未作者独立表态。「Huberman did say $HIMS was set to soar」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2044843391348056489" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者預期催化迫使空頭回補及股票上行。「Short sellers are likely in trouble」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2044544090549981244" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">产品平台潜力肯定。「Combining $HIMS to $TEM has immense potential.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2038281177124245842" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">转述Huberman看多HIMS并质疑空头，未明确作者自身方向。「$HIMS」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2031973770844626988" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明確当前做多。「I would personally hold and go long here on HIMS.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2031748911174725855" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">营运成长潜力，旧买入建议不新增。「global DTC retail distribution network and latent revenue monetization」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2031175321748385992" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">具風險條件的明確做多機會。「it might be worth flipping long again」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2031152993886941656" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确预期HIMS利好可能引发空头挤压上行。「Would not be surprised to see a short squeeze」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2030083176744505386" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">业务逆风批评，没有直接卖出方向。「revenue deceleration or disruption」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2021359576575246505" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">批评HIMS监管与产业游说，情绪不等于股票方向。「$HIMS」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2019903479486279877" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:LASR</span><span class="s-n">14 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-01-23 → 2026-08-24</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="flip">1 人反轉</span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+2.6%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-04 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> → 2026-06 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> → 2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-03 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者認為無人機股今年秋天可能因兩黨立法支持與國防預算大漲，並具體點名此股作為受惠標的「I think drone stocks could go on a tear this fall.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2091681510739054761" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">跌幅與供應風險新聞。「$LASR stock is down 35% after a weak guide」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2087236893167771819" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">认为合理估值，不等同上涨预期。「$LASR and $EOS are fairly valued」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2062619242072355023" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">明確退出倉位。「Closed $LASR and $CRCL」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2061488431851827559" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确称LASR激光武器股价格低估，看多；澳洲股票待验证。「laser weapon stocks like $LASR and $EOS.AX look increasingly mispriced」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2043521641041604654" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">介绍激光武器供应商与订单，无明确股票买卖方向；澳洲代码未核实。「$LASR」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2043457536112689593" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">主张增加激光武器研发，非股票买卖方向。「$LASR」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2038785650632397005" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明確採納Stay Long投資觀點。「I share the same sentiment with Baird」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2029646649170219307" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">过去结果庆祝。「This aged well. $LASR +31%」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2028608109636202887" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">业务曝光评价。「pure play exposure for the future of warfare」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2028497913979302109" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确新增持仓。「Ended up taking positions in $LASR at $3B MC.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2028455727996752242" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">业务供应及收入。「a confirmed supplier」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2028295655525863693" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">技术与历史涨幅正面，没有投资方向。「don’t have any right now」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2021937198799733148" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">说明LASR提供定向能武器纯粹敞口，没有明确股票价值或买卖判断。「$LASR」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2014826579625738691" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:MSTR</span><span class="s-n">14 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-10-31 → 2026-09-03</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="flip">1 人反轉</span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+1.8%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Donald Trump</b>：2026-07 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-01 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>大老师</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> → 2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者原本對MSTR印象負面,看到與Google Cloud合辦論壇的消息後直言「黑轉粉」,顯示態度轉為正面看待該股。「完了 我要MSTR黑转粉了 我日」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2095524271238045982" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">對Strategy進指數不滿。「啥时候从 $IGV 里把丫踢出去」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2088147101851279596" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">具名股票對應避開且有下行剔除風險。「可以避开加密板块」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2084228800540541123" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Donald Trump</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日 2026-07-24（原文：July 24） · 揭露 2026-09-22 · 2 則報導 <a href="https://x.com/DJTRadar/status/2102493972115677608" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文1</a> <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2102473750562361660" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文2</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">批评基金保留Strategy为软件成分，公司负面语气没有明确股票方向。「为什么要留着 $MSTR」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2068449777608708407" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者认同加密风险并讨论机制，引用他人STRC/MSTR崩盘预测不直接归作者。「$MSTR&#x27;s problems」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2062295959644819926" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">对STRC/MSTR风险报道反应，无明确未来股票方向。「风险再现」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2062286277744165008" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">價格回顾。「今日已突破」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2043974372139143547" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">回顾MSTR价格与旧匿名期权单，无当前作者方向。「$MSTR」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2043708501781094524" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">期權流解讀。「$MSTR」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2042683783254818975" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">记录资金流指标偏多和偏空，不等于作者投资方向。「$MSTR」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2042681476702146889" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">回顾加密市场与MSTR及BMNR跌幅，没有当前股票方向。「$MSTR」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2019682329187524746" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明確事件支持MSTR上行。「bullish for $MSTR」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2007872395990937749" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">期權流解讀。「$MSTR」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/1984295150517170427" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:TMC</span><span class="s-n">14 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-10-08 → 2026-08-21</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-1.8%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2025-10 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者僅列出TMC今年至今下跌42.3%作為「稀土/礦業股整體表現不佳」的例證，未表態未來股價方向「$TMC: -42.3% YTD」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2090845626510766366" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确多头方向。「Long $TMC.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2016660616036147373" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确自身组合买入策略中的股票。「My investing strategy is to buy small companies」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2014814859112960424" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确当前投资信念及上行行业机会。「my conviction in $TMC and $KRKNF」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2014405212082208951" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">持续当前投资承诺。「I&#x27;ve been sticking to this play dilligently since summer」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2014369357607125151" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者预期TMC将大幅重估，表达未来股票上涨方向。「We&#x27;re one signature away from a huge re rating.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2014092843472527440" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确当前投资信念增强。「boosts my conviction in $TMC」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2011895962395165087" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">TMC上涨行情及提问，没有投资承诺。「SURGING」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1993818920650985580" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">回顾TMC现有仓位与盘后涨幅，并猜测听证会原因，未给新交易方向。「My second largest position $TMC surging after hours」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1990930784119894447" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">审批实现信心，非股价预测。「This is a when NOT if.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1989089997786607920" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确当前自身投资持仓。「Here&#x27;s why I&#x27;m in」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1983211606692548835" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确表示对TMC看多。「So bullish」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1978248454599016910" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">TMC政府股权或许可催化事件判断，没有明确股票买卖方向。「Permitting or gov stake catalyst feels like a 🔒」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1977439542983676041" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者直接称深海KRKNF和TMC为当前真正alpha，表达看多；ASTS和RKLB仅为喜爱语气。「the real alpha right now」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1975975486770774319" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:AEVA</span><span class="s-n">13 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-02-09 → 2026-08-06</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-02 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">AEVA漲幅及舊消息回顧，無作者新方向。「$AEVA is up 42% on the day」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2085375559765262650" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品及行情正面回顧。「the only one that made a green print was $AEVA.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2085219567727431738" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Aeva产品新市场及Sivers供应链正面读穿，不是明确股票判断。「New TAM and a hyperscaler programs for Aeva」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2085217487864643658" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确看多LITE/Sivers上游受益；雷达公司监管条件分析不等于无条件方向。「For $OUST, $AEVA」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2074581698604593367" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确长期持有Sivers、相信估值巨大扩张，其他公司为合作/同业资讯。「$AEVA starting HVM」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2074046947434860971" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">私人VC资本轮动及旧Aeva曝光论述，未给新的股票方向。「called out $AEVA as potential exposure」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2073044119287722024" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">推测Sivers/Aeva/Apple产品合作及收入潜力，尚无明确股票方向。「$SIVE + Aeva」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2069388279355756826" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">業務及供應鏈資訊。「$AEVA」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2059057639238365336" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">分析机器人供应链业务敞口，未明确股票买卖方向。「$AEVA」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2058644487224848654" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</