class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+5.0%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Trump administration (U.S. government)</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Trump administration (U.S. government)</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 9.9 million shares at $37.85/share (~$375M deal) · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-09-11 <a href="https://x.com/DJTRadar/status/2098522390200263157" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">政府支持消息。「US Gov to take 1% stake in $GFS」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2082513405219631384" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确长期持有Sivers、相信估值巨大扩张，其他公司为合作/同业资讯。「$GFS SCALE」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2074046947434860971" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Sivers融资正面评价附机构与折价条件，未形成无条件投资承诺。「strategic investors like $GFS」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2072007692684837039" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">今日涨幅及事后仓位懊悔，自引旧TSEM看多非新方向。「$GFS and $INTC have been going brrr」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2069188398825566318" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确Sivers为最喜欢的激光瓶颈长仓，其他公司为合作佐证。「foundries like $GFS」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2068651355422814294" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">合作平台肯定。「Globalfoundries Silicon Photonics Platform」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2061718299139100931" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确认为Sivers相对未来收入低估；其他公司为合作背景。「GFS」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2061538735595069534" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">過去漲幅回顧。「$GFS」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2059343560659623985" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">以Sivers为核心论证未来市值上行，伙伴名单仅供应链背景。「$GFS」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2051566667009073315" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">以Sivers市值及未来需求错配论证上行，其他公司仅客户供应链背景。「$GFS」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2047209727738957983" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">电源半导体产业与过去研究表现回顾，无新方向。「$GFS &amp;amp; $UMC have been on a bit of a tear」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2046370913080558010" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">過去持倉與新訂單成果回顧。「We made a huge non-consensus bet」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2045855510323421638" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:LWLG</span><span class="s-n">13 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-03-11 → 2026-08-31</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+14.0%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-03 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-04 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">與ALMU、POET同被列為缺乏現金流支撐、跌回原點的早期光子概念股。「quantum stocks and early-stage photonic moonshots such as $ALMU, $POET, $LWLG gave back their entire runs」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2094494253267157010" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">相對估值批評，無股價看空。「LightWave Logic」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2054737349075218567" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">相對估值比較，沒有股價看空。「$LWLG」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2049609993071259684" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">供應鏈背景或對估值反應的批評。「$LWLG」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2049006161500991925" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者认为LWLG估值错误且资金买错标的，明确投资看空；其他是比较及合作背景。「Feels like dumb money institutions went into the wrong name」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2044830468299010144" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">相对估值比较，不等于股价看空。「$LWLG」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2043977582564229249" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">投机兴趣及条件性产品成功，未明示买入。「genuinely interesting lottery ticket」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2043456793716957405" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">业务和估值批评，未预测下跌或卖出。「$LWLG, a pre-revenue science project」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2033466880661606646" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">監看建議非買入。「One to keep on your watchlist.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2032156195444625546" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">技术性能肯定。「Their material hits higher speeds」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2032145772532416676" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">价格与合作新闻。「Up 15% on the day.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2031849944118669522" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明確投資風報比機會。「highest r/r trade ahead of Nvidia GTC.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2031847046832144844" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">业务管线称赞。「The Tower deal just turbocharged that pipeline.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2031843702335775085" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:TEM</span><span class="s-n">13 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-01-01 → 2026-08-20</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-9.9%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Donald Trump</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Nancy Pelosi</b>：2025-01 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Nancy Pelosi</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-08-20 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2090484632668004517" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Donald Trump</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-08-20 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2090484632668004517" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面回應引用觀察名單，但未明示自己投資方向。「跟上了」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2086704164562980874" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Donald Trump</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日 2026-05-01（原文：May 2026） · 揭露 2026-08-20 <a href="https://x.com/DJTRadar/status/2090501068622819717" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">产品平台潜力肯定。「Combining $HIMS to $TEM has immense potential.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2038281177124245842" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Nancy Pelosi</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · exercised into 5,000 shares · 交易日 2026-01-01（原文：this January） · 揭露 2026-09-07 · 2 則報導 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2096864120091910398" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文1</a> <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2100850438979363177" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文2</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Nancy Pelosi</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2025-10-20 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/1980275631805120892" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Nancy Pelosi</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2025-10-08 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/1975971624513110372" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Nancy Pelosi</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2025-10-07 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/1975582283760566441" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Nancy Pelosi</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2025-10-03 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/1974114406549369265" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-09-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Nancy Pelosi</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2025-09-22 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/1970129836749279240" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-09-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Nancy Pelosi</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2025-09-18 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/1968763039211008087" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-01-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Nancy Pelosi</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日 2025-01-01（原文：January 2025） · 揭露 2026-08-20 <a href="https://x.com/DJTRadar/status/2090501068622819717" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">TWSE:3006</span><span class="s-n">11 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-08-27 → 2026-09-14</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">NOR/SLC语境明确ESMT晶豪科，核验3006；作者直接当前持仓。「my idea and position with ESMT」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2099411795131924487" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者直言認為ESMT有機會複製SNDK的漲勢，強調其單月1.11億美元淨利、年化本益比僅2.1倍，並註明自己持有部位。「Currently they make ~$111M net income a month from July earnings ($2.8B MC), which annualized is like ~2.1X P/E. *I have positions.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2097348486635368686" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者秀出ESMT八月營收年增605%、毛利率同步大幅上升，並註明自己持有部位。「ESMT revenue up ~+605% Y/Y, 16.4% M/M Which is interesting given gross margins also rising tremendously too.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2097232588796780856" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者轉發自己先前對ESMT(3006)供給吃緊、多輪漲價的看多論述，並對登上台灣財經媒體感到開心，顯示他仍持看多立場。「Yep, ESMT (3006) has exposure to multiple legacy memory segments.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2096721917386641756" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者稱這是自己「DDR2/DDR3記憶體想法」的更新，ESMT八月營收年增逾6倍且獲利率極高，並直言「如果定價維持、營收持續增加，那會非常棒」。「ESMT August revenue was ~$249M, up from ~$214M last month... if pricing holds, and revenue increases, that would be very nice」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2095580088620449880" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">全文明确晶豪科3006与ESMT为同一存储设计公司，官方TWSE名录吻合；作者持仓披露和业务兴奋不等于新股票方向。「3006 晶豪科」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2094083798204047577" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">传统记忆体业务及3006明确确认晶豪科技；作者低市盈率和供给持续性论述形成看多价值判断。「ESMT (3006)」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2093811019823132903" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">名稱、3006與DRAM語境確認ESMT；作者認為低估值錯價，表達看多。「I think markets either don&#x27;t know about this, are mispricing duration, or overestimating PSMC&#x27;s wafer hike effects.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2093805166655143988" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">DDR2业务确认晶豪科技，盈利模式类比没有作者股票买卖方向。「ESMT + DDR2 bottlenecks」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2093054882282651723" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确新建 ESMT 多头仓位。「I started up positions in ESMT」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2092851118233764178" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">名稱與3006確認ESMT；作者明說取得部位並支持低估值看多。「I wanted exposure to DDR2/DDR3 bottleneck ongoing and found ESMT (3006).」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2092789800428622128" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:CIEN</span><span class="s-n">11 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-04-09 → 2026-09-10</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+13.7%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2026-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者認為機會延伸到CIEN的網通業務，視為光學建置擴張受惠者「and networking at $CIEN to testing at $VIAV as higher speeds make qualification more demanding」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2098114790048583928" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者將CIEN列為「我的光學題材持股」之一,並在高盛上修市場規模後列出其當日漲幅,明確表態持有看多。「CIEN: +6.94%」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2097367356523892915" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">直接股票多頭主張。「how bullish this is for $CIEN and $NOK」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2087610369153900627" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面候選觀察。「higher velocity set ups」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2080370552800199161" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确持有光学组合与需求长线信念，支持其点名股票多方持有。「why I have conviction in it.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2072738199927926897" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">CIEN跌幅及业务解释，未明确提出作者价格展望；自引旧行业比较非新方向。「Stock is 30% off its high with both selloff catalysts cleared.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2066898048299470925" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者称CIEN暴跌为优质资产甩卖并重申核心持仓投资论点，明确看多。「Fire sale today on one of the highest quality photon」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2062591219642085843" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">本人新增加倉及盈利結構改善論點。「I added to my position on this dip.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2062583117030850807" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">NOK产品新增AI功能新闻，引用旧产业论点不形成新投资方向。「$CIEN」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2054191372802941255" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">業務需求正面新聞。「Ciena」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2046636300124778731" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">分析Nokia业务及英伟达分销战略，没有明确作者股票方向。「$CIEN」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2042337208951325062" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:GME</span><span class="s-n">11 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-01-01 → 2026-10-04</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+3.1%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Michael Burry</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li><li><b>Ryan Cohen</b>：2026-01 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Unusual Whales</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">options_flow 帳號播報 GameStop 內部人買進數據與股價連續上漲週數，純數據陳述未加判斷。「GameStop insiders are buying, and the CEO is leading the way.」 <a href="https://x.com/unusual_whales/status/2106776609457844610" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Unusual Whales</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">options_flow 帳號再次轉述 Ryan Cohen 的公開申報買進資料，屬於純數據播報，沒有作者自己的方向判斷。「Ryan Cohen of GameStop, $GME, has bought millions of $GME recently.」 <a href="https://x.com/unusual_whales/status/2106738860495425611" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ryan Cohen</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · millions of $GME · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-10-04 · 2 則報導 <a href="https://x.com/unusual_whales/status/2106559780743704635" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文1</a> <a href="https://x.com/unusual_whales/status/2106738860495425611" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文2</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Unusual Whales</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">options_flow 帳號轉述 Ryan Cohen 的公開申報買進資料，屬於純數據播報，沒有作者自己的方向判斷。「Ryan Cohen of GameStop, $GME, has bought millions of $GME recently.」 <a href="https://x.com/unusual_whales/status/2106559780743704635" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ryan Cohen</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · $10.6 million · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-09-30 <a href="https://x.com/unusual_whales/status/2105362289486700895" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ryan Cohen</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 1 million shares · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-09-10 · 2 則報導 <a href="https://x.com/unusual_whales/status/2098197053772017962" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文1</a> <a href="https://x.com/unusual_whales/status/2106776609457844610" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文2</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Unusual Whales</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">純粹播報 Ryan Cohen 買進 100 萬股 GameStop 股票的事實，options_flow 帳號沒有加上自己的方向判斷。「BREAKING: GameStop CEO Ryan Cohen bought 1 million $GME shares」 <a href="https://x.com/unusual_whales/status/2098197053772017962" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Wolf Financial</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">轉述 Ryan Cohen 買進 GameStop 股份並揭露持股比例的事實，沒有作者自己的方向判斷。「Ryan Cohen just bought 1 million GameStop shares for about $20.4M, at an average price of $20.38/share」 <a href="https://x.com/WOLF_Financial/status/2098170146519162886" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Evan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">純粹轉述 Ryan Cohen 買進 GameStop 股票的申報事實，沒有作者自己對股價方向的判斷。「RYAN COHEN JUST BOUGHT $20.4M WORTH OF GAMESTOP STOCK」 <a href="https://x.com/StockMKTNewz/status/2098169986414006375" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bear">賣出</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · entire position · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-05-05 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2051521921519321376" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ryan Cohen</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · $79 million · 交易日 2026-01-01（原文：this year） · 揭露 2026-09-30 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2105197431012892747" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:HPE</span><span class="s-n">11 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-05-22 → 2026-09-02</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+10.7%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>大老师</b>：2026-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">貼文是對自己先前財報預測「4中3」命中率的事後檢討,引用內容為財報前的舊預測,不代表目前立場。「4中3 谢谢大家」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2095244650944897202" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">量產预期比較。「$HPE 、Lenovo、 $SMCI」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2069501595377946957" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Rubin量产与HBM验证资料、研究预告，无明确股票方向。「$DELL $HPE Lenovo $SMCI」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2068948199084367969" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">歷史行情自引。「$MRVL $HPE 暴涨」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2062164907907543064" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">两股涨幅及直播宣传，無未来方向。「$MRVL $HPE 暴涨」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2062157708078510491" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">披露旧HPE成本及涨幅，無新方向。「我成本在40左右」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2062138613018865728" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">HPE涨幅回顾与SMCI接棒提问，自引旧买点无新承诺。「$HPE 已然暴涨了」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2061686959010185498" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">價格成果回顧。「不亏我熬了两个晚上研究Rubin」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2061541422168477745" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">已發生涨幅。「盘后上涨24%」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2061540451573014706" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确给出HPE进场区间，同行涨幅和供货属于背景。「40-45都能尝试」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2061459248270499853" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">结合作者未来倍数扩张判断。「$HPE +9.6% - 15.8x forward PE」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2057845989126635757" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:IBKR</span><span class="s-n">11 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-02-11 → 2026-05-16</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">券商开户成績。「$IBKR」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2055797412053070128" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">认为竞争拓展能力较强。「$IBKR can become $HOOD faster」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2054956052828029362" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">推荐更换券商产品，非买卖公司股票。「switch from $HOOD to $IBKR」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2051070690032566401" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">平台功能稱讚。「IBKR」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2049686305865609503" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">获客称赞。「IBKR accounts grow to an all time high」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2049360475046224050" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">批评IBKR外国股票保证金产品规则，没有股票方向。「$IBKR」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2049288233583006018" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">称赞IBKR开放韩国交易产品，没有IBKR股票方向。「IBKR」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2048957085770203478" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">赞IBKR支持韩国股票功能，非公司股票方向。「$IBKR has Korean stocks now」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2048956013374755266" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">券商產品正評。「$IBKR」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2047238732382876064" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">券商业务业绩影响，非股价方向。「adjust their estimates for $IBKR or $HOOD earnings.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2036342519727006000" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">資金流入業務比較。「$IBKR」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2021518590219079692" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:ONDS</span><span class="s-n">11 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-01-11 → 2026-08-24</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-5.7%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2026-04 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者認為無人機股今年秋天可能因兩黨立法支持與國防預算大漲，並具體點名此股作為受惠標的「I think drone stocks could go on a tear this fall.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2091681510739054761" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">政策受益公司敘述，未提出股票價格或持倉方向。「Benefiting U.S. drone component suppliers」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2088181416148562017" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">同行比較，無股票下跌預期。「zero or negative EBITDA」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2067713003479585105" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">公司质量批评，没有该股下跌预测。「objectively weak fundamentals」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2046650038592602341" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">公司技术能力贬低。「$AVEX makes $ONDS look like a joke.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2046310610347192689" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">明确认为AVEX价值优于不应持有ONDS，AVEX看多ONDS看空。「Still can&#x27;t figure out why anyone is long $ONDS when $AVEX exists.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2046274419887153448" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">同行估值或過去基金收益比較，非自身新方向。「$ONDS」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2046270360627315057" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">基本面及稀释批评，不直接预测下跌。「a diluting, pump holdco like $ONDS」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2046228271214600605" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">他人过去投资回报。「$ONDS $UMAC」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2044198916560957759" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">高倍数和亏损业务批评。「$ONDS still burning cash.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2010509156998906320" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者回顾数月前OSS建仓及当前业务优势，未明确新增交易或股票价格方向；ONDS为热度比较。「While everyone chases $ONDS hype」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2010499844838769090" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:TTMI</span><span class="s-n">11 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-05-19 → 2026-08-26</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+6.2%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者列出CEO與董事大額內部人買股，並直接說相對同業本益比「the PCB trade might still be underpriced」，是明確看多論述。「feels like the PCB trade might still be underpriced compared to a pretty rich peer set in AI infra.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2092625857949159751" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者直言這是他目前最看好的國防AI PCB標的，並列出估值折價、NVDA VR200平台份額、內部人買超等論據。「TTMI is my top defense AI PCB pick right now.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2092620946611863849" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">認為TTMI估值折價不久將消失，並提出需求與收入論點，明確看多。「the discount doesn&#x27;t seem like it will last long」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2089411155903304104" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">對收購新聞表示興趣，非股票方向。「Very interesting」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2089296112121471130" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">VIAV財報電話數據筆記及自引兩股財報，無新方向。「$TTMI: revenue $1.00B」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2085115764504510568" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">两家公司财报数据赞赏，明确尚待电话会后意见。「$TTMI: revenue $1.00B」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2085106446446776588" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">估值吸引力觀察仍未明確承諾方向。「last layer in the AI PCB chain that hasn&#x27;t re-rated」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2085079553215766601" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">政策对TTMI业务正面评价，无股票方向；Sanmina与Nvidia为引文背景，TTM为公司名而非该独立代码。「Pretty good for TTMI」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2062825204628480460" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">引文價格反應。「TTMI」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2057779713083593186" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">价格回顾。「why TTMI is up in pre-market」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2057779285860229322" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">仅提示互连瓶颈并引用TTMI管理层提高指引。「$TTMI」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2056575162057924863" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:BB</span><span class="s-n">10 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-05-02 → 2026-08-17</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">讨论他人历史成功及IPO估值反问，不产生作者方向。「BlackBerry $BB burned him too.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2089374997580251236" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">他人投资生涯与慈善故事，历史交易不归作者立场。「BlackBerry $BB burned him too.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2089132875992175031" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品與業務價值正面介紹。「BlackBerry&#x27;s Hidden Physical AI Play」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2073835302729232729" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">BlackBerry机器人应用成长论述未明确股票方向。「those scale way faster than humanoids ever will. $BB」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2072353680523719167" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面業務稱讚與訪談內容。「fastest growing segment in the company」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2071617100838293819" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">公司业务正評。「QNX is quietly becoming the software backbone of physical AI.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2070143245493960913" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">已發生漲幅與業務說明。「$BB」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2057839122228617667" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">明确逢低加仓NOK，看多；BB只今日表现。「$BB is up nicely today」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2056377918566060041" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者将BB列为交易主题并肯定股票条件。「calling this trend the &quot;flip phone&quot; trade」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2050726093146206614" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">業務與估值讚許，沒有明示買賣。「Is this the next $NOK?」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2050722685898960999" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:ICHR</span><span class="s-n">10 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-10-01 → 2026-06-15</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Debbie Wasserman Schultz</b>：2025-10 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Debbie Wasserman Schultz</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-06-15 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2066535985102385527" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Debbie Wasserman Schultz</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-05-04 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2051314824412283056" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Debbie Wasserman Schultz</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-04-13 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2043690385721966742" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Debbie Wasserman Schultz</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-04-09 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2042315986825625813" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Debbie Wasserman Schultz</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-03-24 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2036457543774404636" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Debbie Wasserman Schultz</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-02-24 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2026378314030399718" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Debbie Wasserman Schultz</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-01-20 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2013643780683923651" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Debbie Wasserman Schultz</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-01-14 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2011509198895382528" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Debbie Wasserman Schultz</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2025-10-15 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/1978478213329564064" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Debbie Wasserman Schultz</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2025-10-01 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/1973504080069939462" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:LPTH</span><span class="s-n">10 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-01-18 → 2026-08-28</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+12.3%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明講自己持有部位並認為股價下跌20%是「a huge overreaction」，是逢低買進式的明確看多表態。「I own a position and I think it&#x27;s a huge overreaction.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2093373635159543985" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者稱這是「Cracked DD」，指CEO透露政府資金即將到位並有第二訊號佐證，並強調這是給散戶的alpha，整體態度看多。「Cracked DD. The CEO of $LPTH told me some kind of government funding is coming and @OptimusDelta found a second signal to back it up.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2092274082121437296" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明確表示「我個人非常喜歡」LPTH，屬無人機主題中的重點看多標的「I personally like $LPTH a lot」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2091969064302465311" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者認為無人機股今年秋天可能因兩黨立法支持與國防預算大漲，並具體點名此股作為受惠標的「I think drone stocks could go on a tear this fall.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2091681510739054761" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者轉述並認同受訪者說法：業務預計每12個月翻倍成長，且防務消耗品訂單具備多年重複性，屬看多敘事「He expects his own business to double every 12 months as a norm.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2090863137243431055" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">已發生漲幅解釋。「$LPTH gapped up 15% today」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2088386744182063151" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">營收與產品正面介紹。「growing revenue 109%.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2087201759148277866" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">LightPath CEO访谈预告与经营赞赏，没有股票买进方向。「thermal imaging powerhouse.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2084713590104494282" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">已发生价格上涨。「$LPTH +21.0%」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2024653987224702986" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">公司产业价值正面评价。「existentially critical to the Pentagon」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2012827175314239662" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:MTSI</span><span class="s-n">10 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-04-23 → 2026-09-09</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+15.5%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同COHR，作者將MTSI列入雷射股稀缺溢價論述的知名標的，並揭露自己對此主題有實際部位。「For lasers: $LITE / $SIVE / $AAOI / $COHR / $MTSI / Furukawa / Sumitomo are your better known ones. *disclosure, personal exposure to theme」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2097660318369697875" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者直指光学股跌幅不合理、需求可见及安心等待，明确低估多方论点；其余仅产业佐证。「$LITE, $MTSI and other comments」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2090490101260591481" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">光学产业供需与超级周期讨论，三家公司作为数据出处，没有明确逐股方向。「$LITE, $MTSI, $AAOI all pointing to extreme demand imbalances」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2089973586425766134" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">供需正面資訊。「customers are approaching them with urgency」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2087675367595380783" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">MXL重仓与呼吁不被震出，明确持有多方承诺；引文其他标的无作者方向。「$SMTC and $MTSI」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2085712485500248182" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">供應瓶頸利好但無股票方向。「then $SMTC and $MTSI.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2085711500875116887" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">激光瓶颈经营消息及正面读穿，没有明确股票方向。「$MTSI earnings transcript」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2085511646257332581" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面供應鏈角色。「secure their supply with IQE.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2066421816793714938" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">減債改善風險非股價方向。「$MTSI」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2053794972663754849" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">以Sivers市值及未来需求错配论证上行，其他公司仅客户供应链背景。「$MTSI」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2047209727738957983" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:OSS</span><span class="s-n">10 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-01-07 → 2026-05-06</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-2.8%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2026-01 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-01 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">對另一研究者成果的讚許。「$OSS」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2052158173726089603" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">已发生价格上涨。「$OSS +26.23%」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2024653987224702986" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确再次购买OSS三千股，构成当前做多。「I just blasted another 3000 shares」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2011081060499812467" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确股价上行论。「The multiple expansion case alone is a multibagger」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2011075659792044472" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者当前低估投资论。「Trading at 6x P/S while comparable defense plays trade at 50-125x.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2010804048170209529" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">历史回报回顾。「all my picks up like 60% this week $OSS」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2010744347189547249" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">介绍OSS产品、客户与切换成本，业务赞许未构成股票投资方向。「10+ year procurement cycle with massive switching costs.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2010511642975482144" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">结合OSS低倍数及盈利优势的当前低估判断。「valuation gap is absurd.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2010509156998906320" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者回顾数月前OSS建仓及当前业务优势，未明确新增交易或股票价格方向；ONDS为热度比较。「Took a position in $OSS months ago.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2010499844838769090" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确新建OSS多头仓位并论述估值与业务；其余公司只是对照或可能客户。「I&#x27;ve initiated a position in $OSS.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2008910857003221451" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:VPG</span><span class="s-n">10 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-01-20 → 2026-06-30</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+11.6%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-01 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确Agility/CCXI为当前最喜爱机器人仓位；第三方其他持仓表述不归作者新方向。「Vishay Precision Group (VPG」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2071995924172394695" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">過去選股收益回顧。「$VPG」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2061093085568966664" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">VPG历史收益与过去减仓，無当前新方向。「$VPG ended up tripling」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2059280575203328398" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">機器人感測業務分析。「$VPG」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2036851975376298062" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">分析VPG财报与机器人业务增长，未明确股票方向。「$VPG」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2021549948593123787" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者推算VPG机器人业务收入并肯定规模机会，未表达该股票的买卖或目标价格；TSLA仅为新闻来源。「Pretty interesting figures for such a small company.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2016883354004758910" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者认为特斯拉生产新闻利好VPG业务，未给出明确股票投资方向。「one of the biggest news for robotic supply chains of Optimus like $VPG」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2016651304027009278" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">潜在产业催化剂示例。「potential Optimus ramp」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2014808195014001018" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">明确在AVAV下跌时加仓；VPG旧自引不构成新投票。「$VPG」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2013691795130228801" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者当前买入行动。「I&#x27;ve initiated positions in $VPG」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2013664829282599094" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">TWSE:2337</span><span class="s-n">9 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-01-30 → 2026-09-08</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="flip">1 人反轉</span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+3.0%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-01 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> → 2026-08 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> → 2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">Macronix營收年增218.5%，且SLC NAND、eMMC、NOR供給依然吃緊，支持看多legacy記憶體的論述。「Macronix revenue up +218.5% Y/Y, +5.4% M/M  Says SLC NAND, eMMC, NOR remain tight」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2097232588796780856" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确减仓前述 Macronix 持仓。「I trimmed down those positions aside from Samsung/SK Hynix longs」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2092851118233764178" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">公司名数字和SLC NAND业务明确，核验2337；业务收益评价非交易。「Macronix (2337)」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2077228758491386121" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">NOR/SLC内存产业语境明确旺宏，核验2337；表情和产品涨价非股票投票。「Macronix 😏」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2067116128267313579" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">传统NAND供给语境确认旺宏普通股；LFG仅情绪赞赏无股票方向。「Macronix」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2054236228611101057" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產業及供應商營運資訊。「Macronix」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2046146251063021568" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Nanya旧仓位与Sandisk股权新闻及产业定价疑问，無新股票方向。「Massive implications for others like Macronix」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2036760616376107309" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">公司与2337代码、NAND/NOR产品明确确认旺宏普通股；历史涨幅及旧持仓不新增作者方向。「Macronix (TPE: 2337)」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2033792436892570083" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确持有该受益股票。「beneficiaries post $SNDK earnings that I own」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2017097752535322767" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:ALM</span><span class="s-n">9 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-03-12 → 2026-08-21</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+1.4%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者轉述並認同受訪CEO的論點：鎢在半導體製程中「零替代品」，且ALM有實際營運中的礦場與成長中的營收獲利，明顯看多「Every semiconductor on earth needs tungsten gas during fabrication, tiny amounts, zero substitutes」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2090845626510766366" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者只是炫耀自己專訪受到市場關注（「smart money」注意到），沒有再補充對ALM股價方向的判斷「Looks like the smart money tuned into my interview with Mr. Black?」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2090545853912211722" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者強調ALM營收暴增498%、鎢價已上漲7倍，且旗下Sangdong礦場可能佔非中國供應的40%，明顯看多「growing revenue 498%... $ALM&#x27;s operating Sangdong mine could be 40% of non China supply」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2090131361214726430" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">矿产行业总体观点及Almonty访谈预告，不是个股买进方向。「interviewing the CEO of $ALM」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2085827658664030261" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">产业乐观与过去跌幅。「$ALM is down 14%」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2055006258852417590" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">旧引用价格回顾。「up 75% this past 3 months」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2040504686349090986" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">明确更看多EQR但代码未验证；ALM相对昂贵与内幕卖出评价，没有明确空方承诺。「14.5x the price per ton」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2040425404830199947" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">采购需求和商品价格前景。「$ALM」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2033344033293283378" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">钨与化肥公司供需机会说明，未明确股票买卖方向。「$ALM」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2032164663849300323" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:INFQ</span><span class="s-n">9 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-02-18 → 2026-05-21</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-6.9%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-03 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-02 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">歷史漲幅及低估感嘆。「$INFQ exploded 33% today.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2057491222521098578" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">明示偏好但未個別給出買賣或收益目標。「I like $INFQ.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2050475969484599638" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">觀察清單及業務低估論點。「$INFQ」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2049965509198889094" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">業務及估值評價。「Real revenue, real product market fit」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2049335671400325312" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确当前买入。「I have a position in $INFQ buying the dip today」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2047398737262330237" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确预测INFQ将达到翻倍收益，同行仅估值对照。「I think $INFQ is gonna be my 3rd or 4th 100% call YTD.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2045185799717876020" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确INFQ超卖与底部判断，看多；其余为旧引文比较背景。「this name was oversold」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2036883804040921499" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">当前明确股票收益预期及潜在配置。「My 10x stock idea」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2035503078171107803" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者直接长仓行动。「Decided to go long on $INFQ.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2024135345542242531" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:OPTX</span><span class="s-n">9 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-01-20 → 2026-05-21</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">既往表现。「48% in 5 days」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2057550689057010037" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">OPTX产能增长与历史涨幅，业务优势非股票方向。「Why does $OPTX win this?」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2057463477241856131" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确称OPTX为最喜欢的小市值防务股，结合当前业务论点表达看多。「My favorite defense stock under $1B」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2056834864855564656" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">产品业务进展。「$OPTX quadrupled monthly space optics production」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2053906221485130032" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">引用他人舊論點與成績稱讚。「$OPTX」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2042726618427425163" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">回顾OPTX过去涨幅与旧论点，未新增当前投资方向。「$OPTX」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2014404232984612954" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">供应链机会介绍。「Syntec Optics  $OPTX」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2014016733569237472" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">赞赏OPTX潜在Anduril联系及历史上涨，没有作者股票方向。「$OPTX」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2014012220372623789" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者肯定OPTX业务与国防供应链机会，但未明确股票买卖或预期价格；微软是合约背景。「micro-cap component supplier with real earnings」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2013635622972338643" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:PYPL</span><span class="s-n">9 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-12-17 → 2026-05-08</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-2.7%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Byron Donalds</b>：2026-04 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Michael Burry</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Nancy Pelosi</b>：2026-02 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-03 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 3.5% position · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-05-08 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2052628472154013794" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 3.5% position · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-05-03 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2050913184677003450" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Byron Donalds</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · up to $30,000 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-04-09 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2042247361255162291" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">預期費用支付處理商受破壞。「$PYPL」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2034559475533910175" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">嘲笑他人选股，無自主价格方向。「$PYPL」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2034002371655909686" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">批评常见选股，未明示股价或做空。「Paypal and other overbought stocks.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2032697006586786139" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">支持Google及Meta资本支出的企业价值策略，未明确股票买卖或价格方向。「$PYPL」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2019216672004141282" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Nancy Pelosi</b> <span class="tag t-bear">賣出</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · $295,000 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-02-03 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2018705606199124412" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">公司产品和用户覆盖正面，没有股票方向。「Paypal下场很重要」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2001236405037752625" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">KRX:SKHY</span><span class="s-n">8 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-08-21 → 2026-09-07</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Ren</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者評論韓國散戶過度槓桿的現象「Doesn&#x27;t feel healthy」，是對市場結構與槓桿行為的擔憂，並非直接對SK Hynix股價方向的判斷「This kind of over-leveraging needs to be studied, so that unwinds like this can be avoided where possible. Doesn&#x27;t feel healthy, tbh.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2097057093689684460" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者以打勾符號✅標記多個標的並表示「Tuesday can&#x27;t come fast enough」，顯示對後續發展的期待與正面態度「$SKHY ✅...Tuesday can’t come fast enough ⚡️」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2096799137693888666" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者說明記憶體大廠(含SK海力士)因優先配置產能給AI/資料中心高階記憶體，排擠舊世代產能，隱含對其高階記憶體業務的正面看法。「if you&#x27;re in the $MU / $SKHY, $SNDK trade」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2095580088620449880" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">引述SK海力士公開表示記憶體短缺將持續到2030年，作為看多記憶體供應商的證據。「SK Hynix also publicly stated the memory shortage lasts through 2030」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2094704372831920324" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，被列為技術領先CXMT的HBM龍頭之一。「CXMT is 3 to 5 years behind the leading memory chipmakers in HBM. Bullish memory.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2094484059850158554" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，SKHY同被指出估值過低難以再看空，作者調侃做空者暗示看多。「it becomes much harder to justify $MU and $SKHY still trading below 6x earnings」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2092746640192913539" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，SKHY被列為明確看多的記憶體股之一。「the future of memory is inevitably up... Bullish memory」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2092282443558469697" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同一則貼文以南韓記憶體出口單價暴衝為由，對SK海力士等記憶體股全面看多。「South Korea NAND and DRAM export unit price for August goes parabolic. Bullish AF memory」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2090669354752839785" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">TWSE:2408</span><span class="s-n">8 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-01-28 → 2026-09-07</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="flip">1 人反轉</span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+4.7%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-01 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> → 2026-08 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> → 2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者將Nanya列為自己至今仍上漲逾100%的記憶體主題持股。「16. Nanya - memory」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2096814311306129776" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确减仓前述 Nanya 持仓。「I trimmed down those positions aside from Samsung/SK Hynix longs」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2092851118233764178" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">南亚与Micron DDR4产能竞争语境明确南亚科技DRAM公司，官方IR确认2408；作者说过去涨过并隐含担忧，未明确预测股票下跌或卖出。「DDR4 memory using 1a technology」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2058012812535038014" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">既往漲幅或產業研究背景。「Nanya」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2048846462164045991" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Nanya旧仓位与Sandisk股权新闻及产业定价疑问，無新股票方向。「Nanya was my long earlier in the year」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2036760616376107309" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">競爭影響背景。「Nanya」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2018703864409870379" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">明确 DRAM 旧产品市场对照，不是新增方向。「Nanya v2」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2017097752535322767" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确看多南亚并预期上涨继续；其他存储持仓及自引清单仅为背景，没有逐股新方向。「I&#x27;m long on the cat sounding company selling water in the desert.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2016487104000446545" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:APP</span><span class="s-n">8 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-02-13 → 2026-08-05</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="flip">1 人反轉</span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-02 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> → 2026-07 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li><li><b>大老师</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">五家公司各有独立明确偏空/偏好论点，非纯代码资料清单。「偏好：
APP」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2085031458692018432" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者因持有損失及未滿足催化明示退出APP，看空。「Until the ecom bros on here are posting that their ads are the next massive growth arbitrage, I&#x27;m out.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2080385361184973097" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">已出場與仍預期上行並存。「Will probably keep running but I&#x27;m out now」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2029594197058261463" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">APP与OpenAI广告关系假设及推广，未股票方向。「if $APP really is the engine」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2026717907661762662" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确新买APP并认为卖压过度，看多；其他为业务比较。「I&#x27;m in.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2026717111540912619" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">合作傳聞与收益回顧。「$APP」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2024607476285641153" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确以APP估值和成长论证应在恐惧时买入，表达看多。「Be greedy when others are fearful.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2022812016008925695" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">實際新增買入。「Added $APP and $RDDT」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2022396779082453071" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:CRM</span><span class="s-n">8 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-01-16 → 2026-08-27</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+3.3%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Donald Trump</b>：2026-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Michael Burry</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Ren</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">儘管股價當日+20%，作者明確表示會因產品性價比、易用性與生態系是同業中最差之一而考慮放空。「I could short it purely on having one of the worst price-to-value, usability and ecosystem of any CRM out there.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2092986690763723200" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Donald Trump</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 100-250K · 交易日 2026-06-24（原文：June 24） · 揭露 2026-08-22 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2091280865196155079" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者认为三项Anthropic代理投资被低估并有双重上行，明确看多；其他为历史比较。「investors are genuinely sleeping on these businesses as is.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2065086870409880036" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">歷史跌幅與反彈嘲諷。「$CRM to $FIG」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2060578117320904884" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-05-08 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2052628472154013794" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-05-03 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2050913184677003450" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">软件利润受压背景。「$CRM」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2026029118744105314" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">引用软件业务背景。「$CRM」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2012234091106902291" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:KTOS</span><span class="s-n">8 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-10-09 → 2026-10-02</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="flip">1 人反轉</span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-2.3%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2025-10 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> → 2026-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">僅以近期跌幅說明防務股票行情，沒有對這兩檔作新的價格或交易判斷。「$AVAV and $KTOS are down 60%」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2106083350159253575" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者將KTOS列為他看好的「neoprime無人機builder」之一「the neoprime drone builders $AVAV, $KTOS, $AVEX」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2091969064302465311" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者認為無人機股今年秋天可能因兩黨立法支持與國防預算大漲，並具體點名此股作為受惠標的「I think drone stocks could go on a tear this fall.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2091681510739054761" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">大幅折價及重配投資論點。「We&#x27;re calling the bottom on defense stocks」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2072024859563987322" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面技术及他人推薦，不能歸作者股價方向。「immense value of asymmetric warfare」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2070526153102672001" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">同行比較，無股票下跌預期。「6% and negative EBITDA margins.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2067713003479585105" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">估值肯定但未单独方向。「$KTOS down 51%」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2062619242072355023" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确大额押注Kraken并称AVAV、KTOS严重高估，形成看多与看空的相对价值判断。「$AVAV AND $KTOS are grossly overvalued」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1976395025052561556" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:LULU</span><span class="s-n">8 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-04-01 → 2026-09-04</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-6.1%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Michael Burry</b>：2026-07 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · buying since $275 price level · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-09-04 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2095774262799859986" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">同一句話僅描述市場對這批服飾股的懲罰性反應，作者未表態自己對後市的方向判斷。「American Eagle $AEO, Gap $GAP, Lululemon $LULU, Nike $NKE, Dicks $DKS ... all getting punished by investors lately.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2092645833896497419" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">反諷對沖選擇，無明確股票方向。「went to $LULU to save that brand next?」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2086157318065168490" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · entry ~$118 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-07-30 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2082942341019525339" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">績效嘲諷非股票方向。「$V $WMT $ADBE $LULU」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2079421415988613424" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">转述Burry收购预测并支持收购，公司事件倾向非股票价格或买卖方向。「早该被收购了」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2069087190681022775" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">批评Lululemon任命并比较NikePayPalHP，非股票看空。「I’m just speechless.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2047395389742174406" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">明确认为Nike相对估值缺乏多头吸引力，表达投资看空；同行是消费观察。「lululemon」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2039370303302963209" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:NFLX</span><span class="s-n">8 筆</span><span class="s-range">2022-01-01 → 2026-10-03</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="flip">1 人反轉</span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-3.1%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Alan Armstrong</b>：2026-10 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Bill Ackman</b>：2022-01 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> → 2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li><li><b>Byron Donalds</b>：2026-10 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Cleo Fields</b>：2025-12 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>John Boozman</b>：2026-10 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>John Boozman</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-10-03 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2106417978929566030" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Alan Armstrong</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-10-03 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2106417978929566030" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Byron Donalds</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-10-03 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2106417978929566030" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Cleo Fields</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-10-03 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2106417978929566030" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">談 Netflix DRM 可被移除的案例，屬產品／技術評語，不是看空股票。「remove Netflix’s DRM.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2105539528626970741" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Bill Ackman</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · buying back at more than triple where he sold · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-08-13 · 2 則報導 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2087804989687120089" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文1</a> <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2087843687292145718" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文2</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Cleo Fields</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · up to $500K · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2025-12-10 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/1998767962124071270" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2022-01-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Bill Ackman</b> <span class="tag t-bear">賣出</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · $400M loss · 交易日 2022-01-01（原文：2022） · 揭露 2026-08-13 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2087843687292145718" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:SMTC</span><span class="s-n">8 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-07-08 → 2026-10-01</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+11.5%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者只以「Optics go brrr」表達光學領域的興奮，個股論點均在引文中，未逐股給方向。「Optics go brrr」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2105712095014851027" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明確將 Semtech 視為 TIA／driver 元件需求的贏家。「$SMTC probably winner here for TIAs/drivers」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2105709782854435274" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">直接預期2027光學公司成長。「As photonics like $SMTC to $AAOI, I expect to cook heavily in 2027」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2100938001077674262" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">財報讚賞而非股票票。「I don&#x27;t own Semtec, but these were amazing earnings.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2092408620277457255" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者詳列Semtech在AI網路scale up/out/across三層都有實際產品，並認為若成長跟上曲線，目前估值就不算貴，屬明確看多。「Semtech is one of the few names with real products across all three layers of AI networking.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2092326404507508859" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">MXL重仓与呼吁不被震出，明确持有多方承诺；引文其他标的无作者方向。「$SMTC and $MTSI」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2085712485500248182" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">供應瓶頸利好但無股票方向。「then $SMTC and $MTSI.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2085711500875116887" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">研究建議不是买入承諾。「you gotta dig into $SMTC.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2074846372478488726" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:UBER</span><span class="s-n">8 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-11-26 → 2026-09-06</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-0.1%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Bill Ackman</b>：2026-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>David Tepper</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Nancy Pelosi</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>David Tepper</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · added 21% to stake, now $555 million (5th largest position) · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-09-06 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2096562846725206348" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Nancy Pelosi</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · entered her long position · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-07-26 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2081302552885248129" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">業務競爭風險觀點，不自動等於股票看空。「Waymo looks to be the strongest disruptor to Uber.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2080750537121874206" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Bill Ackman</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-06-30 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2071837856725889315" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Nancy Pelosi</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · up to $1,000,000 in calls · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-06-24 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2069793735597052272" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Nancy Pelosi</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · bought calls · 交易日 2026-05-01（原文：May） · 揭露 2026-07-27 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2081682074944041289" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">本段为Avride商业化新闻；旧自引的NBIS估值论述不视为新的作者投资方向。「$UBER」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/1996198042664669557" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">以NBIS子公司价值与市值折价形成作者看多投资论点；其余股票为竞争、客户或历史案例。「$UBER」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/1993657309986509242" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">TSE:4062</span><span class="s-n">7 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-04-24 → 2026-10-05</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+8.6%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Zephyr</b>：2026-10 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">引用者自己寫「More love for Ibiden」，對以供需缺口與重新評價空間為主題的 Ibiden 分析表達支持。「More love for Ibiden」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2106916539589177690" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">文中稱Ibiden是這個領域的龍頭，正面臨三星電機與LG Innotek兩家新進者挑戰市占，語氣偏向不利其地位，但無明確股價判斷「Japan&#x27;s Ibiden is the leading company in this field.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2097572715893039563" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">足球玩笑与引用旧涨幅，不是股票方向。「Furukawa, Towa, Harmonic Drive, Ibiden」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2068880324202008964" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">CoPoS玻璃基板开发厂Ibiden明确，核验4062；LFG仅业务兴奋。「Ibiden and Innolux」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2066652359875539430" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">日本ABF基板与日元目标确认揖斐电普通股；卖方目标来自引用，作者感叹无买卖方向。「confident about Ibiden」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2057054510716162413" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">全文Intel EMIB基板业务及Ibiden名称明确，核验4062；LFG业务情绪非股票方向。「LFG Ibiden!!!」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2056576060045807819" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">股票已涨幅与成本新闻玩笑，没有未来方向。「Ibiden’s stock is soaring」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2047480248766530038" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:ADBE</span><span class="s-n">7 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-01-16 → 2026-09-10</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+2.9%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>David Ricks</b>：2026-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>大老师</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Wolf Financial</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">純粹播報 Adobe Q3 財報數據與上調全年財測，沒有作者自己對股價後市的判斷。「Revenue: $6.8B, beating est. of $6.69B」 <a href="https://x.com/WOLF_Financial/status/2098140911683436767" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明確稱ADBE「明显偏空」，指出買權平倉、賣權持續加碼，判斷市場正在主動押注下跌方向「ADBE：明显偏空...大量买Call仓位在平仓，同时Put还在持续加码。这说明市场不是单纯卖IV，而是在主动增加下行方向仓位。」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2098137811874648179" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">績效嘲諷非股票方向。「$V $WMT $ADBE $LULU」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2079421415988613424" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>David Ricks</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · $1.94M, 10,000 shares at $194.51 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-07-04 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2073451355587403958" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>David Ricks</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · $1.94M; 10,000 shares · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-06-30 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2072079899507204198" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>David Ricks</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 10,000 shares; $1.94 million · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-06-27 · 2 則報導 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2070953914808389754" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文1</a> <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2070953273532846556" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文2</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">引用软件业务背景。「$ADBE」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2012234091106902291" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:AMAT</span><span class="s-n">7 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-03-19 → 2026-08-13</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+10.9%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Michael Burry</b>：2026-06 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li><li><b>大老师</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">直接預期弱勢且難突破600。「AMAT财报后  中性偏弱」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2087991743409217859" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">他人報導長期競爭風險。「pose a threat to established global equipment suppliers」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2084827925833302106" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bear">放空</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日 2026-06-30（原文：8 days ago） · 揭露 2026-07-08 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2074931666347286651" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">业务竞争优势。「structural advantage」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2055026707321786430" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">欢呼AMAT财报好于预期，情绪积极但没有股票方向。「$AMAT」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2055017829699899615" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">预测Samsung可能购买更多Besi设备，业务判断非股票方向。「$AMAT」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2038927755988160898" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">MicronEUV订单技术利弊判断，非股票买卖方向。「negative for AMAT and LRCX」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2034726127030476973" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:BABA</span><span class="s-n">7 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-11-19 → 2026-08-25</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-2.7%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Gil Cisneros</b>：2025-11 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Joseph Tsai</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Joseph Tsai</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 720,000 shares, $10.4 million · 交易日 2026-08-25（原文：August 25） · 揭露 2026-09-01 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2094711078970163689" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者自行認同長倉與低估機會。「Agreed, $BABA is a sleeper.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2088737590006428127" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">引用產品進展。「Alibaba’s Qwen becomes the world’s No. 1 open AI model」 <a href="https: