class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">新增買入且認為可重估翻倍。「I loaded this morning」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2061488431851827559" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:IBM</span><span class="s-n">7 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-02-23 → 2026-07-22</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+0.9%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2026-02 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li><li><b>Trump administration</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>大老师</b>：2026-07 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">期权市场状态对比与宏观风险，无明确作者股票方向。「$TSLA 显著乐观于 $IBM」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2080019747606061299" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者认为IBM缺支撑且有加速下跌风险，明确空方分析。「这对IBM来说是一个危险的信号」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2080017951084917082" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">已發生漲幅回顧。「IBM尾盘涨飞了」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2069152976657318025" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">歷史收益。「获利巨大」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2061440544090513775" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Trump administration</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日 2026-05-20（原文：May 20, 2026） · 揭露 2026-07-14 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2077067717270483014" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">已有下跌後仍預期軟體估值壓縮。「The software compression trade is just starting.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2026046036372750411" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">已发生卖压及业务冲击。「$IBM selling off」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2026029118744105314" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:MXL</span><span class="s-n">7 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-05-15 → 2026-10-02</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Ren</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-10 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者在自己的持倉上漲脈絡直接說讀者還不夠看多，屬持有與看多表態。「You guys are not bullish enough.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2106044829041864831" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者只以「Optics go brrr」表達光學領域的興奮，個股論點均在引文中，未逐股給方向。「Optics go brrr」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2105712095014851027" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者提出 MaxLinear 的 DSP 可能受益，表態有條件且把握較低。「maybe $MXL for DSPs too.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2105709782854435274" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">MXL重仓与呼吁不被震出，明确持有多方承诺；引文其他标的无作者方向。「I’m heavy on this name. Hope you didn’t get shaken out.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2085712485500248182" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">供應瓶頸利好但無股票方向。「positive industry read through for names like $MXL」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2085711500875116887" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">赞赏分析师及其Nokia/Sivers/MXL目标价，不归作者方向。「$SIVE and $MXL」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2062249961463418970" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">後悔過去沒買。「Then not go long?」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2055251965819687347" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:NOW</span><span class="s-n">7 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-0