v></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">成果回顧。「全面成功了」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2066877172720263331" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">質疑HDD永久成長論點。「$WDC」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2050166581821595859" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确认同MU低估与重估论点，看多MU；HDD相对估值疑问无明确未来投票。「premium valuations」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2046550105877270728" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Donald Trump</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日 2026-03-01（原文：March 1st） · 揭露 2026-06-16 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2066883033014136867" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:WULF</span><span class="s-n">7 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-12-11 → 2026-09-08</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+2.4%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Serenity</b>：2025-12 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">同CIFR，作者把WULF列為Nebius的對照組，用以凸顯其相對劣勢，但未直接論斷股價方向。「the highest revenue Neocloud untouched by $CIFR | $WULF and colo providers」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2097327653116363127" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">新合約後難維持買盤的過去價格觀察，未预测未来方向。「they can&#x27;t seem to hold the bid」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2087205015802822817" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">業務消息與板塊利好。「$WULF signs a $19B DC lease」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2074109998544846954" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面表情與他人猜測。「👀😉😉」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2066883216519418088" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">板塊潛在業務利好。「potential tailwind for the Neocloud colo sector.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2065130589204992048" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者认为NBIS现价与盈利潜力严重不符，表达有条件看多；其他云服务公司是产业主题及交易背景。「Neocloud colo players from $CIFR / $WULF」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2006013108817678779" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确当前买入机会。「amazing buying opportunity」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/1998925429890261130" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">TPEX:8299</span><span class="s-n">6 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-01-30 → 2026-09-21</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="flip">1 人反轉</span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-0.9%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-01 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> → 2026-08 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">NAND行业明确Phison群联，核验8299；第三方看多不赋作者方向。「SanDisk, Phison, etc」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2101901218390188226" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确减仓前述 Phison 等记忆体股票，保留三星与 SK。「I trimmed down those positions aside from Samsung/SK Hynix longs」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2092851118233764178" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">NAND控制器合作语境明确群联，核验8299；技术业务评价。「Phison is solid」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2071866798988026335" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">回顾Macronix涨幅并解释业务；台湾身份未核实，Phison旧引用非新方向。「Phison」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2033792436892570083" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">三星SKhynixPhison涨价新闻及产业需求赞誉，无股票方向。「Phison shifts to prepayments」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2028374385544093829" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确持有该受益股票。「beneficiaries post $SNDK earnings that I own」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2017097752535322767" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">TSE:6981</span><span class="s-n">6 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-05-24 → 2026-09-09</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+9.5%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">點名積層陶瓷電容現貨價因 AI 伺服器規格短缺漲 3 到 5 倍，且該公司正在漲價「MLCC spot prices are up 3-5x on scarce AI-server specs since April」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2097692213014606169" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">AI伺服器MLCC確認村田；業務受益並非股票方向。「Samsung Electro-Mechanics/Murata」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2089183484556480536" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">MLCC业务村田主体明确，核验6981；错失过去涨幅非当前买入。「Murata up 155.43%」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2067954339982008731" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">想交易公司但沒有買賣指令。「村田」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2061152691162960091" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">硅电容器业务确认村田普通股；业务受益预测没有股票方向。「Murata still maintains a very close relationship with Ibiden」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2059967125020934181" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">矽電容與MLCC曝險確認村田；看好產業供需未明確給該股投資方向。「Murata」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2058535139534373182" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">TSE:9984</span><span class="s-n">6 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-03-13 → 2026-09-05</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+1.1%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者僅轉貼連結並附上他人「you can buy softbank now」的說法,自己沒有加上任何評論或方向判斷。「you can buy softbank now...」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2096056773421728198" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">仅分享链接与他人SoftBank折价论点，不归为作者方向。「Their ARM holdings alone」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2085287245100302736" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">股價下跌回顧。「SoftBank probably down -13.5% today」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2070373235452162540" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">赞颂SoftBank负责人，非股票投资方向。「Long live Masa」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2069699626828238986" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">集團投資融資疑慮。「Softbank takes out $40B bridge loan」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2047255106677362910" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">控股股东解禁压力评价，不是软银股票方向。「Softbank ATM-like overhang」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2032334155053470177" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">TWSE:2317</span><span class="s-n">6 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-04-13 → 2026-05-15</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+1.4%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Shunsin母公司与ODM语境确认鸿海普通股而非大陆子公司；母公司供应链背景无方向。「It&#x27;s a subsidiary of Foxconn」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2055107276575588612" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Shunsin母公司及CPO生产语境确认鸿海普通股；看多对象主要是未核实Shunsin，母公司业务背景无独立方向。「Foxconn’s SiPH and CPO packaging/test arm」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2054327689721581789" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">同文明稱Hon Hai Group及越南製造確認鴻海普通股；出貨新聞无作者股票方向。「Foxconn」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2054289519411896455" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">对 Foxconn 组装业务的正面消息，作者目标投资是 Shunsin，非 Foxconn 明确方向。「Foxconn is the exclusive assembler」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2049609993071259684" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">集团与光学子公司订单语境明确鸿海，官方TWSE名录2317；作者肯定母公司支撑作用，涨价目标属于Shunsin。「Foxconn is massive. And de-risks this company.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2044954792381030506" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Shunsin母公司及台湾ODM语境确认鸿海普通股，非大陆工业富联；主体看多对象Shunsin未核实，母公司背景无独立方向。「It&#x27;s a subsidiary of Foxconn」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2043508231746810000" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">TWSE:2344</span><span class="s-n">6 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-02-03 → 2026-09-08</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="flip">1 人反轉</span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+4.0%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> → 2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">Winbond營收年增289%，總裁預期2027年供需將比2026年更吃緊，屬看多訊號。「Winbond revenue up +289.43% Y/Y, up 2% M/M  Their president says memory supply and demand are expected to be even tighter in 2027 than in 2026.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2097232588796780856" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者认为所列记忆体板块远期市盈率有进一步上升机会，包含明确点名的 Winbond。「Winbond 正在与多家客户」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2093252439973777674" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确减仓前述 Winbond 持仓。「I trimmed down those positions aside from Samsung/SK Hynix longs」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2092851118233764178" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">内存厂华邦明确，核验2344；引用技术批评非作者卖出。「Winbond&#x27;s SLC NAND」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2085598759501885686" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">公司名数字和SLC NAND业务明确，核验2344；业务收益评价非交易。「Winbond (2344)」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2077228758491386121" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">競爭影響背景。「Winbond」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2018703864409870379" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:ACMR</span><span class="s-n">6 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-03-31 → 2026-06-29</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+9.8%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Jukan</b>：2026-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">BOE玻璃技术赞赏及研究关注，未明确股票方向；ACMR设备供货资料。「ACMR will supply them」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2071416090459341044" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">在明確投资機會上下文中推薦。「Names like ACMR and NAURA look promising.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2071029953001570708" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">寻找NAV折价研究机会且已有曝光，未给新买进或价格方向。「$ACMR and WUS」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2067658240612262198" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">他人观点引用。「$ACMR only direct US winner」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2059664682953368021" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">赞称ACMR技术赢家，引文买入属他人，無作者股票投票。「Biggest winner」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2058778412517646355" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">欢呼ACMR产品展示，无股票投资方向。「$ACMR」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2038798872462635237" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:ALMU</span><span class="s-n">6 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-02-02 → 2026-09-03</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+2.8%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者認為隨著量子點雷射進入客戶送樣階段，ALMU等「QD兄弟們」可能終於要出頭天。「Your QD bros like $ALMU, QD Laser (6613), and others might finally start to see the light of day」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2095460499769155944" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者將其歸類為缺乏現金流支撐的「science projects」，指這類早期光子概念股在這波回檔中把漲幅全部跌回，明確看空。「quantum stocks and early-stage photonic moonshots such as $ALMU, $POET, $LWLG gave back their entire runs」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2094494253267157010" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">技術尚遠的負面比較，未作股票操作。「$ALMU」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2052084166960001150" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">合約與漲幅新聞。「$ALMU」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2043684078289813862" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">市场顶点玩笑，没有自身股票方向。「$ALMU moons」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2043456793716957405" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">AAOI产品及业务比较，没有明确股票投资方向。「$ALMU」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2018370861351284759" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:AMKR</span><span class="s-n">6 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-02-01 → 2026-09-11</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+5.3%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Markwayne Mullin</b>：2026-02 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者只回覆👀👀表情轉發Amkor亞利桑那廠投資加碼的消息，沒有明確表態方向。「👀👀」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2098203583934304621" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">供應瓶頸受益機會，未承諾股票方向。「traditional packaging capacity could face a deficit exceeding 20% by 2027」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2093712497949950242" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确保有Sivers/AAOI多方信念，其他公司为主题需求数据而非各自方向。「as seen with $AMKR」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2082230983487803755" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">庆祝TSMC/Amkor合约，不是股票方向。「LFG!!!」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2066882770002128940" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">试探业务受益问句，没有确定投资承诺。「Amkor bullish?」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2050024550176522452" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Markwayne Mullin</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日 2026-02-01（原文：February purchase） · 揭露 2026-04-27 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2048771117939118092" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:APH</span><span class="s-n">6 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-09-18 → 2026-09-21</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+2.8%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Byron Donalds</b>：2025-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>James Comer</b>：2025-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>大老师</b>：2026-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">XPO功耗与演示赞赏，不代表股票看多。「Amphenol booth」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2102024374002041292" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">本人交易前景判断加長期看漲資金解讀。「这条线我觉得市场还没讨论到高点。」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2064715007154401752" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">鉸鏈技術問題新聞。「Amphenol」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2043603693669663044" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Byron Donalds</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2025-12-29 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2005650682888822985" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-09-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>James Comer</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2025-09-19 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/1969080923703382162" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-09-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Byron Donalds</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2025-09-18 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/1968773389775999382" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:CIFR</span><span class="s-n">6 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-12-11 → 2026-09-08</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-6.2%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Serenity</b>：2025-12 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者把CIFR列為Nebius『未受影響』的對照組，暗示其仍面臨colo業者隱憂，但沒有明講股價方向。「the highest revenue Neocloud untouched by $CIFR | $WULF and colo providers」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2097327653116363127" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">板塊潛在業務利好。「potential tailwind for the Neocloud colo sector.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2065130589204992048" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">假设改名提高估值的玩笑，未构成实际投资方向。「$CIFR」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2033033107557986332" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确主张不持有IREN并推荐CIFR和NBIS替代多头。「much more asymmetrical upside」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2029993746658643978" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者认为NBIS现价与盈利潜力严重不符，表达有条件看多；其他云服务公司是产业主题及交易背景。「Neocloud colo players from $CIFR / $WULF」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2006013108817678779" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确当前买入机会。「amazing buying opportunity」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/1998925429890261130" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:CLSK</span><span class="s-n">6 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-05-19 → 2026-09-08</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-4.5%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-07 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者指出CLSK缺乏大型雲端業者合約帶來的營收確定性，用以凸顯Nebius優勢，未直接論斷股價方向。「Revenue uncertainty at scale with Hyperscaler contracts that $CLSK, $BITF, $WYFI, $SLNH, and others lack.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2097327653116363127" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者喜歡CLSK交易催化並給未來合約估值，明確多方。「Lots of short term catalysts I like as a trader.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2079256553228796225" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">條件推測與反問，非明确股票方向。「Imagine if $CLSK becomes the proxy」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2078161834125697417" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面績效語境但沒有自己股票方向。「He ran a $2B long short hedge fund.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2077476821797671094" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">直接買入與財務低估論點。「makes it an interesting buy at $3.2B.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2077117178692980971" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">研究他人CLSK仓位与券商目标价，未自行投资投票。「Leopold knows something」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2056797035488047496" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:GLXY</span><span class="s-n">6 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-05-06 → 2026-06-08</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>大老师</b>：2026-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面業務及風險反應，沒有明确買入或上漲預期。「应该不至于再现去年的惨案了」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2064067031440462114" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">自身將業務兑现定位股價上行催化。「Helios AI/HPC数据中心园区是股价催化剂」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2064065767310799251" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Galaxy业务消息后的错过期权遗憾，没有当前买进方向。「早知道call进去了啊」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2064029261099585669" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">引用業務轉變內容，未明說自己的股票方向。「数据中心有巨大进展」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2064021327527501838" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Galaxy大单/数据中心进展报道，无作者投资方向。「应该是数据中心有巨大进展了」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2064013120411258911" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">商業催化與市場资金觀察。「叙事层面上即将在六月出现转移」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2052097949703041086" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:LRCX</span><span class="s-n">6 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-04-04 → 2026-08-27</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+10.5%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Jonathan Jackson</b>：2025-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Marjorie Taylor Greene</b>：2025-04 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Zephyr</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者呼應原貼文「分析師19%成長估計過低」的論點，並直接說$LRCX未來12個月將賣出大量蝕刻機，是明確看多。「LCRX is going to sell sooo many etchers in the next 12 months」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2093004879224824081" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">他人報導長期競爭風險。「Applied Materials, Lam Research, and KLA.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2084827925833302106" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">過去LRCX期權订单盈利回顾，无新方向。「22小时后变成 445.9万美金」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2070138539652821349" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">MicronEUV订单技术利弊判断，非股票买卖方向。「negative for AMAT and LRCX」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2034726127030476973" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-09-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jonathan Jackson</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2025-09-24 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/1970847141452239297" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-04-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Marjorie Taylor Greene</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日 2025-04-04（原文：April 4th） · 揭露 2025-10-02 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/1973831573943238699" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:MCD</span><span class="s-n">6 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-05-07 → 2026-10-05</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-0.7%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Ren</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Wolf Financial</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">McDonald&#x27;s 是 Lynch 說明盈餘與股價關係的條件式例子，並非作者對未來股價的判断。「If McDonald&#x27;s earnings go up over the next 10 years, he says, the stock goes up with them.」 <a href="https://x.com/WOLF_Financial/status/2106959190820561094" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确开盘重仓麦当劳买进意向。「I need to go all in $MCD at the open.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2104772909021753491" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">全部投入與變員工為假設玩笑，無實際承諾方向。「If we all full port $MCD」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2082640836517392680" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">麦当劳跌幅的玩笑回应，不是新看空。「I knew it the Big Mac was a bubble.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2081251629953642891" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">产品品质及利润来源嘲讽。「麦当劳利润上涨都是从汉堡缩水里抠出来的利润吗」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2052351053711204447" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">财报正面反应。「麦门永存」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2052346252332089725" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:SKM</span><span class="s-n">6 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-06-11 → 2026-06-18</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2026-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">官方名錄確認SK Telecom，作者維護公司與中國無關，沒有股價方向。「SK Telecom has absolutely nothing to do with Huawei or China.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2067427117504283101" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确以SKM作为Anthropic上市交易，正向机会；SpaceX是历史涨幅。「Anthropic is next up. And $SKM is the trade.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2066988235033899420" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">對$39股票業務轉型與同業估值折價的現行論點。「Every Western telco peer clears 7.5x to 9x.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2065126237857521782" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面估值及條件業務機會，未明说買入或股價方向。「the cheapest name in the global peer group.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2065119274814038416" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者认为三项Anthropic代理投资被低估并有双重上行，明确看多；其他为历史比较。「investors are genuinely sleeping on these businesses as is.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2065086870409880036" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确SKTelecom资产折价及市场错价代理标的投资论点。「mispriced Anthropic proxy plays the market has completely missed.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2065081193188442330" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:STM</span><span class="s-n">6 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-05-16 → 2026-09-02</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+8.6%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Ren</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>大老师</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上,作者表態看多AI晶片供應鏈並考慮複製此清單,STM為名單第三梯隊持股。「STMicroelectronics $STM [Long]」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2095228808278446221" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者描述STM是因MCU漲價而新增的持股，暗示其基本面轉佳。「some are new like $STM (eg. MCU price hikes)」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2095087925822190023" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品供應限制。「having problems getting allocations at TSMC」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2076540599197712606" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面供應鏈研究主題，不等於股票方向。「companies like $STM $NOVT are at play.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2075440522655613280" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">合作可能性而非STM股價方向。「$STM和 $CPSH的封装深度合作」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2055710895381348484" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者推介訂單上行交易。「这可是一个在上市前就可以交易预期的SpaceX标的！」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2055707257116270628" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:UMC</span><span class="s-n">6 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-04-18 → 2026-06-18</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Zephyr</b>：2026-04 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">業務新闻。「UMC is collaborating with Intel」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2067636769856860367" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">過去漲幅回顧。「$UMC」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2059343560659623985" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">电源半导体产业与过去研究表现回顾，无新方向。「$GFS &amp;amp; $UMC have been on a bit of a tear」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2046370913080558010" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產業及供應商營運資訊。「UMC」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2046146251063021568" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者當前明示看多。「we are bullish on Tower Semi &amp;amp; UMC」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2045855510323421638" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產業、财报或產品價格資訊，無個股投資方向。「$UMC」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2045565771234021468" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:V</span><span class="s-n">6 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-03-19 → 2026-08-13</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-1.9%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Bill Ackman</b>：2026-04 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Donald Trump</b>：2026-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-03 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Bill Ackman</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-08-13 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2087804989687120089" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">價值股績效嘲諷非股票方向。「$V $WMT $ADBE $LULU」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2079421415988613424" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Donald Trump</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 1-5M · 交易日 2026-06-18（原文：June 18） · 揭露 2026-08-22 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2091280865196155079" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">批评支付摩擦，不是股价。「Visa/Mastercard」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2044916474008191162" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Bill Ackman</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日 2026-04-01（原文：Q2） · 揭露 2026-09-20 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2101710005841830043" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">未定價長期破壞的負面估值方向。「markets aren’t pricing in long term disruption」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2034559475533910175" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:VOYG</span><span class="s-n">6 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-05-18 → 2026-08-04</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-6.8%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Maria Salazar</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Maria Salazar</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-08-04 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2084691867736666344" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Maria Salazar</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-07-08 · 2 則報導 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2074846314056065322" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文1</a> <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2074858467064492202" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文2</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Maria Salazar</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-06-11 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2065135810412703904" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Maria Salazar</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-05-26 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2059272452409061519" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Maria Salazar</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-05-22 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2057819437244305586" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Maria Salazar</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-05-18 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2056435191489397002" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:VSAT</span><span class="s-n">6 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-04-17 → 2026-08-04</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+0.5%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Debbie Wasserman Schultz</b>：2026-04 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Debbie Wasserman Schultz</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-08-04 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2084698769640034312" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Debbie Wasserman Schultz</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-06-30 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2071952722618646738" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Debbie Wasserman Schultz</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-05-26 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2059280597088882798" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Debbie Wasserman Schultz</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-05-20 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2057136743661388265" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Debbie Wasserman Schultz</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-05-11 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2053875068132790574" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Debbie Wasserman Schultz</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-04-17 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2045172970687988091" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">KRX:009150</span><span class="s-n">5 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-08-27 → 2026-09-09</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+5.5%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Jukan</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，被列為正在調漲售價的主要供應商之一「Murata, Samsung Electro-Mechanics, and Taiyo Yuden all raising prices.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2097692213014606169" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">報導三星電機積極搶進英特爾EMIB-T高值封裝基板供應鏈，屬業務擴張機會的產業新聞，但作者未直接表態「Samsung Electro-Mechanics and LG Innotek push to commercialize substrates for Intel&#x27;s &#x27;EMIB-T&#x27;, challenging Japan&#x27;s Ibiden」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2097572715893039563" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者認為每顆加速器搭載的MLCC數量增加，暗示未來瓶頸比市場預期更嚴重，對MLCC供應商偏正面看法。「more accelerators x MLCCs per accelerator might indicate a more future extreme bottleneck than people expect」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2094704372831920324" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">依DART揭露資訊,三星電機簽下一筆金額達年營收9.5%的MLCC供應大單,是明確的正面業務進展。「Contract value: KRW 1.0722 trillion (9.5% of annual revenue)」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2094593254801223840" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">TrendForce報告指出三星電機(SEMCO)率先於4Q26調漲MLCC價格,漲價範圍已從經銷商擴散到終端OEM/ODM客戶,標誌著MLCC產業正式進入上升週期,對SEMCO是明確利多。「signaling the start of a full-fledged MLCC industry upcycle」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2092873605835362806" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:ACN</span><span class="s-n">5 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-05-29 → 2026-06-24</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+14.0%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Donald Trump</b>：2026-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Donald Trump</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 100-250K · 交易日 2026-06-24（原文：June 24） · 揭露 2026-08-22 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2091280865196155079" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Accenture财报下跌与旧期权归零回顾，無新方向。「财报低于预期，直接崩了」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2067592209902534877" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">條件預期而非确定投资方向。「若该期权对应 埃森哲AI优化后的财务数据，那看涨210是可以预期的」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2061905406444884379" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">回顾ACN期权获利，未新增当前投资方向。「ACN」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2061454253127020579" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">期權與財報利多猜测。「可能是财报利好预期的老鼠」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2060377497213280511" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:BKKT</span><span class="s-n">5 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-03-08 → 2026-06-07</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-04 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">明確股權稀釋與避免投資的負面論點。「endless dilution to fund executive pay.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2063571485739106593" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">明确认为SLNH及比较公司均为糟糕多头且将稀释股东，表达看空。「They’re all absolutely terrible longs.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2049969772251709921" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">IQE过去收益与嘲笑别股持有者，情绪非本次股票投票。「bagholding $BKKT or $IREN」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2043315043455176826" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">历史稀释比较或融资背景，无当前个股方向。「$BKKT」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2038163974437659019" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者预计IREN稀释损害每股价值并提醒相应调整投资，表达当前看空。「$BKKT」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2030761150292615564" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:FLNC</span><span class="s-n">5 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-05-07 → 2026-08-05</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="flip">1 人反轉</span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+1.5%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> → 2026-05 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面財報候選而非确定方向。「interesting earnings setups I&#x27;m watching」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2085079553215766601" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">参考电力架构合作与FLNC涨幅解释，無作者方向。「up 36%」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2061442981102764171" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">實際減持且判斷短期賣壓。「I personally cut concentration」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2054198288556109906" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">FLNC已涨50%回顾及自引旧投资论点，无本次新方向。「$FLNC is up over 50% now」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2052744623366475916" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确新入FLNC催化交易并认为好买点，看多；客户为背景。「the company looks like a great entry point to me」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2052435712126161008" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:HLIT</span><span class="s-n">5 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-05-22 → 2026-05-27</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">業務及估值讚許；全倉為被引用者。「has a 95% software monopoly」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2059741745542283742" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">本次是涨势感慨。「$HLIT」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2059077988755648705" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">肯定业务护城河。「$HLIT (~$1.65B) controls more than 95%」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2059027858190643541" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者當前高信念持倉及估值上行。「I made a high conviction trade into $HLIT on Friday.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2059027159893856581" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确HLIT新做多与较好报酬风险，看多；FCEL旧卖出收益及其他背景無新方向。「Long $HLIT at $16」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2057954297414049845" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:INDI</span><span class="s-n">5 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-08-07 → 2026-08-21</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+2.4%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Ren</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者表示INDI單日上漲6%且「越深入研究越喜歡」，並詳述其五合一業務結構帶來的被低估價值，明確看多。「$INDI up +6% on the day, and the more I dig into it the more I like it.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2090860911242207259" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者直言「不懂這公司怎麼還不是10美元」並標註Bullish，明確表態看多。「I don&#x27;t see how this company isn&#x27;t $10 already. Bullish」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2090530712268996946" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者開頭直接表態「I&#x27;m long」，並詳述機器人公司主動採購indie車用晶片帶來的新成長動能。「$INDI I&#x27;m long.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2090505191510434123" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确要求INDI上涨；引文其他股票及合并代码不归作者方向。「$INDI Send it higheeeeer!」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2089890179389563009" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">INDI持有人祝福及希望维持涨幅，未给确定股票预期。「good fortune to you.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2085718079464517904" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:LTRX</span><span class="s-n">5 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-01-27 → 2026-01-28</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2026-01 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-01 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者认可研究值得注意，但预测归属他人。「When he says $LTRX might be next, pay attention.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2016487255267811470" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">業務正評。「$LTRX」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2016410470077628584" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">承接明确LTRX投资论的当前配置建议。「It&#x27;s critical you position into the infrastructure powering it!」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2016272805181202446" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">預期重估且當前倍數低估。「I think $LTRX is next.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2016267442755142145" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确估值上行投资判断。「5x P/S (half of $KRKNF) = $590M = 2x」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2016264322268463282" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:MA</span><span class="s-n">5 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-03-19 → 2026-08-13</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-2.8%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Bill Ackman</b>：2026-04 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Donald Trump</b>：2026-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-03 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Bill Ackman</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-08-13 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2087804989687120089" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Donald Trump</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 1-5M · 交易日 2026-06-18（原文：June 18） · 揭露 2026-08-22 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2091280865196155079" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">批评支付摩擦，不是股价。「Visa/Mastercard」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2044916474008191162" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Bill Ackman</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日 2026-04-01（原文：Q2） · 揭露 2026-09-20 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2101710005841830043" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">未定價長期破壞的負面估值方向。「$MA」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2034559475533910175" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:NVTS</span><span class="s-n">5 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-05-27 → 2026-09-28</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+5.7%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Ren</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">保留觀望並讚賞技術；不能把Good news的bullish覆蓋明確旁觀。「Great validation for the tech, but for me it&#x27;s still a wait-and-see name, so I&#x27;ll keep watching from the sidelines.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2104670676774986130" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者直接寫明「Bullish $NVTS」,認為雖然目前只是設計贏單和新聞稿,但賭它能兌現到2027年800VDC機櫃放量。「Bullish $NVTS」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2094636614513229966" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，NVTS為目前獲利中的波段持倉之一。「Today all of my swings but one are green $NBIS $MRVL $NVTS $AXTI $AEHR」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2092738683934003516" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">技术受益，不是个别股票预测。「$NVTS and other fabless/fab-lite beneficiaries」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2061348882685243497" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">公司或過去漲幅評論，不等於股票投票。「$NVTS」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2059674880761860125" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:ONTO</span><span class="s-n">5 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-03-31 → 2026-07-03</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+13.5%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">設備供應可能利好，不是股票方向。「Onto in terms of yields」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2072986020640076052" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">引用技术研究肯定，价格目标不是作者。「Onto Innovation」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2052010162769301810" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">ONTO投资消息及Rigaku过去未买遗憾，无新方向。「beefed up its up inspection division」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2046463031534842321" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">强调媒体称ONTO技术领先，无作者股票方向。「The most advanced player is U.S.-based Onto Innovation.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2038930149232787675" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">設備驗證新聞。「$ONTO」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2038929887386362165" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:PANW</span><span class="s-n">5 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-10-06 → 2026-09-01</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+2.8%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>John Hickenlooper</b>：2025-10 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Josh Gottheimer</b>：2026-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">同上,僅為五檔財報預測全中的戰績宣布,未包含對PANW目前方向的新判斷。「五中五」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2094880788978553301" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者質疑PANW財報成長有多少是靠併購CyberArk和Chronosphere貢獻,屬於風險提問而非明確方向判斷。「I want to know how much of the growth is actually Palo Alto&#x27;s own and how much they bought.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2094627777831936311" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者列出$PANW下一代安全ARR年增60%，且CEO已表態首季優於預期，屬正向看多敘述。「Next-gen security ARR at $8.1 billion, up 60%... Nikesh already said the first quarter surpassed expectations.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2093323212138721762" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Josh Gottheimer</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-06-04 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2062528553372078205" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>John Hickenlooper</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · up to $250K · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2025-10-06 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/1975346467167740282" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:SIMO</span><span class="s-n">5 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-02-18 → 2026-09-07</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+0.9%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-02 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者將SIMO列為自己至今仍上漲逾100%的記憶體主題持股。「14. $SIMO - Memory」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2096814311306129776" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">主管市場資料。「The retail SSD market has almost disappeared」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2067585795175944324" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">过去股票涨幅。「$SIMO」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2052126435721318528" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">已發生漲幅。「$SIMO」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2049564617215795571" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确今天新买SIMO看多；供应商和客户为背景。「trade idea that I took positions in today」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2024147309949551096" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:STX</span><span class="s-n">5 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-09-01 → 2026-07-28</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Lisa McClain&#x27;s husband</b>：2025-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面財報反應。「reported the best quarter in its history」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2082220837264900453" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">質疑HDD永久成長論點。「$STX」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2050166581821595859" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确认同MU低估与重估论点，看多MU；HDD相对估值疑问无明确未来投票。「premium valuations」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2046550105877270728" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Lisa McClain&#x27;s husband</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-01-28 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2016538788403581298" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-09-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Lisa McClain&#x27;s husband</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日 2025-09-01（原文：last month） · 揭露 2025-10-29 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/1983629692205986296" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:TER</span><span class="s-n">5 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-04-13 → 2026-08-05</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">模糊喜爱光学股与引用历史业绩跳涨，不构成特定股票新方向。「$TER +30%」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2084826016107917466" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确保有Sivers/AAOI多方信念，其他公司为主题需求数据而非各自方向。「$BE to $TER reported blowout results」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2082230983487803755" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">研究關注不等同股票看多。「值得关注一下」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2071974337519997368" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">競爭能力評論，沒有賣出或股價看空。「I was a bit disappointed」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2050059631490400525" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">认为Teradyne供应链业务受挫，未明确股票方向；海外伙伴未核实。「Teradyne」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2043559550016733352" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:TTWO</span><span class="s-n">5 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-05-05 → 2026-09-06</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+0.2%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，作者認為引擎股被錯誤地與AI替代疑慮綁在一起，實際上模型是與引擎協作而非取代，視為機會「I don&#x27;t think AI replaces game engines, at least not yet, because generating a world and running one are separate problems」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2096667046117343741" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者引用自己先前貼文提到認同「做多TTWO」這個邏輯本身沒錯（「我有一樣的論點」），只是他個人選擇上檔空間更大的SONY，顯示對TTWO本身也持正面看法。「I have the exact same thesis, but took everything he taught me and went long the real mispriced GTA bet in $SONY」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2094483946763657311" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者稱自己與知名交易者對TTWO抱持「完全相同的論點」（看多），只是認為SONY的上檔空間更大「I have the exact same thesis」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2090895096694857804" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">券商評級轉述。「BofA Securities reiterates」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2069423672688050607" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Rockstar所属Take-Two游戏需求担忧。「Memory scarcity will affect GTA 6 sales」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2051453064650039482" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:UNH</span><span class="s-n">5 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-09-15 → 2026-03-11</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Kevin Hern</b>：2026-01 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li><li><b>Lisa McClain</b>：2025-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Markwayne Mullin</b>：2025-10 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Markwayne Mullin</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · up to $100K · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-03-11 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2031737117706014957" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Kevin Hern</b> <span class="tag t-bear">賣出</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · entire position; up to $500K · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-01-26 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2015899149888073944" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Kevin Hern</b> <span class="tag t-bear">賣出</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · entire position; up to $500K · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-01-23 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2014716445536535024" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Markwayne Mullin</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · up to $50K · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2025-10-01 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/1973532320268484952" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-09-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Lisa McClain</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2025-09-15 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/1967608251627049334" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:USAR</span><span class="s-n">5 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-10-13 → 2026-07-07</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-5.7%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Trump administration</b>：2026-07 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>United States Department of Commerce</b>：2026-04 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Trump administration</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-07-07 <a href="https://x.com/DJTRadar/status/2074618430322274440" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">政策业务受益評述。「这一政策变化可能利好」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2070226780703854835" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>United States Department of Commerce</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 8% equity stake (loan is separate) · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-04-30 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2049850078353821831" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">赞稀土政策与战略重要性，非个股股票方向。「$USAR to $MP are incredibly important」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2038556249592119671" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">翻译他人USAR期权资金押注，非作者自身看空。「usar期权市场有人押注下跌」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/1977756550908256373" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:APLD</span><span class="s-n">4 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-06-03 → 2026-09-09</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+3.5%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Ren</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，僅列為他人過去持倉之一，未表態自己看法「Look at the names Leopold was in」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2097521722954072202" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">同CRWV，作者提到APLD背負高利率債務，作為對照Nebius優勢的例子，未直接論斷股價方向。「High interest debt that $CRWV, $APLD, and others face.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2097327653116363127" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上,作者表態看多AI資料中心層並考慮複製此清單,APLD為名單第三梯隊持股。「Applied Digital $APLD [Long]」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2095228808278446221" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">同業FCF負面對比。「all burn cash」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2062201072463061056" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:BKNG</span><span class="s-n">4 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-05-14 → 2026-09-23</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Donald Trump</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">回顧短方論點及跌幅，自引Meta舊論點，無新承諾。「$EXPE and $BKNG getting nuked today」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2102843025131245920" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明說Meta多頭及聚合商空頭配對交易，方向明確。「Short aggregators」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2100704362024820857" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">质疑代理对旅游平台护城河影响，反问未给明确股票方向。「$EXPE and $BKNG built much of their moat」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2100665638330986951" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Donald Trump</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · up to $250,000 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-05-14 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2054978447097622653" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:BTDR</span><span class="s-n">4 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-05-28 → 2026-06-03</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">庆祝既往涨价。「今天比特小鹿20.35了」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2062241655416377643" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">已發生價格變化。「已经12.5-18.4了」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2060290460242125072" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">回顾BTDR消息前的期权及涨幅，未新增当前方向。「BTDR」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2060025405055418586" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">價格回顧。「BTDR牛逼 单日10%」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2060015811373470104" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:CPSH</span><span class="s-n">4 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-05-16 → 2026-05-26</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>大老师</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">已發生市值回顧。「85M-181M」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2059281527616553098" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">既往价格上涨及错过感慨。「我没买！」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2059281157884412236" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">材料用途及业务可能性正面。「CPSH客户具体信息」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2055712564705972358" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者推介股票低估及訂單催化。「8500万美金实在是太便宜了，太低廉了。」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2055710895381348484" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:CVX</span><span class="s-n">4 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-02-19 → 2026-06-21</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+0.2%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>David Taylor</b>：2026-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-02 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">以估值低与长期需求论点指出Micron仍有价格重评上行机会；石油股为比较。「$CVX ran from $42 to $174」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2068786194813686224" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>David Taylor</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日 2026-06-15（原文：June 15） · 揭露 2026-07-06 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2074108018757718451" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">当前多头及战争升级条件下继续上行。「going long on $CVX」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2037944481199358169" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确推荐CVX与AVAV为战争对冲多头；JBSS只业务猜想，XLS未核实。「might be good longs/hedges here.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2024322169376035019" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:DOCN</span><span class="s-n">4 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-06-30 → 2026-08-04</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>大老师</b>：2026-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者自己的明確多頭期權解讀。「整体财报前看涨」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2084594597251154059" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">DigitalOcean模型托管平台业务收益论述，未明确股票回报或买卖方向。「Every big open source release sends more developers to platforms like this.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2078132525625381140" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">DOCN已涨与平台收益经营论述，产能填满仍条件性，不给明确股票方向。「it runs a full five-layer stack」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2074544093443592678" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">直接買入意向。「DOCN 尾盘我将会敏捷买入」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2072020369637364155" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:ENPH</span><span class="s-n">4 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-05-29 → 2026-08-24</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+8.3%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者認為ENPH目前股價已反映最壞情境，一旦民主黨選情轉好可能受惠反彈「Residential solar has been crushed with names like $FSLR, $ENPH priced for a no subsidy world.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2091969064302465311" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">看好技術位置但仍需突破51。「当前位置是一个值得关注的位置」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2071977387928268955" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面技術觀察，沒有明確買入或突破方向。「技术面也相对成立」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2069057830985060373" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">回顾匿名ENPH期权获利，未表明作者当前方向。「ENPH」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2060361031025856941" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:EQIX</span><span class="s-n">4 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-07-15 → 2026-09-03</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+1.4%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Donald Trump</b>：2026-07 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Michael Rulli</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Rulli</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-09-03 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2095509656193974669" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Donald Trump</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · up to $1,000,000 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-08-31 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2094426846825775221" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Donald Trump</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · up to $1,000,000 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-08-20 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2090489621121519867" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Donald Trump</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · up to $1,000,000 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-07-15 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2077446527174230107" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:ERII</span><span class="s-n">4 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-03-09 → 2026-06-18</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2026-03 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-03 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确ERII高信念长仓及过度卖出低估，第三方内部交易支持作者自身方向。「a new high conviction long for me.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2067650070313578790" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确ERII具再评级机会并提出当前低估及催化论点。「prime re-rating territory.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2067307445492576683" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">當前低估与未定價催化。「Now here is the disconnect the market has not priced:」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2031024365576368369" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确ERII便宜且应大幅重估，看多。「This stock is due for a massive re-rating.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2031024184713974043" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:FORM</span><span class="s-n">4 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-04-13 → 2026-08-06</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">收入與時程訊息。「Seeing CPO test revenues hit for $VIAV to $FORM around now.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2085174977272360987" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">模糊喜爱光学股与引用历史业绩跳涨，不构成特定股票新方向。「$FORM +16.6%」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2084826016107917466" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">FormFactor财报CPO增长解析，主题前景未转为明确单股方向。「takeaways from $FORM earnings call」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2082720873908494456" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">认为Teradyne供应链业务受挫，未明确股票方向；海外伙伴未核实。「FormFactor」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2043559550016733352" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:HAL</span><span class="s-n">4 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-06-01 → 2026-06-16</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Gil Cisneros</b>：2025-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Michael Burry</b>：2025-11 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者提出SLB为伊朗资本开支交易且比旧案例更大，明确多方机会。「Halliburton popped 8%」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2066977713450275231" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-01-05 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2008255886851240041" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2025-11-03 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/1985464359750140237" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文