资方向。「$IONQ」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2031118556172005694" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:KLAR</span><span class="s-n">4 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-06-25 → 2026-08-30</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+0.8%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Klarna CEO</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Klarna CEO</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · $10M · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-08-30 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2093963681516138955" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">法院判决新闻及自引旧期权分析，没有新方向。「裁定PriceRunner胜诉」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2072281681562857539" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">已發生期權收益回顧。「这个也ITM了」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2070602591831200048" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Klarna诉讼胜率与期权状态观察，没有明确股票回报方向。「胜诉概率偏高」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2070222767644127434" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:LMT</span><span class="s-n">4 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-03-31 → 2026-07-04</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-2.4%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Donald Trump</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Donald Trump</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · up to $250,000 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-07-04 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2073474774857023916" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Donald Trump</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · up to $250,000 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-07-01 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2072363068055748731" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Donald Trump</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · up to $250,000 · 交易日 2026-05-15（原文：May 15th） · 揭露 2026-07-01 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2072352479191105953" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">主张增加激光武器研发，非股票买卖方向。「$LMT」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2038785650632397005" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:MRNA</span><span class="s-n">4 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-03-02 → 2026-10-04</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-3.7%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Donald Trump</b>：2026-03 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Zephyr</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Unusual Whales</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">options_flow 帳號純粹陳述 Moderna 今年大漲逾570%與單日大漲140%的數據事實，沒有方向性評論。「Moderna, $MRNA, is up more than 570% this year.」 <a href="https://x.com/unusual_whales/status/2106791708830622185" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Donald Trump</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-08-20 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2090407933343416327" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者稱這是「重大突破」，正面看待MRNA與MRK合作的個人化mRNA癌症疫苗第三期試驗成功的消息「Huge breakthrough」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2090051577143001302" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Donald Trump</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日 2026-03-02（原文：March 2nd） · 揭露 2026-07-02 · 3 則報導 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2090098801050571050" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文1</a> <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2102109855209160793" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文2</a> <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2072717449154224278" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文3</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:NKE</span><span class="s-n">4 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-04-01 → 2026-09-09</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-6.9%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-04 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者說Nike『只需要做一件事就能挽救品牌形象』，這是在批評其品牌形象，並非對股價方向的判斷。「$NIKE 只需要做一件事，就能挽救自己的品牌形象」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2097601244898775465" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">同一句話僅描述市場對這批服飾股的懲罰性反應，作者未表態自己對後市的方向判斷。「American Eagle $AEO, Gap $GAP, Lululemon $LULU, Nike $NKE, Dicks $DKS ... all getting punished by investors lately.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2092645833896497419" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">批评Lululemon任命并比较NikePayPalHP，非股票看空。「$NKE “veteran”」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2047395389742174406" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">明确认为Nike相对估值缺乏多头吸引力，表达投资看空；同行是消费观察。「maybe there’s better longs out there.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2039370303302963209" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:NVEC</span><span class="s-n">4 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-07-09 → 2026-07-23</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2026-07 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-07 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者現行低估與成長論點。「the stock is cheaper than the day we published.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2080375550325981320" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确NVEC仍有机器人股票上行空间；PENG/AEHR仅旧成功案例。「how much upside this profitable small cap gem has in the robotics revolution.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2080348641823171026" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">財報成長熱情反應。「SOMEBODY STOP ME」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2080057984647049656" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面股票研究與關注建議，沒有明确買入或價格預測。「needs on their watchlist.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2075307790990446879" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:NYT</span><span class="s-n">4 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-02-17 → 2026-07-26</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-2.3%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Berkshire Hathaway</b>：2026-02 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">舊自引受惠公司。「$NYT and newscorp.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2081469550802166170" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">業務合作及诉訟正面預期。「Will get very lucrative deals from LLMS」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2067825364722995559" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">媒体声誉嘲讽，不是股价方向。「the NYT is finished now」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2058013144761680132" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Berkshire Hathaway</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · $351M · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-02-17 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2023871361404502449" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:PH</span><span class="s-n">4 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-03-23 → 2026-08-06</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+0.3%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>David Taylor</b>：2026-03 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Jared Moskowitz</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Markwayne Mullin</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Markwayne Mullin</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-08-06 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2085389053533266201" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>David Taylor</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-05-29 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2060352477300420912" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jared Moskowitz</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-05-01 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2050209175381193196" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>David Taylor</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-03-23 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2036082896071483609" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:SNOW</span><span class="s-n">4 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-05-21 → 2026-09-02</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+3.9%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Donald Trump</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Ren</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者詳述SNOW營收與EPS大幅超預期、產品營收連三季加速成長且同時擴張營業利益率,稱這種組合「幾乎沒人能做到」。「Growing faster and making more money at the same time is the combination nobody gets, which is why the stock is up 22% after hours.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2095290741031321954" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">同上,屬於財報預測命中率的事後戰績回顧,非目前新立場。「4中3 谢谢大家」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2095244650944897202" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">負面業務護城河評價，不直接等於股票方向。「More white flags from SaaS」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2067671271115219342" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Donald Trump</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日 2026-05-21（原文：May 21st purchase） · 揭露 2026-08-11 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2087177432176484446" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:XOM</span><span class="s-n">4 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-02-02 → 2026-06-21</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+0.9%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Josh Gottheimer</b>：2026-02 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">以估值低与长期需求论点指出Micron仍有价格重评上行机会；石油股为比较。「ExxonMobil $XOM」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2068786194813686224" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Josh Gottheimer</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-04-02 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2039704461669535953" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Josh Gottheimer</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-03-17 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2034051194381905980" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Josh Gottheimer</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日 2026-02-02（原文：February 2nd） · 揭露 2026-03-27 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2037568311534195161" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">TSE:6976</span><span class="s-n">3 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-06-19 → 2026-09-09</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+11.6%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上，被列為正在調漲售價的主要供應商之一「Murata, Samsung Electro-Mechanics, and Taiyo Yuden all raising prices.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2097692213014606169" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明示持倉並以H2至2027消費型MLCC瓶頸及大市占支持前瞻受益論點。「But companies with large market share of overall MLCCs like Taiyo Yuden (6976, disclosure: I have positions) with less AI server share, would be a major beneficiary of this.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2089183484556480536" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">MLCC业务完整太诱名称明确，核验6976；错失过去涨幅非当前买入。「Taiyo Yuden up 211.38%」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2067954339982008731" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">TWSE:3661</span><span class="s-n">3 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-04-23 → 2026-07-06</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">ASIC与Trainium后端语境确认世芯普通股，合作背景无作者自身方向。「AlChip likely Trainium win」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2074046947434860971" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Trainium后端设计明确确认世芯普通股；技术合作新闻无股票方向。「Alchip is also handling the back end」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2072534382712369183" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">ASIC与CPO合作确认世芯普通股，背景无作者投资方向。「Alchip (Joint CPO)」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2047209727738957983" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:AMC</span><span class="s-n">3 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-03-06 → 2026-03-29</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-15.8%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">历史稀释比较或融资背景，无当前个股方向。「$AMC」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2038163974437659019" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">持股困境类比，没有AMC新交易。「$AMC bagholding territory」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2036512077960061176" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">明确主张不持有IREN并推荐CIFR和NBIS替代多头。「$AMC」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2029993746658643978" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:AMRZ</span><span class="s-n">3 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-03-01 → 2026-09-15</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Jan Jenisch</b>：2026-03 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jan Jenisch</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 30,000 shares; approximately US$1.27 million · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-09-15 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2099849222413553975" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jan Jenisch</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日 2026-05-01（原文：May） · 揭露 2026-09-15 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2099849222413553975" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jan Jenisch</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 60,000 shares · 交易日 2026-03-01（原文：March） · 揭露 2026-09-15 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2099849222413553975" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:ASST</span><span class="s-n">3 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-03-08 → 2026-04-30</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+3.6%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-04 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">明确认为SLNH及比较公司均为糟糕多头且将稀释股东，表达看空。「They’re all absolutely terrible longs.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2049969772251709921" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">历史稀释比较或融资背景，无当前个股方向。「$ASST」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2038163974437659019" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者预计IREN稀释损害每股价值并提醒相应调整投资，表达当前看空。「$ASST」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2030761150292615564" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:BOT</span><span class="s-n">3 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-05-17 → 2026-06-04</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+9.2%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">认为Tesla机器人未计价并将估值重塑，明确多方；其余为涨幅背景。「$BOT  今日上涨18%」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2062625310370308384" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明示股票估值不合理及稀釋風險，反對追買。「that move just seems predatory when there’s already a valuation NAV disconnect.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2056549908438749581" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确批评股票价格远高NAV及即将大幅稀释。「$BOT is the biggest red flag.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2055970949762302055" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:CORZ</span><span class="s-n">3 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-06-11 → 2026-09-02</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-0.4%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>CORZ director (unnamed)</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Ren</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上,作者表態看多AI建設並考慮複製此清單,CORZ為名單第三梯隊持股。「Core Scientific $CORZ [Long]」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2095228808278446221" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>CORZ director (unnamed)</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 6,000 shares for $110,000 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-08-25 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2092162971459875182" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">業務進度正評與期權流。「数据中心进展迅速」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2065083025759838330" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:CRS</span><span class="s-n">3 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-02-04 → 2026-03-03</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Markwayne Mullin</b>：2026-02 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Markwayne Mullin</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-03-03 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2028638562262950037" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Markwayne Mullin</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-02-05 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2019427765771264323" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Markwayne Mullin</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · up to $100K · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-02-04 · 2 則報導 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2019197674462015727" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文1</a> <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2019196790592196894" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文2</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:CRWD</span><span class="s-n">3 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-08-27 → 2026-09-15</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+4.2%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Ren</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">批評估值但未給股價方向。「while ignoring all their fundamentals.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2099659874892386678" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者稱$CRWD創紀錄季度營收、淨新增ARR年增51%，並認為市場仍把它當端點防護廠商估值，暗示被低估，屬明確看多。「The market still prices CrowdStrike like an endpoint vendor. Kurtz is describing the security layer for the agent era.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2093323211660509338" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者認同資安產業長線成長趨勢（資安預算隨AI增加2-3倍），雖自稱目前未跟進，但整體論述偏多。「cybersecurity will only get more important as AI gets used for everything」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2092987523186233622" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:CSCO</span><span class="s-n">3 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-04-21 → 2026-08-12</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+5.5%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>大老师</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">明示看跌，後文為作者的期權證據。「CSCO财报看跌」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2087626373108248719" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Nokia和Cisco发布产品，LITE上涨为他人行情解释。「Cisco」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2053866116842410090" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">業務需求正面新聞。「Cisco」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2046636300124778731" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:DOW</span><span class="s-n">3 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-05-27 → 2026-06-02</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+0.3%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>大老师</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">明示只交流期权流，两股看涨订单并非作者股价方向。「近月来跑出了大量的看涨期权」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2061925660076163175" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">DOW旧期权达成与新订单播报，自引旧观点无本次方向。「DOW 35call ITM实现」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2061453235005894868" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确投资机会。「潜在交易机会（半导体相关 非老鼠仓） $DOW」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2059644915328639420" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:EXPE</span><span class="s-n">3 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-09-17 → 2026-09-23</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+0.3%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">回顧短方論點及跌幅，自引Meta舊論點，無新承諾。「$EXPE and $BKNG getting nuked today」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2102843025131245920" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明說Meta多頭及聚合商空頭配對交易，方向明確。「Short aggregators」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2100704362024820857" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">质疑代理对旅游平台护城河影响，反问未给明确股票方向。「$EXPE and $BKNG built much of their moat」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2100665638330986951" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:FN</span><span class="s-n">3 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-05-04 → 2026-09-09</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+13.1%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Ren</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">列在 Bullish for 清單，理由是光引擎組裝「$FN - engine assembly」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2097820413900276043" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确长期持有Sivers、相信估值巨大扩张，其他公司为合作/同业资讯。「like $FN」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2074046947434860971" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">引用中相對供應鏈劣勢。「$FN」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2051402855005954368" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:GE</span><span class="s-n">3 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-04-22 → 2026-05-14</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Donald Trump</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Jared Moskowitz</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Maria Salazar</b>：2026-04 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Donald Trump</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-05-14 · 2 則報導 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2054966449043595282" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文1</a> <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2054919028393574455" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文2</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jared Moskowitz</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-05-01 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2050209175381193196" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Maria Salazar</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-04-22 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2046943979720065478" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:GS</span><span class="s-n">3 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-11-13 → 2026-07-23</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Ted Cruz</b>：2025-11 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">市場正面反應及業務品質。「高盛、摩根大通和美国银行财报后表现更强」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2080221517309432162" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">研究质量称赞。「Goldman Sachs’ AI report」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2051894739843362932" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ted Cruz</b> <span class="tag t-bear">賣出</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · up to $250K · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2025-11-13 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/1988979767144771612" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:HUT</span><span class="s-n">3 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-06-11 → 2026-09-01</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-3.3%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Ren</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者引用Anthropic向Nvidia背書的Lambda簽下350億美元雲端協議、租用Hut 8德州機房的新聞,並鼓勵「不要讓總經干擾你的信念」,暗示看好HUT。「Don&#x27;t let macro get in the way of your conviction.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2094806736527864225" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者將$HUT與Lambda/GPU算力擴張並列，並提問「下一個受惠的neocloud/colo業者是誰」，暗示看好其受惠於前緣模型算力需求爆炸。「$HUT / DC, with Lambda / GPUs... Which neocloud/colo player is next?」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2094585395224981709" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">板塊潛在業務利好。「potential tailwind for the Neocloud colo sector.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2065130589204992048" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:ICE</span><span class="s-n">3 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-02-27 → 2026