v class="tl-body"><b>KEEL Chief Operating Officer</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 30,769 shares, over $100k · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-08-21 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2090756789444751651" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:MELI</span><span class="s-n">3 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-05-08 → 2026-08-12</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-0.9%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Marcelo Melamud</b>：2026-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Michael Burry</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-08-12 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2087648528428380602" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Marcelo Melamud</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 125 shares; around 200k · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-06-16 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2066881179123343422" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · full position · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-05-08 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2052816032998257033" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:NVO</span><span class="s-n">3 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-02-06 → 2026-04-17</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-3.6%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者认为HIMS跌幅与利好不匹配，并论证空头回补限制股价下行，表达投资利好。「$NVO」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2045196575010587104" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确预期HIMS利好可能引发空头挤压上行。「$NVO」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2030083176744505386" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">批评HIMS监管与产业游说，情绪不等于股票方向。「$NVO」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2019903479486279877" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:OKLO</span><span class="s-n">3 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-10-02 → 2026-09-11</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-3.3%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Wolf Financial</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">報導Oklo啟動新的10億美元市價增發(ATM)計畫，純轉述無作者評論，但增發計畫通常被市場視為稀釋利空。「$OKLO LAUNCHES NEW $1B AT-THE-MARKET STOCK OFFERING PROGRAM」 <a href="https://x.com/WOLF_Financial/status/2098376933428109483" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Evan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">純粹轉述Oklo宣布增發最高10億美元普通股的消息，作者未加評論，但增發本身對既有股東而言通常是稀釋性利空消息。「$OKLO JUST ANNOUNCED PLANS TO RAISE UP TO $1 BILLION BY SELLING SHARES OF COMMON STOCK」 <a href="https://x.com/StockMKTNewz/status/2098376454073438400" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">业务重要性与历史涨幅赞扬。「there&#x27;s no AI without Oklo」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1973800082626806050" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:OPEN</span><span class="s-n">3 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-07-01 → 2025-10-01</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Cleo Fields</b>：2025-07 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Cleo Fields</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2025-10-01 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/1973397570232680879" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-07-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Cleo Fields</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日 2025-07-21（原文：July 21st） · 揭露 2025-09-17 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/1968354503360700817" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-07-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Cleo Fields</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日 2025-07-01（原文：back in July） · 揭露 2025-10-01 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/1973397570232680879" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:OUST</span><span class="s-n">3 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-06-04 → 2026-07-07</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确看多LITE/Sivers上游受益；雷达公司监管条件分析不等于无条件方向。「For $OUST, $AEVA」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2074581698604593367" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">推广朋友交易风格并引用其历史交易，不归作者方向。「$OUST, SK Square, $CRDO」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2072750104189047063" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">认为Tesla机器人未计价并将估值重塑，明确多方；其余为涨幅背景。「$OUST  今日上涨9%」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2062625310370308384" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:PDD</span><span class="s-n">3 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-05-22 → 2026-06-26</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">PDD数据外泄与侮辱，公司负面语气不是明确股票看空。「PDD 大规模数据泄露了」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2070513891764015557" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">績效警告與反問，未直接預測下跌。「劝告一下喜欢pdd的朋友」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2066563539809206297" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确主张避免中国股票敞口，担忧FUTU和TIGR政策风险。「$PDD」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2057780545292308506" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:PGY</span><span class="s-n">3 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-10-20 → 2025-11-10</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2025-10 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2025-11 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">當前相對低估。「still very undervalued compared to peers」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1987995542128074874" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">當前倍數低估论點。「Still trades at 6.5x earnings.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1983993537554194797" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">推荐PGY文章；便宜估值判断属于引用作者，没有本作者方向。「Good read on $PGY. Worth checking out」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/1980406796834795794" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:PI</span><span class="s-n">3 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-04-04 → 2025-10-23</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+7.2%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Marjorie Taylor Greene</b>：2025-04 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Marjorie Taylor Greene</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2025-10-23 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/1981368181500334487" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Marjorie Taylor Greene</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2025-10-02 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/1973831573943238699" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-04-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Marjorie Taylor Greene</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日 2025-04-04（原文：April 4th） · 揭露 2025-10-08 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/1975990803253408114" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:PUMP</span><span class="s-n">3 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-04-01 → 2026-05-21</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-0.3%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Leopold</b>：2026-04 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>大老师</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面调侃，非明确交易。「我们一起pump pump」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2057540214760120800" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者偏好及估值重估機會。「$PUMP 也许更优质」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2057538141368791242" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Leopold</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 115% added to position · 交易日 2026-04-01（原文：last quarter） · 揭露 2026-09-17 · 2 則報導 <a href="https://x.com/DJTRadar/status/2100608252509589540" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文1</a> <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2100537529325752680" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文2</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:QRVO</span><span class="s-n">3 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-05-18 → 2026-06-22</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>大老师</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">期權流數據。「684万美金看涨」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2069088338569797922" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">主文仅回顾SWKS到达80，引用旧并购论点不形成新方向。「$QRVO」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2057838247724961921" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确认为合并带来更多未来股价买盘，SWKS及QRVO看多；订单与客户背景不投票。「我们绝不能忽视 $SWKS 和 $QRVO的 合并」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2056366947252720067" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:RIOT</span><span class="s-n">3 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-08-11 → 2026-09-02</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-8.7%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Ren</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上,作者表態看多AI算力建設並考慮複製此清單,RIOT為名單第三梯隊持股。「Riot Platforms $RIOT [Long]」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2095228808278446221" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">新合約後難維持買盤的過去價格觀察，未预测未来方向。「they can&#x27;t seem to hold the bid」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2087205015802822817" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Riot合約、AMD擴約與收入時間線，讚賞成長非股票方向。「$RIOT announced a $9.1B deal」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2086988264448409739" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:RTX</span><span class="s-n">3 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-12-22 → 2026-05-05</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Roger Williams</b>：2025-12 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">以Sivers为核心论证未来市值上行，伙伴名单仅供应链背景。「$RTX」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2051566667009073315" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">主张增加激光武器研发，非股票买卖方向。「$RTX」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2038785650632397005" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Roger Williams</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日 2025-12-22（原文：December 22nd） · 揭露 2026-01-16 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2012186860886630481" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:SHAZ</span><span class="s-n">3 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-05-18 → 2026-09-02</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-4.0%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Ren</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同上,作者表態看多AI建設並考慮複製此清單,SHAZ為名單第三梯隊持股(公司資訊較少見,判斷把握略低)。「SharonAI Holdings $SHAZ [Long]」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2095228808278446221" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面業務猜測，沒有股票方向。「stating to make more sense connection wise?」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2073704784398528599" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">外部机构新持仓及业务前景。「$SHAZ」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2056338027082125448" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:SLNH</span><span class="s-n">3 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-04-30 → 2026-09-08</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-9.3%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-04 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">同CLSK，作者指SLNH缺乏大型雲端業者合約帶來的營收確定性，未直接論斷股價方向。「Revenue uncertainty at scale with Hyperscaler contracts that $CLSK, $BITF, $WYFI, $SLNH, and others lack.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2097327653116363127" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">大額ATM與轉移投資人資金的負面股票論點。「new $500m ATMs on a $250m MC.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2063571485739106593" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">明确认为SLNH及比较公司均为糟糕多头且将稀释股东，表达看空。「They’re all absolutely terrible longs.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2049969772251709921" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:SNAP</span><span class="s-n">3 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-03-27 → 2026-06-07</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-06 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">直接預期股權價值下降。「you&#x27;ll likely see the value of your equity decrease due to dilution.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2063571485739106593" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">历史稀释比较或融资背景，无当前个股方向。「$SNAP」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2038163974437659019" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">认可稀释担忧，未明示做空。「excessive SBC makes sense」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2037320624746729756" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:SOXX</span><span class="s-n">3 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-07-30 → 2026-08-12</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bear">放空</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+5.0%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Michael Burry</b>：2026-07 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bear">放空</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · puts added · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-08-12 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2087648528428380602" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bear">放空</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-08-11 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2087276225727271035" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bear">放空</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · entry ~$506 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-07-30 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2082942341019525339" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:SPGI</span><span class="s-n">3 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-08-13 → 2026-10-03</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-2.4%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Bill Ackman</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Bill Ackman</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · ~$1B · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-10-03 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2106252334770638980" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Bill Ackman</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 2.59 million shares, ~$1.06 billion · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-09-09 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2097631933840699612" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Bill Ackman</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-08-13 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2087804989687120089" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:STRC</span><span class="s-n">3 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-06-03 → 2026-06-20</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+0.8%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">对派息频率消息正面反应，無股票方向。「$STRC now pays dividends twice per month.」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2068449353585557750" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者认同加密风险并讨论机制，引用他人STRC/MSTR崩盘预测不直接归作者。「Most $STRC investors will lose」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2062295959644819926" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">对STRC/MSTR风险报道反应，无明确未来股票方向。「风险再现」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2062286277744165008" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:SWKS</span><span class="s-n">3 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-05-18 → 2026-06-22</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-2.9%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>大老师</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">期權流數據。「684万美金看涨」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2069088338569797922" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">主文仅回顾SWKS到达80，引用旧并购论点不形成新方向。「$SWKS」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2057838247724961921" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确认为合并带来更多未来股价买盘，SWKS及QRVO看多；订单与客户背景不投票。「将在未来带来更多潜在买盘」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2056366947252720067" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:TTD</span><span class="s-n">3 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-12-04 → 2026-04-20</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Serenity</b>：2025-12 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">当前股票持仓与重估偏好。「I do have short term positions at $22」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2046296091461869737" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">預期40至50%上行。「$TTD at $22 is compelling」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2046005919637733430" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者直接买入评级。「Upgrading $TTD to a buy at $38.6」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/1996581986472022087" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:TXN</span><span class="s-n">3 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-05-09 → 2026-06-15</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+5.6%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>大老师</b>：2026-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">舊自引估值意見，現在未新增方向承諾。「所以我研究完事没发对吗」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2066523100968308870" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者直接表达股票低估。「我认为 $TXN 德州仪器可能有低估的可能」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2061936615145267268" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">業務回暖感嘆。「Analog is super back」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2053094502521618473" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:U</span><span class="s-n">3 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-02-11 → 2026-09-09</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+9.4%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">看到 GPT 6 Astra 與該公司整合建構虛擬世界後認同其邏輯，並稱 AI 加遊戲這個主題還很早期「AI + gaming feels like a name/theme that&#x27;s still very early」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2097699543773319339" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者提到今年稍早$U曾因類似AI世界生成恐慌重挫20%，如今認為這種恐慌被誇大，AI其實是與引擎協作，視為機會「$U down more than 20% in a single day and $RBLX and $TTWO going with it. The fear was that if a model can generate a playable world, nobody needs an engine.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2096667046117343741" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">质疑Unity股价反应过激，但没有明确买卖或公平估值。「$U」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2021620427009970501" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:WOLF</span><span class="s-n">3 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-01-24 → 2026-06-15</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="flip">1 人反轉</span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-01 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span> → 2026-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span> <span class="flip">立場反轉</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者预期WOLF及LITE主题篮子上涨，明确正向；SpaceX仅IPO事件，Hynix为历史宏观比较。「$WOLF power semi basket should go brrr」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2066360345774764496" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">公司或過去漲幅評論，不等於股票投票。「$WOLF」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2059674880761860125" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确当前证券投资陷阱评价。「This is a negative EV trap:」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2015152332821217305" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">KRX:005935</span><span class="s-n">2 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-06-17 → 2026-08-07</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-2.9%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">明示優先股，引用預期非作者方向。「SEC (005930) / SEC-P (005935)」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2085569668950249843" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">優先股明示，正面估值反問不直接當多票。「Samsung preferred is trading at a 40% discount」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2067379602314711497" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">TWSE:3037</s