5" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:ETN</span><span class="s-n">2 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-02-09 → 2026-02-13</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>John Hickenlooper</b>：2026-02 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>John Hickenlooper</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · up to $100,000 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-02-13 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2022347277000732690" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>John Hickenlooper</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · up to $100,000 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-02-09 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2020946068020871643" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:ETOR</span><span class="s-n">2 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-01-15 → 2026-02-06</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-01 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者当前明确低估判断。「one of the most undervalued companies on NASDAQ」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2019835298658807869" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">结合3.9x现金流和Walmart高估值的明确低估判断。「Valuation seems a bit absurd」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2011837062157385907" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:FCEL</span><span class="s-n">2 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-05-20 → 2026-05-21</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">过去价格和项目正面评价。「$FCEL surging 25% today.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2057507211287634319" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-20</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确持有FCEL小仓位并论证上行赔率；BE为业务比较。「I have a small position」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2057245346263380086" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:FIG</span><span class="s-n">2 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-05-30 → 2026-08-05</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>大老师</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">五家公司各有独立明确偏空/偏好论点，非纯代码资料清单。「FIG — AI变现加速」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2085031458692018432" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">歷史跌幅與反彈嘲諷。「$CRM to $FIG」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2060578117320904884" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:FLUT</span><span class="s-n">2 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-07-08 → 2026-07-30</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-2.4%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Michael Burry</b>：2026-07 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-07-30 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2082942341019525339" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-07-08 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2074978412196687982" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:GLOB</span><span class="s-n">2 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-05-14 → 2026-05-15</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">已發生交易收益。「$GLOB」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2055281029272010945" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">異常资金关注而非明示買入。「财报老鼠又来了」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2055002974867562773" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:GPRO</span><span class="s-n">2 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-08-31 → 2026-09-01</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+1.5%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者對GoPro因宣布併購光子公司而股價暴漲79%表達驚訝，但未表態後續走勢判斷。「What... $GPRO is up 79.17% after planning to merge with a photonics company」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2094786201605808566" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">敘述GPRO因網紅Markiplier建倉8.5%成為最大股東而暴漲，作者僅陳述現象未表態後市方向。「$GPRO, up almost 100% on the day. Why? Markiplier.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2094545635575779606" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:GTLB</span><span class="s-n">2 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-09-01 → 2026-09-01</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+7.7%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">檢討GTLB舊預測「看涨」命中良好,屬於財報後的事後戰