><span class="s-range">2026-03-30 → 2026-06-25</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">政策业务受益評述。「这一政策变化可能利好」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2070226780703854835" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">赞稀土政策与战略重要性，非个股股票方向。「$USAR to $MP are incredibly important」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2038556249592119671" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:MRAM</span><span class="s-n">2 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-05-09 → 2026-05-15</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+3.9%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Zephyr</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">公司负面称呼与既往上涨，不等于看空。「the shitco Everspin is rising」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2055116190184534211" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确称MRAM为泡沫，表达估值看空；MU和SNDK仅作为对比。「This is where the bubble is」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2052931039329505425" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:MS</span><span class="s-n">2 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-03-30 → 2026-07-24</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-03 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">MorganStanley与海力士承销消息，无股票方向；明确ADR/美上市语境用SKHY。「Morgan Stanley was quite shaken internally」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2080445048576229786" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者提出MorganStanley未定价优势及做多理由，明确看多；竞争者与IPO公司为背景。「a structural advantage in retail IPO distribution that the market hasn&#x27;t priced in yet」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2038700948953186807" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:MSCI</span><span class="s-n">2 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-05-03 → 2026-05-08</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-1.2%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Michael Burry</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-05-08 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2052628472154013794" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-05-03 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2050913184677003450" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:NWSA</span><span class="s-n">2 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-06-19 → 2026-07-26</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">舊自引受惠公司。「$NYT and newscorp.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2081469550802166170" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">News Corp公司身份已確認，內容業務正面預期。「Publishers with legit news teams and fact checkers like $NYT and newscorp」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2067825364722995559" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:ONON</span><span class="s-n">2 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-04-01 → 2026-08-18</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+2.8%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>On Holding CEO</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-18</div><div class="tl-body"><b>On Holding CEO</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 65,000 shares for almost $2M · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-08-18 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2089620368986198524" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">明确认为Nike相对估值缺乏多头吸引力，表达投资看空；同行是消费观察。「Oncloud」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2039370303302963209" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:OPTT</span><span class="s-n">2 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-01-24 → 2026-01-26</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2026-01 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">已發生漲幅。「$OPTT」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2015610626291224847" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者认为OPTT风险回报具有非对称吸引力，同时提示现金与稀释风险，方向仍偏多。「Seems pretty asymmetric to me but the cash runway is tight.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2015203261377024101" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:ORBS</span><span class="s-n">2 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-10-08 → 2025-10-17</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">公司研究机会评价，未给当前交易或价格。「nobody seems to be acknowledging the assymetric opportunity」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1979208929704878298" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-10-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">访谈ORBS董事长及转述其World技术观点；作者用问句宣传节目，没有投资方向。「$ORBS」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/1976022953184854492" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:PALL</span><span class="s-n">2 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-07-13 → 2026-07-14</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-3.5%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>John Boozman</b>：2026-07 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>John Boozman</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-07-14 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2076936544120648046" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>John Boozman</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-07-13 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2076726914488647826" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:PDYN</span><span class="s-n">2 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-01-31 → 2026-01-31</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2026-01 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">对他人研究及业务机会正面关注。「Check this one out」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2017677801416232973" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者认为PDYN消息后回落是错误定价且具有非对称机会，表达看多；其他公司仅是供货、比较或自引背景。「Classic sell the news mispricing.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2017676440376852826" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:PFE</span><span class="s-n">2 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-11-03 → 2026-01-05</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-3.2%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Michael Burry</b>：2025-11 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-01-05 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2008255886851240041" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-11-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2025-11-03 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/1985464359750140237" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:PL</span><span class="s-n">2 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-12-02 → 2026-04-01</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="r