il">板塊潛在業務利好。「potential tailwind for the Neocloud colo sector.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2065130589204992048" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:ZTS</span><span class="s-n">2 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-07-30 → 2026-08-12</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-2.4%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Michael Burry</b>：2026-07 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-08-12 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2087648528428380602" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Burry</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · entry ~$76 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-07-30 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2082942341019525339" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">KRX:011070</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-09-09 → 2026-09-09</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-0.7%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">LG Innotek同樣被報導積極爭取進入英特爾EMIB-T基板供應鏈，屬業務擴張消息，但作者未表態方向「Samsung Electro-Mechanics and LG Innotek push to commercialize substrates for Intel&#x27;s &#x27;EMIB-T&#x27;, challenging Japan&#x27;s Ibiden」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2097572715893039563" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">TSE:2768</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-09-01 → 2026-09-01</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-1.8%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">同樣被列為該鎵供應鏈計畫的日方受益夥伴。「Sojitz (2768) as the Japanese JV offtake partner」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2094854529967862140" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">TSE:3103</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-09-03 → 2026-09-03</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+0.1%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Jukan</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者原本視Unitika為「無基本面的迷因股」，如今因通過Qualcomm的T-Glass認證而認為它開始有實質受惠，態度從否定轉為認可其潛力。「it actually passed Qualcomm’s qualification test for T-Glass」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2095304543827554716" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">TSE:5802</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-12-27 → 2025-12-27</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-27</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">明确住友电工材料供给。「Sumitomo Electric」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2004936335702753729" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">TSE:6600</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-09-09 → 2026-09-09</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Jukan</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者對Kioxia執行長決定NAND價格維持穩定、指示員工不要大幅漲價一事以「WTF?」表達不滿，暗示認為在缺貨環境下放棄漲價機會對公司不利「WTF?」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2097490423120048592" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">TSE:6613</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-09-03 → 2026-09-03</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+4.7%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-03</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者認為隨著量子點雷射進入客戶送樣階段，QD Laser等相關公司可能終於要出頭天。「Your QD bros like $ALMU, QD Laser (6613), and others might finally start to see the light of day」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2095460499769155944" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">TWSE:2303</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-08-28 → 2026-08-28</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+5.2%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Jukan</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">UMC的22nm產能已滿載,連三星的加急代工請求都難以配合,顯示其產能供不應求、議價地位轉強。「UMC said it would be difficult」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2093264392678941094" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">TWSE:3054</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-09-08 → 2026-09-08</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+1.5%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">Etron營收年增525%，董事長預期記憶體成長動能可延續到2028甚至2030年，作者並註明自己持有部位。「Etron revenue up +525% Y/Y, +6.4% M/M  Chairman says he sees growth momentum in memory to extend through 2028 or longer」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2097232588796780856" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">TWSE:6239</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-10-04 → 2026-10-04</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者提醒注意力成的 FOPLP 封裝能力，但未明說力成營運改善、買進或股價方向。「Don&#x27;t forget Powertech&#x27;s FOPLP」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2106719792891851255" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">TWSE:6770</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-08-29 → 2026-08-29</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+4.8%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">ESMT晶圆供应与涨价语境确认现行力积电；业务利好没有作者买卖方向。「from PSMC」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2093811019823132903" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:AA</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-09-01 → 2026-09-01</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-0.7%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者將Alcoa列為美國國防部1.74億美元鎵供應鏈投資的受益者，並以「很高興看到」表達正面態度。「$AA (Alcoa Corp) for Gallium production at its refinery... Good to see US critical minerals supply chains investments」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2094854529967862140" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:ADEA</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-06-26 → 2026-06-26</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">反驳Adeia HBM技术假设，非明确股票看空；其他為引用许可客户。「Can someone supply me the hybrid bonded HBM4??」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2070390794071298075" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:ADI</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-05-29 → 2026-05-29</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+5.5%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">零件供應瓶頸。「extreme bottleneck」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2060268717838307684" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:ADTN</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-09-25 → 2026-09-25</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">被列為歷史轉出類別，沒有獨立新方向。「$AMPG, $TRT and $ADTN are just a few that come to mind.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2103597680861626556" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:AEIS</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-04-08 → 2026-04-08</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">电源交期消息，没有股票方向；Delta上市主体未核实。「$AEIS」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2041768179563950542" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:AEO</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-08-26 → 2026-08-26</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+2.3%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者僅描述這幾檔「近期被投資人教訓」的市場反應，未明說自己預期後續會續跌。「American Eagle $AEO, Gap $GAP, Lululemon $LULU, Nike $NKE, Dicks $DKS ... all getting punished by investors lately.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2092645833896497419" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:AIRO</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-01-16 → 2026-01-16</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-01 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确根据反无人机业务量做多AIRO。「hence long $AIRO」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2012199466166616492" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:AKAM</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-09-24 → 2026-09-24</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-24</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">合約新聞。「$AKAM signs $11.6B compute deal with Anthropic」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2103232350348001701" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:ALC</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-08-13 → 2026-08-13</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-2.3%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Bill Ackman</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Bill Ackman</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-08-13 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2087804989687120089" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:ALK</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-06-15 → 2026-06-15</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">AlaskaAir开盘涨幅及感谢，非前瞻方向。「阿拉斯加航空高开8%」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2066514788415640017" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:AMCR</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-04-14 → 2026-04-14</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Thomas Kean Jr.</b>：2026-04 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-14</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Thomas Kean Jr.</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-04-14 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2044046143558946820" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:AMPG</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-09-25 → 2026-09-25</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">被列為歷史轉出類別，沒有獨立新方向。「$AMPG, $TRT and $ADTN are just a few that come to mind.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2103597680861626556" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:AMR</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-09-08 → 2026-09-08</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-2.3%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Kenneth Courtis</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Kenneth Courtis</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 10,000 shares for $2.26 million · 交易日 2026-09-08（原文：September 8） · 揭露 2026-09-11 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2098515551131668866" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:AMRC</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-05-26 → 2026-05-26</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">观察既往期权表现。「ITM $AMRC」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2059273748327596317" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:ANF</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-08-26 → 2026-08-26</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+1.3%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者稱$ANF靠減少促銷仍拉動同店銷售、Hollister缺貨顯示需求強勁，且回購7%股份卻僅11倍本益比，明確看多。「$ANF grew sales at its existing stores by running LESS promotions, not more. Hollister ran out of inventory because demand was too strong.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2092645833896497419" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:AON</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-08-31 → 2026-08-31</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-1.0%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Lester Knight</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-31</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Lester Knight</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · $6.55 million (family partnership) · 交易日 2026-08-31（原文：last week） · 揭露 2026-09-10 · 2 則報導 <a href="https://x.com/DJTRadar/status/2098002039343120755" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文1</a> <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2098001647817433253" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文2</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:AOSL</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-06-26 → 2026-06-26</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">直接作者看多該交易標的。「bullish thematically for US power semi trade from $AOSL to $POWI」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2070304723262210194" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:APD</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-04-08 → 2026-04-08</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <s