class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+0.3%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Donald Trump</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Donald Trump</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日 2026-05-22（原文：May 22nd） · 揭露 2026-07-29 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2082482741635916025" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:AXON</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-02-10 → 2026-02-10</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-2.7%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Donald Trump</b>：2026-02 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Donald Trump</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · $1 to $5 million · 交易日 2026-02-10（原文：February 10, 2026） · 揭露 2026-07-26 <a href="https://x.com/DJTRadar/status/2081298307200987516" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:BAC</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-07-23 → 2026-07-23</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">市場正面反應及業務品質。「高盛、摩根大通和美国银行财报后表现更强」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2080221517309432162" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:BAM</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-10-05 → 2026-10-05</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+0.8%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>In The Assembly</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者在轉述 Brookfield 的 AI 優勢時附上 BAM，屬交易揭露帳號而非可計票的自身立場。「$BN $BAM」 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2106970720223797735" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:BBW</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-01-25 → 2026-01-25</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">过去买入和历史收益回顾。「bought a Teddy Bear like I did」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2015506107075264735" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:BIRD</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-04-15 → 2026-04-15</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+44.4%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-15</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">公司转型嘲讽。「pure dot-com vibes」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2044394534625521788" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:BITF</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-09-08 → 2026-09-08</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">同CLSK，作者指BITF缺乏大型雲端業者合約帶來的營收確定性，未直接論斷股價方向。「Revenue uncertainty at scale with Hyperscaler contracts that $CLSK, $BITF, $WYFI, $SLNH, and others lack.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2097327653116363127" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:BJRI</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-03-04 → 2026-03-04</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+3.2%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Donald Trump</b>：2026-03 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Donald Trump</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日 2026-03-04（原文：March 4th） · 揭露 2026-07-17 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2078147561542558030" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:BMNR</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-02-06 → 2026-02-06</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">回顾加密市场与MSTR及BMNR跌幅，没有当前股票方向。「$BMNR」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2019682329187524746" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:BN</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-10-05 → 2026-10-05</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>In The Assembly</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">貼文轉述 Ackman 的持倉與 Brookfield 是 AI 贏家的評語，交易揭露帳號依判準不計方向。「&quot;Brookfield is an AI winner for sure. They&#x27;ll provide a lot of the backbone, power and otherwise.&quot;」 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2106970720223797735" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:BW</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-04-01 → 2026-04-01</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-0.9%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Leopold Aschenbrenner</b>：2026-04 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Leopold Aschenbrenner</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · added 49% more last quarter, bought 673,551 shares · 交易日 2026-04-01（原文：last quarter） · 揭露 2026-09-11 · 2 則報導 <a href="https://x.com/DJTRadar/status/2098349948559315178" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文1</a> <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2098309649866928349" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文2</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:BWET</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-09-11 → 2026-09-11</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+19.6%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者只是拿BWET過去從10漲到700的誇張案例當作範例，詢問下一個類似機會，並未對BWET現在走勢表態。「What&#x27;s the next $BWET if you guys have ideas?」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2098470900823916940" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:C</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-07-23 → 2026-07-23</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-2.1%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">市場負面反應，不等於作者看空。「花旗和富国银行却相对承压」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2080221517309432162" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:CBRL</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-10-05 → 2026-10-05</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Wolf Financial</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Cracker Barrel 出現在歷史高報酬案例中，作者沒有提出當前投資方向。「McDonald&#x27;s, Chili&#x27;s, Cracker Barrel, Dunkin&#x27; Donuts and Taco Bell up close, and he says those were 40 to 50 baggers.」 <a href="https://x.com/WOLF_Financial/status/2106959190820561094" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:CCL</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2