432" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:DDOG</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-08-06 → 2026-08-06</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">價格下跌反應。「DDOG崩了」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2085324589756993755" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:DE</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-09-01 → 2026-09-01</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-0.1%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者用反問語氣質疑「一家幫農夫導入AI的曳引機公司，你還看空？」，暗示Deere推出AI助理JD是正面催化劑，對DE看法偏多。「A tractor company is rolling out AI to farmers and you&#x27;re bearish?」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2094837835983630636" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:DKS</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-08-26 → 2026-08-26</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+1.4%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-d