el Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者將FSLR列為若民主黨在期中選舉勝出、太陽能補貼情緒回溫的潛在受惠股，屬題材性看多「Residential solar has been crushed with names like $FSLR, $ENPH priced for a no subsidy world.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2091969064302465311" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:FUTU</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-05-22 → 2026-05-22</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确主张避免中国股票敞口，担忧FUTU和TIGR政策风险。「$FUTU」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2057780545292308506" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:GAP</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-08-26 → 2026-08-26</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-1.9%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">同一句話僅描述市場對這批服飾股的懲罰性反應，作者未表態自己對後市的方向判斷。「American Eagle $AEO, Gap $GAP, Lululemon $LULU, Nike $NKE, Dicks $DKS ... all getting punished by investors lately.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2092645833896497419" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:GD</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-05-01 → 2026-05-01</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-1.2%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Jared Moskowitz</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jared Moskowitz</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-05-01 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2050209175381193196" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:GDRZF</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-09-07 → 2026-09-07</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+5.5%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者將GDRZF列為自己至今仍上漲逾100%的委內瑞拉主題持股。「8. $GDRZF - Venezuela」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2096814311306129776" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:GEV</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-10-05 → 2026-10-05</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Whale Receipts</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者強調 GEV 的建設進度領先其他業者，但依交易揭露帳號判準一律不計方向。「$GEV is building the first grid-scale SMR under construction in North America.」 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2106980126303142177" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:GH</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-08-10 → 2026-08-10</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面回應引用觀察名單，但未明示自己投資方向。「跟上了」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2086704164562980874" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:GM</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-06-29 → 2026-06-29</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">工厂机器人的業務驗證及社会評論，無上市股票方向。「$GM cuts 1,000 workers」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2071532870859149617" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:GNPX</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-02-23 → 2026-02-23</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-6.4%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Tim Moore</b>：2026-02 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-23</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Tim Moore</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 