ss="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">產品、產業及併購資訊。「$KEYS」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2046734699255439573" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:KLAC</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-08-05 → 2026-08-05</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+9.4%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">他人報導長期競爭風險。「Applied Materials, Lam Research, and KLA.」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2084827925833302106" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:KLIC</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-08-29 → 2026-08-29</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">設備瓶頸正面提及無股票方向。「wire bonding equipment」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2093712497949950242" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:KO</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-07-28 → 2026-07-28</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-07-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">已發生漲幅感想。「The entire bottle was ours for the taking.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2082141849981169922" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:KOPN</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-09-08 → 2026-09-08</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+3.4%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者強調Kopin是美國唯一能生產AR頭戴顯示器所需MicroLED的公司,對應軍方220億美元頭戴顯示器計畫的商機,語氣正面看待其定位。「$KOPN is the only U.S. company making the MicroLEDs needed to make them useful」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2097310232926101858" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:LAC</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-08-21 → 2026-08-21</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-4.9%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者僅引用LAC今年下跌27.8%的數據說明板塊疲弱，並非自己對後市的判斷「$LAC: -27.8% YTD」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2090845626510766366" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:LBRT</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-05-21 → 2026-05-21</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+1.9%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>大老师</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者條件性上行重估判斷。「将会颠覆以上油企的估值逻辑」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2057538141368791242" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:LEN</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-09-09 → 2026-09-09</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-2.7%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Berkshire Hathaway</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Berkshire Hathaway</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · $1.2 billion · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-09-09 <a href="https://x.com/DJTRadar/status/2097589865781076250" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:LEU</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-01-28 → 2026-01-28</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-28</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者介绍LEU业务垄断、政策和消息后涨幅，自引的未命名公司研究不能移植为LEU或客户股票方向。「It’s only up 2% on the news, which was surprising.」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2016584615679643966" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:LGIH</span><span class="s-n">1 