26-02-02</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+3.2%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2026-02 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-02-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明确正面投资选择与低估值论点。「safest semiconductor infrastructure play」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2018462434554466647" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:PNR</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-12-08 → 2025-12-08</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Markwayne Mullin</b>：2025-12 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Markwayne Mullin</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2025-12-08 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/1998043268819636387" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:POWL</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-04-09 → 2026-04-09</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">称赞投资想法同时说明自己未买。「$POWL was another good switchgear long」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/stat