ller</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Stanley Druckenmiller</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-08-17 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2089343926847025644" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:PVH</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-09-11 → 2026-09-11</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-0.3%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Stefan Larsson</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Stefan Larsson</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · $1 million, around $70.53/share · 交易日 2026-09-11（原文：September 11） · 揭露 2026-09-12 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2098707283177865610" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:RBLX</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-09-06 → 2026-09-06</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+5.4%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者認為AI生成世界暫時無法取代遊戲引擎，這幾檔因被誤與「被AI商品化」的軟體股歸為一類而被錯殺，視為潛在機會「So while these names keep getting lumped in with the software stocks getting commoditized, I think there could be an opportunity here.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2096667046117343741" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:RCL</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-09-29 → 2026-09-29</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+14.5%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">歷史價格反應。「哎 谢谢大家 邮轮股飞了」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2104929455051616300" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:RR</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-03-25 → 2026-03-25</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-03-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">对比Unitree和Richtech产品及估值，未给出作者股票方向。「$RR」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2036644541080670304" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:RSG</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-09-08 → 2026-09-08</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-1.3%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Cascade Investment</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Cascade Investment</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · $159.6 million, 720,804 shares · 交易日 2026-09-08（原文：September 8-9） · 揭露 2026-09-10 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2098167801026359361" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:RZLV</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-05-29 → 2026-05-29</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>大老师</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">明示買入及上漲預期。「一方面会被软件股反弹带着上涨（beta上涨）」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2060381788024000687" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:SAIL</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-08-13 → 2026-08-13</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-0.7%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Josh Gottheimer</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-13</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Josh Gottheimer</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-08-13 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2087946277086544333" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:SEI</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-09-09 → 2026-09-09</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+8.4%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者只是驚訝地評論某人（Leopold）過去持倉全部大漲的巧合，並未明確表態自己對這些個股後市的看法「Look at the names Leopold was in...I&#x27;m beginning to think he was just someone from this side of FinX under a anime character.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2097521722954072202" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:SHEL</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-05-21 → 2026-05-21</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-0.2%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>大老师</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者條件性上行重估判斷。「将会颠覆以上油企的估值逻辑」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2057538141368791242" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:SHMD</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-06-07 → 2026-06-07</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-07</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">玻璃基板时程资料与公司评论，无明确投资方向；亚洲数字及LPK身份不猜。「financials were pretty toxic」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2063442668844167613" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:SHOP</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-08-06 → 2026-08-06</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-06</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">研究財報讚賞沒有投資承諾。「I don’t own, nor do I trade this name.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2085223020038082920" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:SILC</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-04-30 → 2026-04-30</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-30</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">业务供需肯定与引用。「$SILC」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2049947249145483395" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:SITE</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-08-26 → 2026-08-26</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-1.5%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Doug Black</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Doug Black</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 5,000 shares at roughly $96 · 交易日 2026-08-26（原文：August 26） · 揭露 2026-09-01 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2094711078970163689" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:SLB</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-06-16 → 2026-06-16</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-5.3%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者提出SLB为伊朗资本开支交易且比旧案例更大，明确多方机会。「This is that same trade, on a far bigger field.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2066977713450275231" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:SM</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-01-26 → 2026-01-26</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Donald Trump</b>：2026-01 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Donald Trump</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日 2026-01-26（原文：January 26th） · 揭露 2026-05-19 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2056817439896219944" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:SNPS</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-10-01 → 2026-10-01</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-01</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">用反諷回應 EDA 股價上漲；屬價格反應與正面語氣，沒有新的買進或價格預測。「but i ThouUght EDA wAs COoKED???」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2105655693969670599" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:SOFI</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-09-19 → 2025-09-19</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>James Comer</b>：2025-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-09-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>James Comer</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2025-09-19 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/1969080923703382162" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:SSYS</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-01-17 → 2026-01-17</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-01 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-01-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者撤回部分SSYS机器人推论，但因核心催化仍在而明确维持持仓信念；META客户身份是未确认猜测。「I still hold shares since the core catalyst remains」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2012316373482140144" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:SYK</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-06-24 → 2026-06-24</span><