</summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Michael Lyons</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Lyons</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 21,000 shares; roughly $1.02 million · 交易日 2026-09-17（原文：September 17） · 揭露 2026-09-19 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2101382885244882972" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:TIGR</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-05-22 → 2026-05-22</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Serenity</b>：2026-05 <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-22</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-bear">看空</span><div class="tl-detail">作者明确主张避免中国股票敞口，担忧FUTU和TIGR政策风险。「$TIGR」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2057780545292308506" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:TM</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-08-05 → 2026-08-05</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-3.6%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Kon Kenta</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Kon Kenta</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 85,000 shares, about $1.56 million · 交易日 2026-08-05（原文：August 5） · 揭露 2026-09-01 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2094711078970163689" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:TMQ</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-08-21 → 2026-08-21</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-2.2%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-21</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者僅引用TMQ今年下跌13.2%的數據作為板塊疲弱的例證，未表態方向「$TMQ: -13.2% YTD」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2090845626510766366" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:TRGP</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-06-02 → 2026-06-02</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-02</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">觀望與輕倉条件意向不形成确定方向。「这一单以观望为主/轻仓参与为主」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2061893107248201841" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:TRT</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-09-25 → 2026-09-25</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Ren</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">歷史出售及不適合長持的評價，未明示當前跌幅預期。「I sold it more than a month ago.」 <a href="https://x.com/ren_stocks/status/2103597680861626556" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:TWST</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-08-10 → 2026-08-10</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+5.1%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>大老师</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面回應引用觀察名單，但未明示自己投資方向。「跟上了」 <a href="https://x.com/octopusycc/status/2086704164562980874" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:UBS</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-05-29 → 2026-05-29</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-05-29</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Jukan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">研究质量肯定。「remarkable report from UBS」 <a href="https://x.com/jukan05/status/2060234657430642804" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:UPST</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-09-10 → 2026-09-10</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-1.0%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Paul Gu</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-10</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Paul Gu</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 50,000 shares at avg $25.55 (about $1.28M) via JECCO LLC · 交易日 2026-09-10（原文：September 10） · 揭露 2026-09-12