-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">設備雙寡頭背景。「duopoly with Veeco」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2067513458812473533" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:VELO</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-04-04 → 2026-04-04</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">提醒VELO融资稀释风险，明确作为风险披露而非买卖建议。「$VELO」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2040428338213507531" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:VIST</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-09-12 → 2026-09-12</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-4.0%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Peter Thiel</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Peter Thiel</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 18.1% of portfolio · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-09-12 <a href="https://x.com/InTheAssembly/status/2098671715937038341" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:VMC</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-08-17 → 2026-08-17</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-1.3%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>TCI</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-17</div><div class="tl-body"><b>TCI</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-08-17 <a href="https://x.com/WhaleReceipts/status/2089270259610009999" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:VNOM</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-04-16 → 2026-04-16</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>August Pfluger</b>：2026-04 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-04-16</div><div class="tl-body"><b>August Pfluger</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-04-16 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2044790688521265462" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:VRT</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2025-12-12 → 2025-12-12</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2025-12-12</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">产业需求背景。「$VRT」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/1999575509462843833" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:VSH</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-06-19 → 2026-06-19</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-19</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">正面歷史價格反應，沒有當前持倉或買入承諾。「$VSH up 146.15%」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2067954339982008731" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:VSXY</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-08-26 → 2026-08-26</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+3.9%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-26</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者稱新CEO「promo detox」奏效，同店銷售連四季雙位數成長並搶下年輕客群份額，屬明確看多敘事。「Now same store sales are up 13%, four quarters in a row of growth, and they&#x27;re taking share in bras from 18 to 24 year olds specifically.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2092645833896497419" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:VZ</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-09-08 → 2026-09-08</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-1.6%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>KawzInvests</b>：2026-09 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-08</div><div class="tl-body"><b>KawzInvests</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者提及VZ與GLW簽署延續到2032年的多年期光纖大單，視為AI基建強勁早晨的一部分「$VZ + $GLW: multibillion-dollar fiber deal extending through 2032.」 <a href="https://x.com/KawzInvests/status/2097332258386403456" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:WEN</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-06-25 → 2026-06-25</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-4.2%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-25</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Serenity</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">Wendy过去涨幅与散户话题评论，未給自己投资方向。「The burger fast food chain is now up ~50%」 <a href="https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2070020727441621026" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:WSE</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-09-09 → 2026-09-09</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret down">-0.5%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-09-09</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Zephyr</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">作者嘲諷整合對象「用Windows 95加數據機」的老舊金融基礎設施,這是在諷刺產業基礎設施而非對WSE本身財務體質的方向判斷。「Cyberinfra is completely cooked」 <a href="https://x.com/zephyr_z9/status/2097647642960699717" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:YUM</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-10-05 → 2026-10-05</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret" style="color:var(--muted)">無價格</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-05</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Wolf Financial</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">旗下 Taco Bell 僅被用作歷史投資案例，不能把 Lynch 的回顧視為作者對母公司股票的看多立場。「McDonald&#x27;s, Chili&#x27;s, Cracker Barrel, Dunkin&#x27; Donuts and Taco Bell up close, and he says those were 40 to 50 baggers.」 <a href="https://x.com/WOLF_Financial/status/2106959190820561094" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:ZBRA</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-08-04 → 2026-08-04</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+1.1%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Donald Trump</b>：2026-08 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-08-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Donald Trump</b> <span class="tag t-bull">買進</span><div class="tl-detail">揭露事件 · up to $1,000,000 · 交易日未知 · 揭露 2026-08-04 <a href="https://x.com/QuiverQuant/status/2084694812591022474" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:ZETA</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-10-04 → 2026-10-04</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+12.6%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-10-04</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Evan</b> <span class="tag t-mute">僅提及</span><div class="tl-detail">提到受邀參加 Zeta Live 活動，語氣偏正面，但沒有對股價方向的判斷。「Zeta Global $ZETA will be hosting its Zeta Live Event (They invited me to go to this actually ... so this is where I will be on Thursday)」 <a href="https://x.com/StockMKTNewz/status/2106831119614173471" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details><details class="dt"><summary><span class="s-tk">US:ZM</span><span class="s-n">1 筆</span><span class="s-range">2026-06-11 → 2026-06-11</span><span class="s-dir">最新 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></span><span class="s-ret"><span class="ret up">+6.4%</span></span></summary><div class="dt-body"><div class="paths"><div class="paths-h">每個人的立場軌跡</div><ul><li><b>Michael Sikand</b>：2026-06 <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span></li></ul></div><div class="tl-row"><div class="tl-t">2026-06-11</div><div class="tl-body"><b>Michael Sikand</b> <span class="tag t-bull">看多</span><div class="tl-detail">作者认为三项Anthropic代理投资被低估并有双重上行，明确看多；其他为历史比较。「investors are genuinely sleeping on these businesses as is.」 <a href="https://x.com/michaelsikand/status/2065086870409880036" target="_blank" rel="noopener">原文</a></div></div></div></div></details>
<h2>交易風向：交易者權重</h2>
<p class="note">權重 = 先驗值 × 實績乘數。先驗值依身分類別給，實績乘數由本專案自己抓到的揭露事件加價格資料算出，樣本不足時退回 1.0。點任一位展開他的全歷史交易時間線。</p>
<p class="note">權重結合先驗值與揭露事件的價格計分。有成交日用成交日，未知時用揭露日，混合兩種起點；尚未驗證預測能力，不能當成實際交易績效，未納入完整持倉。</p>
